72c85bda-27d4-44e7-a980-d6f812ca425b,,ZEN Social: Halloween Spooktakular🎉🎶🎮 Live Performances & New Friends!,Welkom to Sin City! 🎲👻,"Welkom to Sin City! 🎲👻

This Halloween, Albert’s Schloss is transforming its iconic Bavarian beer hall into a dark, glittering destination of haunted hedonism for their official seasonal takeover: **Viva Slash Vegas**!
Join the **ZEN Social** crew for an unforgettable evening of killer live entertainment, dark disco beats, and spooky socializing. Whether you're new to the area, coming with friends, or just looking to expand your social circle, everyone is welcome!
Expect a darkly decadent atmosphere, world-class biers, outrageous showtimes, and plenty of opportunities to mix and mingle in a fun, relaxed environment.
Whether you come dressed to kill in full glam, as a ghostly apparition, or channeling your inner Vegas vampire, you'll fit right in! Costumes aren't strictly mandatory, but they are heavily encouraged—let’s embrace the spookiness together.
**What to Expect:**

• 🧛♂️ **The Atmosphere:** A spine-tingling makeover of the schloss with dark disco, glitter, and gore.
• 🍻 **The Drinks & Eats:** World-class biers, killer cocktails, and alpine-indulgence.
• 🎶 **The Entertainment:** Outrageous live performances, cabaret twists, and late-night party vibes.
• 👋 **The Social:** A warm, welcoming crowd ready to mix, mingle, make new friends, and dance on the benches!

*No entry tickets are required for the venue, but please RSVP so we know who to look out for, grab enough table space, and kick off the night together.*
Let’s raise a glass to the weekend. See you under the disco ball! 🪩🕷️

**How to find us** 📌
Check the “How to find us” section. Please arrive within the first 30 minutes. If there’s a queue you’ll need to wait. ⏳
Come for the company, stay for the music, and leave with new connections. See you there! 😎🤝

This is a CityZen Zen Social (not an official venue event).

**Some Tips:**

1. **Let’s all commit to updating our RSVPs if plans change**—it helps us plan better and ensures great attendance for everyone. If you RSVP “yes” but don’t attend and don’t update your RSVP, you may be removed from the group to keep things fair. No stress, though—you can rejoin for a small £10 fee! Just send me a DM, and I’ll share the PayPal details to get you back in.
2. **Turn Up on Time at the start!** This helps the quality of the event and helps you.
3. If you are struggling with the **app**, use the web page instead, that's what I use.
4. **Attendee Numbers & Guest Lists:** We have this event listed at least on two groups and the guest list includes attendees from all. You can see the list of attendees here:
https://www.meetup.com/zensingles/
https://www.meetup.com/cityzenlondon/
https://www.meetup.com/LoveLife
1. Join our **social media**:
**Instagram**: https://www.instagram.com/cityzen.london/
**X:** https://x.com/CityZenLondon
1. **Our WhatsApp group:** [See private comment in the comments section below]. We have a few rules including no ads, no DMs unless recipient is in the ""Direct Messaging List"" or risk removal and £10 rejoin fee.
2. **Support Our Amazing London Event Hosts! 🙌**
Our incredible crew of hosts is the heartbeat of London’s buzzing meetup scene, bringing people together for unforgettable experiences that spark connection, growth, and fun! 🌟 From museum adventures to flirty dating mixers, these rockstar hosts pour their energy, time, and passion into creating events that level up your social and communication skills. But hosting isn’t easy—it takes resources, effort, and heart. 💖
Please consider supporting our hosts with a donation to keep the good vibes flowing and help us make London the ultimate social hub! 🚀 Below, meet our hosts for this event and see how you can chip in to fuel their amazing work.
1. To encourage signing up early to events and regulate the number of attendees a late joiner/overflow fee may be applied to an event for any **additional** people wanting to join the event. This may happen on the day or even an hour before the event. So there may be people who obtained a free RSVP to network with our group and some who had to pay. If you have successfully signed up to our event on meetup paid or not then you are in. Happy networking

**Zen & The Meetup Groups**
*The Visionary Social Connector*
Zen, our AI guru with 25 years in the game, founded these meetups to transform his own social skills and now helps others do the same. From sparking in-person networking to coordinating epic events, Zen’s passion for connection is unstoppable. Help him keep the momentum going!
Support Zen: Donate to cover event planning tools, venue bookings, and more. **Donation Link (https://paypal.me/Zenswalks)**

**Disclaimer, Liability Waiver & Media Consent**
By attending this event, you acknowledge and agree to the following:
**Organiser Identity** – The organiser operates under the community name **“ZEN”**, which is used as an alias for privacy and branding purposes. By joining, you understand that “ZEN” refers to the organiser and/or designated hosts of this event. **Assumption…",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/9/f/f/highres_536811711.jpeg,2026-10-31 19:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,Albert's Schloss,20-24 Shaftesbury Ave,London,8827b689-2637-4245-8ba7-214b35948ea2,"{sport,socialising,fitness}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/cityzenlondon/events/317142772/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-28 03:22:55.252474+00,source:f26eb5d4-b239-4813-8e0c-3cf689eed4bd,https://www.meetup.com/cityzenlondon/events/317142772/,event_317142772@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:30.379+00,,2026-10-28 03:22:55.252474+00,2026-10-28 03:22:57.153794+00,,,,,f,GB
