1c700206-753d-4e6c-baa8-1ee9c4a0eb2c,,Join a vibrant mix of talents and pros for a FREE lively Friends Circle Night!,"Dear Meetup Members,","**Dear Meetup Members,**

**We cordially invite you to join us FREE via Zoom for our bi-monthly Friends Circle Night:**

**2nd Tuesday in Even months, 8-10 pm PST**
(Even months = Feb, April, June, August, Oct and Dec only)

**As always, Friends-Circle-Nights are FUN-FILLED FREE online events via Zoom. You will have the great opportunity to meet a bunch of talented entertainment professionals including:**
Talent Managers
Casting Directors
Legal Consultants
Directors
Producer
Actors
Writers
Editors
Comedians
Musicians and
Investors ...
**NETWORK AND GET TO WORK!**

**REGISTER HERE to JOIN THE FREE EVENT:**
(1)
**http://tinyurl.com/dt4yu5kr (https://us02web.zoom.us/meeting/register/tZcuduGqrjsqHd0S6KyHqYOGELWGiLx_m3pb)**
**(click or copy-paste the above link to your browser)**
**or (2）**
**See the Zoom ""ONLINE EVENT"" link under the event date and time?**
Click there and proceed.
**Meeting ID: 833 1820 0079 (no password needed)**

Please keep the Zoom event link you received from Zoom on your calendar for easy access.

**FOR OUR INTERNATIONAL MEMBERS AND FRIENDS:**
India time is 12.5 hours ahead of PST;
UK is 8 hours ahead of PST;
Stockholm, Sweden is 9 hours ahead of PST;
Vancouver, BC, Canada is the same time zone as PST;

**PLEASE CHECK YOUR LOCAL TIME:**
https://www.worldtimezone.com
Or use Google search keywords: PST=(YOUR country) local time

**Our Zoom meeting room usually opens about 10-15 minutes**
**before the event begins.**

********If you have 2-5 minute clips, such as short films or music videos,**
that demonstrate your talent, OR if you would like to perform LIVE
at our online Talent Show to raise your profile,
**BOOK your gig HERE to demonstrate your talent:**
**https://tinyurl.com/2s3kwmyk**
OR contact us for more details.

**WHO ARE EXPECTED TO BE AT the Dec 10th, 2024 Friends-Circle-Night EVENT:**
Talent Managers, Casting Directors, Film industry talents, Actors, Singers, Comedians, Writers, Composers, Camera Teams, Makeup Artists, Editors, Directors, Producers…

**ZOOM TEST MEETING**:
If you’re new to Zoom, you could do a test drive here to **“select” your settings**. It’s pretty easy.
https://support.zoom.us/hc/en-us/articles/115002262083-Joining-a-test-meeting (https://www.google.com/url?q=https://support.zoom.us/hc/en-us/articles/115002262083-Joining-a-test-meeting&sa=D&source=calendar&usd=2&usg=AOvVaw0QUpIyLZ8zY4ei5Fc0zAtv)
**Please do the test a day or two ahead of the event time.**

**FIND YOUR LOCAL NUMBER** to call in to join us:
**https://us02web.zoom.us/u/kDw8xHPK0 (https://www.google.com/url?q=https://us02web.zoom.us/u/kDw8xHPK0&sa=D&source=calendar&usd=2&usg=AOvVaw0xVmW_TqfTWqLNQgpyqbTM)**

**WE ARE LOOKING FORWARD TO SEEING YOU THERE!**

www.FriendsCircleNight.com (http://www.FriendsCircleNight.com)
