50e5cdf3-3d62-4345-9be1-8b1882d3ca93,,"MumbAI AI Saturdays—Get Funded to Co-Work @Adani Inspire BKC, BHIVE",Bringing Dubai AI (https://www.meetup.com/dubai-ai) / Shanghai AI (https://www.meetup.com/shanghai-ai) weekly AI energy to Mumbai AI: we discuss and co-work on our laptops every Saturday 18:00 PM at…,"Bringing Dubai AI (https://www.meetup.com/dubai-ai) / Shanghai AI (https://www.meetup.com/shanghai-ai) weekly AI energy to Mumbai AI: we discuss and co-work on our laptops every Saturday 18:00 PM at **BHIVE Adani Inspire** **BKC**. This is a casual, high-bandwidth co-working session for AI programmers, founders, and the AI-curious. **Sign up is not required.**

**📱 Synchronize Here:** Join 5,000+ in the X / WhatsApp group to find new co-working friends and topics/projects:
https://x.com/i/chat/group_join/g2054363861009207629/6Bz8S3Q21T (better)
https://chat.whatsapp.com/ElS2eXOLhti2sIjcgbSz4G Free :-)
https://chat.whatsapp.com/BmmQAZhntxE2REnlOBpgku (full)

**NOTE: This is not an event organized by BHIVE team**; it is a shared co-working session for everyone who are planning to co-work together on their laptops at BHIVE BKC this Saturday on many shared AI/business projects/topics. Each person must buy their own BHIVE ₹75 day pass (re-fundable...) and follow all the rules of the business, independently of this Meetup page or WhatsApp group.

Join DubaiAI.VIP (https://dubaiai.vip/) — ChatGPT Owes You Money ⭐ Monetize your professional ChatGPT AI workspace with unlimited marketing contacts—from Mumbai and Dubai to the world! And contribute to its open-source: https://functors.zulipchat.com

**💰 Get Funded/Sponsored to Co-Work.** Do you want to get paid or (re-)funded for your BHIVE ₹75 day pass? Reply with a comment here:
https://DubaiAI.VIP/r/26011DLGJ50000
and explain what AI discussion topics/projects you will be co-working/managing, and some sponsors companies will fund your ₹75 (or more!) co-working day pass.

📍 **The Venue.** The co-working session is happening at **BHIVE Platinum Plus BKC (https://bhiveworkspace.com) (Bandra-Kurla Complex),** a premium coworking space inside the **Adani Inspire BKC** building. Bring your own laptop. It is the perfect environment for businesses and builders aiming to thrive in Mumbai's prime corporate hub. Easily accessible via a short walk from **Bandra-Kurla Complex Metro Station (https://maps.app.goo.gl/1o3adxbiYsX7q1Q16)** (Asia’s largest).

**Cost:** **FREE**. But you must become a customer of BHIVE, i.e. you must buy the **₹75 ""Co-Working Day Pass"" (https://bhiveworkspace.com/book-day-and-bulk-day-pass/)** from BHIVE website online:
https://bhiveworkspace.com/book-day-and-bulk-day-pass/
The day pass includes high-speed Wi-Fi, unlimited coffee/tea, and screen access for the full day of Saturday—ideal if you want to arrive early to code.

🗓️ **When & Where** Every **Saturday: 6:00 PM to 8:00 PM** (Mumbai time zone).
Location (Google Map (https://maps.app.goo.gl/F92EEad6Sx26vDYH6)): **BHIVE Platinum Plus BKC,** **3rd floor, Unit No. 305, Inspire BKC Rd, G Block BKC, Bandra East (https://maps.app.goo.gl/F92EEad6Sx26vDYH6)** (10 min walk from **BKC Metro station** (Aqua Line 3)). Bring your own laptop. Look for groups of 3-5 people co-working on various AI topics...

**🌍 Global Context** We share a direct link with the Dubai AI (DIFC) https://www.meetup.com/dubai-ai and Shanghai AI (Bookstore) https://www.meetup.com/shanghai-ai communities. Expect cross-border insights from the Gulf and China tech scenes as we transition this pilot into a dedicated **Mumbai AI** chapter.

Reply with a comment below or at https://getpaidx.com/r/26011DLGJ50000 to add ideas to this scratchpad of possible co-working projects, discussion topics, brainstorming and collaborations for next co-working sessions:
• how to get paid and funded by fans, clients, local businesses: co-working around app payments, Stripe API (US) vs WeChat Pay / Alipay (China) vs RazorPay API (India) vs PayU API (India) vs Cashfree, Justpay, marketplace payout, taxes, financial regulations, etc...
• how to get closer to creators, authors, developers: co-working around local WhatsApp communities, local co-working spaces, local business networks and entrepreneurs, government contracts, regulated industries education/healthcare/legal, what products do local customers want? etc...
