3b619b31-c8aa-44a4-a87f-ceb76715d916,,Board Games Evening at The Library Pot 😁🍻🎲🍰☕🍕,The Library Pot has over 700 board games to choose from!,"The Library Pot has over 700 board games to choose from!
Join Emily Wednesday night to learn and play board games together.

IMPORTANT PLEASE READ

Venue: The Library Pot Board Game Cafe, 86 Kew Road, Richmond, TW9 2PQ.

The cafe has food and drink minimum spend requirement of £15 and a £6.50 cover charge.

The Library Pot menu
https://librarypot.uk/menu/

Please don't bring any food or drink to be consumed on the premises.

Sorry no bicycles or buggies of any type inside.

Venue: The Library Pot - Games Club, 86 Kew Road, Richmond, TW9 2PQ
