**We cordially invite you to join us FREE via Zoom for our bi-monthly Friends Circle Night:**

**2nd Tuesday in Even months, 8-10 pm PST**
(Even months = Feb, April, June, August, Oct and Dec only)

**As always, Friends-Circle-Nights are FUN-FILLED FREE online events via Zoom. You will have the great opportunity to meet a bunch of talented entertainment professionals including:**
Talent Managers
Casting Directors
Legal Consultants
Directors
Producer
Actors
Writers
Editors
Comedians
Musicians and
Investors ...
**NETWORK AND GET TO WORK!**

