**Meeting ID: 833 1820 0079 (no password needed)**

Please keep the Zoom event link you received from Zoom on your calendar for easy access.

**FOR OUR INTERNATIONAL MEMBERS AND FRIENDS:**
India time is 12.5 hours ahead of PST;
UK is 8 hours ahead of PST;
Stockholm, Sweden is 9 hours ahead of PST;
Vancouver, BC, Canada is the same time zone as PST;

**PLEASE CHECK YOUR LOCAL TIME:**
https://www.worldtimezone.com
