e7842284-6e13-4038-a187-f5504ecfd11c,,"From Vision to Reality – A Journey of Growth, Clarity & Career","Join us for a heartful and empowering meetup where we talk about career, clarity, confidence, and inner growth—in a simple, practical, and relatable way.","Join us for a **heartful and empowering meetup** where we talk about **career, clarity, confidence, and inner growth**—in a **simple, practical, and relatable way**.
✨ **Yeh sirf career ki baat nahi hai… yeh aapki journey hai.**
From understanding yourself better to shaping your career with confidence, this session is about **growing from within and moving forward in life**.

Join our Telegram Group (https://t.me/+BBI_937uLWBmNzQ9)

What we’ll explore together:

• 🌸 **Self-exploration & personal growth** – Apne aap ko samajhna, apni strengths pehchanna
• 🧘 **Mindfulness & meditation (practical & simple)** – Busy life ke beech thoda sa peace
• ❤️ **Self-love & confidence building** – Khud par bharosa kaise badhayein
• 🎯 **Career clarity & guidance** – Direction kaise mile, next step kaise choose karein
• 📝 **Resume & professional growth tips** – Practical guidance jo real life mein kaam aaye
• 🌿 **Self-healing & self-awareness practices** – Emotional balance aur inner strength ke liye

This meetup is for:

• Students & teens figuring out their path
• Working professionals feeling stuck or confused
• Career-focused individuals seeking clarity
• Spiritual seekers who want **practical application**
• Anyone who wants to **grow personally and professionally**

💬 **No heavy gyaan. No pressure.**
