8890288b-b3c7-4805-842d-b2923b495d8f,,TradFi & Bitcoin Club,Details,"Details

Where Traditional Finance meets Bitcoin.
**When:** Every **Tuesday, 8 PM IST** (14:30 UTC) — ongoing.
**Where:** Discord Lounge (https://discord.com/invite/STeQFVEWf9)
(After you RSVP, click “Join Event” to pop straight into voice.)

Where we broadly discuss:

• Bitcoin Treasury firms like Microstrategy, Metaplanet, Semler etc,
• Financial instruments like Convertible Debt, Warrants, Bitcoin denominated convertible debt,
• Bitcoin Metrics like BTC mNAV, Days to mNAV, BTC yield etc,

Sometimes we keep the discussion on broader topics like speculative attacks on

• Dollars
• Gold
• Stocks and bonds
• Personal wealth / retirement plans etc.

And at other times, we bring in guests who have built and are building at the intersection of TradFi and Bitconi!

Join us in lounge of Bitshala discord server for the session at 8 PM Tuesday, if you'd like!

Each week's discussion focus and relevant articles will be updated inside Bitshala Discord #Announcements (https://discord.com/channels/1104831812720656540/1106608454761730158), prior to the session.

Quick Links

• **Luma:** Bitcoinceirge Luma (https://luma.com/bitcoincierge)
• **X :** https://x.com/bitcoinciergein
• Whatsapp: Bitcoincierge Bitcoin Treasury Discussions (https://chat.whatsapp.com/HCKRGv5HRz0HyHWoPeqmxu)
• **YouTube playlist of past sessions:** https://www.youtube.com/@bitcoincierge (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YCB7IHT8IWU&list=PLpOA0dSGVypGEWhbQCOQiyo3HD1lnH4em)",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/7/d/d/highres_531250205.jpeg,2026-12-16 14:30:00+00,2026-12-16 15:30:00+00,Asia/Kolkata,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,finance,crypto,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/bitcoincierge/events/bffjztyjcqbvb/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 03:21:15.028412+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/bitcoincierge/events/bffjztyjcqbvb/,event_bffjztyjcqbvb@meetup.com,,2026-10-22 03:20:45.416+00,,2026-10-22 03:21:15.028412+00,2026-10-22 19:53:43.49522+00,,,meetup:bitcoincierge:tradfi bitcoin club,"Every week on Wednesday until January 6, 2027",f,
