207ef462-c27a-497b-b944-f1fefae0061d,,Beyond Vibe Coding: Hands-on Workshop on Spec Coding & Agentic Engineering,Join us for a hands-on workshop to elevate your software development practice using Spec Coding & Agentic Engineering.,"Join us for a hands-on workshop to elevate your software development practice using Spec Coding & Agentic Engineering.

