30456a01-4ab4-4d51-9543-1a3dfc73041f,,Beyond Vibe Coding: Hands-on Workshop on Spec Coding & Agentic Engineering,Join us for a hands-on workshop to elevate your software development practice using Spec Coding & Agentic Engineering.,"Join us for a hands-on workshop to elevate your software development practice using Spec Coding & Agentic Engineering.

