42015d70-5ec2-4871-8670-ea5f72e2ad8b,,Build Your Own Network on AWS: VPC Hands-on,Build Your Own Network on AWS: VPC Hands-on 🌐☁️,"**Build Your Own Network on AWS: VPC Hands-on** 🌐☁️
Ever wondered what actually happens behind the scenes when you launch a server on AWS? In this live, hands-on session, you’ll build your own network on AWS from scratch, step by step, alongside the speaker.
This is a build-along session, not a slide-only talk. By the end, you’ll have a working VPC that you designed yourself.
🎤 **Speaker:** Shivansh Sukhija
📅 **Date:** Sunday, 25 October 2026
⏰ **Time:** 11:00 AM IST
💻 **Where:** Online (link will be shared with RSVP’d attendees)
**🛠️ What we’ll build together**

• Create a custom VPC and plan its IP ranges (CIDR)
• Set up public and private subnets across Availability Zones
• Connect to the internet with an Internet Gateway, NAT Gateway and route tables
• Secure your network with Security Groups and Network ACLs
• Launch an EC2 instance and test connectivity

**👥 Who should join**

• Students and freshers starting out with cloud
• Developers who use AWS but find networking confusing
• Anyone preparing for AWS certifications (Cloud Practitioner, Solutions Architect)

No prior networking experience needed. We’ll start from the basics.
**✅ Before you join**

• A laptop with a stable internet connection
• An AWS account (Free Tier is fine)
• Some curiosity! 😄

⚠️ *Note: a few resources, such as the NAT Gateway, aren’t free. We’ll show you how to clean everything up at the end so you don’t get billed.*

Hit **RSVP** to save your spot. See you there! 🚀",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/5/3/highres_536703411.jpeg,2026-10-25 05:30:00+00,,Asia/Kolkata,online,Online event,,,4cece675-2670-4581-90e6-2b792576b047,{technology},,external,https://www.meetup.com/aws-sbg-at-nutan-maharashtra-inst-of-engineering-and-tech/events/317057988/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 03:22:46.934486+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/aws-sbg-at-nutan-maharashtra-inst-of-engineering-and-tech/events/317057988/,event_317057988@meetup.com,,2026-10-22 03:22:12.257+00,,2026-10-22 03:22:46.934486+00,2026-10-22 03:22:56.322363+00,,,,,f,
