2c8112c0-0f8f-41cc-a2e0-81a2a51722a8,,From AI Tools to AI Workforce: The Next Step in Online Business,What If AI Could Help Run Your Online Business?,"What If AI Could Help Run Your Online Business?

Most conversations about AI focus on the tools.

Which AI should you use? Which prompts should you learn? How do you create content faster?

But something much bigger is beginning to happen.

**AI is moving beyond being a tool you use occasionally and becoming part of how an online business actually operates.**

In this beginner-friendly webinar, Paul Chuter takes you inside an AI-supported online business to show how marketing, content, lead generation, customer conversations and digital products can work together as one connected system.

You'll explore how AI and automation can support:

**AI-assisted marketing**
See how AI agents can help develop marketing ideas, content and campaigns without starting from a blank page every day.

**Automated social content**
Discover how approved content can be scheduled and published without requiring constant manual posting.

**AI-supported customer conversations**
See how an AI sales advisor can answer common questions, help visitors understand available products and guide them towards relevant information.

**Lead generation and follow-up**
Learn how website visitors can become subscribers and receive useful information automatically.

**Digital products and delivery**
Explore how ready-to-sell digital products can form part of an online business without requiring you to create everything yourself.

**One connected business system**
Most importantly, see how these individual pieces can work together rather than operating as a collection of disconnected AI tools.

This isn't about becoming an AI expert.

You don't need to master dozens of platforms, become a programmer or spend every day creating content.

The purpose of this session is to show you what's now possible when AI and automation are built into the infrastructure of an online business — and where the business owner still fits into the picture.

You'll remain responsible for the decisions, direction and oversight. AI and automation can support many of the repetitive operational tasks.

If you've been interested in starting an online business but the technology, marketing and sheer amount of work involved have made you hesitate, this session offers a practical look at a different approach.

**Stay for the Live Q&A with Paul Chuter.**

Paul will be available live following the presentation to answer your questions and explore how the different parts of an AI-supported business work in practice.

**No previous AI, technical or online business experience is required.**

*This is an educational session exploring an online business model and the use of AI and automation. It does not promise or guarantee income or business results.*",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/b/6/f/1/highres_536386833.jpeg,2026-10-22 09:00:00+00,,Europe/Amsterdam,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,technology,entrepreneurship,ai,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/amsterdam-remote-work-ai-digital-skills-collective/events/316780982/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/amsterdam-remote-work-ai-digital-skills-collective/events/316780982/,event_316780982@meetup.com,,2026-10-21 22:13:45.894+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,2026-10-22 19:53:37.570154+00,,,,,f,
