3483bb56-f087-4a9c-983b-93f926de84c0,,Fit and Happy Indoors - Strong and Powerful - Online class,"This session is aimed at people over 50. Our exercises are gentle but effective. There will be no floor exercises in this session, but you can expect to work hard!","This session is aimed at people over 50. Our exercises are gentle but effective. There will be no floor exercises in this session, but you can expect to work hard!

