7033da45-665e-489c-8c02-b0a7cccd4d79,,Bewl Water - a most stunning walk,A most stunningly beautiful 11 mile medium paced walk in the Sussex countryside and by a clockwise stretch of beautiful Bewl Water !,"A most stunningly beautiful 11 mile medium paced walk in the Sussex countryside and by a clockwise stretch of beautiful Bewl Water !

Bewl Water is a reservoir and is the biggest stretch of open water in the whole of the South East.

Let's go with the flow !

Please only rsvp if you can walk 2.5 miles per hour and you should have adequate and appropriate insurance for this type of activity.

Please arrive by 8.55am to facilitate the purchase of group train tickets - Wadhurst return - for the train at 9.24am that arrives at 11.05am after rail replacement bus from Tonbridge to Wadhurst.

Train ticket : Wadhurst return.

Or you may decide to drive.

The walk shall commence at 11.25am if the toilets are open at Wadhurst train station.

Meetup fee £8 payable in cash or £6 non refundable by bank transfer in advance, details available upon request. No PayPal.

We shall have a drink at the end of the walk in Three Legs Cross before aiming to take the 254 bus at 4.29pm and then the replacement bus and train back to London.

Please bring packed lunch, water, snacks etc as well as waterproof jacket and walking shoes/trainers or boots plus sunhat, suncream and sunglasses.

Please only post photos of others with their consent.

