0fbeeb26-2208-4db0-a29e-6a675214669c,,"TechConnect: Global Virtual Job & Networking Event for Data, AI, and Tech Pros","Calling all developers, AI engineers, software architects, data scientists, DevOps professionals, and tech enthusiasts — TechConnect is your ultimate destination for career growth, project…","Calling all developers, AI engineers, software architects, data scientists, DevOps professionals, and tech enthusiasts — **TechConnect** is your ultimate destination for career growth, project showcasing, and global peer networking in the tech ecosystem.

Hosted in a self-led, Slack-style virtual space, this **virtual tech networking event** invites you to connect, collaborate, and innovate with a diverse community of tech minds and hiring professionals from around the world. Whether you're looking for your next job, exploring startups, showcasing tools, or building a **peer coding accountability group**, **TechConnect** is where meaningful connections are made.

🎥 **Watch the explainer video to see how it works:**
👉 https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pgm2_MiHLDk

**💬 What to Expect:**
At TechConnect, participants enjoy full access to group discussions and 1-on-1 video/text chats, with zero moderation — allowing spontaneous, genuine interaction across roles and regions.

Attendees can engage across several thoughtfully organized channels:

• **General** – A community-wide welcome zone for announcements, orientation, and casual conversation.
• **Intros** – Share your tech background, favorite projects, or personal story. Find shared passions with others.
• **Networking** – Showcase your startup, GitHub repo, app, or career goals. Build relationships and get feedback.
• **Help Wanted** – Looking for a co-founder, DevOps hand, designer, or marketer? Post or respond here.
• **Industry Room Tech** – Dive into the newest programming trends, frameworks, and stacks shaping the future.
• **Projects & Collabs** – A showcase area tailored for **developer project sharing platforms**, where you can post demos, join builds, or spark new ideas.
• **Coding Sprints & Accountability Pods** – For those building in public or looking for **peer coding accountability groups**, this space will keep your momentum strong.

**📍 Where:**
Join virtually at:
👉 https://events.tao.ai/pod/ai.bharath.club/te5gd5wngmz9

**🕓 When:**
The event takes place from **4:00 PM – 6:00 PM local time**, globally. Join to network, hire, learn, and collaborate.

**👥 Who Should Attend:**

• Developers and software engineers across all stacks
• Data professionals, AI researchers, and machine learning engineers
• Startup founders and tech entrepreneurs
• Recruiters and employers hiring in the tech space
• Students and learners aiming to connect and grow in the industry
• Tech enthusiasts looking to explore career pivots, personal projects, or trends

**🔧 Why You’ll Love It:**

• Connect with professionals, recruiters, and peers in real time
• Explore a live **tech job fair online** that’s open and interactive
• Showcase your innovations, code, or startup demo
• Get feedback or help on your latest dev build
• Join project-based groups or accountability pods to stay productive
• Make global tech connections via 1-on-1 **video and text chats**

**❓ Have Questions or Suggestions?**
We’re here to help. Reach out at:
👉 https://noworkerleftbehind.org/event_support

**🔖 Hashtags:**
#TechConnect #VirtualTechNetworkingEvent #OnlineDeveloperCommunityMeetup #TechJobFairOnline #DeveloperProjectShowcasePlatform #PeerCodingAccountabilityGroup #AIJobs #DataScienceNetworking #SoftwareEngineerMeetup #GlobalTechEvent #TechCareersVirtual",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/8/1/c/highres_526346652.jpeg,2026-11-04 10:30:00+00,2026-11-04 12:30:00+00,Asia/Kolkata,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{technology,careers,entrepreneurship,ai}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/ai-hyd/events/315841775/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 03:22:46.934486+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/ai-hyd/events/315841775/,event_315841775@meetup.com,,2026-10-22 03:22:12.257+00,,2026-10-22 03:22:46.934486+00,2026-10-22 03:22:55.425823+00,,,meetup:ai-hyd:techconnect global virtual job networking event for data ai and tech pros,"Every 1st Wednesday of the month until December 2, 2026",f,
33660889-f22f-47cf-a634-eeecc3b2a253,,[PAID]-AI Training for Product Owners (PSPO-AI),Are you still managing your product backlog the old-fashioned way?,"**Are you still managing your product backlog the old-fashioned way?**

In 2026, AI is no longer just a buzzword; it is a strategic partner. If you want to stay ahead in product management, ask yourself:

• Do you want to use AI to proactively identify new product opportunities?
• Are you tired of manual grooming and want AI-driven insights to simplify Backlog prioritization?
• Do you want to use AI tools to deeply understand real-time customer needs and enhance user journeys?
• Are your competitors accelerating their product development cycles using GenAI?

If you answered YES to any of these, it is time to transition from a manual task-doer into an AI Orchestrator. You are invited to join our intensive, one-day workshop.

Link to Register & Secure Your Seat (https://productleadersdayindia.org/trainings/ai-product-owner.html)

**About the Workshop**
The Professional Scrum Product Owner – AI Essentials (PSPO-AI Essentials) is a highly interactive, hands-on course tailored specifically for Product Owners, Product Managers, and Business Analysts.

Building seamlessly upon Scrum.org's (https://www.scrum.org/sanjay-saini) foundational PSPO curriculum, this training dives deep into practical AI applications. You won't just learn theory; you will explore a newly introduced PO stance emphasizing AI ethics and security, learning how to leverage AI tools responsibly to gain a massive competitive advantage.

**What You Will Master**
Participants will leave equipped with immediately applicable AI-driven capabilities, including how to:

• Speak the Language of AI: Confidently explain Machine Learning, Generative AI, and Agentic AI in business-centric terms.
• Automate Your Backlog: Use tools like ChatGPT and Synthesia to optimize daily responsibilities, draft User Stories, and refine backlogs instantly.
• Enhance Stakeholder Alignment: Integrate AI insights seamlessly into everyday product management workflows to drive data-backed decisions.
• Lead with Ethics: Advocate for responsible AI practices, protecting your product from bias, hallucinations, and security risks.

**Who Should Attend?**

• Product Owners & Product Managers
• Business Analysts
• Agile Coaches and Scrum Masters looking to support their POs
• Business Leaders involved in product strategy

**What Your Registration Includes:**
💎 One FREE attempt at the industry-recognized Scrum.org (https://www.scrum.org/sanjay-saini) PSPO-AI certification exam.
💎 A Second FREE attempt (if the first is taken within 14 days and not passed).
💎 7 PDUs/SEUs for your professional credentials.
💎 A comprehensive soft-copy Training Reference Guide.

Please WhatsApp to +91-8368865197 or drop a note to support@agilewow.com for more details.

