a1a7a445-c08d-4216-a1fe-53f958fa7418,,HacktoberFest Hack Day,"Join us for a two-round buildathon organised by AWS Student Builder Group at RV University, in collaboration with ECell RVU.","Join us for a two-round buildathon organised by AWS Student Builder Group at RV University, in collaboration with ECell RVU.

**How It Works:**
**Round 1: Online PPT Screening**
• Choose a provided problem statement or participate in Open Innovation.
• Submit your proposed solution using the mandatory PPT template via Google Form.
• Deadline: 22 October 2026.

**Round 2: In-Person Hackathon & Pitch**
• The top 25 teams advance to RV University on 31 October 2026 to build, demo, and pitch their solutions to the judging panel.
Team Requirements
• Teams of up to 4 members.
• Every member must register on the official MLH event page.
• Only the team lead submits the Round 1 form, once per team.

**Important:** Developing your solution before arriving at the hackathon venue is strictly prohibited and may result in disqualification. This event is only for students.

**Resources:**
**Problem Statements:** https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JQIZVWEpxd_JpSd_FUU2OWkZfvR6XPuG/view

**Mandatory PPT Template:** https://canva.link/23gb9j6p0n2h879

**Round 1 Submission Form:** https://forms.gle/75LecNp7Mazi29ib8

**Official MLH Registration:** https://events.mlh.com/events/15139-hacktoberfest-hack-day-bengaluru-x-aws-sbg-rvu

**Note:** Meetup RSVP alone does not guarantee participation. Registration on the official MLH event page is mandatory.

