8a72745e-6884-48fc-846b-e99806dad07f,,"Understanding AI Governance Standards, Frameworks & Regulations","Understanding AI Governance Standards, Frameworks & Regulations","**Understanding AI Governance Standards, Frameworks & Regulations**

As organizations move from experimenting with AI to deploying **Copilots, AI applications, models, and autonomous agents at enterprise scale**, understanding how to govern AI is becoming increasingly important. But with standards, frameworks, principles, regulations, and security guidance evolving rapidly, organizations often face a fundamental question: **Which ones apply, how do they fit together, and how do we turn their requirements into practical controls?**

Join us for **Session 2 of the Enterprise AI Governance Webinar Series**, where we’ll explore the major **industry standards, frameworks, and regulations shaping Enterprise AI Governance** and, more importantly, how organizations can translate their requirements into actionable governance and technical controls.
We’ll discuss **ISO/IEC 42001, NIST AI Risk Management Framework (AI RMF), OECD AI Principles, the EU AI Act, Gartner AI TRiSM, Microsoft Responsible AI, OWASP and MITRE ATLAS**, understand how these approaches complement one another, identify their common governance requirements, and explore how those requirements can be mapped to capabilities across the **Microsoft ecosystem**, including identity, security, data protection, compliance, AI platforms, monitoring, and audit.

📅 **23 October 2026 | 6:00 PM IST**
💻 **Virtual Event | Zoom**

Whether you're an **IT or business leader, Enterprise Architect, security or compliance professional, risk or privacy practitioner, AI professional, developer, or IT administrator**, this session will help you understand the evolving AI governance landscape and how to move from **standards and requirements to practical enterprise controls**.

**Speakers:**
**Vignesh Ganesan** — Enterprise Architect | Microsoft MVP, MCT, AIGP, TOGAF, PMP & ITIL

**Narasima Perumal Chandramohan** — Co-Founder, JiJi Technologies | Microsoft MVP

🎥 **Session Recordings:**
Recordings from the Enterprise AI Governance Webinar Series will be available on the Vignesh Ganesan YouTube Channel (https://www.youtube.com/@VigneshGanesan?utm_source=chatgpt.com).",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/b/5/5/e/highres_536506430.jpeg,2026-10-23 12:30:00+00,,Asia/Kolkata,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{technology,ai}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-365ug/events/316868389/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 03:22:46.934486+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-365ug/events/316868389/,event_316868389@meetup.com,,2026-10-22 03:22:12.257+00,,2026-10-22 03:22:46.934486+00,2026-10-22 03:22:57.751613+00,,,,,f,
