07a22f62-9622-4d1e-ae1c-7e8e245368f0,,Cloud & Beyond: An Introduction to Cloud Computing and AWS,"Curious about cloud computing and want to know how it powers the technology we use every day? Join us for Cloud & Beyond, an introductory online webinar organized by the AWS Student Builder Group at…","Curious about cloud computing and want to know how it powers the technology we use every day? Join us for **Cloud & Beyond**, an introductory online webinar organized by the **AWS Student Builder Group at SRMCEM, Lucknow**.

Whether you're interested in cloud computing, software development, AI, or emerging technologies, this session will introduce you to the fundamentals of cloud computing, explore Amazon Web Services (AWS) and its essential services, and showcase how cloud technology is used to solve real-world problems. Whether you're just starting out or exploring new career possibilities, this webinar is your opportunity to take the first step into the world of cloud computing.

What You'll Learn

• Fundamentals of Cloud Computing and its importance
• Introduction to AWS and its key services, including EC2, S3, IAM, VPC, and Lambda
• Real-world applications and use cases of cloud technology
• Getting started with the AWS Management Console
• Best practices and essential tips for beginners
• AWS learning resources, certification pathways, and career opportunities

Who Should Attend?

• Students curious about cloud computing and AWS
• Aspiring developers and tech enthusiasts eager to explore new technologies
• Students interested in AI, DevOps, software development, and cloud engineering
• Beginners looking to build technical skills and explore career opportunities in the tech industry
• Anyone eager to learn and discover cloud technology

Prerequisites

No prior knowledge of cloud computing or AWS is required. All you need is an interest in learning and exploring new technologies.

Event Details

**Event Name:** Cloud & Beyond
**Date:** 31 October 2026
**Time:** 6:00 PM – 8:00 PM IST
**Mode:** Online Webinar via Google Meet
**Target Attendance:** Approximately 50 participants
**Organized by:** AWS Student Builder Group, SRMCEM, Lucknow
Join us for our inaugural event as we explore the world of cloud computing, discover the possibilities of AWS, and take the first step toward building cloud technology skills.

We look forward to having you with us!
**AWS Student Builder Group (AWS SBG)**
