fd99be39-71a9-4d82-813c-7402ccc6c741,,Weekend Walk — Regent's Canal,Sign-up is only possible via the WeMeet app: https://onelink.to/wemeet,"**Sign-up is only possible via the WeMeet app:** https://onelink.to/wemeet
**Sunday afternoon, London, nothing on? Come for a walk.** 👋
Two hours along the canal, starting in Maida Vale and heading east past Little Venice, through Regent's Park and along London Zoo, ending at Camden Lock. **4–5 km, easy pace**, plenty of time to talk. 🌳
Camden Lock is a good place to stop — anyone who fancies it stays on for a coffee. ☕
👟 **Comfortable shoes are all you need.** We walk in drizzle and call it off in proper rain.
**Most people come on their own and don't know anyone beforehand — that's rather the point.** Nothing to bring, nothing to prepare, nobody to know. Just turning up is enough. 🙂
💬 **There's no host at this event — what there is instead is the event chat.** Do say hello there beforehand, it makes finding each other on the day much easier.
**And please only sign up if you actually plan to come** — it's fairer to everyone else who'd like a spot. 🙏",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/4/8/d/5/highres_536478645.jpeg,2026-11-01 14:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,London,"London, UK",London,8827b689-2637-4245-8ba7-214b35948ea2,"{sport,fitness}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/wemeet-london/events/316865688/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,source:f26eb5d4-b239-4813-8e0c-3cf689eed4bd,https://www.meetup.com/wemeet-london/events/316865688/,event_316865688@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:30.379+00,,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,2026-10-28 03:22:55.486349+00,,,,,f,GB
