d9360887-1fdf-4d89-823c-1aba338290fa,,🍂 RICHMOND PARK AUTUMN COLOURS & ISABELLA PLANTATION 🍁 FREE HIKE,Join us for a relaxed but rewarding 17 km Sunday hike through Richmond Park at one of the most spectacular times of year.,"Join us for a relaxed but rewarding **17 km Sunday hike through Richmond Park** at one of the most spectacular times of year.

🍁 **THE AUTUMN COLOUR EXPERIENCE**

Autumn transforms the park with rich reds, oranges, golds and browns, while **Isabella Plantation** becomes one of the highlights of the season. The Royal Parks specifically describes October as a peak period for autumn colour at Isabella, with the **Acer Glade** particularly spectacular as the Japanese maples turn scarlet, orange and gold.

🦅 **LOCAL KNOWLEDGE MATTERS**

I've lived in Richmond for most of my life and know Richmond Park intimately. Rather than simply following the obvious route, we’ll explore a mixture of **well-known viewpoints, beautiful woodland, open parkland and quieter corners** that are easy to miss if you don’t know the park well. This is an English-speaking social hike for people who enjoy walking, nature, good conversation and discovering interesting places.

🌳 **WHAT WE'LL SEE**

🍁 **Isabella Plantation** spectacular autumn colours
🌳 **Thomson’s Lawn** & woodland garden
🍂 **The Acer Glade** in brilliant autumn colours
💧 **Brownie’s Stream** & Main Stream
🦌 **Richmond Park’s free-roaming deer**
🏞️ **Pen Ponds** & surrounding parkland
🌿 **Tamsin Trail** & quieter sections of park
✨ **King Henry’s Mound** & St Paul’s Cathedral view
🍰 **Pembroke Lodge** & Thames Valley views
🌅 **Richmond Hill** & famous view over Thames Valley

📍 **QUICK INFO**

📅 **Date:** Sunday 25 October 2026
📍 **Start:** **Richmond Station (https://maps.app.goo.gl/5Uw1bmQ2Kwp7Yv6y5)** - main entrance
⏰ **Meet:** 9:45 am | **Start:** 10:00 am sharp
🥾 **Distance:** Approximately **17 km circular route**
⏱️ **Duration:** Around 4½ – 5 hours
⚖️ **Difficulty:** **Moderate**
🚶 **Pace:** Steady
🚾 Various toilets available on the route
💷 **Price:** **FREE — Registration Required (https://avalanx.es/experiencias/richmond-park?lang=en)**

*The route includes a number of gentle inclines and declines and is suitable for people who are comfortable walking 17 km over several hours.*

🚨 **REGISTRATION IS REQUIRED**

Although this is a **FREE hike**, you must register through our platform to secure your place.
An RSVP on Meetup alone **does not secure your spot**.

👉 **Register here:** https://avalanx.es/experiencias/richmond-park?lang=en

This allows us to keep the group organised and provide the relevant meeting and preparation information.
After registration, you’ll receive your unique **Booking Reference** and the logistics for the day.

📱 **ON THE DAY**

If you are running late or have difficulty finding the group on Sunday, you can call or text the organiser on: **07447 162 666** (Please use this number for **on-the-day logistics only**).

🍻 **OPTIONAL SOCIAL FINISH**

🌄 We´ll aim for the sunset over Richmond view
🍻 We'll finish back in Richmond. If you'd like to stay afterwards, you're very welcome to join us for an **optional drink, coffee or bite to eat** at a local pub. No pressure — the official hike finishes when we return to Richmond Station.

🎒 **WHAT TO BRING**

🥾 Comfortable walking shoes or hiking boots
💧 **1.5–2 litres of water**
🥪 Packed lunch and snacks
🧥 **Waterproof jacket** and warm layers
📱 Fully charged phone

🦌 **DEER & PARK SAFETY**

Richmond Park is home to wild deer and **October is part of the annual deer rut**. We will enjoy the wildlife from a **safe distance** and follow the park guidance. Please never approach, feed or attempt to photograph deer at close range.

🚩 **MORE THAN A WALK**

This hike is also an introduction to 🦅 ***AVALANX* | Secrets of Spain** 🛡️ A community built around discovering Spain beyond the obvious tourist routes.

We organise **group walking adventures, outdoor experiences and curated trips across Spain**, combining nature, local knowledge, food, history and great company.

🌍 **DISCOVER SECRETS OF SPAIN**
Find out more about our Spanish adventures and follow the journey:
🌐 https://avalanx.es/

📸 **Instagram:** @avalanx.es

*🍂 Come for the **autumn colours**. Stay for the walk, the conversation and a drink afterwards. Let's discover Richmond Park together!* 🥾🍁🦌

⚖ **TERMS & CONDITIONS (https://avalanx.es/terminos-y-condiciones)**

Instagram (https://www.instagram.com/avalanx.es/) | Facebook (https://www.facebook.com/secretosdeespana/) | TikTok (https://www.tiktok.com/@avalanx.es) | **Google Reviews (https://share.google/aimode/BqgWs8o8PfmqgQyUU)**",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/f/0/8/highres_532524328.jpeg,2026-10-25 10:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,Richmond Train Station/underground,The Quadrant,Richmond,c06699ed-62e0-4957-bcb4-080c5271da9a,"{sport,travel,fitness}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/secrets-of-spain/events/316738811/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,source:f26eb5d4-b239-4813-8e0c-3cf689eed4bd,https://www.meetup.com/secrets-of-spain/events/316738811/,event_316738811@meetup.com,,2026-10-25 03:22:37.598+00,,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,2026-10-25 03:23:00.161242+00,,,,,f,GB
