d9306047-6484-4973-8016-05ceb3dbe992,,AI Design Kickstart Workshop,"Get your AI design workspace ready, then put it to work on your own project.","Get your AI design workspace ready, then put it to work on your own project.
AI Design Kickstart Workshop is a free online pilot for up to four designers. In two hours, I’ll help you understand your starting point, set up the tools and context you need, and practise an AI-assisted workflow with individual support.
What we’ll do
• Start with introductions, an overview and a practical demonstration.
• Look at your current setup and what you want to build.
• Work through your AI design workstation setup using Claude or other agents as appropriate.
• Practise on your own project, with time for questions and troubleshooting.
Bring a laptop, a reliable internet connection, and a project or non-confidential practice example. Have access to the tool accounts you want to use. The workshop is free, but some tools may require your own subscription. Please keep private client and employer information out of the session.
10:00–12:00 Amsterdam time (CET, UTC+1)
Online via Zoom. Check the event time in your own timezone before booking.
Reserve your workshop seat at https://luma.com/r9fl98wd
Luma is the only reservation source for the four participant places. A Meetup RSVP alone does not reserve a seat. Zoom joining details are provided through Luma to confirmed participants. If full, join the Luma waitlist.
These free pilots help me learn what is most useful and improve the workshop. Honest feedback is welcome and optional. You do not need to leave a positive review or give permission for a public testimonial to take part. No participant recording is planned.",,2026-10-31 09:00:00+00,,Europe/Amsterdam,online,Online event,,,4cece675-2670-4581-90e6-2b792576b047,"{technology,creative,ai}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/eindhoven-user-experience-meetup-group/events/316971561/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:16:55.807095+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/eindhoven-user-experience-meetup-group/events/316971561/,event_316971561@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-21 22:16:55.807095+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.493162+00,,,,,f,
1c69415b-84ab-4349-9ad4-5a6aa7fb1006,,AI Builders London - Nov 10,🎟️ GET TICKETS ON LUMA (https://lu.ma/lon-nov10) 🎟️,"🎟️ GET TICKETS ON LUMA (https://lu.ma/lon-nov10) 🎟️
Join our informal meetup for the biggest AI nerds!

We share the latest insights about: AI dev tools, Agent frameworks, RAG, vibe coding, OpenClaw, Claude Code and more!

// FOR WHO

✅ Devs, Product peeps, Data lovers, ML engineers, Founders

✅ Anyone building with AI

⚠️ Some LLM knowledge required!*

// FORMAT

🎤 Innovative AI Demos — from EU + Silicon Valley leaders

💻 Builder Tool Demos — ship fast, explain faster

🤝 🍻 A LOT of time for informal networking

🍕 Yummy Pizza & Snacks

// AGENDA

18:00 🍕 Pizza, Drinks & Networking

18:30 💻 When an AI Agent is Authorized – but the Action Isn’t

• Dave Bennet (https://www.linkedin.com/in/dave-bennett-4bb6537) @ Indykite

18:50 💻 What’s That? Using AI to Make Sense of Your Whatsapp Group!

• Martin O'Hanlon (https://www.linkedin.com/in/martinohanlon) @ Neo4j

19:10 💻 TBA

19:30 🪑 Open Panel

21:00 🔚 End

// FAQ

What is AI Builders? A self-organizing nonprofit community of 5000+ AI nerds 🤓. We're building a democratic AI platform, to make our community completely co-owned and co-governed by you (yes, all attendees).

New question?

Will it be recorded? Yes, some sessions are streamed live and recorded. By attending, you consent to being photographed and filmed. Let us know if you don't want to be on camera.

I'm not technical. Can I come? Yes, but to actually enjoy the meetup we recommend understanding basic LLM concepts: Agents, Embeddings, RAG, MCPs, Inference, Structured Output, Finetuning, APIs, Reinforcement Learning. Not sure what those mean? Ask any chatbot — that's literally what they're for.

Can I get a free ticket? Can I volunteer? Money should never be the reason not to join. If you need a sponsored ticket, or want to help out by arriving 1.5h early to set up, message Dan (https://aib.club/dans).

Can I demo, give a talk, or just help out? Message Dan (https://aib.club/dans) if you want to shine ✨ on stage and grow your network — community demos are 10 minutes, builder demos are 15-20 minutes.

What time does the event start? The event starts at 18:00 on Tuesday, 10 November.

Where is the venue located? The event will be held at Civo Tech Junction, First Floor, 32-37 Cowper St, London EC2A 4AW, UK, England.

Is food provided? Yes! We'll have pizza and drinks available.

// VENUE & SPONSORS

We look forward to hanging out with you!

Thanks to our friends for hosting us in their beautiful space.

// ABOUT THE CLUB

AI Builders (https://aibuilders.club) is a community organizing 100+ meetups and hackathons per year in Europe and the US. We're 6000+ devs, founders & engineers and growing fast! -> Grow with us! (https://aibuilders.club/contribute)

