1881b472-a45f-4e83-b0bc-46d4e2e3bfdc,,Build Your AI Clone: The One File That Makes AI Sound Like You,Most people's AI output sounds like everyone else's. There's a specific reason — and a specific fix.,"**Most people's AI output sounds like everyone else's. There's a specific reason — and a specific fix.**

Every time you open ChatGPT or Copilot, it starts from zero. It doesn't know who you are, who you serve, how you talk, or what you'd never say. So you get back something polished and anonymous, you spend twenty minutes editing it into sounding like you, and eventually you think: I could've just written this myself.
That's not a prompting problem. It's an onboarding problem.

**This is a working session, not a webinar.** Bring a laptop. By the end of 45 minutes you'll have built a Personal AI DNA file for your own business — one page of plain text that makes every AI session afterward sound like you instead of a stranger.

**What we'll cover**

• What AI actually is, in plain language — and honestly what it can't do
• Three things from the news that matter to you as a business owner
• Where this is heading, and the one thing that doesn't change as the tools do
• Why your AI output feels generic, and why it isn't your fault
• The six components of a Personal AI DNA file, with real examples
• A four-minute trick for capturing your writing voice
• **The build:** I'll write mine live on screen while you write yours
• **The test:** run the same request with and without it, and see the difference on your own screen

**What you'll need**
A laptop and a free ChatGPT, Claude, Copilot or Gemini account. No paid plan. No software to buy. Notepad is genuinely enough.

**Who this is for**
Business owners, coaches, consultants and freelancers who write a lot and resent how long it takes — especially if you've tried AI and found the output too generic to actually use. Complete beginners are welcome; so are daily users, who tend to get the most out of the second half.

**About me**
I'm Emery Layton, a licensed Professional Engineer with 25 years in water and wastewater infrastructure. I work in a field where being wrong carries real liability, so I had to make AI work under constraints most people never deal with — it had to be accurate, consistent, and sound like me. That's the version I teach: built for reliability, not for show.
At the end I'll mention a paid workshop for anyone who wants to go further. It's genuinely optional — the class stands on its own, and everyone leaves with the template whether they buy anything or not.
💻 Online — Microsoft Teams link sent to RSVPs
⏱️ 45 minutes, plus Q&A for anyone who wants to stay
💻 **Bring a laptop — we build during the class**",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/7/2/0/4/highres_536429188.jpeg,2026-10-22 00:00:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{technology,ai}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/ai-strategy-lab-manchester/events/316831665/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:16:55.807095+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/ai-strategy-lab-manchester/events/316831665/,event_316831665@meetup.com,,2026-10-21 22:16:27.132+00,,2026-10-21 22:16:55.807095+00,2026-10-21 22:16:58.705458+00,,,,,f,
6ad4d0e6-2507-4f48-933f-fb0b644305b4,,Free Public Speaking: Beginners to Advanced – Central London Toastmasters,🎤 Join Our Free Public Speaking Class in Central London,"🎤 **Join Our Free Public Speaking Class in Central London**

• 🌟 Are you struggling with public speaking or experiencing anxiety about it?
• 👉 Attend our in-person public speaking class, suitable for beginners to advanced speakers, absolutely FREE as a guest!

*You don't need to speak - just observe and learn, or participate if you feel ready.*

**Why Attend Our Public Speaking Class?**

• 💪 **Overcome Public Speaking Fear**
Central London Toastmasters is the premier weekly public speaking club, offering a relaxed and supportive environment. Practice in a safe space where no one judges you, and start your journey to becoming a confident speaker.
• ✨ **Become a Charismatic Speaker**
Enhance your public speaking skills and develop the charisma you've always wanted. Impress your colleagues with smooth, polished presentations and wow your friends with newfound confidence and storytelling abilities.
• 💼 **Improve Business Speaking Skills**
Our meetings are friendly and informal, making them the perfect starting point for building confidence in public speaking. Many of our members began with anxiety, but now speak with total confidence. As a guest, you’ll see firsthand how warm and welcoming our club is, and you can chat with members about their experiences.
• 🏆 **Develop Leadership Skills**
Public speaking is not just about presenting; it's also about leading. Our club provides opportunities to take on leadership roles, helping you to develop crucial skills like team management, decision-making, and strategic thinking that can benefit your personal and professional life.

📅 **Location and Time**

• 📍 Location: Cittie of Yorke pub, Holborn
• ⏰ Time: 6:30 PM – 8:30 PM (Feel free to arrive late and quietly take a seat)

🔄 **What to Expect at Our Meetings**

• The meeting is divided into two halves, each lasting approximately 50 minutes, with a 10-minute break.
• 🎯 First Half: Members participate in impromptu speeches, and guests are invited to introduce themselves by name.
• 📈 Second Half: Members deliver prepared speeches followed by evaluations.
• After the meeting, we enjoy drinks and informal chats, providing a great opportunity to network and learn more about the club.

🎟️ **Interested in Becoming a Member?**
Membership includes access to our online course, Pathways, guiding you step-by-step through your public speaking journey. A full year’s membership, covering 50 weekly meetings, is just £168, plus a one-time £30 registration fee.

**💬 Testimonials from Our Members**

• **“Toastmasters transformed my life!”**
""I went from fearing public speaking to leading meetings at work. This newfound confidence even earned me a promotion!"" – **Alexander**
• **""A warm and supportive club!""**
""From the first meeting, I felt welcomed. The constructive feedback boosted my confidence both in public speaking and daily life."" – **Sarah**
• **""Overcoming my fear was easier than I thought.""**
""The support here made my sales presentations more impactful and less stressful. It's been a game-changer for me professionally."" – **David**
• **""A fun and rewarding experience.""**
