0d9f9f70-5b17-48e4-89f4-b40f82faf5f8,,My Gardening Journey (And Yours!): Let’s Chat About Plants & Growth,"Welcome to our very first casual plant meetup! Before we begin, I want to dedicate our inaugural session to the stories behind our green spaces.","Welcome to our very first casual plant meetup! Before we begin, I want to dedicate our inaugural session to the stories behind our green spaces.
Every plant lover started somewhere. Some of us inherited a green thumb from our family, some of us bought a single pothos to decorate a work desk, and some of us turned to urban gardening simply to find a pocket of peace and mindfulness in a busy city.
This is a 100% casual, friendly, and low-pressure virtual chat. Grab a cup of tea, find a cozy spot, and let’s connect!
**🌱 What we will talk about and share:**

• **Our Gardening Journeys:** I will share the story of how I fell in love with plants and how it led me to start this community. I’d love to hear what spark got *you* interested in gardening!
• **Show & Tell:** If you wish,bring one plant to the camera (or just a photo on your phone!) that you absolutely love, or even one that you are currently struggling to keep alive.
• **Group Chat & Solves:** We will casually chat about what kinds of plants or balcony spaces you have, and what you’d love to talk about in our future weekend gatherings.

**📌 How to Join:**

