64c144b5-a67b-4104-ad45-885cf58275ac,,Saturday night spooky stories,Be ready for a spooky saturday night.,"Be ready for a spooky saturday night.

Every saturday, we would have new people, new stories, and new experiences to share.

This is going to be a video podcast for my YouTube channel, at the luxury of your homes.
Interested people can RSVP, and we can share a few stories

***Kindly subscribe to our channel to stay updated. The meeting link will be available in the description of our live event, which airs every Saturday at 10:00 PM IST.***

https://youtube.com/@boobarkbanter?si=tqMk7LUZK20QUorV

Rules -
1. We need to have at least one story to share
2. Need to be open-minded
3. Make sure you are alone in your room with very minimal to no background noise.
4. Set your ambience accordingly, low light, silence, eerie, etc.

Please register only if you are okay with me posting the session on YouTube.

