74b29610-031a-4555-8ec5-ccc4335ccad8,,Business Growth Connect,Business Growth Connect,"Business Growth Connect

Networking & Collaboration for Entrepreneurs, Business Owners & Freelancers

**Running a business can feel lonely—but it doesn't have to be.**
Whether you're building a startup, growing a business, freelancing, or simply looking to connect with ambitious people, **Business Growth Connect** is a weekly networking session designed to help you learn, collaborate, and grow together.
This is not a sales pitch or a traditional networking event where people exchange business cards and leave. It's a community where members openly discuss real business challenges, share experiences, and help each other find practical solutions.

What You'll Gain

✅ Meet entrepreneurs, founders, freelancers, consultants, and professionals from different industries.
✅ Get fresh perspectives on your business challenges.
✅ Learn from the successes and mistakes of other business owners.
✅ Discover collaboration opportunities and potential partnerships.
✅ Expand your professional network in a supportive environment.

Discussion Topics

Bring your questions or experiences around topics such as:

• Sales & Lead Generation
• Marketing & Branding
• Business Strategy
• Operations
• Customer Acquisition
• Service Delivery
• Productivity & Systems
• Hiring & Team Building
• AI & Technology for Business
• Personal Growth as a Founder
• Any challenge related to building or growing a business

No question is too small, and no business is ""too early.""

Who Should Attend?

This meetup is ideal for:

• Entrepreneurs
• Startup Founders
• Small Business Owners
• Freelancers
• Consultants
• Coaches & Trainers
• Solopreneurs
• Professionals planning to start a business

Event Format (60 Minutes)

**🟢 Welcome & Introductions** (10 mins)
Meet fellow participants and briefly introduce yourself.
**🟢 Open Networking & Discussion** (40 mins)
Participants bring their business questions, challenges, and ideas while the group brainstorms practical solutions together.
**🟢 Key Takeaways & Next Steps** (10 mins)
Summarize insights, exchange contact information, and identify collaboration opportunities.

Submit a brief profile here: https://zfrmz.in/SXMql5oRgqHEV5Z2Hv9i

Join the Whats App group here: https://chat.whatsapp.com/KE0MOKRTTHM6kVtIgqWILK

Hosted By

**AJ**
Founder, **Bharat Knowledge Solutions**
