12e9ddc9-ede3-415e-9e12-cc5b58ef6741,,"Lead With Tech: The Next Chapter — AI, Copilots & Agentic Engineering","At Lead With Tech, we're preparing for an exciting new chapter!","At **Lead With Tech**, we're preparing for an exciting new chapter!
Join us for a special two-hour live session where we'll explore practical AI capabilities, demonstrate how AI is transforming software engineering, and unveil what we're planning for the next three months at Lead With Tech.
This is more than a regular meetup. It's an opportunity to experience what's possible, discover what's coming, and help shape the future of our learning community.

🔥 What We'll Explore

🤖 **AI Productivity — Work Smarter, Not Just Faster**
Discover how AI can improve everyday productivity, accelerate research and problem-solving, streamline repetitive tasks, and enhance the way you learn and work.
💻 **GitHub Copilot — Beyond Code Completion**
See how AI coding assistants can help you understand codebases, generate and refactor code, write tests, debug issues, and improve your software development workflow.
🧠 **Agentic SDLC — The Next Evolution of Software Engineering**
Explore how AI agents are changing the software development lifecycle, from requirements and planning to implementation, testing, code reviews, and delivery. Understand where human expertise remains essential and how engineers can adapt.
🗺️ **The Lead With Tech Roadmap: October–December**
Get a preview of our plans for the next three months, including weekday learning sessions, hands-on workshops, emerging AI tools, practical engineering experiences, and opportunities to grow together.
🤝 **Help Shape Our Next Chapter**
This is your community, and your voice matters. Share your ideas, tell us what you want to learn, and help us create experiences that deliver real value to technology professionals.

🗓️ Our 2-Hour Agenda

| Time | Session |
| ---- | ------- |
| 00:00–00:15 | **Welcome to the Next Chapter:** Lead With Tech's journey, vision, and the opportunities ahead. |
| 00:15–00:40 | **AI Productivity:** Practical AI workflows, smarter prompting, and everyday productivity demonstrations. |
| 00:40–01:05 | **GitHub Copilot:** Codebase understanding, code generation, testing, refactoring, and debugging. |
| 01:05–01:15 | **Break & Community Poll:** Share your AI adoption level and learning priorities. |
| 01:15–01:40 | **Agentic SDLC:** Explore AI agents across the software development lifecycle, with a practical workflow example. |
| 01:40–01:55 | **The Lead With Tech Roadmap:** Discover our October–December plans, upcoming learning experiences, and hands-on workshops. |
| 01:55–02:00 | **Your Voice, Our Next Steps:** Share feedback, ask questions, and help shape what's coming. |

🌟 Who Should Attend?

Software developers, tech leads, architects, engineering managers, AI enthusiasts, and anyone curious about how AI is changing the future of technology.
Whether you're just beginning your AI journey or already experimenting with AI-powered engineering, you'll leave with new ideas, practical insights, and a clearer view of what's ahead.
**Every minute with Lead With Tech is an investment in learning, growth, and your future.**
