60bd9d67-d5e2-4eac-82f6-3cef4f6e2352,,From “Unexplained” to Empowered: Boost Your Chances of Conception,"This experience is designed for individuals and couples navigating unexplained infertility and who feel heartbroken, confused, and stuck despite doing everything they’ve been told is “right.”","This experience is designed for individuals and couples navigating unexplained infertility and who feel heartbroken, confused, and stuck despite doing everything they’ve been told is “right.”
This may resonate if they are:

• Being told that “everything looks normal,” yet conception still doesn’t happen;
• Experiencing failed IVF cycles with no clear medical explanation;
• Carrying guilt, self-blame, or a sense that their body has betrayed them.

In this live webinar, **Aurore** explores how the **mind–body connection** can play a powerful role in fertility. She explains why conventional medicine may not always be able to identify the root cause of infertility and how emotional blocks, subconscious beliefs, and long-term stress patterns can quietly interfere with the body’s ability to conceive.
Aurore works using **hypnotherapy**, which has been shown to significantly increase conception rates. This approach helps release unconscious fears, calm the nervous system, and reprogram limiting beliefs around the body, self-worth, and the ability to become a parent.
Participants will learn how this method can support conception through both **natural routes and assisted medical pathways such as IVF**.
The work extends into a **3-month program**, designed to create a deep shift in subconscious programming that may be blocking conception.
The intention is to guide participants from feeling powerless and “unexplained” to feeling calmer, informed, and actively engaged in improving their chances of conceiving.
