3e6aa0ff-90fd-456f-922f-f191f33a84f8,,Monthly Meet | Indo-Japan Kai,Namaste & Konnichiwa! 🇮🇳🇯🇵,"**Namaste & Konnichiwa! 🇮🇳🇯🇵**

