AI is here, freeing us to do more work and build abundance into our lives. Side hustles such as building a consulting practice, content creating, or sales reach out are more accessible than ever.
Unfortunately, most ""build an AI side hustle"" content is made by people whose only business is selling AI side hustle content. This isn't that. Mohit has built real revenue for companies like SurveyMonkey and CompStak — and runs his own ventures that have made $30,000+ per month — using the same AI-assisted process he'll walk through here.
In 60 minutes, you won't just hear *why* a side business matters — you'll leave with a shortlist of ones you're already qualified to start.
Here's how the session works: Mohit makes the honest case for why a second income matters in 2026 and which roles AI is reshaping fastest. Then you do the work live — running a sequence of AI prompts against your own LinkedIn or resume to surface side businesses built on the expertise you already have.
What you'll walk away with:

• A clear read on where you stand — the specific roles AI is reshaping, and why a side income is a hedge, not a hobby
• A live, hands-on exercise: run AI prompts against your own LinkedIn or resume to surface businesses you're already qualified to run
• A personalized shortlist — not generic ""start a newsletter"" advice, but directions built from *your* background and leverage
• An honest view of what ""start this weekend"" actually takes — so you leave knowing whether this is for you
• The opportunity to take your talents even further through Mohit's course — always updated with the latest strategies.

Who this is for: Professionals — especially in roles AI is reshaping (marketing, finance, ops, HR, legal, recruiting) — who want a second income stream and are ready to build, not just bookmark.
Finding the idea is the easy part. Mohit spends the end of the session on the part most people get wrong — actually getting paid.
