25cc856e-3580-4ea9-b71f-c9dfabda2689,,NODES 2026,"NODES, the biggest community gathering dedicated to engineering better intelligence returns on November 12, 2026, for its eighth year.","**NODES**, the biggest community gathering dedicated to engineering better intelligence returns on **November 12, 2026**, for its eighth year.
