9e4f364d-b6bb-4813-aaf6-a31820acbbdb,,Gentle end of the week – half hour only - Online exercise class and chat after,"This exercise session is aimed at people over 50. Our exercises are gentle but effective. There will be no floor exercises in this session, but you can expect to work hard!","This exercise session is aimed at people over 50. Our exercises are gentle but effective. There will be no floor exercises in this session, but you can expect to work hard!

