1f398ce4-fa33-4ae8-954c-5585c12d26d0,,YIN YOGA LAB,Yin Lab | Online yoga,"**Yin Lab | Online yoga**
Yin Lab is a laboratory: you practise, and you understand what happens to your body when it slows down.
I am Federica Masci, an occupational health researcher and yoga teacher. I have studied stress for eighteen years, in the lab and in the field. In Yin Lab I bring what I know about the nervous system into a slow practice of long held postures, read through the symbolic map of Chinese medicine.
**What to expect**
• postures held three to five minutes, always with props
• a short explanation each time of what is happening to fascia, breath and nervous system
• no performance, no level required
**Who it is for**
People who work a lot, sleep badly, and notice they have lost their slow gear. Beginners welcome.
**What you need**
A mat, two cushions or a blanket, a connection. Live online sessions.
Join the group to get the dates of the next cycles.
