*Register for this free webinar and walk away knowing exactly what it's worth — and how to sell it.*

The way people buy things is changing. Secondhand isn't a fallback anymore — it's often a first choice. especially with the holiday season coming up. Buyers are looking for quality, value, and items that aren't easy to find through retail. And in a world where availability and pricing vary more than ever depending on where you live, something common in your home might be exactly what someone in another market has been looking for.
That shift creates a real opportunity for everyday sellers — especially people who haven't thought of themselves as sellers before.
You don't need to buy inventory. You don't need a warehouse. You don't need a background in retail or tech.
You need to know what you have, what it's worth, and how to describe it accurately. That's what this webinar covers.

What You'll Learn

• How to identify an item you already own and find out exactly what it's worth
• How to use AI to evaluate condition accurately and price with confidence
• How to write a listing that sells and protects you from buyer disputes
• How to build a personal knowledge hub using NotebookLM so you're not starting from scratch every time you find something new
• A clear, realistic plan for getting your first listing live this weekend

You'll Leave With

• A fully evaluated item ready to list — one you worked through yourself, during the session
• The AI prompts to repeat this process for everything else in your house
• A NotebookLM setup guide for your category
• A weekend action plan built around 1–3 items — not an overwhelming to-do list
• An exclusive discount code for the full course, valid for webinar attendees only

Why This Matters Right Now

Consumer behavior is shifting in ways that favor secondhand sellers. More buyers are turning to resale platforms as a first choice — not because they have to, but because it makes sense. Supply chains are less predictable. Pricing varies widely across markets. And items that are easy to come by in one place may be scarce or expensive somewhere else entirely.
That means the things you already own have a buyer pool that's wider than you might think. And it means right now is a better time than ever to know what you have and how to sell it well.

About Your Host

Charles Costa, MLIS, is the creator of ResellingGuide.ai and a senior content strategist at eBay. He's been reselling since 2021, focusing on clothing and accessories sourced from estate sales and thrift stores. ResellingGuide.ai is his independent project — not affiliated with eBay.

Optional Next Step

