fe1d9d28-248e-4358-9f75-8ea672d3ac6f,,How to Build an eBay Reselling Side Hustle with AI in One Weekend,This event is being promoted by many groups.,"This event is being promoted by many groups.

Our meetup group is participating by promoting this event.

This event is organized by Albert's List.

Our meetup group is collaborating by promoting this event.

This is an online event.

Attendees can be located anywhere in the world!

This event is FREE to attend!

In order to attend, please register here:
https://www.eventbrite.com/e/2003248615535?aff=oddtdtcreator
*Register for this free webinar and walk away knowing exactly what it's worth — and how to sell it.*

The way people buy things is changing. Secondhand isn't a fallback anymore — it's often a first choice. especially with the holiday season coming up. Buyers are looking for quality, value, and items that aren't easy to find through retail. And in a world where availability and pricing vary more than ever depending on where you live, something common in your home might be exactly what someone in another market has been looking for.
That shift creates a real opportunity for everyday sellers — especially people who haven't thought of themselves as sellers before.
You don't need to buy inventory. You don't need a warehouse. You don't need a background in retail or tech.
You need to know what you have, what it's worth, and how to describe it accurately. That's what this webinar covers.

What You'll Learn

• How to identify an item you already own and find out exactly what it's worth
• How to use AI to evaluate condition accurately and price with confidence
• How to write a listing that sells and protects you from buyer disputes
• How to build a personal knowledge hub using NotebookLM so you're not starting from scratch every time you find something new
• A clear, realistic plan for getting your first listing live this weekend

You'll Leave With

• A fully evaluated item ready to list — one you worked through yourself, during the session
• The AI prompts to repeat this process for everything else in your house
• A NotebookLM setup guide for your category
• A weekend action plan built around 1–3 items — not an overwhelming to-do list
• An exclusive discount code for the full course, valid for webinar attendees only

Why This Matters Right Now

Consumer behavior is shifting in ways that favor secondhand sellers. More buyers are turning to resale platforms as a first choice — not because they have to, but because it makes sense. Supply chains are less predictable. Pricing varies widely across markets. And items that are easy to come by in one place may be scarce or expensive somewhere else entirely.
That means the things you already own have a buyer pool that's wider than you might think. And it means right now is a better time than ever to know what you have and how to sell it well.

About Your Host

Charles Costa, MLIS, is the creator of ResellingGuide.ai and a senior content strategist at eBay. He's been reselling since 2021, focusing on clothing and accessories sourced from estate sales and thrift stores. ResellingGuide.ai is his independent project — not affiliated with eBay.

Optional Next Step

At the end of the webinar, you'll have the chance to join the full course: Launch a Profitable Reselling Side Hustle Using the Items You Already Own.",,2026-11-17 18:00:00+00,,Asia/Dhaka,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{technology,ai}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/dhaka-startup-idea-to-ipo/events/316992135/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 03:22:47.855553+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/dhaka-startup-idea-to-ipo/events/316992135/,event_316992135@meetup.com,,2026-10-22 03:22:12.257+00,,2026-10-22 03:22:47.855553+00,2026-10-22 03:22:55.13788+00,,,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9:how to build an ebay reselling side hustle with ai in one weekend:online,,f,
7229e3eb-feb1-4e33-acfc-a71539fffec6,,AI for Work: Build Your Own AI-Powered CRM,Pre-Registration is REQUIRED. Joining link -https://streamyard.com/watch/ZTUy3awMp3J8,"**Pre-Registration is REQUIRED. Joining link -https://streamyard.com/watch/ZTUy3awMp3J8**

What would it take to build a CRM around the way your team actually works?

Join **Sheamus McGovern, Founder of ODSC AI**, for a practical walkthrough of an AI-powered CRM that brings together prospect sourcing, company research, qualification, personalized outreach, and follow-ups—with human approval at key stages.

WHEN

**November 19 at 1:00 PM ET**
**Free live webinar**

WHO SHOULD JOIN?

If you already use AI for everyday tasks and want to explore building an application for your team, this session is for you.
It’s especially useful for:

• Sales and business development professionals
• Marketing and operations teams
• Product and project managers
• Founders and small business teams
• Anyone interested in turning a recurring business process into an AI-powered application

WHAT YOU’LL LEARN

Using a working CRM, Sheamus will show you how to approach your own build:

• **Map your workflow.** Identify the steps, decisions, and information your application needs.
• **Turn your team’s procedures into reusable AI skills.** Give the system clear instructions for tasks you repeat.
• **Build in manageable stages.** Use an AI coding assistant to develop your application one part at a time.
• **Connect your existing tools.** Bring the application into the way your team already works.
• **Test real scenarios and keep people involved.** Add human approval where it matters and document how the system runs.

You’ll leave with a blueprint for your first version, an understanding of the tools involved, and a practical starting point for your own build.
The CRM is the example—the approach can help you tackle other recurring processes across your business, too.

