**Stuart Clare**
*Senior Manager Digital Trading, Optimisation & Personalisation, The AA*

Stuart Clare is a digital marketing and optimisation leader at The AA, where he leads a team of trading and optimisation managers focused on driving business growth across digital channels.
He brings more than 15 years’ experience in digital marketing, experimentation and personalisation, with previous roles at adidas, Vistaprint and Shop Direct. His work centres on turning customer and commercial insight into better experiences and measurable business value through CRO, testing and personalisation.

*Connect with Stuart on LinkedIn (https://www.linkedin.com/in/stuart-clare-75637429/)*

