765bcf79-f6d6-46c1-a651-832a6a754b3c,,A meditative walk on the life of the earth,Sunday 25 October | 2–4pm,"**Sunday 25 October | 2–4pm**
**Followed by Tea, coffee & conversation | 4–5pm**
**Woodfield Pavilion, 16A Abbotswood Road, Tooting Common, London SW16 1AP**

**What if we could experience the whole 4.6-billion-year story**
**of the Earth in a single afternoon?**

Join Soul Rewilding for an interactive journey through deep time – from the fiery birth of our planet and the first oceans, through the extraordinary emergence of life, plants and animals, to the very recent arrival of our own species.

Along the way we’ll pause, reflect and experience something of the wonder of the Earth’s story through science, poetry, different spiritual traditions, conversation, simple ritual and encounters with the natural world.

This isn’t a lecture. It’s an invitation to slow down and step out of the frantic timescale of everyday life – the emails, headlines, deadlines and social media – and enter the vastly deeper rhythms of the living Earth.

There will be opportunities for quiet reflection and conversation, moments of playfulness and wonder, and time simply to notice and reconnect with the more-than-human world around us.

At a time when it is easy to feel overwhelmed by what is happening to the natural world, this afternoon is also about hope. Deep time reminds us that we belong to an astonishing, resilient, creative living planet – and that our own story is still being written.

Afterwards, please stay for tea, coffee and conversation from 4–5pm, and the chance to meet others interested in nature, spirituality and living more deeply connected lives.

**Booking**
There is no need to pay for Meetup membership to come along – simply join the Soul Rewilding Meetup group and book your place for the event.

Come curious. Leave connected, hopeful and a little more in awe of the world beneath your feet.

Please contact Soul Rewilding https://www.soulrewilding.co.uk/ directly if you'd like us to run an event for your community.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/d/1/6/highres_532691542.jpeg,2026-10-25 14:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,,,,8827b689-2637-4245-8ba7-214b35948ea2,"{sport,fitness}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/nature-walks-round-london/events/316210635/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,source:f26eb5d4-b239-4813-8e0c-3cf689eed4bd,https://www.meetup.com/nature-walks-round-london/events/316210635/,event_316210635@meetup.com,,2026-10-25 03:22:37.598+00,,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,2026-10-25 03:23:00.161242+00,,,,,f,
