0f9ee0f8-0577-4f19-9ea7-0be797d0ab56,,Autumn Escape: Italy/ Lake Como,🇮🇹 NORTH ITALY & SWITZERLAND ROAD TRIP 🇨🇭,"🇮🇹 NORTH ITALY & SWITZERLAND ROAD TRIP 🇨🇭

🌊 Lake Como • 🏞️ Lake Garda • 🇨🇭 Lugano • Milan

📅 2–8 November | 7 Days / 6 Nights

Stay in Lake Como throughout the trip, with exciting day trips to Switzerland and Lake Garda!

Day 1 – Monday 2 November: Milan → Lake Como🇮🇹
✈️ Arrive at Milan Airport, collect our rental car and drive to Lake Como. Check into our accommodation and relax for the evening.

Day 2 – Tuesday 3 November: Lugano, Switzerland 🇨🇭
Enjoy a scenic drive to Lugano. Explore the beautiful lakeside promenade, charming town centre and stunning Swiss scenery before returning to Lake Como.

Day 3 – Wednesday 4 November: Lake Garda Day Trip 🏞️
Drive to Lake Garda and visit the picturesque town of Sirmione. Explore its historic old town, castle, charming streets and beautiful lakeside views before returning to Lake Como.

Day 4 – Thursday 5 November: Explore Lake Como 🌊
Enjoy a relaxed day discovering the local area, exploring lakeside villages and enjoying delicious Italian food.

Day 5 – Friday 6 November: Bellagio & Varenna💙
Spend the day hopping between the beautiful villages of Bellagio and Varenna. Enjoy scenic ferry rides, colourful streets, lakeside cafés and breathtaking views.

Day 6 – Saturday 7 November: Bellagio & Varenna🌊
Enjoy another day exploring Bellagio and Varenna at a relaxed pace. Discover hidden corners, take photos, enjoy Italian coffee and soak up the beautiful lake atmosphere.

Day 7 – Sunday 8 November: Lake Como → Milan Airport✈️
Check out, drive back to Milan Airport, return the rental car and fly home to London.

💷 Trip Prices
• Full trip: £550– Hotel + car hire
• Half trip: £300– Hotel + car hire

✈️ Flights are booked separately.

