d50a214d-4461-4bef-b8dd-4141da0e9950,,Bag Charm Making Workshop,Design and handcraft a bespoke bag charm,"**Gather your friends and get into the Christmas spirit with a crafting workshop.**

In this fun workshop, you’ll be guided through the techniques needed to design and make your very own unique bag charm.

Whether you're treating yourself to a quiet moment of Christmas self-care or crafting a truly unique, hand-made gift for a loved one, this hands-on workshop offers the perfect place to slow down and get creative.

Come along, get creative, and enjoy a relaxed and festive atmosphere while crafting something both sustainable and stunning.

No prior experience is necessary - just bring your festive spirit, and we’ll supply the rest.

**What’s Included:**

• **Bespoke Bag Charm**: With a beautiful selection of beads, fabrics, charms, cords and tassels to choose from, you can mix and match colours, textures and details to create something that’s completely your own.
• **Professional Instruction**: You’ll have the chance to learn simple beading, macramé, fabric plaiting, bow and tassel-making techniques, with plenty of guidance along the way.
• **Complimentary Refreshments**: Enjoy two drinks throughout the workshop, with Prosecco and non-alcoholic options available.
• **Beginner Friendly**: This is a no-sew activity, perfect for beginners.

**Tickets are £35** and include two complimentary drinks (Prosecco and non-alcohol drinks available) and access to all the equipment and materials you need to make your fresh wreath.

**Joining an in-store event**

Please arrive at the store at least 10 minutes before the start of the session and make your way to the meeting place, The John Lewis Lounge on Level 5. Please bring your ticket with you, either printed or on your phone.

