5bf32fde-6d04-4976-924c-883e3eac9790,,"Still Figuring It Out… ☕ | Coffee, Conversations & Randomness","Another meetup, another bunch of strangers, and still no idea where this is going! 😄","Another meetup, another bunch of strangers, and still no idea where this is going! 😄

But that’s kind of the fun of it, isn’t it?

We’re a bunch of people from different walks of life, figuring out what’s next, exploring new ideas, or simply looking to break the routine and meet some interesting people.

Some of us are between jobs, some are thinking about changing careers or starting something new, and some just enjoy good company and random conversations.

And if you’re new here, even better! Don’t worry about coming alone or not knowing anyone. Most of us started exactly that way, and we’re always happy to see a new face.

No agenda, no awkward networking, no pressure to be interesting or have your life sorted.

Just grab a coffee, join the conversation and see where it takes us. We might talk about careers, travel, crazy ideas, life decisions or absolutely nothing important!

If you like a little randomness and meeting people without expectations, you’ll fit right in.

Come as a stranger, leave with a few familiar faces. ☕😊

Still figuring it out, still making it up as we go — together!",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/2/2/6/highres_536408742.jpeg,2026-10-24 10:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,Pret A Manger,"Pret a Manger, 252 Tottenham ct rd, W1T 7RB",London,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth,careers,food}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/figuring-it-out-together/events/316954500/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:53:33.497215+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/figuring-it-out-together/events/316954500/,event_316954500@meetup.com,,2026-10-23 03:21:52.022+00,,2026-10-22 19:53:33.497215+00,2026-10-23 03:22:32.887535+00,,,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02:still figuring it out coffee conversations randomness:pret a manger,,f,GB
