15bbbe9f-d7c2-4920-9212-2aae43a85885,,"👩‍💻Women Empower Hour: Connect, Grow & Lead","Join us for the Women Empower Hour, an interactive virtual gathering designed for women in Amsterdam who are ready to make a shift, build meaningful relationships, or launch and scale their own…","Join us for the **Women Empower Hour**, an interactive virtual gathering designed for women in Amsterdam who are ready to make a shift, build meaningful relationships, or launch and scale their own businesses. Whether you are navigating a career transition, looking for like-minded female connections, or taking your first steps as an entrepreneur, this event offers a supportive space to share ideas and take action.
**What to Expect:**

• **Authentic Networking:** Skip the standard elevator pitches and engage in genuine online conversations with local women who share your drive and ambition.
• **Open Discussion & Idea Sharing:** Bring your ideas, current challenges, or goals to the group for collaborative feedback, brainstorming, and support.
