5d1600b6-1dd9-4dfe-a08f-64ab6aae59aa,,Digital Meetup: Systems at Play @ the V&A,"If you're interested in drawing robots, physical computing and creative coding, you might enjoy this free event we're organising at the V&A on Friday 23 October with arebyte:","If you're interested in drawing robots, physical computing and creative coding, you might enjoy this free event we're organising at the V&A on Friday 23 October with arebyte:

