bc7bc317-2165-4b3d-a51e-3246e2622c96,,Melody & Mingling: Your Next Chapter Starts Here 🎹🌟 (Limited Free Tickets),"Join us for a stylish singles social mixer designed for open-hearted people ready to make new friends 👫, form genuine connections 💞, and create memorable experiences 🎉.","Join us for a stylish singles social mixer designed for open-hearted people ready to make new friends 👫, form genuine connections 💞, and create memorable experiences 🎉.

Whether you’re here for lively chat 🗣️, quiet sparks ⚡, or simply the pleasure of meeting interesting new people in a beautiful setting, the evening is yours to enjoy 😊.

