afde2b36-99b1-4dea-b62c-b5949d5776e4,,Front Splits & Flexibility | 4-Week Online Yoga Workshop,"A little more time to explore, a little more space to grow. 🤍","**A little more time to explore, a little more space to grow. 🤍**
After six wonderful weeks of practicing together, I'm excited to introduce our very first four-week yoga workshop!

This time, we're taking our practice a little further with a progressive journey towards **front splits (Hanumanasana)**.
Through **FOUR** **LIVE CLASSES**, we'll explore not only flexibility, but also the strength, mobility, and body awareness that help us move deeper into our practice safely and mindfully.
Whether you're working towards your first front split or you'd like to deepen your existing practice, you'll be encouraged to explore at your own pace, with variations suited to different experience levels.

🌿 What will we explore?

**Week 1 — Building the Foundations**
We'll explore hamstring flexibility, hip flexor mobility, and the foundations of a balanced front split.
**Week 2 — Strength Meets Flexibility**
We'll introduce active flexibility techniques, strengthen the muscles that support our range of motion, and build greater control.
**Week 3 — Deepening the Practice**
We'll work with progressive variations, explore our individual limitations, and develop more confidence and stability as we move deeper.
**Week 4 — Bringing Everything Together**
We'll integrate what we've learned into a complete yoga flow, explore front split variations, and offer optional challenges for those interested in more advanced asanas.

✨ What's included?

• **4 live online workshops** (75 minutes each + Q&A)
• Guided instruction, individual variations, and opportunities to ask questions
• Recordings of the instructor-led practices to revisit between sessions
• Optional 10-minute home practice suggestions to help you maintain consistency
• An optional WhatsApp group for practice tips, encouragement, questions, and additional workshop materials

The goal isn't to achieve a perfect split in four weeks. It's to develop a better understanding of your body, explore your potential, and build a practice that supports your progress beyond the workshop.

🗓️ Workshop Details

**Dates:** November 11, 18, 25 & December 2, 2026
**Time:** 19:00–20:30 CET (Amsterdam time)
**Location:** Live online via Zoom
**Language:** English
**Group size:** Maximum 10 participants

🎉 Special Founding Workshop Offer

To celebrate our very first four-week workshop series, I'm offering a special early-bird price for the first five participants!
**✨ Early bird: €29 — first 5 places only**
**Regular price: €35**
Both prices include the complete four-week program, all four live sessions, recordings, and additional practice materials.
Only 10 places are available so we can keep the group small and make room for individual guidance.
This introductory early-bird offer is exclusive to our first workshop series. The fee is a one-time payment, not a subscription. Meetup may add a checkout service fee.

🧘 What will you need?

A yoga mat, two yoga blocks (or sturdy alternatives), a yoga strap or towel, and enough space to move comfortably.
Some familiarity with basic yoga movements is helpful, but you don't need to be close to achieving front splits to participate.
Please practice within a comfortable range and let me know about any injuries or limitations that may affect your participation. Individual progress will vary.

**Important participation note:**
Because this is a small-group workshop and I’d like to offer individual guidance, participants are expected to join the live sessions with their **camera on**. Please only book if you feel comfortable being visible during the workshop.

To respect everyone’s privacy, the shared recordings will focus on the **instructor-led practice only**.

💌 How to join

Simply reserve and pay for your spot through Meetup. **One registration covers the entire four-week program.**
Your Zoom joining details, recordings, and additional practice materials will be shared privately with registered participants.
The WhatsApp group is completely optional. Important workshop information will still be provided to everyone.
If you have any questions about the workshop or whether it's suitable for your level, feel free to message me here on Meetup.
I'm really looking forward to exploring this journey together!
See you on the mat 🤍
*Cancellation and refunds: Full refunds of the workshop ticket price are available for cancellations made at least 7 days before the first session. Later requests will be considered in accordance with applicable consumer rights and circumstances. If I cancel the workshop, the ticket price will be refunded. Meetup and payment-processing fees may be handled separately according to their policies.*",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/7/e/2/highres_536726594.jpeg,2026-11-11 18:00:00+00,,Europe/Amsterdam,online,Online event,,,c06699ed-62e0-4957-bcb4-080c5271da9a,"{sport,fitness}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/move-breathe-connect-online-yoga/events/317074107/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-24 03:21:20.750761+00,source:cba1b9d2-d09d-4c19-a89e-50bdbe5525a0,https://www.meetup.com/move-breathe-connect-online-yoga/events/317074107/,event_317074107@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:20:38.34+00,,2026-10-24 03:21:20.750761+00,2026-10-28 03:21:15.930389+00,,,,,f,
