9d8256e9-6659-456a-8e58-e604f5753a10,,GenAI Community – Codeforce Edition (Virtual),The Codeforce Returns: Self Advancing Context! 🧠 🛠️,"**The Codeforce Returns: Self Advancing Context! 🧠 🛠️**

How can a new agent benefit from a correction you already made?

This time, Mario Deubler (https://at.linkedin.com/in/mario-deubler) joins the GenAI-Codeforce with **Self Advancing Context in the Age of Agents**.

Every agent task can produce both useful work and a tested improvement to future work. Mario will show how corrections can become **durable memory and reusable methods**.

Fresh tasks test those lessons while preserving their scope. The goal is for a different agent to benefit without needing the same correction again.

Our free online meetup brings the AI Austria community together for practical demos and technical exchange. Bring a question from your own workflow, or a lesson your agents keep forgetting.

🌐 **What to expect:**
🧭 **News & discussion:** GenAI developments and perspectives from the community
🛠️ **Live demo:** Self Advancing Context in the Age of Agents with Mario Deubler
💬 **Open Floor:** Share your questions and experiences from working with AI agents

🎯 **Who should join?**
Developers, AI engineers, researchers, and anyone curious about building or using AI agents. Whether you already work with agents or are just getting started, you are welcome.

Have a project or demo you would like to share at a future Codeforce? Let us know.

See you at the GenAI-Codeforce!

