e644ba01-9e56-4314-8bf0-f990eb7cee7d,,[FREE]-Agentic AI Readiness Advisor: A Live Walkthrough,"Agentic AI is changing how organizations approach automation, decision-making, and software delivery. But how can leaders assess whether their organization is ready to adopt AI agents?","Agentic AI is changing how organizations approach automation, decision-making, and software delivery. But how can leaders assess whether their organization is ready to adopt AI agents?
In this interactive session, I’ll demonstrate how to use the **Agentic AI Readiness Advisor** through a live walkthrough, covering three key questions:

• **How do you assess readiness?** We’ll explore how to navigate the advisor and answer questions about an organization’s preparedness for adopting agentic AI.
• **How do you interpret the results?** We’ll look at how the advisor identifies readiness gaps, highlights potential risks, and evaluates areas that need improvement.
• **How do you turn insights into action?** We’ll explore how the tool translates assessment results into prioritized recommendations and a practical 90-day roadmap.

You’ll see the tool in action and learn how it can help leadership teams understand their current readiness, identify improvement areas, and plan their next steps toward responsible agentic AI adoption.
This is a practical, demonstration-focused session rather than a lecture.

Come ready to explore the tool and ask questions.

No prior experience with agentic AI is needed.

Watch more FREE learning resources - https://www.youtube.com/@agilewow?sub_confirmation=1",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/d/8/3/highres_536684419.jpeg,2026-10-22 12:00:00+00,,Asia/Kolkata,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{technology,ai}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/agilewow/events/317043501/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 03:22:46.934486+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/agilewow/events/317043501/,event_317043501@meetup.com,,2026-10-22 03:22:12.257+00,,2026-10-22 03:22:46.934486+00,2026-10-22 03:22:59.164769+00,,,,,f,
e6dab41f-e370-4ceb-aa1a-160fb5912b44,,AI This Week: Open Circle,"AI moves fast. Something new drops every week, and it's hard to keep up alone.","AI moves fast. Something new drops every week, and it's hard to keep up alone.

AI This Week: Open Circle is our weekly open circle for developers, builders, and anyone curious about where AI is headed. There are no slides and no fixed speaker. We bring the week's biggest AI news, new model releases, tools worth trying, and whatever questions you're stuck on, and we talk it through together.
**What we usually cover:**
• The AI news that actually matters this week
• New models, frameworks, and tools people are testing
• Real problems from your projects or work
• Quick live demos when someone has something cool to show
**Who should come:**
Engineers, data folks, founders, students, and career switchers. All levels are welcome. You don't need to present anything. Just show up with curiosity.
Bring a topic, a question, or just listen in. Some of our best conversations start with ""Has anyone tried...?""
Hosted by AgentVersity, a community of 30,000+ developers learning to build with AI.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/8/3/0/highres_536182576.jpeg,2027-01-08 04:00:00+00,2027-01-08 05:30:00+00,Asia/Kolkata,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{technology,ai}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/bengaluru-artificial-intelligence-group/events/zfkkbvykccblb/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 03:22:47.855553+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/bengaluru-artificial-intelligence-group/events/zfkkbvykccblb/,event_zfkkbvykccblb@meetup.com,,2026-10-22 03:22:12.257+00,,2026-10-22 03:22:47.855553+00,2026-10-22 03:22:59.187729+00,,,meetup:bengaluru-artificial-intelligence-group:ai this week open circle,Every week on Friday,f,
43fb1528-ec79-45c3-8883-e01cd1bbaba1,,AI Week 2026 with AI Hub Frankfurt,"Dear AI Enthusiasts, we’re excited to announce that we’re partnering with AI Hub Frankfurt for our meetup event on October 29, 2026, as part of AI Week Frankfurt 2026…","Dear AI Enthusiasts, we’re excited to announce that we’re partnering with AI Hub Frankfurt for our meetup event on October 29, 2026, as part of AI Week Frankfurt 2026 (https://ai-week-frankfurt.com)! On behalf of AI Hub Frankfurt, (https://ai-hub-frankfurt.de/) we warmly welcome you to AI Week Frankfurt 2026 and look forward to connecting, exchanging ideas, and discovering new opportunities together.

**We’ll soon share a special coupon code with everyone registered for our meetup event**, giving you free access to participating events on October 29 at AI Week Frankfurt 2026.

**Agenda**

**17:00 A welcome note** from organizers & host/sponsor
**17:15 Speaker I: Mario Meir-Huber - *Software Factories***
*One of the most promising use cases for AI is to significantly speed up software engineering. Developers all over the world are using Claude Code and Codex to supercharge their software development. What was once considered ""Vibe Coding"" is now becoming a first-class citizen for software teams around the world. The next evolution is the software factory. In this talk, we explore what a software factory is capable of doing and how it can further boost the development lifecycle. The Session will be hands-on and we will see a real software factory in action.*
**17:45 Speaker II: Ivan Parfilov - *YTsaurus: An Open-Source Data Platform for AI - and AI for the Data Platform***
*As AI models scale, infrastructure often becomes the primary bottleneck. This talk introduces YTsaurus, an open-source, exabyte-scale big data platform, and shows how teams use it across the machine learning lifecycle: preparing data, training models, and running them over massive datasets. It then turns to a new direction: making the data platform itself AI-first. Engineers and analysts simply ask for what they need (a report, an answer, an investigation), and an AI agent orchestrates the platform's engines to deliver it.*
**18:15 Break**
**18:45 Speaker III: Aarti Gupta - *Is AI making you productive or dependent?***
*AI now generates ideas, writes content, and acts on our behalf. As once-rare intelligence becomes abundant, the advantage shifts from speed to intellect. This session offers practical ways to use AI as a thinking partner rather than a substitute, so it strengthens YOU and raises the quality of your work, not just its pace.*
**19:15 Announcements/Socializing**

