08d2a25b-09a8-40a9-98cc-9a68d760a0ca,,AI This Week: Open Circle,"AI moves fast. Something new drops every week, and it's hard to keep up alone.","AI moves fast. Something new drops every week, and it's hard to keep up alone.

AI This Week: Open Circle is our weekly open circle for developers, builders, and anyone curious about where AI is headed. There are no slides and no fixed speaker. We bring the week's biggest AI news, new model releases, tools worth trying, and whatever questions you're stuck on, and we talk it through together.
**What we usually cover:**
• The AI news that actually matters this week
• New models, frameworks, and tools people are testing
• Real problems from your projects or work
• Quick live demos when someone has something cool to show
**Who should come:**
Engineers, data folks, founders, students, and career switchers. All levels are welcome. You don't need to present anything. Just show up with curiosity.
Bring a topic, a question, or just listen in. Some of our best conversations start with ""Has anyone tried...?""
Hosted by AgentVersity, a community of 30,000+ developers learning to build with AI.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/8/3/0/highres_536182576.jpeg,2027-01-01 04:00:00+00,2027-01-01 05:30:00+00,Asia/Kolkata,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{technology,ai}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/bengaluru-artificial-intelligence-group/events/zfkkbvykccbcb/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 03:22:47.855553+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/bengaluru-artificial-intelligence-group/events/zfkkbvykccbcb/,event_zfkkbvykccbcb@meetup.com,,2026-10-22 03:22:12.257+00,,2026-10-22 03:22:47.855553+00,2026-10-22 03:22:55.354897+00,,,meetup:bengaluru-artificial-intelligence-group:ai this week open circle,Every week on Friday,f,
