6115aa8b-455a-40dc-90fc-827ea28cc9e8,,Enfield Spark and Soul Jewelry Social,"We are getting together for the Enfield Spark and Soul Jewelry Social, a chance for local makers to step away from the workbench and enjoy some conversation. Whether you are a full-time…","We are getting together for the Enfield Spark and Soul Jewelry Social, a chance for local makers to step away from the workbench and enjoy some conversation. Whether you are a full-time professional, a dedicated hobbyist, or someone just starting to experiment with pliers and wire, this is an opportunity to connect with others in the area who share an interest in jewelry design. There is no formal agenda or workshop planned; it is simply a space to share ideas, talk through creative blocks, or just meet some new people in the local craft community.

This event is for anyone who enjoys the process of making things by hand and wants to build a local network of fellow artists. We will be meeting at a local spot in Enfield to grab a drink, talk about our current projects, and see what everyone else is working on. It is a casual, low-pressure environment meant to help us feel a bit more connected outside of our home studios. If you have been looking for a reason to get out and talk shop with some like-minded folks, we would love to have you join us. Please let us know if you can make it by clicking the RSVP button so we can get an idea of numbers for the table.",,2026-10-25 19:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,12 Hutton Grove,12 Hutton Grove,Enfield,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,socialising,hobbies}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/the-jewelry-makers-collective-social-club/events/317071652/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:46:37.169472+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/the-jewelry-makers-collective-social-club/events/317071652/,event_317071652@meetup.com,,2026-10-22 19:47:17.036+00,,2026-10-22 19:46:37.169472+00,2026-10-22 19:48:29.865213+00,,,,,f,GB
