6aa1686b-fca3-49fa-8ece-f07d084b6816,,🎉 Friday Night Zen Social at the National Gallery + After Party! 🎉,🎉 Friday Night Social at the National Gallery London 🎉,"🎉 Friday Night Social at the National Gallery London 🎉

**Art. Connection. Adventure.**
Join us for an unforgettable evening at one of the world’s most iconic art museums—the National Gallery in Trafalgar Square! With its late-night opening hours and legendary collection, this is your chance to explore masterpieces, meet new people, and enjoy a relaxed social vibe in the heart of London 🌆.

🖼️ About the National Gallery

Founded in 1824, the National Gallery houses over 2,300 paintings spanning from the 13th to the early 20th century. From da Vinci’s ethereal brushwork to Van Gogh’s swirling sunflowers, this museum is a treasure trove of Western European art. And the best part? Admission is free! 🆓
Whether you're an art aficionado or just curious, the Gallery offers a welcoming space to wander, reflect, and connect. It’s a place where history meets inspiration—and tonight, it meets community.

🗓️ Event Schedule

**6:45pm – Meet & Mingle**
📍 INSIDE the Sainsbury Wing entrance in the Foyer next to one of the thick giant columns.
We’ll gather here for 30 minutes (6:45-7:15PM) to chat, introduce ourselves, and kick off the evening with our icebreaker:
**“What kind of artwork are you drawn to?”** 🎭
No name tags—just good conversation and friendly faces.
**7:15pm – Leave meeting point to Explore the Gallery**
🎨 We’ll head inside to explore these stunning rooms:

• Room 32: Carracci, Caravaggio, Guercino
• Room 34: Reynolds, Gainsborough, Turner, Constable
• Room 45: Van Gogh 🌻

Feel free to roam in small groups—if you get separated, check these rooms to reconnect.
**8:15pm – Reconvene AT ORIGINAL MEETING POINT**
Then in your groups make your own way to the optional after-party:
**8:30pm – Afterparty at ZEBRANOS IN SOHO🍸**
18 Greek St, London W1D 4DS
Let the social vibes continue at a lively spot for drinks, music, and more mingling.
Mention ZEN on entry. Bring ID
Route: https://maps.app.goo.gl/9FhUkidjkcCKJGmA8?g_st=ac

🎟️ Tickets & Entry

This is a **free event**, but you’ll need a ticket to enter the Gallery.
Grab yours from the National Gallery website (https://www.nationalgallery.org.uk/) before they run out!
If tickets are unavailable, don’t worry—we’ll share a group ticket in the WhatsApp group and Meetup page 📲.

👗 Dress Code & Essentials

• **Smart Casual** (no athletic track suits or sports trainers)
• **Bring your ID** for the bar
• A curious mind and a friendly spirit 💫

Ready to mix art with social magic? Let’s make Friday night a masterpiece 🖌️💃

**Some Tips:**

1. **Let’s all commit to updating our RSVPs if plans change**—it helps us plan better and ensures great attendance for everyone. If you RSVP “yes” but don’t attend and don’t update your RSVP, you may be removed from the group to keep things fair. No stress, though—you can rejoin for a small £10 fee! Just send me a DM, and I’ll share the PayPal details to get you back in.
2. **Turn Up on Time at the start!** This helps the quality of the event and helps you.
3. If you are struggling with the **app**, use the web page instead, that's what I use.
4. **Attendee Numbers & Guest Lists:** We have this event listed at least on two groups and the guest list includes attendees from all. You can see the list of attendees here:
https://www.meetup.com/zensingles/
https://www.meetup.com/cityzenlondon/
https://www.meetup.com/LoveLife
1. **Join our** **social media**:
**Instagram**: https://www.instagram.com/cityzen.london/
**X:** https://x.com/CityZenLondon
1. **Our WhatsApp group:** [See private comment in the comments section below]. We have a few rules including no ads, no DMs unless recipient is in the ""Direct Messaging List"" or risk removal and £10 rejoin fee.
2. **Support Our Amazing London Event Hosts! 🙌**
Our incredible crew of hosts is the heartbeat of London’s buzzing meetup scene, bringing people together for unforgettable experiences that spark connection, growth, and fun! 🌟 From museum adventures to flirty dating mixers, these rockstar hosts pour their energy, time, and passion into creating events that level up your social and communication skills. But hosting isn’t easy—it takes resources, effort, and heart. 💖
Please consider supporting our hosts with a donation to keep the good vibes flowing and help us make London the ultimate social hub! 🚀 Below, meet our hosts for this event and see how you can chip in to fuel their amazing work.

**Disclaimer, Liability Waiver & Media Consent**
By attending this event, you acknowledge and agree to the following:
**Organiser Identity** – The organiser operates under the community name **“ZEN”**, which is used as an alias for privacy and branding purposes. By joining, you understand that “ZEN” refers to the organiser and/or designated hosts of this event. **Assumption of Risk** – You understand and accept that participation in any social, recreational, or group activity involves inherent risks, including but not limited to personal injury, illness, property damage, or other…",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/3/0/a/2/highres_535872450.jpeg,2026-12-04 18:45:00+00,2026-12-04 21:45:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,The National Gallery Sainsbury Wing,"Trafalgar Square,",London WC2N 5DN,8827b689-2637-4245-8ba7-214b35948ea2,"{sport,socialising,arts,fitness,travel}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/cityzenlondon/events/316455842/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-26 03:22:56.772649+00,source:f26eb5d4-b239-4813-8e0c-3cf689eed4bd,https://www.meetup.com/cityzenlondon/events/316455842/,event_316455842@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:30.379+00,,2026-10-26 03:22:56.772649+00,2026-10-28 03:22:55.486349+00,,,meetup:cityzenlondon:friday night zen social at the national gallery after party,"Every 1st Friday of the month until April 2, 2027",f,GB
