f48b6248-ec2b-49d7-9fd8-c94a228e231f,,Autumn Talk: Nick Bailey on 365 Days of Colour in your Garden,Catch Nick Bailey sharing some cool stories and insights this autumn—don’t miss out on a chill evening! N,"**Autumn Talk: Nick Bailey**

Join us for an exciting **in-person** event where Nick Bailey shares his insights and stories. It's a perfect chance to connect, learn, and enjoy some great conversation this autumn. Don’t miss out – come along and be part of the chat!

Nick is a freelance horticulturalist, best-selling author, award-winning TV presenter, garden designer and speaker.

After studying horticulture at Hadlow College and achieving a 1st class honours degree in Landscape Design from Greenwich University, Nick has worked across many sectors of horticulture over the last 30 years, including nursery stock production, garden management, garden design, teaching, public speaking writing and broadcasting.

Nick is currently a regular presenter on BBC Two’s Gardeners’ World to over 2.5million viewers. His film on plants associated with Shakespeare for Gardeners’ World won best TV programme at the Garden Media Guild Awards 2016.

Nick’s horticultural media career spans some 15 years, during which time he worked as an editor for Garden Answers and Garden News, moving on to write freelance for BBC Gardeners’ World Magazine, RHS The Garden, The Mail, The Times and The Telegraph. He currently has regular columns in BBC Gardeners’ World Magazine and Garden News.",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792660154/orbit/event-covers/sources/n9z6n6oijiohxtklt3na.jpg,2026-10-26 20:00:00+00,2026-10-26 22:30:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,1 Harestone Hill,1 Harestone Hill,Caterham,7aa69eeb-df8c-40ae-b929-a4324f936266,"{gaming,arts,hobbies,socialising,creative}",,external,https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/autumn-talk-nick-bailey-on-365-days-of-colour-in-your-garden-tickets-1996090499417,Register on Eventbrite,f,,t,,16.96,16.96,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 09:09:07.539977+00,source:692118d3-2638-432e-9973-25e783168a55,https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/autumn-talk-nick-bailey-on-365-days-of-colour-in-your-garden-tickets-1996090499417,eventbrite-1996090499417,,2026-10-26 03:23:43.89+00,,2026-10-22 09:09:07.539977+00,2026-10-26 03:24:07.505073+00,51.2803032,-0.0797656,,,f,GB
