2190b6c9-4b2e-48ae-ad1f-a9e3d5e89ead,,Complimentary Introductory Pair Yoga Session,"Join us for a complimentary introductory Pair Yoga session - A unique practice designed for two people to move, stretch, and breathe together. Pair Yoga is for anyone: family members, friends,…","Join us for a complimentary introductory Pair Yoga session - A unique practice designed for two people to move, stretch, and breathe together. Pair Yoga is for anyone: family members, friends, siblings, cousins, parents and kids, colleagues, or roommates. If you've got a partner in life (of any kind), you've got a partner for this class. What is Pair Yoga? Pair Yoga blends traditional yoga postures with partner-assisted stretches, counterbalances, and trust-based movements.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/3/7/7/d/highres_534434205.jpeg,2026-11-07 10:30:00+00,2026-11-07 11:30:00+00,Europe/Paris,online,Online event,,,c06699ed-62e0-4957-bcb4-080c5271da9a,"{sport,fitness}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/meetup-group-bckuvujs/events/317032375/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:49:59.056229+00,source:cba1b9d2-d09d-4c19-a89e-50bdbe5525a0,https://www.meetup.com/meetup-group-bckuvujs/events/317032375/,event_317032375@meetup.com,,2026-10-27 03:20:39.241+00,,2026-10-22 19:49:59.056229+00,2026-10-27 03:21:14.030792+00,,,meetup:meetup-group-bckuvujs:complimentary introductory pair yoga session,"Every week on Saturday until November 30, 2026",f,
249adf5b-7058-47d1-aa2a-12a07b6600ab,,INTRO TO TRADITIONAL UPHOLSTERY – EVENING,Bookable via our website ➡️ https://www.thegoodlifecentre.co.uk/events/intro-to-traditional-upholstery-evening-40/,"**Bookable via our website ➡️** https://www.thegoodlifecentre.co.uk/events/intro-to-traditional-upholstery-evening-40/
⋆⋆⋆

**KEY PROJECT: TRADITIONALLY STITCHED AND SEWN EDGED FOOTSTOOL**
*All of our upholstery classes are for absolute beginners. It doesn’t matter which one you choose to take first. Each technique that is offered is part of all the processes that every upholsterer has to learn.*

6-week workshop. 6:30pm – 9pm.

A perfect course for a beginner. Jumpstart your knowledge of traditional upholstery skills and methods.

Over six Thursday evenings, experienced upholsterers will guide you through the wonderful world of upholstery and help you build a fabulous footstool using traditional methods. You can leave your project at the centre in between classes.

Before the advent of foam in the middle of the twentieth century, the only way to make wooden seats more comfortable was to build up layers using available materials. Our small fabric footstool (above) is built from layers of woven webbing, hessian, vegetable fibre, animal hair and calico and is sewn with specialist needles and stitches. Although this method is more labour-intensive than the modern method of using foam, it is much longer lasting and preferred in more expensive pieces of furniture. This is the method used in many traditional chair seats, so once learned, you can apply this method to your own projects.

We provide everything for the workshop, from the wood frame to the set of natural beech wood legs that are included for you to paint or stain as you wish. Choose from our selection of top fabrics, or bring your own. You will need about a metre of fabric and you will not need it until the final class. The use of all tools and materials is included. We also have a selection of specialist upholstery tools and all the materials that we use in our workshops for sale at the Goodlife Centre for you to continue your new hobby at home.

Beginners welcome.

**Need a different date or time?** You can check our full schedule on the website here: ➡️ https://www.thegoodlifecentre.co.uk/upholstery-traditional-footstool/",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1793071205/orbit/event-covers/sources/pbd3wzsrnykdwhqbvmhj.jpg,2026-11-10 18:30:00+00,2026-11-10 21:00:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,The Goodlife Centre,"49-55 Great Guildford St, London SE1 0ES, UK",London,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,socialising,hobbies}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/thegoodlifecentre/events/vvctbvyjcpbnb/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,380.00,380.00,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-27 03:19:45.380416+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/thegoodlifecentre/events/vvctbvyjcpbnb/,event_vvctbvyjcpbnb@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:19:10.809+00,,2026-10-27 03:19:45.380416+00,2026-10-28 03:19:47.193092+00,51.503138,-0.096736,meetup:thegoodlifecentre:intro to traditional upholstery evening,"Every week on Tuesday until December 8, 2026",f,GB
