2160147c-a24a-44a7-9fc0-22ece16d7ce1,,Virtual D365PPUG - November 2026,"Join us for the D365 & PP UG Virtual Event! This user group will focus solely on Virtual Events. We know that not everyone can make it to in person events, so we've created a dedicated Virtual UG…","Join us for the D365 & PP UG Virtual Event! This user group will focus solely on Virtual Events. We know that not everyone can make it to in person events, so we've created a dedicated Virtual UG that anyone can attend!

Agenda

18:00 - Intros

18: 15 - Talk 1: **Introducing the Power Platform ToolBox** - Carl Cookson

19:00 - break

19:05 - Talk 2: **60 Power Platform Tips in 60 Minutes -** Kylie Kiser & Heidi Neuhauser

20:00 Wrap up & Finish

Talk 1 - **Introducing the Power Platform ToolBox** - Carl Cookson
Power Platform ToolBox is a modern, cross‑platform desktop application that brings together community‑built tools for managing, building, and troubleshooting Microsoft Power Platform and Dataverse applications.

In this lightning talk, you’ll get a fast‑paced introduction to what Power Platform ToolBox is capable of. We’ll look at how it lets you discover, install, and update tools with a single click, connect securely to your environments using interactive login and MFA, and run each tool in complete isolation for improved security and stability.
I'll also highlight the kinds of tools available today, including:

Dataverse data management, bulk operations, and migrations
Environment, solution, and security role analysis
Power Automate flow exploration and visualisation
Metadata exploration, dependency analysis, ERD generation, and documentation

Developer tools for plugins, PCF controls, and Custom APIs
Finally, we’ll touch on how Power Platform ToolBox is open source, community‑led, and designed to evolve alongside the platform, making it a successor to the XrmToolBox in lots of ways.

**Bio**
Carl Cookson (https://www.linkedin.com/in/carlcookson/)

Talk 2 - **60 Power Platform Tips in 60 Minutes** - Kylie Kiser & Heidi Neuhauser

Your favorite fast-talking MVP duo will rattle off as many tips as we can fit in our time! We’re talking about tools, best practices, tips and tricks for Dynamics 365, Power Apps and other Power Platform tools! Let’s see if we can get through all 60 or maybe even more!

LEARNING OBJECTIVES
Take away one tip that you can implement in your organization
Learn about a new product or feature to test out
Find some interesting information to do additional research on

**Bio**
Kylie Kiser (https://www.linkedin.com/in/kylie-kiser/) & Heidi Neuhauser (https://www.linkedin.com/in/heidineuhauser/?isSelfProfile=false)",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792621044/orbit/event-covers/sources/c6opmc7ym9peys4juvyt.jpg,2026-11-18 18:00:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,{technology},,external,https://www.meetup.com/d365ppug/events/310817747/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:16:55.997298+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/d365ppug/events/310817747/,event_310817747@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-21 22:16:55.997298+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.493162+00,,,,,f,
