dd25ffee-a1e0-4746-859f-1b2aee9b5df3,,🏴‍☠️ Isle of Mull Adventure – Online Q&A,Fancy exploring Scotland’s wild west coast? Join us online and find out more about our Isle of Mull adventure!,"**Fancy exploring Scotland’s wild west coast? Join us online and find out more about our Isle of Mull adventure!**

After RSVP, you will be sent a ZOOM meeting passcode.

https://www.bee-adventures.co.uk/isle-of-mull

Thinking about joining us but have a few questions before booking? Come along to our relaxed online Q&A, where we’ll talk you through the trip, what to expect and what makes this adventure so special.
We’ll cover everything from the journey and accommodation to the hikes, island exploration and our wildlife boat trip to Staffa, where we’ll hopefully spot puffins, dolphins and other incredible marine wildlife.

🌿 **What we'll chat about:**

• Our planned itinerary and highlights
• The walks, challenges and fitness levels involved
• Travel, accommodation and what to bring
• The wildlife and scenery we hope to experience
• What makes a Bee Adventures trip different
• Any questions you have!

Whether you're a seasoned adventurer or just fancy trying something different, this is a great chance to find out if the trip is right for you.
**No pressure, no commitment — just a chance to meet us, ask questions and get excited about exploring somewhere amazing.**
