e9526dee-d1ae-443e-be9d-20a8755eff66,,"So, what's your goal today?",The Execution Gym for Entrepreneurs,"The Execution Gym for Entrepreneurs

**Commit. Execute. Update. Repeat.**
No more endless learning.
No more boring lectures.
No more overthinking.
**Just consistent execution.**

YBAP is the Execution Gym for entrepreneurs.

Everyone asks:

**“What did you learn today?”**

YBAP asks:

**“What did you execute today?”**

Because learning is valuable.
But **execution is what turns amazing ideas, plans, decisions and remarkable knowledge that you gained over the period of time into reality.**

Every day, ask yourself:

**What can I execute NOW that moves me one step closer to my goals?**

How does YBAP work?

There are **two ways to participate — and you can do both.**

1. Join the live Execution Sessions

Commit your goals, execute through the day, and come back to share your progress, wins, lessons or challenges.

**Missed a session? No problem. Join the next one — or jump into our super-active WhatsApp group of self-driven entrepreneurs and goal achievers.**

1. Join the YBAP WhatsApp Group

Can't make it to the live goal-setting sessions? **No problem.**
Our WhatsApp group is your **24×7×365 execution gym.**

Drop your goal whenever you want.
Go execute.
Come back and share your update.

**Where other self-driven entrepreneurs are doing the same. Keep moving.**

Ready to execute?

**For now join the YBAP WhatsApp Group:**
https://chat.whatsapp.com/IMc0KuD7XVa9vEdAdsIrOt?mode=gi_t&utm_source=chatgpt.com

Then join our live sessions whenever the timing works for you.

Check Meetup for the latest session schedules, updates and announcements.

The simple loop:

**Commit. Execute. Update. Repeat.**

Wins are welcome.
Lessons are welcome.
Progress is welcome.
Imperfect days are welcome.
**Showing up is most welcome.**

**YBAP — The Execution Gym for Entrepreneurs**

**By The Execution Way**
**Consume Less. Execute More.**",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/c/2/2/highres_535287682.jpeg,2026-10-22 06:30:00+00,2026-10-22 06:45:00+00,Asia/Kolkata,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,entrepreneurship,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/ybap-your-business-accountable-partner-india/events/317035833/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 03:21:15.028412+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/ybap-your-business-accountable-partner-india/events/317035833/,event_317035833@meetup.com,,2026-10-22 03:20:45.416+00,,2026-10-22 03:21:15.028412+00,2026-10-22 19:53:49.576661+00,,,meetup:ybap-your-business-accountable-partner-india:so what s your goal today,"Every week on Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, Friday, Saturday until October 24, 2026",f,
