e83a0a60-e11c-4e05-b53f-96520e163e89,,How Do Creators Monetize?,"You can also use Luma to register (https://luma.com/ptaya9l1). Join our newsletter (https://news.socialrising.com/join) to stay informed about virtual & in-person events, opportunities, news, and…","You can also use Luma to register (https://luma.com/ptaya9l1). Join our newsletter (https://news.socialrising.com/join) to stay informed about virtual & in-person events, opportunities, news, and offers. Also, we have Discord now (https://link.socialrising.com/discord) - it's new; let's fill it with life!
Let's find out how today's creators turn their followers into income.
To prepare, we reached out to creators in our community to share their strategies. You'll hear what actually works: from small creators to established influencers, there are strategies for every level. And that will also allow you to meet the creators who shared the strategies, as they are regularly at our in-person and virtual events.
I'm joined by Vlad, CEO of AdAUC, the first auction-based marketplace for creators and brands. Since his work is helping creators earn, he's exactly the right person to discuss this topic. And of course we're curious about your experiences and questions.
Whether you're just starting or want new ideas, we'll discuss what you can make work.
Your hosts:

• Matteo Savio, CEO of Social Rising
• Vlad, CEO & founder of AdAUC, the world’s first auction-based influencer marketplace

