91cd7e5f-b874-401c-a5b4-73c1c6161a74,,Social & Mingle Night With 3 Course & A Glass Of Wine Or Beer,SOCIAL DINNER AT THE GREAT NORTH WOOD PUB,"SOCIAL DINNER AT THE GREAT NORTH WOOD PUB

**Friday 13th November 2026**
**7:00pm – 11:00pm**

**Upstairs at The Great North Wood Pub**
3 Knights Hill, West Norwood, London SE27 0HS
**Next door to West Norwood Station**

Join **Get A Social Life** for a relaxed and friendly **3-course social dinner**, perfect for anyone who enjoys good food, good conversation and meeting new people.
Many people attending our events come on their own, so please don’t worry if you don’t have anyone to come with — you certainly won’t be the only solo guest.
Come along, step out of your comfort zone, meet some new people and enjoy a lovely Friday evening together.

EVENING ITINERARY

**7:00pm – Arrival, Welcome Drink & Introductions**
Arrive, collect your welcome drink and meet your host and fellow guests. We’ll start with some relaxed introductions to help everyone settle in and get chatting.
**7:30pm – Dinner Begins**
Take your seats and enjoy your starter while getting to know the people around your table.
**8:15pm – Main Course**
Enjoy your main course with plenty of time for conversation, laughter and making new connections.
**9:15pm – Dessert**
Finish your meal with dessert while continuing to chat and socialise.
**10:00pm – Drinks, Music & Socialising**
After dinner, there’s no need to rush off. Grab another drink from the bar, mingle with the group and enjoy some background music while getting to know more people.
**11:00pm – Evening Finishes**

YOUR TICKET INCLUDES

**£45 per person – service charge included**
• 3-course meal
• One glass of wine, beer or a non-alcoholic drink
• Hosted introductions
• Friendly Get A Social Life host
• Relaxed social dining
• Time to mingle and meet new people
• Music and socialising after dinner
• Vegetarian and vegan options available
**Additional drinks can be purchased directly from the bar.**

PERFECT FOR SOLOS, FRIENDS & COUPLES

Don’t worry if you don’t have anyone to come with.
Our events are very welcoming to solo guests and **the majority of people attending our social events come on their own**.
There’s no awkward walking into a restaurant and sitting by yourself. This is a hosted evening where everyone is there to socialise, enjoy themselves and hopefully make some new connections.
**Come as strangers, leave having made new connections.**

IMPORTANT – YOUR MEAL MUST BE PRE-ORDERED

All meals must be pre-ordered **at least 7 days before the event**.
The pub is currently serving its summer menu. As our Get A Social Life dinner takes place in November, the summer menu will be replaced by the pub’s **autumn/winter menu** before our event.
The dishes listed below are therefore examples of the type of food currently served at The Great North Wood Pub and **are not the confirmed November menu**.

Current Starter / Small Plate Examples

• Smoked Harissa Hummus & Olive Tapenade with flatbread
• Panko Breaded Prawns with sweet chilli dip
• Grilled Chicken Wings with a choice of sauces
• Pork Belly Bites with Tokyo sauce
• Mac & Cheese Bites with jalapeño mayo
• Chicken Skewers in a sticky soy & maple glaze
• Halloumi Fries with sweet chilli dip
• Frickles – breaded fried pickles with jalapeño mayo

Current Main Course Examples

• Fish & Chips with peas, chunky chips and homemade tartare sauce
• Classic Beef Burger
• Smoke Burger with bacon, American cheese and jalapeño mayo
• Grilled Buttermilk Chicken Burger
• Volcano Jerk Chicken Burger
• Vegan Burger
• Caesar Salad with optional chicken, bacon or tofu
• Cajun Lime Sweet Potato Salad
• Chicken Skewers with fries and jalapeño slaw

Vegetarian & Vegan Options

Vegetarian and vegan choices will be available.
Please let me know about any **vegetarian, vegan, allergies or other dietary requirements** when submitting your meal choices.
Dessert choices and the final starter and main-course options will be confirmed once the autumn/winter menu is released.

AFTER BOOKING

Once you have purchased your ticket, please email:
**contact@getasociallife.co.uk**
Please include:
**Your full name**
**Your mobile number**
**Any dietary requirements**
Once the new **autumn/winter menu** is available, I will send it to you so you can choose:
**1 Starter**
**1 Main Course**
**1 Dessert**

Your final meal choices must be submitted **at least 7 days before the event**.
Pre-ordering is important so that the restaurant can prepare in advance and the evening runs smoothly for everyone.

LIMITED SPACES – BOOK EARLY

We have a **limited number of places available**.
Because of the size and layout of the upstairs dining space, once all the seats have been booked, we will not be able to simply add extra places.
**Please book early to avoid disappointment.**

CANCELLATION POLICY

Tickets are **non-refundable unless the event is cancelled**. Any applicable booking fees are non-refundable.

CONTACT

For further information, please email:
**contact@getasociallife.co.uk**
Or contact me on:
**07957 320516**

SOCIAL MEDIA & PHOTOS

