8fb3ec47-0f13-400f-91f9-7c82abb140b3,,Icebreaker & Launch Session: Meet the Community,"Welcome to our very first online gathering! This session is all about breaking the ice, setting a comfortable rhythm for future events, and meeting fellow members in a relaxed, low-pressure…","Welcome to our very first online gathering! This session is all about breaking the ice, setting a comfortable rhythm for future events, and meeting fellow members in a relaxed, low-pressure environment.
Whether you want to introduce yourself on mic, type in the chat, or simply grab a seat and listen in, you are 100% welcome. Zero pressure, zero forced call-outs.
**What We’ll Cover (30–45 Mins)**

• **Welcome & Concept Overview (5 mins):** A quick intro to how our upcoming financial briefings and presentation practice sessions will work.
• **Casual Intros & Light Chat (20 mins):** Share a bit about your background, profession, or general interests—only if you feel like speaking up. Mics, cameras, and chat box are all optional. Anonymous/quiet participation is fully respected!
• **Upcoming Session Preview (10 mins):** An introduction to how our content-sharing format works. We will open the floor for voluntary sign-ups for our next session (volunteers receive their short narration script via email 3 days in advance).
• **Wrap-Up & Q&A (5 mins):** Final thoughts and offline next steps.

**Event Details**

• **Location:** Online (Meeting link will be visible upon RSVP)
• **Duration:** 45 to 60 minutes
• **What to Bring:** Just yourself! No prior preparation or financial background required.",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792639290/orbit/event-covers/sources/z5apjeqnegmhyvt7e8hn.jpg,2026-10-24 04:30:00+00,2026-10-24 05:30:00+00,Asia/Kolkata,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/public-speaking-forum-economy-and-finance-narration/events/316835639/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 03:21:15.028412+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/public-speaking-forum-economy-and-finance-narration/events/316835639/,event_316835639@meetup.com,,2026-10-22 03:20:45.416+00,,2026-10-22 03:21:15.028412+00,2026-10-22 19:53:43.862659+00,,,meetup:public-speaking-forum-economy-and-finance-narration:icebreaker launch session meet the community,"Every week on Saturday until February 16, 2027",f,
