• **From Task to Workflow** — Identify repetitive activities where Copilot can move beyond answering questions and help automate your work.
• **Build Your First Agent — Live Demo** — See how to move from a simple Copilot interaction to building an AI agent designed for a real business use case.
• **Responsible AI Usage** — Understand what to verify, what not to blindly trust, and how to keep humans in the loop.
• What you will learn:

Microsoft Copilot is becoming part of the everyday workplace—but getting value from it is not simply about knowing which prompt to type. The real advantage comes from knowing **how to give Copilot the right context, how to use it across your daily work, and how to turn AI assistance into repeatable productivity.**
