4b27398d-e10a-43b5-86a3-eaf6112998f7,,How to Build an eBay Reselling Side Hustle with AI in One Weekend,This event is being promoted by many groups.,"This event is being promoted by many groups.

Our meetup group is participating by promoting this event.

