d5e4ed5c-13df-41c2-98fb-9d0d5205c7ff,,trade with Institutional order flow L2,This online educational seminar builds on and applies the framework introduced in the L1 seminar.,"This online educational seminar builds on and applies the framework introduced in the **L1 seminar**.
While anyone with an interest in the financial markets is welcome to join, we encourage participants to first attend an L1 seminar in order to gain a clearer understanding of the **real institutional order flow framework** and the logic behind it. In this series, our focus will be on examining individual instruments that have recently experienced notable capital inflows or outflows, and then monitoring how they develop afterward.
All investment activity leaves a digital footprint in the trade tape. We deliberately tune out the overwhelming stream of trivial, misleading, and distracting content online, because price is simply a byproduct of investment activity. Understanding the mechanism of price formation behind the tickers is the genuine key to decoding the market.
