25527505-d4e9-4dbc-895f-a6efeef716ae,,Monday Ping Pong Social @Roxy Ball Room Liv Street,"Ping, Pong, Pint, Repeat! 🏓🍻","Ping, Pong, Pint, Repeat! 🏓🍻

Smash it, sip it, socialise in the heart of the City of London!

Join our Ping Pong Social at Roxy Ball Room, St Mary Axe (2 mins from Liverpool Street). Serious smasher or total beginner, there's a game for you.

What's on:
~ 4 hours of ping pong fun
~ Tournaments for Beginners, Intermediates & Experts
~ Quirky games: Social Doubles, Round Pong, Weapon Pong & more
~ Prizes: Prosecco, medals & free entry to our next event
~ Music, drinks & great company

