57fe593f-114a-4e0a-af94-b0f9e329a0a8,,WHITECHAPEL THURSDAY BADMINTON - LEVEL-WISE,Badminton Competitive Games with Social Energy 🏸✨,"Badminton Competitive Games with Social Energy 🏸✨

Join us for a fantastic session of high-energy badminton, great rallies, and awesome company! Whether you're here to sharpen your game or get ready for upcoming tournaments, this is the place to be. We play with feather shuttles for a true competitive feel.

The Setup: 28 Players Across 4 Courts (7 players per court - You will only play at your court according to level with same 6 players on the day for 2.5 hours; last half hour is OPEN PLAY (anyone can play with anyone). also, I can move your around for few games as well depending on your level- Usually can move Higher players to lower court for some chill game)

Rotation System: 7 players per court ensures everyone gets plenty of play time alongside short, well-paced breaks to rest and catch up. Court Level Breakdown: Games till 15 :)

COURT - 2 (LEVEL E) Understands the basic rules and can maintain simple rallies. Can hit basic forehand clears and serves but still developing consistency, backhand, footwork and positioning.

COURT - 2 (LEVEL D) Can sustain mid-court rallies and hit basic forehand clears. Struggles with deep backhands, defends smashes poorly, and gets caught off-balance.

COURT - 3 (LEVEL C) Reliable baseline-to-baseline clears and low doubles serves. Understands court rotation (front/back vs. side-by-side) and maintains medium-pace rallies.

COURT - 4 (LEVEL B)Strong footwork recovery, tight net play, and steep smashes. Uses tactical variation to force errors and counter-attacks under heavy pressure.

The Vibe: Competitive, high-fun games where you can push your skills, share a laugh, and build connections. Looking to join future tournaments? This is a great session to test your level with quality feather shuttles and get tournament-ready!

Location & Parking Info: No Onsite Parking: Street parking is available nearby (free after 6:00 PM), or you can use the nearby Sainsbury's parking. Great Transport Links: Super close to Whitechapel Station, and well within easy walking distance from Shadwell, Bethnal Green Overground, and the Central Line.

Post-Game Drinks 🍻🥤: After we wrap up on the court, let's head out for a few drinks together to unwind, chat, and socialize! Bring your racket, bring your energy, and let's smash it! See you on the court!",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/a/3/e/highres_535827198.jpeg,2026-11-12 18:30:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,Swanlea,"Swanlea School, 31 Brady St, London E1 5DJ, UK",Greater London,c06699ed-62e0-4957-bcb4-080c5271da9a,"{sport,fitness}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/dropshotfolks-badminton/events/317106134/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-25 03:21:27.385057+00,source:cba1b9d2-d09d-4c19-a89e-50bdbe5525a0,https://www.meetup.com/dropshotfolks-badminton/events/317106134/,event_317106134@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:20:38.34+00,,2026-10-25 03:21:27.385057+00,2026-10-28 03:21:16.106472+00,,,meetup:dropshotfolks-badminton:whitechapel thursday badminton level wise,"Every week on Thursday until December 10, 2026",f,GB
