413baf8e-0621-44d6-945a-a9b2e71b39bc,,"🌍 If You Dig a Hole Straight Down, Where Will You End Up?","🌍 If You Dig a Hole Straight Down, Where Will You End Up?","🌍 **If You Dig a Hole Straight Down, Where Will You End Up?**
Have you ever wondered where you'd emerge if you could dig a tunnel straight through the Earth?
Join Antipode Explorers for a friendly online exploration of antipodes — the points on Earth directly opposite one another.
We'll discover:

• What lies on the opposite side of the Earth from London and other famous places.
• Why many antipodes fall in the ocean rather than on land.
• What lies beneath our feet, from the Earth's crust to its core.
• Which places around the world have the most surprising antipodes.

📅 Friday, 30 October 2026
🕡 6:30 pm UK time (GMT)
💻 Online via Zoom

