29a7b487-6972-4ed7-a673-749c36824ead,,Play Badminton for fun... social badminton with a competitive edge!,"Welcome to Grove Park Badminton! Come and play at our bi-weekly sessions, please RSVP your attendance and bring along your racket.","Welcome to Grove Park Badminton! Come and play at our bi-weekly sessions, please RSVP your attendance and bring along your racket.
**MIDDLE INTERMEDIATE LEVEL AND ABOVE ONLY (INCLUDING VISITORS)** - Sorry, NO beginners, this club is not suitable for players who cannot serve, smash, hold a strategic rally and clear a shot from the back of the court. We play with quality, feather shuttlecocks only. Please do not attend Badminton if you are feeling unwell at all, or if you or anyone in your household currently has symptoms of any virus.

**INFORMATION:** Sessions cost: £13 for regulars and 'First Timers'* (cash or bank transfer, always pay before you play) for 2 hours. Please do not attend unless you have RSVP to reserve a space. If circumstances change, update your RSVP 24 hours before the session so others can fill the space. *If you do not attend or cancel after midday on the day of the session, then you will be expected to pay the full £13 cancellation fee on your next visit.*
*First Timers - you will receive a message with bank details to make your first payment of £13. Failure to send payment by midday of the day of your session will result in your name being moved to the 'Not Going' list, this in turn means if there is a 'WaitList', then another player will automatically fill your space.

**TRAVEL:** Free car park and main entrance accessed via Staveley Road. Walk through the side gate, towards sports hall and entrance is on your right hand side. Buses: E3 bus stop opposite the entrance. Chiswick Station: South West Trains - 7 minutes walk Please ring if you get lost - 07811 331030.

**ATTENDANCE, LATE DROP-OUTS AND NO-SHOWS:** Regular players: First no-show - You'll be expected to pay full price for the missed session. Second no-show - £15.00 penalty Third no-show - you will be removed from the group. This is to ensure basic courtesy to those playing and those waiting who can attend and want to play! First Timers: First no-show - you will be removed from the group.

**INSURANCE:** Any injury or loss incurred will be the individual’s responsibilities. The club will hold no responsibility or liability for any loss or injury. Because of this we encourage you to warm up appropriately, wear appropriate clothing including non-marking footwear and STRETCH off before and AFTER the games.
We hope you’ll have fun and an enjoyable time at this session! **PLAYING BADMINTON IS A GREAT WAY TO GET FIT AND HAVE FUN!!!**

**Note:** Please ensure you have all you belongings (and rubbish) before leaving at the end of the evening. There are bins situated just outside the hall for any rubbish. Thank you.",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792812087/orbit/event-covers/sources/yzmvuwqk5buczdmcg3ww.jpg,2027-01-08 20:00:00+00,2027-01-08 22:00:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,Grove Park Badminton Club,"Chiswick School Sports Hall, Free Car Park and entrance off Staveley Road",London,c06699ed-62e0-4957-bcb4-080c5271da9a,"{sport,fitness,socialising}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/grove-park-badminton-club/events/zzczztykccblb/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-24 03:21:20.750761+00,source:cba1b9d2-d09d-4c19-a89e-50bdbe5525a0,https://www.meetup.com/grove-park-badminton-club/events/zzczztykccblb/,event_zzczztykccblb@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:20:38.34+00,,2026-10-24 03:21:20.750761+00,2026-10-28 03:21:15.930389+00,,,meetup:grove-park-badminton-club:play badminton for fun social badminton with a competitive edge,"Every week on Friday until December 20, 2030",f,GB
0ab034b3-9d39-4c6b-9a36-ad2881c55dfb,,Agentic AI Multimodal MonthlyMixer - Where Agents Minds Meet,"Join the global gathering of AI builders, researchers, and enthusiasts pushing the boundaries of agentic systems and multimodal intelligence.","Join the global gathering of AI builders, researchers, and enthusiasts pushing the boundaries of agentic systems and multimodal intelligence.
Connect every month for organic networking, 1-on-1 video chats, and powerful peer-to-peer exchanges across a flexible, open chat-based platform.
**Watch how it works**: https://youtu.be/trmf6Gqs6FM (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=trmf6Gqs6FM)
What Is the **Agentic AI Multimodal** #MonthlyMixer?
The **Agentic AI Multimodal MonthlyMixer** is a self-led, virtual networking event built for the ever-evolving AI community. Held on a Slack-like platform, this event is **unmoderated and open-format**, giving you full control to explore conversations, meet new minds, and share your work with others who “get it.”
From autonomous agents to multimodal AI, this mixer is the go-to online space for researchers, engineers, founders, and curious learners working at the frontier of machine intelligence.
**Who It’s For:**

• AI & ML researchers building agent-based systems
• Engineers and developers experimenting with LLMs and multimodal models
• Founders and startup teams innovating with AI tools
• Students, hobbyists, and professionals exploring applied AI
• AI community managers, mentors, and tech evangelists

Whether you're here to **collaborate, hire, share, or simply learn** — this mixer offers a space to grow your AI network month by month.
Channels You'll Explore:
Once inside, you’ll find themed group chats designed to make it easy to dive in:

• **#general (https://teamtaoindia.slack.com/archives/C04SYEPNHH6)** – For intros, casual chat, and major community announcements
• **#networking** – Drop your portfolio, project, startup, or agent demo
• **#intros** – Share your background, interests, and goals
• **#help-wanted** – Ask for or offer help with AI, code, design, research & more
• **#industry-room-tech** – Deep discussions on the latest tools, models, and frameworks in AI

And yes — you can instantly jump into **1-on-1 video or text conversations** with anyone you meet.
When & Where?

• **Every third Wednesday of the month**
• **5:00 PM – 7:00 PM (your local time)**
• **Register from the platform here - https://events.tao.ai/pod/analytics.club/cont-4d55c8eg78pg**

No Zoom. No formal agenda. Just real people, real tech, real connections.
**Why You Shouldn’t Miss It:**

• Global network of agentic AI practitioners and researchers
• Self-guided 1-on-1 connections and peer-led topic chats
• Showcase your work, explore partnerships, or ask for feedback
• Return monthly to reconnect and keep the conversation going
• A low-pressure space to think out loud with fellow innovators

Questions or Feedback?
Reach out any time at: https://noworkerleftbehind.org/event_support
**Useful Links**

• **Explainer Video**: https://youtu.be/trmf6Gqs6FM
• **Need help?** https://noworkerleftbehind.org/event_support

**Hashtags:**
#AgenticAI #MultimodalAI #MonthlyMixer #AICommunity #AIMeetup #LLMNetworking #AutonomousAgents #AIBuilderMeetup #MachineLearningNetworking #VirtualAIMixer #AIIndustryEvents #ConnectWithAI **#**thefutureofAI—together.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/3/b/d/highres_528234205.jpeg,2026-11-18 16:00:00+00,,Europe/Paris,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{technology,ai,science}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/ac-cdg/events/317063872/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-23 03:23:42.912934+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/ac-cdg/events/317063872/,event_317063872@meetup.com,,2026-10-27 03:23:01.838+00,,2026-10-23 03:23:42.912934+00,2026-10-27 03:23:38.398784+00,,,meetup:ac-cdg:agentic ai multimodal monthlymixer where agents minds meet,"Every 3rd Wednesday of the month until December 31, 2026",f,
