f63db7e6-ec25-4444-afe0-e5dedd99ef75,,AI World: Oracle Integration Live from the Conference Floor Community Webcast,"Trusted, enterprise-ready Agentic AI with Oracle Integration","**Trusted, enterprise-ready Agentic AI with Oracle Integration**
As organizations move from AI experimentation to real business execution, they need more than powerful models. Join the Oracle Integration team during Oracle AI World for a webcast on how to connect, orchestrate, govern, and monitor AI agents across your business.

What Oracle Integration brings to Agentic AI?
Secure connectivity to enterprise systems, governed workflows, visibility into agent actions, and the right human oversight, together in one platform:

• **Connect**: Secure connectivity to enterprise systems and SaaS applications.
• **Govern**: Human oversight and administrative control over agent actions.
• **Orchestrate**: Governed workflows where agents and people work together.
• **Monitor**: Enterprise-wide visibility into what your agents are doing.

**The product management team will provide an overview of the Oracle AI World Integration sessions and annoucements.**
