9a4fbd26-c3f5-45b8-8a63-ac0a30dd2192,,Explore London like a local🇬🇧,"Embark on this trip to fully live the London life and get to know the British culture! We will explore iconic landmarks including Piccadilly Circus, Covent Garden, Trafalgar Square and Westminster,…","Embark on this trip to fully live the London life and get to know the British culture! We will explore iconic landmarks including Piccadilly Circus, Covent Garden, Trafalgar Square and Westminster, with its famous Abbey, Big Ben and Houses of Parliament. We will also enjoy the vibrant streets of Camden Town, discover the colourful houses of Notting Hill and go shopping at Portobello Market. If you are a big Harry Potter fan, we will also visit some popular filming locations from the movies! We will enjoy lovely walks through Hyde Park, Green Park and St James's Park, visit Buckingham Palace and see the Changing of the Guard. And of course, you can't say you've truly experienced London without seeing a musical in the West End! We will have a theatre night to experience the magic and entertainment that make this city so special.

