8aa98494-8d23-441b-9511-fc62c2310549,,Croydon Spark and Solder Social Hour,"We are hosting another Croydon Spark and Solder Social Hour for anyone interested in jewelry making, from hobbyists to established makers. This is a relaxed, informal time to get together, work on…","We are hosting another Croydon Spark and Solder Social Hour for anyone interested in jewelry making, from hobbyists to established makers. This is a relaxed, informal time to get together, work on our current pieces, and chat about techniques, tools, or just catch up with fellow local makers. Whether you are currently working on a soldering project or just want to bring along some beadwork or wire wrapping to keep your hands busy, you are welcome to join us.

The goal here is simply to build a bit of community and share some space with people who enjoy creating. We will have a few tables set up where you can spread out your supplies, and there will be plenty of time to talk shop or ask for advice on a tricky design. If you have been looking for a reason to get out of the studio and meet others in the area, this is a great low-pressure way to do it.

We hope to see a good mix of faces there. If you think you can make it, please let us know by RSVPing so we can make sure we have enough room for everyone.",,2026-10-25 19:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,20 Mount Pleasant,20 Mount Pleasant,Croydon,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,socialising}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/the-jewelry-makers-collective-social-club/events/317071622/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:46:37.169472+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/the-jewelry-makers-collective-social-club/events/317071622/,event_317071622@meetup.com,,2026-10-22 19:47:17.036+00,,2026-10-22 19:46:37.169472+00,2026-10-22 19:48:29.865213+00,,,,,f,GB
6943dd65-89a3-4ea2-8322-df8be1cbb78e,,Explore London like a local🇬🇧,"Embark on this trip to fully live the London life and get to know the British culture! We will explore iconic landmarks including Piccadilly Circus, Covent Garden, Trafalgar Square and Westminster,…","Embark on this trip to fully live the London life and get to know the British culture! We will explore iconic landmarks including Piccadilly Circus, Covent Garden, Trafalgar Square and Westminster, with its famous Abbey, Big Ben and Houses of Parliament. We will also enjoy the vibrant streets of Camden Town, discover the colourful houses of Notting Hill and go shopping at Portobello Market. If you are a big Harry Potter fan, we will also visit some popular filming locations from the movies! We will enjoy lovely walks through Hyde Park, Green Park and St James's Park, visit Buckingham Palace and see the Changing of the Guard. And of course, you can't say you've truly experienced London without seeing a musical in the West End! We will have a theatre night to experience the magic and entertainment that make this city so special.

If you like to join my group trip reserve your spot at this link HERE (https://jmt.li/1yc5Tw)

If you have any questions about the itinerary, accommodation, activities or what to expect during the trip, feel free to reach out to me anytime, I’d be happy to share more and help you get ready for an unforgettable London adventure!",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/c/9/9/highres_536756473.jpeg,2026-11-19 18:00:00+00,,America/Los_Angeles,in_person,King's Cross St. Pancras,"London, UK",London,8827b689-2637-4245-8ba7-214b35948ea2,"{sport,travel,fitness,arts}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/the-san-jose-travelers-club-joinmytrip/events/317107024/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-27 03:22:58.978128+00,source:f26eb5d4-b239-4813-8e0c-3cf689eed4bd,https://www.meetup.com/the-san-jose-travelers-club-joinmytrip/events/317107024/,event_317107024@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:30.379+00,,2026-10-27 03:22:58.978128+00,2026-10-28 03:22:55.486349+00,,,source:f26eb5d4-b239-4813-8e0c-3cf689eed4bd:explore london like a local:king s cross st pancras,,f,GB
