209f9417-e585-40cd-b0a2-b8ef624b0d35,,London Data Intelligence Network | Meetup | Oct 2026,"Welcome, London Data Intelligence Network!","**Welcome, London Data Intelligence Network!**

London Data Intelligence Network (https://www.meetup.com/london-data-intelligence-network/?eventOrigin=your_groups) is a community-based networking event bringing people together to meet peers, share stories, and build meaningful relationships around data intelligence.

Hosted by Datacove (https://datacove.co.uk/), award-winning Brighton-based R, Python and Shiny experts, these events also offer inspiring talks, hands-on sessions, and open knowledge sharing, all in a friendly, inclusive environment. Whether you’re just starting out in data or a seasoned expert, there’s always something new to discover, spark your curiosity, and take back to the office.

We run four events each year in London, offering fresh insights, lively discussions, and opportunities to connect with the wider Data Intelligence Network, anchored by the EARL Data Intelligence Conference (https://earl-conference.com/), our flagship event held in Brighton each October.

The events are supported by the generous team at Incubeta (https://incubeta.com/find-us/london-united-kingdom/).

For more information, sponsorship opportunities, or to get involved as a speaker, contact us at [[admin@datacove.co.uk](mailto:admin@datacove.co.uk)](https://datacove.co.uk/contact/) or visit https://datacove.co.uk (https://datacove.co.uk/)

**--- Important Information ---**

**This is a paid event.** Your ticket entitles you to pizza and drink options (soft and alcoholic beverages available).

As standard, we cater for Vegetarian, Vegan, and GF. Please contact an organiser for any other requirements.

**You can book your tickets online through Ticketpass (https://ticketpass.org/event/EMUCND/london-data-intelligence-network-oct-2026) at a discounted rate:**

• **General Admission:** £5 online / £10 at the door

Students must bring an NUS card or any other form of student ID. Cash and card accepted on the door.

**--- Talk Information ---**

**Interpretable Boosted Linear Modelling.**

We’re delighted to be joined by Paul Beard, Actuary at Pacific Life Re.

The talk will focus on the ""IBLM"" package, which I authored and had accepted to CRAN. In short, Interpretable Boosted Linear Modelling (IBLM) is a technique for fitting machine learning models in R that combines a conventional generalised linear model (GLM) with a modern machine learning model (e.g., XGBoost).

**How to Tell a Clear Story with Data**

We also welcome Tom Price, Senior Commercial Analytics Manager at Worldpay.

He will explore how to make data analysis easier for an audience to understand and act on. He’ll share a simple approach to turning analysis into a clear story by focusing on what matters, why it matters and what the audience should take away.

**--- Schedule & Refreshments ---**

Now, refreshments! Drinks and nibbles will be served from 6pm. Talks will commence at 6:30pm/6:45pm and the event will conclude at 8pm. The conversation will continue after the event at a local pub.

**--- Sponsorship Information ---**

Our event relies heavily on sponsorship from companies that attend. Please contact the organisers or **admin@datacove.co.uk (https://datacove.co.uk/)** to get involved.

**--- Arrival Instructions ---**

Please arrive at The Bower and locate the reception, where staff will be there to guide you to the correct floor.

**What3Words**: magma.clip.achieving

**--- Registration Etiquette ---**

At our meetups, the event is sometimes capped by the space. We’re committed to keeping these events accessible for everyone, but to make that possible, we need your help. **Please ensure your registration is kept up to date.** If your plans change, simply update your RSVP to reflect your availability. Thank you for your understanding and cooperation.

Please feel free to spread the word. We look forward to seeing you all again!",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/3/1/d/e/highres_532812766.jpeg,2026-11-05 18:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,Incubeta,"14th Floor, The Bower, 207-211 Old St, London EC1V 9NR",London,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{technology,data}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/london-data-intelligence-network/events/312536046/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/london-data-intelligence-network/events/312536046/,event_312536046@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.493162+00,,,,,f,GB
