f9b1707f-bebd-487e-9d09-05ce6bf98a0d,,Yes Atlas: Scavenger Hunt- UK 🇬🇧,"Hosted by Seek Discomfort, Laura Copeland and 1 other","**Hosted By:** Seek Discomfort

Most people spend a weekend in the places they already know. That’s the comfortable version. This is the other one.

This October and November, Seekers around the world are turning their cities into a playing field. A scavenger hunt- part city exploration, part Seek Discomfort challenge, entirely unpredictable. You get a list, people you’ve probably never met, and a few hours to find out what you’re actually willing to do in public.

And across every city taking part, **two Seekers** will win the new Yes Theory Atlas!

**About the prize:**

The Atlas is ten years of Yes Theory, made physical. A 384-page full-colour hardcover holding more than 50 of the most memorable stories- the adventures, the people, the places- with personal writing, photography, behind-the-scenes moments, and QR codes that take you straight back to the original films. Sewn binding, silver foil, embossed matte cover. A decade of seeking discomfort, captured in something that won’t disappear into an algorithm.

Two of you are going to walk out with it for free.

What happens during the hunt will be completely different for each city!

Some of the events will be lightly filmed, and this is your opportunity to be a part of a Seek Discomfort reel!

**What to bring:**

• A phone with a working camera and enough battery to last
• Your epic energies, and a friend if you must
• The willingness to be a little embarrassed in front of strangers",https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/s0/216c3a84-128d-48eb-8844-6fa11227dcca.png,2026-11-08 12:00:00+00,2026-11-08 14:00:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,Hyde Park,London,London,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{technology,ai,growth,careers,gaming}",,external,https://luma.com/bfgjvco9,Register on Luma,f,,t,,0.00,0.00,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 21:15:28.90274+00,source:43f3ff01-5d55-4ce5-93b5-3108d665e05e,https://luma.com/bfgjvco9,evt-w730na4VbEGIKZr@events.lu.ma,36171b97-6d14-45d1-87c1-84c6d73fc164,2026-10-22 21:15:22.505+00,,2026-10-22 21:15:28.90274+00,2026-10-22 21:16:15.743275+00,51.5073638,-0.1641135,,,f,GB
