3bc0c977-a025-4962-ae10-cec66c6f2a2f,,2 Hours to Freedom: Build a Job Hunt AI Agent with Claude,There are many groups promoting this event.,"There are many groups promoting this event.

Our meetup group is participating by promoting this event.

