Check Meetup for the latest session schedules, updates and announcements.

The simple loop:

**Commit. Execute. Update. Repeat.**

Wins are welcome.
Lessons are welcome.
Progress is welcome.
Imperfect days are welcome.
**Showing up is most welcome.**

