fd009d6b-1d03-4e9a-b455-ab3005bf92e4,,Microsoft Ignite 2026 | Online,Your code. Your cloud. Your agents. Watch Microsoft Ignite 2026 online.,"Your code. Your cloud. Your agents. Watch Microsoft Ignite 2026 online.

Agents now take on whole coding tasks in parallel, and they need infrastructure, data and operations that can keep up. At Microsoft Ignite, the engineers behind GitHub Copilot, VS Code, Microsoft Foundry and Azure show how it all fits together, live. Developers see how to ship more while staying in control of every merge. IT and platform teams see how to run, scale and govern AI workloads in production.

**With digital access, you can:**
Take an idea from prompt to merged pull request with GitHub Copilot, parallel agents and VS Code. Build, ground and deploy production-ready agents in Microsoft Foundry, starting from your first line of agent code.

