**· Architects:** Get inside the Azure infrastructure, networking and data platforms built to run AI models, apps and agents at scale.
· Watch every featured session live or on demand in your own time zone and replay the demos when you sit down to build.

Hear **Satya Nadella** and **Judson Althoff** in the opening keynote. Then see sessions from **Scott Hanselman, VP and Member of Technical Staff; Mark Russinovich, Azure CTO, Tina Schuchman, Corporate Vice President; Jeff Hollan, VP of Product;** and **Brendan Burns, Corporate Vice President Azure Cloud Native** on AI-assisted development, Microsoft Foundry and agentic cloud operations.

