52a9cb13-38ca-4976-9522-f288cb806569,,Meeting C++ 2026,Meeting C++ 2026! Get your tickets while you can!,"Meeting C++ 2026! Get your tickets while you can!
Tickets are available in the online shop at Tito (https://ti.to/meetingcpp/meetingcpp-2026)
Access will be provided to ticket holders only. This event is what makes Meeting C++ all year possible.

**Meeting C++ 2026 (https://meetingcpp.com/2026)** - Schedule of 2026 (https://meetingcpp.com/mcpp/schedule)
This years Meeting C++ is a hybrid event in **Berlin** and **online** on **26th - 28th November 2026**.
The conference will be again hybrid - just like last year, attendees will join us on location (https://meetingcpp.com/2025/Location.html) in Berlin, but the conference will be also featuring online and onsite only content.

• Meeting C++ 2026
• streaming the onsite tracks and hosting a track online
• Tickets are available in the online shop at Tito (https://ti.to/meetingcpp/meetingcpp-2026)
• Tickets are transferable for the full event, but not refundable
• Book your hotel room (soon tm) on the Meeting C++ ticket contingent
• Rooms are also available as hotel tickets in the ticketshop
• Get cheaper train tickets for Deutsche Bahn (https://eventanreise-bahn.de/?event=53578&language=en)
• Student (https://meetingcpp.com/mcpp/studentprogram/) and Support Tickets (https://meetingcpp.com/mcpp/supportticket/) are available
• Talklisting of Meeting C++ 2026 (https://meetingcpp.com/mcpp/schedule/talklisting.php)
• A first schedule for the conference (https://meetingcpp.com/mcpp/schedule/)
• Sponsors are welcome (https://meetingcpp.com/mcpp/sponsoring/)
• Meeting C++ 2025 Trip reports:
• Frances Buontempo (2025) (https://buontempoconsulting.blogspot.com/2026/04/meeting-c-2025.html)
• Sandor Dargo (https://www.sandordargo.com/blog/2025/11/12/trip-report-meeting-cpp-2025)
• Guillaume Dua (https://guillaumedua.github.io/publications/2026/03/13/meeting-cpp-2025-trip-report/)
• Omniverse (https://omniverse.ru/blog/2025/11/27/meetingcpp-trip-report/)
• Meeting C++ 2026 runs under the Berlin Code of Conduct (http://berlincodeofconduct.org/)

Attending onsite

The onsite part of the conference is hosted in the Vienna House by Wyndham Andel's Berlin Hotel (**Address: Landsberger Allee 106, 10396 Berlin**)
You can secure your own little spot to sit for 3 days by putting up a name sign in the main hall on the table you chose to sit. If you have special needs, the conference hotel is fully accessible and offers rooms with accessible bathrooms and a twin room for an assistant (https://meetingcpp.com/meetingcpp/news/items/Visit-Meeting-Cpp-2025-with-assistance-and-your-wheelchair.html).
For 3 full days Meeting C++ 2026 will be held in Berlin. Meeting C++ will host 3 tracks onsite: the main track and tracks B and C. Keynotes and the main program is hosted in Track A. See last years schedule (https://meetingcpp.com/2025/Schedule.html) for further information such as time tables on the conference. Onsite attendees will also have access to the online part of the conference.

Attending online

Meeting C++ will stream all the tracks including the keynotes to the online part of the event and features an online only track with talks by various speakers. A few words on how-to-attend. First, the link to the online event will be send to the **email you've (been) registered with, this is then also your login**. Meeting C++ will send some more details about the event to that email, so if you don't receive these in November, make sure you're registered with the right email. You'll need to register then with that email for the event.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/e/4/3/b/highres_536278427.jpeg,2026-11-26 08:00:00+00,,Europe/Berlin,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,{technology},,external,https://www.meetup.com/meeting-cpp-online/events/316763496/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-28 03:23:34.220625+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/meeting-cpp-online/events/316763496/,event_316763496@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-28 03:23:34.220625+00,2026-10-28 03:23:36.467947+00,,,,,f,
