aade5819-bb38-465b-b275-2aa4f6204e1e,,What Is My Agent Actually Doing?,What Is My Agent Actually Doing?,"What Is My Agent Actually Doing?

**Observing and Tracing AI Agents in Production on AWS**

Getting an AI agent to work in a demo is the easy part.
The real challenge begins when that agent reaches production — when it makes an unexpected decision, calls the wrong tool, gets stuck in a workflow, or suddenly consumes far more time and cost than expected.
**So, what is your agent actually doing?**
In this session, we’ll go beyond simply knowing *whether* an agent worked and explore how to understand **what happened inside a running agent**.
We’ll look at how observability can help you trace agent behaviour across **reasoning steps, tool calls, model interactions, tokens, latency, and failures** — turning otherwise mysterious production issues into something you can investigate and understand.

What we'll explore

🔹 **Tracing AI agents in production**
Understand what happens across the different steps of an agentic workflow.
🔹 **Understanding how agents fail**
Explore three common failure patterns:

• Wrong or unexpected results
• Incomplete or broken workflows
• Runaway latency and cost

🔹 **Observability with AWS**
See how **Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Observability and Amazon CloudWatch** can help capture, monitor, and investigate agent behaviour.
🔹 **From visibility to trust**
Learn why observability isn't just about monitoring systems — it is a critical foundation for **AI governance, explainability, reliability, and trust**.

The takeaway

You’ll leave with a practical mental model for designing and operating **observable, reliable, and trustworthy AI agents** — especially when real users, real workloads, and real consequences enter the picture.

Who should attend?

This session is designed for anyone building, deploying, or operating AI agents, including:
**• AI/ML Engineers**
**• GenAI Developers**
**• Software Engineers**
**• Cloud Architects**
**• Data Scientists**
**• DevOps/MLOps Engineers**
**• AI Leaders**
**• Technology Enthusiasts**

If you are asking, **“How do I know what my AI agent is actually doing once it goes into production?”** — this session is for you.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/3/7/9/4/highres_535994228.jpeg,2026-10-24 04:30:00+00,,Asia/Kolkata,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{technology,ai}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/awsaimlindia/events/316429773/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 03:22:46.934486+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/awsaimlindia/events/316429773/,event_316429773@meetup.com,,2026-10-22 03:22:12.257+00,,2026-10-22 03:22:46.934486+00,2026-10-22 03:22:58.341962+00,,,,,f,
