33a18b41-8c41-4586-be0d-0c9c92f0aad1,,🌙✨ Nightly Journaling Circle✨,🌙✨ Nightly Journaling Circle | Online | 9 PM – 10 PM,"🌙✨ **Nightly Journaling Circle | Online | 9 PM – 10 PM**

Looking for a peaceful way to end your day? Join us every evening for a cozy online journaling session where we pause, reflect, and set intentions for a better tomorrow.

From **9:00 PM to 10:00 PM**, we'll spend time writing down our thoughts, practicing gratitude, and sharing general reflections in a warm, supportive, and judgment-free space. Whether you're celebrating small wins, processing your day, or simply seeking calm, you're welcome here.

💛 **What to expect:**
• Guided journaling prompts
• Quiet reflection time
• Optional sharing and meaningful conversations
• A positive and supportive community
• Small daily habits for personal growth and well-being

📖 **Bring along:**
• A journal or notebook
• A pen
• An open heart and mind

No writing experience is needed—just come as you are.

**Because healing, self-discovery, and growth happen one page at a time.** 🌿✨

*""Write your thoughts today, create a better tomorrow.""*

*# Journaling Session Ground Rules*

*To create a safe, focused, and meaningful space for everyone, please keep these guidelines in mind:*

1. **This is a journaling-focused session.** *Please keep all discussions related to the prompts and personal reflections from today's session.*

2. **No work or workplace discussions.** *This is a space to disconnect from work and reconnect with yourself. Please avoid conversations about your job, colleagues, office, or workplace situations.*

3. **Respect everyone's time.** *Stay on topic and avoid side conversations so we can make the most of our time together.*

4. **No unrelated subjects.** *Please refrain from discussing politics, current affairs, gossip, business, or other topics unrelated to the journaling experience.*

5. **Share with kindness, not advice.** *If participants choose to share, listen with empathy. Avoid giving unsolicited advice or trying to solve someone else's experiences.*

6. **Confidentiality matters.** *What is shared in this session stays in this session. Please respect everyone's privacy.*

7. **Share only what feels comfortable.** *There is no pressure to speak. You're welcome to simply journal and listen.*

8. **Be present.** *Silence your notifications, minimize distractions, and give yourself this hour to reflect and be fully engaged.*",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792620962/orbit/event-covers/sources/cuebbhsi72crkdo488pv.jpg,2026-10-28 17:00:00+00,2026-10-28 18:00:00+00,Asia/Dubai,online,Online event,,,8827b689-2637-4245-8ba7-214b35948ea2,"{sport,wellbeing,fitness}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/dlrc-walk-and-talk/events/316899087/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:15:29.416216+00,source:f26eb5d4-b239-4813-8e0c-3cf689eed4bd,https://www.meetup.com/dlrc-walk-and-talk/events/316899087/,event_316899087@meetup.com,,2026-10-22 03:21:50.591+00,,2026-10-21 22:15:29.416216+00,2026-10-22 03:22:11.100007+00,,,meetup:dlrc-walk-and-talk:nightly journaling circle,Every week on every day,f,
