f1673f75-3367-488a-8291-6913d9a46ef9,,❤️Think and Grow Rich💲Practical Workshop for Wealth💰and Success💯,🧭How to join?,"**🧭How to join?**

1. 💸Register for the workshop using this link: **https://tinyurl.com/GG2MT100**
2. 🎁Apply Coupon Code ""**2MT100**"" to get **FREE** access for **Limited-time ONLY**!!
3. Join the 📹 **Zoom session** from workshops section
4. Join us on **WhatsApp** for getting reminders: https://chat.whatsapp.com/GuPbVjhJZ2sCfFfDfnvXCu

**What we will do in this Workshop?**
A **step-by-step, practical implementation of the 12 core Principles of Success** from the book ***Think and Grow Rich* by Napoleon Hill,** including:
🎯 **Desire** – The starting point of all achievement
🧠 **Faith** – Believing in the unseen
💬 **Autosuggestion** – Programming the subconscious mind
📚 **Specialized Knowledge** – Learning that pays dividends
💡 **Imagination** – The workshop of the mind
🗂️ **Organized Planning** – Turning dreams into actionable steps
💪 **Decision** – Conquering procrastination
🛡️ **Persistence** – The power to push through
👥 **The Mastermind** – Harnessing collective intelligence
🧘 **The Subconscious Mind** – Directing your inner compass
🧠 **The Brain** – Your mind is a powerful broadcasting and receiving station.
🌌 **The Sixth Sense** – Tap into intuition and insight beyond logic.
**📅 Workshop Structure:**
🧭 Live Session (90-120 minutes)
📘 Assignments & Exercises
🧠 Group Discussion & Q&A
Whether you're an entrepreneur, working professional, or simply someone seeking personal transformation, this workshop offers clarity, structure, and action.

**Disclaimer:**
*This workshop and its associated exercises or assignments are based entirely on my personal interpretation and understanding of the book ""Think and Grow Rich"" by Napoleon Hill. It is not affiliated with, nor does it officially represent, any individual or entity associated with the book in any form. All materials and insights shared are intended solely for educational and self-development purposes.*",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/2/4/3/highres_528953827.jpeg,2026-12-13 04:00:00+00,2026-12-13 06:00:00+00,Asia/Kolkata,online,Online event,,,4cece675-2670-4581-90e6-2b792576b047,"{sport,finance,fitness}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/bangalore-manifestation-club/events/317024067/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:15:29.416216+00,source:f26eb5d4-b239-4813-8e0c-3cf689eed4bd,https://www.meetup.com/bangalore-manifestation-club/events/317024067/,event_317024067@meetup.com,6c9d8842-2c3b-4a35-bc85-75dcf5b228dc,2026-10-22 03:21:50.591+00,,2026-10-21 22:15:29.416216+00,2026-10-22 03:22:11.100007+00,,,meetup:bangalore-manifestation-club:think and grow rich practical workshop for wealth and success,"Every 2 weeks on Sunday until November 30, 2030",f,
