In today’s fast-paced digital world, having skills is just the beginning - knowing how to turn them into income is what matters. Freelancing offers an opportunity to use your existing skills, work independently, and build a career on your own terms.

Join us for an insightful online webinar with Jaya Shakthi Kannan (https://www.linkedin.com/in/shakthik92/), Founder of Chennai Freelancers Club, on **“Freelancing-னா என்ன...? (What is Freelancing?)” - In Tamil.**

Discover the basics of freelancing, understand how it works, and explore how you can get started on your freelancing journey.

**Event Details**

• **Date:** Friday, 23rd October 2026
• **Time:** 8:00 PM – 9:00 PM
