69fa737d-6808-436a-bf79-da8b7df24145,,"MC 02: Application Architecture: UI Building, Git, and GitHub","Every AI app needs more than a model. It needs an interface people can actually use, and code you can trust and share.","Every AI app needs more than a model. It needs an interface people can actually use, and code you can trust and share.

In this live masterclass you will learn how an application is put together end to end: how the architecture of an AI app fits together, how to build a simple UI for it, and how to manage your code with Git and GitHub so your work is saved, versioned and ready to share.

What we will cover:
• How an AI application is structured: model, logic and interface
• Building a simple UI for your app
• Git basics: track and save your work properly
• GitHub: publish your project and share it with the world
• From notebook to working app
• Live Q&A

Who it's for: developers, analysts, career switchers, and anyone building their first AI applications. No prior Git or GitHub experience needed.

