ce90cdf9-d8e1-4bdd-98de-9634ab6282ae,,AI This Week: Open Circle,"AI moves fast. Something new drops every week, and it's hard to keep up alone.","AI moves fast. Something new drops every week, and it's hard to keep up alone.

AI This Week: Open Circle is our weekly open circle for developers, builders, and anyone curious about where AI is headed. There are no slides and no fixed speaker. We bring the week's biggest AI news, new model releases, tools worth trying, and whatever questions you're stuck on, and we talk it through together.
**What we usually cover:**
• The AI news that actually matters this week
• New models, frameworks, and tools people are testing
• Real problems from your projects or work
• Quick live demos when someone has something cool to show
**Who should come:**
Engineers, data folks, founders, students, and career switchers. All levels are welcome. You don't need to present anything. Just show up with curiosity.
Bring a topic, a question, or just listen in. Some of our best conversations start with ""Has anyone tried...?""
Hosted by AgentVersity, a community of 30,000+ developers learning to build with AI.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/8/3/0/highres_536182576.jpeg,2026-11-20 04:00:00+00,2026-11-20 05:30:00+00,Asia/Kolkata,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{technology,ai}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/bengaluru-artificial-intelligence-group/events/316732376/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 03:22:47.855553+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/bengaluru-artificial-intelligence-group/events/316732376/,event_316732376@meetup.com,,2026-10-22 03:22:12.257+00,,2026-10-22 03:22:47.855553+00,2026-10-22 03:22:58.792734+00,,,meetup:bengaluru-artificial-intelligence-group:ai this week open circle,Every week on Friday,f,
f4f8754f-77a8-4e41-9194-b0eee5a2161e,,The Book Club in London,"A relaxed London book club exploring the most influential book in history. Whether you think it’s rubbish, holy, or you’re simply not sure what to make of it, you’re very welcome.","A relaxed London book club exploring the most influential book in history. Whether you think it’s rubbish, holy, or you’re simply not sure what to make of it, you’re very welcome.

We meet for two hours at a time. Our reading list includes books from the Bible — as well as some of the books that didn’t make it into most Bibles. The Bible has shaped culture, law, art and ethics for centuries, yet many people are personally unfamiliar with it.

Each evening is structured but informal. The group chooses the book or books to read, and discussion takes place in small groups. No lectures. No pressure. No need to prepare anything in advance. The aim is thoughtful, respectful conversation.

Plenty of people feel they know quite a bit about the Bible, yet struggle to read it. This is a space to explore it thoughtfully and honestly — in good company.
This club is for:
• Curious thinkers
• Skeptics
• Christians with questions
• Anyone who wants to make up their own mind

Our only rules?
Be curious.
Be honest.
Be kind.
And enjoy yourself.

It’s also a chance to find a bit of community along the way.

Photos may be taken during the evening to share on the Meetup page or social media to help others see what the group is like. If you prefer not to appear in photos, just let the organiser know at any time.

We meet in a private room on the second floor of the Duke of Sussex pub. When you arrive, get yourself a drink, ask for The Book Club, and come on up.",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792898422/orbit/event-covers/sources/atz1se8gvp8p1essc1py.jpg,2026-11-09 18:30:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,"Baylis Road, London, SE1 7AY",Baylis Road,London,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,books,socialising,arts}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/the-book-club-in-london/events/316496230/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:46:37.169472+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/the-book-club-in-london/events/316496230/,event_316496230@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:19:10.809+00,,2026-10-22 19:46:37.169472+00,2026-10-28 03:19:47.776315+00,,,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a:the book club in london:baylis road london se1 7ay,,f,GB
