169e3cae-9377-4e2d-bf8d-48666bdd3cfe,,Developer Impact Days 2026 (Hybrid Event 3 of 3) | Berlin,Hybrid Tech Conference | Online + Onsite in Berlin & Cologne,"**Hybrid Tech Conference | Online + Onsite in Berlin & Cologne**
*How the SDLC is changing, and impacts the life of developers.*

**Developer Impact Days 2026 (Event 3 of 3)**
Engineers, Architects, Techies - join the last event of our hybrid series in 2026 covering different R&D + xOps topics & trends that keep us up night, with each afternoon full of **tech** keynotes without annoying sales pitches!

What makes the events stand out?
🥷🧙♀️🧝🪄 Tech + Community-first: Join bloody honest tech insights from like minded techies together with other practitioners — not just watching, but discussing, reacting, and learning in real time.

All the 3 events bring different topics and speakers...**this** **last event will** **take place *in Berlin, in Cologne & Online* simultaneously** on 22nd October
The event is free of charge. Tickets are limited.

If you’re curious about where the SDLC, software engineering and DevOps is going next - and how it impacts your life as a developer, this is a great place to plug in.

Let's make this an amazing shared community experience with tech in its center.

Join a variety of senior practitioners and run into like minded **techies** and discuss your thoughts with the community in a relaxed setting, with fingerfood and drinks...

👉 **Agenda** for the 22nd October:
13:00 Open Doors & Networking
14:00 Official Welcome - **Sebastian Grodzietzki**
14:15 The Serverless Experience, **Jacob Schwarz**
14:40 Taking Quarkus to Cloud, **Martin Stefanko**
15:20 API Management - Managing your API zoo, **Rhett Widurski**
15:40 Coffee break & snacks
16:00 Stepping up your productivity with Quarkus: Running your application in Dev Mode, **Martin Stefanko**
16:40 Cloud-Native Observability (Beyond Just Logs): Total visibility. No more ""it works on my machine."", **Marcus Rüsch & Basak Vogt**
17:20 The Code Works. But Do I Still Understand It?, **Thomas Südbröcker**
17:50 Platform Engineering & Internal Developer Platforms (IDP): Less friction, more coding, **Nikolaus Lemberski**
18:30 Wrap-up, Dinner & Drinks, Networking

