0eaf07ee-630f-49ca-98f9-889438187526,,"AI Agents in Action – Brunch & Build at Extrablatt, Bockenheimer Warte",How much of your life slips away every week on…?,"How much of your life slips away every week on…?

✈️ Endless holiday research and route planning
✍️ Painful writing of emails, letters, or official forms
🛒 Recipe hunting, meal plans, and shopping lists
📝 Grinding through long texts or PDFs

Enough of that!

There are brilliant little digital helpers, right on your smartphone, that do exactly these jobs for you in seconds. Free, and no tech talk.

**The plan**
Let us combine the pleasant with the useful: a delicious breakfast at Cafe Extrablatt and a relaxed exchange about how we win back time for real life with smart tools.

**What awaits you**
**Feasting and meeting people:** we start relaxed at the buffet.
**Aha moments:** we unmask your everyday time wasters and talk about solutions that actually work.
**Live test:** if you like, bring your phone or laptop and we test a few of these everyday tricks right at the table.

This is for everyone who is curious about new things!
You need no prior knowledge at all. It is about practical tips for daily life, real relief, and a good time in a small group.

📋 **Event Details**

