5ae908fb-62b9-4b0e-83a8-e22b0c4ebed7,,The Startup Stroll x FoundHers,"Hosted by Marion Boimond, Stefanie Mulder and 2 others","**The Startup Stroll partners with FoundHers** to organise a longer walk in Hampstead Heath! Find out more about **FoundHers** here (https://foundhersglobal.com/) ✨ and learn more about **The Startup Stroll** below 🤗

**Your Saturday morning reset. No agenda, no pitching, just good conversation** ☕

The Startup Stroll is a bi-monthly morning walk for founders and builders. Building something is hard and we rarely make room to just *talk*. About the messy bits, the doubts, and the wins that don't feel big enough to celebrate yet.

This is that space.

Wind down into the weekend with people who *get it.* Bring your curiosity, your coffee, and whatever's on your mind. We'll stroll through London's greenery, talk honestly, and share what we're working on 🌿

When the hour's up, we'll find somewhere nearby for coffee or brunch for those who want to keep the conversation going.

Saturday October 31st, 11am-3pm. Parliament Hill Fields (Bus Stop GH) by Hampstead Hill 🥐",https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/9y/2d5692ec-d6e6-4b54-8a52-43bf17c8c975.png,2026-10-31 11:00:00+00,2026-10-31 15:00:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,"London, United Kingdom",,London,168d49d1-9456-4c1f-a396-5bc9f2050d9d,"{technology,ai,growth,careers,entrepreneurship}",,external,https://luma.com/4gsodxj4,Register on Luma,f,,t,,0.00,0.00,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 21:15:28.714683+00,source:43f3ff01-5d55-4ce5-93b5-3108d665e05e,https://luma.com/4gsodxj4,evt-oPFX7v6j7WToqlA@events.lu.ma,ce85d5da-c695-4573-965e-dd5f80fc7de6,2026-10-22 21:15:22.505+00,,2026-10-22 21:15:28.714683+00,2026-10-22 21:16:15.575642+00,51.5596922031047,-0.149803747266688,,,f,GB
