e8dd6ece-df85-4261-a468-3d1d64a0f35a,,Tech Summit 2026,"Hosted by KCL Tech Events, Haleema Mohammed and 1 other","Join us for **Tech Summit 2026**, KCL Tech’s flagship annual event and the **UK’s largest student-led technology conference and careers fair**.

