3b75796d-2744-47a8-99f8-d067acf3f491,,"We Need to Talk About AI, for real!","Is your organisation pushing AI at any cost, with no one asking whether it actually makes sense?","**Is your organisation pushing AI at any cost, with no one asking whether it actually makes sense?**
Are you sitting in meetings where ""just use AI"" is the answer before anyone has defined the problem? Watching KPIs get built around tools nobody fully understands? Wondering if you're the only one who thinks something's off?
**You're not.**

This **online gathering** is an open space for ***employees***, ***leaders***, and ***practitioners*** navigating AI adoption from the inside.

Join us and share what's really happening, challenge assumptions, and ask the questions that don't fit in a Slack channel or a one-on-one with your manager.
**Let's have an honest conversation about what's working, what isn't, and what choices we actually have.**

Your Human Future Hub Team 💙🩵🧡

🔒 *These sessions are private. No recording, no transcripts.*",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/0/4/e/highres_533120558.jpeg,2026-11-04 18:00:00+00,2026-11-04 19:00:00+00,Europe/Berlin,online,Online event,,,7aa69eeb-df8c-40ae-b929-a4324f936266,"{technology,ai}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/human-future-hub/events/316294837/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:16:55.807095+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/human-future-hub/events/316294837/,event_316294837@meetup.com,,2026-10-21 22:16:27.132+00,,2026-10-21 22:16:55.807095+00,2026-10-22 09:28:23.916645+00,,,meetup:human-future-hub:we need to talk about ai for real,"Every 2 weeks on Wednesday until December 20, 2026",f,
4f0b1909-3e78-4391-b4a8-ae17c462d937,,Poker Night @ DAS London,"Hosted by Katie Narain, Matthew Leightman and 2 others","**♠️ The Final Table of the Year**

Over 2025 and 2026 our poker nights have travelled from **Buenos Aires** to **Miami**, from **Cannes** to **Hong Kong**. Now the 2026 tour wraps in London.

We're coming together with **Blockworks** for **DAS London**, joined by **Flow Traders**, to open the conference with our last tournament of the year. It's the first night of DAS Week, **Monday 9 November**, at the **Royal Horseguards**, a historic Whitehall landmark on the Thames.

**12 tables. 120 players. One champion.**

Expect a night of Texas Hold'em, live jazz, drinks and some of the sharpest people in digital assets, all before the Summit starts.

**The night**
🃏 Free-entry Texas Hold'em tournament across 12 tables
🎷 Live jazz and music all evening
🥂 Drinks and canapés
🏆 A prize for the champion

**Details**
📍 The Royal Horseguards, 2 Whitehall Court, London SW1A 2EJ
🗓 Monday 9 November, 6pm until late
👔 Dress code: optional cocktail, smart is favoured

**How to get a seat**
There are only 120 seats, so registering doesn't guarantee you a place at the tables. We review every player request. **Confirmed players will get a separate email** with their seat confirmation and the details for the night.

Please rsvp with your work email

**Not confirmed?** We'll keep a few seats back for last-minute walk-ins. They're released at **6pm before play starts** and go on a first-come, first-served basis, so get there early.

We'll deal you in at the start of DAS week.

*Presented by Serotonin × Flow Traders × Blockworks*

*photos and videos will be taken during the event, attendees may be filmed and photographed for content used as promotional material

**About DAS:** Blockworks' Digital Asset Summit (DAS) returns to London this November 10–11, 2026. DAS is crypto's premier institutional event.

Stablecoins, tokenization, onchain infrastructure, and AI are rapidly reshaping the global financial system. DAS London will bring together the leading institutional leaders, allocators, builders, and policy makers from across the UK, Europe, North America, MENA, and Asia to discuss how the next chapter of global finance will be written.",https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/l9/97fbcabb-cde2-41f0-95a5-2819c9afdb23.png,2026-11-09 18:00:00+00,2026-11-10 00:00:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,"The Royal Horseguards Hotel & One Whitehall Place, London","2 Whitehall Ct, London",London,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{technology,ai,growth,careers,crypto}",,external,https://luma.com/z7g0eoa3,Register on Luma,f,,t,,0.00,0.00,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 21:15:28.921153+00,source:43f3ff01-5d55-4ce5-93b5-3108d665e05e,https://luma.com/z7g0eoa3,evt-MgdhYr9RORaw5d6@events.lu.ma,c657a6df-f21d-486b-989a-3768fba1beaf,2026-10-22 21:15:22.505+00,,2026-10-22 21:15:28.921153+00,2026-10-22 21:16:15.761653+00,51.5060478,-0.1241368,,,f,GB
