d8b32011-7ffb-4d84-99cf-002eec0be954,,AI & Print-on-Demand: Build Your Online Business (Free Live Webinar),🎨 AI & Print-on-Demand: Build Your Online Business,"🎨 AI & Print-on-Demand: Build Your Online Business

🚀 Live Online Webinar
💡Curious about starting an online business without managing physical stock?
Print-on-demand allows you to sell products featuring your designs without having to store inventory yourself. With the help of AI tools, you can explore design ideas, research potential audiences, and learn how products can be created and listed online.

Join Nigel Wymer for a live webinar exploring how print-on-demand works, how AI can support the process, and what beginners should understand before getting started.

🔍 What you'll discover

🤖AI-assisted design — Explore how AI tools can help you develop visual concepts for products.
🎯Niche research — Learn ways to investigate audiences, interests, and product ideas.
🛍️Selling on Etsy — Understand how an online marketplace can fit into a print-on-demand business model.
📦How print-on-demand works — Discover how products can be produced and shipped when customers place orders, without you holding inventory.
⚙️Getting started — Explore the main steps involved in setting up a print-on-demand business, from choosing product ideas to creating listings.
📈Understanding the business model — Learn about the practical considerations involved in pricing, costs, competition, and marketing.

👨🏫 Meet your host: Nigel Wymer

Nigel Wymer shares his experience in online business and print-on-demand, offering insights into the tools, processes, and considerations involved in selling products online.
During this session, you'll have the opportunity to explore the approach and learn more about how AI tools may fit into the process.

👥 Who is this webinar for?

✅ Beginners curious about online business
✅ People exploring print-on-demand as a potential business model
✅ Existing Etsy or print-on-demand sellers interested in AI tools
✅ Anyone who wants to understand how online product creation and fulfilment work
No previous experience is required. The session is designed to introduce the concepts clearly, with practical examples to help you understand the process.

🎟️ Interested in learning more?

