ed8fd37e-cf9e-4bfc-a0e3-763de4689568,,What’s Next for Semantic Models in Fabric Data Agent,Join our Microsoft Fabric - UK User Group for our latest webinar.,"Join our Microsoft Fabric - UK User Group for our latest webinar.

