8fba7235-0b58-4289-abe1-9c6cad293625,,Public Speaking Business Club Frankfurt Toastmasters (Bornheim),About Us,"**About Us**

Whether you're itching to share your thoughts or aiming to refine your speaking and leadership prowess, all while having fun, consider our community your stage – welcome! So come along and see what it's all about!

We are part of Toastmasters International, a non-profit organisation that aims to improve public speaking skills. If you want to, you can do much more:
Toastmasters offers a warm and encouraging environment, focusing on:

• Confidently addressing an audience
• Delivering impactful presentations
• Crafting well-structured speeches
• Orchestrating successful meetings
• Providing constructive feedback and embracing criticism.

Join us on Tuesdays, Wednesdays or Thursdays, from 18:45 to approximately 21:30. Following our Toastmasters meeting, we pursue the conversation with food, drinks, and camaraderie in a nearby restaurant – a perfect conclusion to the evening!

**Visit us on LinkedIn:**
https://www.linkedin.com/company/business-club-frankfurt-toastmaster/

**Explore more on our homepage:**
http://www.businessclub-frankfurt-toastmasters.de/

We eagerly await your contribution and look forward to connecting with you!",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/4/b/2/4/highres_535099236.jpeg,2026-12-15 17:45:00+00,2026-12-15 20:15:00+00,Europe/Berlin,in_person,Saalbau Bornheim,Arnsburger Strasse 24,Frankfurt,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth,food}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/public-speaking-business-club-frankfurt-toastmasters/events/315843906/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/public-speaking-business-club-frankfurt-toastmasters/events/315843906/,event_315843906@meetup.com,,2026-10-21 22:13:45.894+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,2026-10-22 09:28:23.916645+00,,,meetup:public-speaking-business-club-frankfurt-toastmasters:public speaking business club frankfurt toastmasters bornheim,"Every 3rd Tuesday of the month until December 15, 2026",f,
