0aebe1f6-6acf-466f-8d70-588f3ef78697,,Data London with Trustpilot,"Really pleased to announce the latest addition to our Data community events, and even better to be kicking things off alongside the brilliant team at Trustpilot, who will be hosting us at their…","Really pleased to announce the latest addition to our Data community events, and even better to be kicking things off alongside the brilliant team at **Trustpilot,** who will be hosting us at their London office on Wednesday 25th November!

Bringing people together from across the Data Analytics and wider Data & AI community, we have some brilliant speakers lined up from **Trustpilot,** as well as a fantastic guest speaker to bring you from **Synthesia!**

With 3 technical talks throughout the evening, each exploring data engineering, modern data platforms, self-service analytics, and how AI is being used in practice across data analytics teams - followed of course by an audience Q&A and plenty of time for networking, food and drinks.. it’s set to be a good one!

**Date:** Wednesday 25th November 2026
**Time:** 6:00pm
**Location:** Trustpilot, 5th Floor, The Minster Building, 21 Mincing Lane, London, EC3R 7AG

**Our Speakers & Talks**

**1. Sujee Ravi | Analytics Engineering Manager, Trustpilot**

**Talk:** Self-Serve Without the Chaos: How We Built a dbt Platform to Power Analytics, Operations & Product

*Freedom to build, guardrails to keep it from falling over.*

A look behind the scenes at how Trustpilot have built their dbt platform to support self-service analytics across the business, giving teams the freedom to build while maintaining the structure and standards needed to keep everything running smoothly.

**2. Zsuzsanna Szucs | Lead Data Analyst, Trustpilot**

**Talk:** Nobody Asked Me to Build This: From a Data Request to a Self-Serve Product

*What if that repeat data request you keep answering is actually a product waiting to be built?*

Zsuzsanna shares how she turned a recurring data request into a self-serve tool that anyone can quickly run. With AI doing the heavy lifting, knowing how to build is no longer the hard part. Knowing what to build is.

**3. Gina Jenks | AI Knowledge & Analytics Manager, Synthesia**

**Talk:** Building Self-Service Data in AI, with AI.

From Cursor-powered development to AI evaluation frameworks, a technical deep dive into building reliable self-service analytics, automating workflows and pushing the boundaries of what AI can do for Data teams.

**Agenda for the evening**
6:00pm – Arrivals, refreshments and networking
6:30pm – Welcome and speaker presentations
7:15pm – Q&A with our speakers
7:30pm – Food, drinks and networking
8:15pm – Finish

**Places are limited** so make sure to register early to secure your spot.

A big thank you to Trustpilot for hosting - we're really looking forward to bringing the community together for what should be another great evening of knowledge sharing, technical discussion and networking.

See you there!",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/4/3/9/highres_536737945.jpeg,2026-11-25 18:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,Trustpilot Ltd,"5th Floor, The Minster Building, 21 Mincing Ln., London EC3R 7AG, UK",London,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{technology,data}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/data-london/events/317102242/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-27 03:23:37.258822+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/data-london/events/317102242/,event_317102242@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-27 03:23:37.258822+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.493162+00,,,,,f,GB
4a368244-79a7-452f-a17e-472b288045b9,,Django London Meetup: November,November is here and Django London is back at the Octopus Energy offices near Oxford Circus! We are very grateful to Octopus Energy for hosting us.,"November is here and Django London is back at the Octopus Energy offices near Oxford Circus! We are very grateful to Octopus Energy for hosting us.

