a57c116a-5a7b-4fe3-a551-d885d600edfd,,The AI-Powered Business That Works for You💡,What if AI could help you automate more of the repetitive work in an online business?,"**What if AI could help you automate more of the repetitive work in an online business?**

Imagine AI tools supporting your marketing, approved content being published automatically on social media, leads being captured through your website, and an AI sales assistant answering visitors’ questions and helping them explore relevant products.
That’s what you’ll explore in this webinar with **Paul Chuter.**

💡 This isn't another webinar about learning dozens of AI tools.
It’s an opportunity to explore how different AI tools and automation systems can be brought together to support an online business.

⚙️ What you'll discover

🤖AI marketing agents — how they can support content creation and marketing campaigns.
📱Automated social posting — how scheduling and automation can reduce the need for manual publishing.
💬AI sales assistance — how an AI assistant can answer common questions and help visitors explore products.
🎓Digital courses — how ready-to-use digital course products can be incorporated into an online business model.
📧Lead capture — how website visitors can subscribe to an email list.
📩Automated lead delivery — how digital resources can be delivered automatically to subscribers.
🔗Connected business systems — how these different components can work together within a broader business setup.

📊Exploring an AI-supported business model

The organisers state that digital products within their wider business ecosystem have generated more than £700,000 in historical sales. This is a claim about past performance, not a prediction of future results or a guarantee of earnings.
The webinar will explore how AI and automation can support different business activities without requiring the owner to master every technical skill before getting started.

🚀 From learning AI tools to putting them to work

You don't necessarily need to become an expert in marketing, sales, websites, automation, and content creation to begin exploring an online business.
AI and automation may help with parts of the setup and repetitive execution, while you remain responsible for the business, its decisions, and its development.

If you've been curious about starting an online business but feel overwhelmed by the number of tools and skills involved, this session offers an opportunity to learn more about how these systems can fit together.

✨**Come and explore how AI can become part of your business workflow.**

