3bb2bc1a-9981-497f-8b7c-8d8d65a68bfc,,Unexplained Infertility: Exploring What May Be Missing,Coach: Aurore Prefumo,"**Coach:** Aurore Prefumo

**Description:**
This gentle, supportive webinar is for individuals and couples who feel emotionally exhausted, confused, or quietly grieving their fertility journey — especially when no clear explanation has been given.

You may relate to:

• The emotional weight of each cycle ending in disappointment
• Being told “everything looks fine,” yet still feeling stuck
• IVF or medical routes not bringing the outcome you hoped for
• A growing sense of self-doubt, guilt, or disconnection from your body
• Holding space for others’ joy while carrying your own private pain

In this session, Aurore invites you to explore fertility through a **mind–body lens**, looking beyond tests and timelines to understand how subconscious patterns, stress, and emotional history may influence the body’s readiness to conceive.

We’ll explore:

• Why fertility challenges can remain “unexplained”
• How the nervous system responds to long-term stress and emotional pressure
• How hypnotherapy can help create a calmer, safer internal environment
• How this approach can support both natural conception and medical pathways, including IVF

Using the **Marisa Peer Methodology**, hypnotherapy works to gently release unconscious fears and restore trust in the body — helping many people feel more grounded, hopeful, and involved in their fertility journey.

Aurore will also share information about her **3-month hypnotherapy programme**, designed to support deeper subconscious shifts for those who feel called to continue.

This session is not about guarantees or pressure.
It’s about understanding, self-compassion, and exploring what might help things begin to soften.

**You’re warmly invited to join and explore your next step with care.**",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/e/8/4/highres_534663716.jpeg,2026-10-22 19:30:00+00,,Europe/Amsterdam,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/amsterdam-remote-work-ai-digital-skills-collective/events/316763827/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/amsterdam-remote-work-ai-digital-skills-collective/events/316763827/,event_316763827@meetup.com,,2026-10-21 22:13:45.894+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,2026-10-22 19:53:38.614621+00,,,,,f,
