16e4514f-147d-4f30-89b1-ab33b02a3b48,,Andreas Joppich: AI for Managers - A Chatbot to Reflect on My Leadership?,About our speaker:,"About our speaker:

Andreas Joppich (https://www.linkedin.com/in/a-joppich/)
Andreas (Diploma in Logistics) is a facilitator and coach passionate about agile leadership, meaningful participation, and executive development. Drawing on his hands-on leadership experience as Managing Director of the GRIPS Theater, he supports leaders and organizations in navigating change and creating environments where people can actively contribute and collaborate.
