15c711b3-8da1-4fad-a976-d9ebaf9513da,,Bamberg Toastmasters–Practise public speaking in a friendly atmosphere (hybrid),Bamberg Toastmasters (https://www.bamberg-toastmasters.de) is a non-profit bilingual German and English language public speaking club that is part of the worldwide Toastmasters Organization…,"Bamberg Toastmasters (https://www.bamberg-toastmasters.de) is a non-profit bilingual German and English language public speaking club that is part of the worldwide Toastmasters Organization (https://www.toastmasters.org).
Both native and non-native German and English speakers have the opportunity to practice presentation and speaking skills in a fun and supportive atmosphere. At Bamberg Toastmasters you will:
• Formulate and express your ideas effectively
• Be more persuasive and confident when giving presentations
• Lead productive meetings
• Speak off the cuff
• Provide constructive feedback
• Enjoy professional and social networking

Visit us online or in person as a guest (it's free) and see for yourself.
Regular meetings: every 2nd & 4th Monday of the month at 7:30 PM. Please login at 7:20 PM.

The 2nd Mondays in the month are online only meetings. The 4th Mondays are hybrid (online and in person).
We meet in person at Stadtteilzentrum Starkenfeld, Katzheimerstr. 3, 96050 Bamberg.

Subscribe to our organizer messages to confirm when the meeting hybrid or online only.

Bamberg Toastmasters (https://www.bamberg-toastmasters.de) ist ein gemeinnütziger zweisprachiger deutsch- und englischsprachiger Rednerclub, der Teil der weltweiten Toastmasters Organisation (https://www.toastmasters.org) ist.
Sowohl deutsche als auch englische Muttersprachler haben die Möglichkeit, ihre Präsentations- und Redefähigkeiten in einer unterhaltsamen und unterstützenden Atmosphäre zu üben. Bei Bamberg Toastmasters wirst Du:
• Deine Ideen effektiv formulieren und ausdrücken
• Überzeugender und selbstbewusster bei Präsentationen sein
• Produktive Meetings leiten
• Aus dem Stegreif sprechen
• Konstruktives Feedback geben
• Professionelles und soziales Networking genießen

Besuche uns online oder persönlich als Gast (es ist kostenlos) und überzeuge Dich selbst.
Regelmäßige Treffen: jeden 2. und 4. Montag im Monat um 19:30 Uhr. Bitte melde Dich um 19:20 Uhr an.

Die Treffen jeweils am 2. Montag ist nur Online. Die Treffen jeweils am 4. Montag ist Hybrid (Online und Präsenz).",,2026-10-26 18:00:00+00,,Europe/Berlin,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/bamberg-toastmasters/events/316336031/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.927193+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/bamberg-toastmasters/events/316336031/,event_316336031@meetup.com,,2026-10-21 22:13:45.894+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.927193+00,2026-10-22 09:28:23.916645+00,,,meetup:bamberg-toastmasters:bamberg toastmasters practise public speaking in a friendly atmosphere hybrid,Every 4th Monday of the month,f,
2d5bdb05-042f-4d80-a94b-986947a3c5d8,,Play Badminton for fun... social badminton with a competitive edge!,"Welcome to Grove Park Badminton! Come and play at our bi-weekly sessions, please RSVP your attendance and bring along your racket.","Welcome to Grove Park Badminton! Come and play at our bi-weekly sessions, please RSVP your attendance and bring along your racket.
**MIDDLE INTERMEDIATE LEVEL AND ABOVE ONLY (INCLUDING VISITORS)** - Sorry, NO beginners, this club is not suitable for players who cannot serve, smash, hold a strategic rally and clear a shot from the back of the court. We play with quality, feather shuttlecocks only. Please do not attend Badminton if you are feeling unwell at all, or if you or anyone in your household currently has symptoms of any virus.

**INFORMATION:** Sessions cost: £13 for regulars and 'First Timers'* (cash or bank transfer, always pay before you play) for 2 hours. Please do not attend unless you have RSVP to reserve a space. If circumstances change, update your RSVP 24 hours before the session so others can fill the space. *If you do not attend or cancel after midday on the day of the session, then you will be expected to pay the full £13 cancellation fee on your next visit.*
*First Timers - you will receive a message with bank details to make your first payment of £13. Failure to send payment by midday of the day of your session will result in your name being moved to the 'Not Going' list, this in turn means if there is a 'WaitList', then another player will automatically fill your space.

**TRAVEL:** Free car park and main entrance accessed via Staveley Road. Walk through the side gate, towards sports hall and entrance is on your right hand side. Buses: E3 bus stop opposite the entrance. Chiswick Station: South West Trains - 7 minutes walk Please ring if you get lost - 07811 331030.

**ATTENDANCE, LATE DROP-OUTS AND NO-SHOWS:** Regular players: First no-show - You'll be expected to pay full price for the missed session. Second no-show - £15.00 penalty Third no-show - you will be removed from the group. This is to ensure basic courtesy to those playing and those waiting who can attend and want to play! First Timers: First no-show - you will be removed from the group.

**INSURANCE:** Any injury or loss incurred will be the individual’s responsibilities. The club will hold no responsibility or liability for any loss or injury. Because of this we encourage you to warm up appropriately, wear appropriate clothing including non-marking footwear and STRETCH off before and AFTER the games.
We hope you’ll have fun and an enjoyable time at this session! **PLAYING BADMINTON IS A GREAT WAY TO GET FIT AND HAVE FUN!!!**

**Note:** Please ensure you have all you belongings (and rubbish) before leaving at the end of the evening. There are bins situated just outside the hall for any rubbish. Thank you.",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792812087/orbit/event-covers/sources/yzmvuwqk5buczdmcg3ww.jpg,2026-12-18 20:00:00+00,2026-12-18 22:00:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,Grove Park Badminton Club,"Chiswick School Sports Hall, Free Car Park and entrance off Staveley Road",London,c06699ed-62e0-4957-bcb4-080c5271da9a,"{sport,fitness,socialising}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/grove-park-badminton-club/events/316408222/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-24 03:21:20.750761+00,source:cba1b9d2-d09d-4c19-a89e-50bdbe5525a0,https://www.meetup.com/grove-park-badminton-club/events/316408222/,event_316408222@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:20:38.34+00,,2026-10-24 03:21:20.750761+00,2026-10-28 03:21:15.930389+00,,,meetup:grove-park-badminton-club:play badminton for fun social badminton with a competitive edge,"Every week on Friday until December 20, 2030",f,GB
112f27a2-bde7-4b34-ba65-6de72670a4a6,,Lerne überzeugend aufzutreten | Rhetorik am Donnerstag,Willkommen beim Rhetorik-Club Frankfurt e.V.!,"**Willkommen beim Rhetorik-Club Frankfurt e.V.!**

**Souverän überzeugen. Wirksam präsentieren. In deinem Tempo wachsen. 🚀**

Egal, ob du deine **Auftrittsangst** endlich ablegen willst, im Job **wichtige Präsentationen** hältst oder deine **Rhetorik** **auf das nächste Level** heben möchtest:

**Ein starker Auftritt ist keine Begabung, sondern reines Training. 💡**

Unser Rhetorik-Club ist dein wöchentliches Praxislabor. Hier feilen wir gemeinsam an Wirkung, Klarheit und Überzeugungskraft – dynamisch, praxisnah und auf jedem Level. 🎤

**Warum unser Club wirkt:**

**Praxis statt Theorie:**
**🔄** Einmal pro Woche ins Tun kommen, Feedback erhalten und dich kontinuierlich steigern.

**Fordern & Fördern:**
**🎯** Egal ob Erste-Hilfe-Schritte gegen Lampenfieber oder Feinschliff für die nächste Präsentation – du trainierst auf deinem Niveau.

**Geschützter Raum:**
**🛡️** Ausprobieren, Fehler machen, Neues wagen. Bei uns zählt das Wachstum, nicht die Perfektion.

**Wertschätzende Feedback-Kultur:**
**🤝** Konstruktiver Austausch auf Augenhöhe, der dich wirklich weiterbringt.

**Echtes Miteinander:**
**❤️** Wir lernen miteinander und voneinander – als starke Gemeinschaft, die sich gegenseitig unterstützt.

**Dein Einstieg:**
Komm einfach als Gast vorbei! Du kannst 3-mal kostenlos und unverbindlich reinschnuppern. 🎟️
Du entscheidest selbst, wie du startest: Direkt ausprobieren oder erst einmal entspannt zuschauen und die Atmosphäre erleben. 👀✨

**Komm vorbei – wir freuen uns auf dich! 👋**

