204f3360-53a0-41c4-826c-01ca56f0cec0,,Futury Build Days #4 Banking & Finance,Futury Build Days: Banking & Finance — Build AI Solutions in 32 Hours,"**Futury Build Days: Banking & Finance — Build AI Solutions in 32 Hours**
⚠️ **Your Meetup RSVP does not secure your spot.**
Registration only counts if you apply via Luma: https://luma.com/rk42z63i
📅 11–12 November · 📍 Frankfurt · 🎟️ Free to join
The next Futury Build Days focus on one of Frankfurt's defining industries: banking and finance. Interdisciplinary teams turn ideas into working AI prototypes over two intense days. You'll work on real challenges brought by partners from the financial sector, get support from mentors across the startup ecosystem, and pitch your solution to a jury of founders and investors. No prior hackathon experience required.
**Why join**
🚀 Ship a working prototype, not a slide deck
🤝 Solve a real challenge from a leading financial institution
🧠 Get 1:1 mentoring on tech, product, and business
🌍 Build alongside motivated students from across disciplines and universities

**The three challenges**
Three challenges from partners in banking and finance — announced soon. Follow this event to be notified.

**Who it's for**
Students from all disciplines: developers, designers, business thinkers, and anyone curious about building with AI. No finance background needed. Bring your laptop and your ideas; food, drinks, and workspaces are on us.

**How to join**
Spots are limited and confirmed through our application form, not through Meetup. Apply here: https://luma.com/rk42z63i
