2df6a174-e034-4b64-840a-f55693e4dc2e,,Casual Badminton near Waterloo/Southwark/London Bridge 🏸,Join our WhatsApp group and sign up at [www.thesocialsport.com](www.thesocialsport.com)!,"**Join our WhatsApp group and sign up at [www.thesocialsport.com](www.thesocialsport.com)!**

Our weekly casual badminton session at Borough Academy, Southwark. We play every Tuesday from 6 to 7 pm.

**What is Social Sport?**
Social Sport was set up to face two main challenges in cities like London:

1. Limited opportunities for those moving here to meet new people and socialise in a genuine, healthy way.
2. Lack of casual sports clubs for young professionals.

We started with our New Sport Every Week session, voted for by people in our community. Since then, we have played over 21 different sports. Our weekly casual sessions allow us to create communities around certain sports.

**Please note this session is popular and has a set number of places. If you do not secure your place before attending and the event is full, you may not be able to play.**",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/3/7/9/a/highres_535754234.jpeg,2026-10-27 18:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,Southwark,"112 Great Suffolk St, 112 Great Suffolk St, London SE1 0BE, UK",Greater London,c06699ed-62e0-4957-bcb4-080c5271da9a,"{sport,fitness}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/social-sport-southwark/events/316885530/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:49:59.35823+00,source:cba1b9d2-d09d-4c19-a89e-50bdbe5525a0,https://www.meetup.com/social-sport-southwark/events/316885530/,event_316885530@meetup.com,,2026-10-27 03:20:39.241+00,,2026-10-22 19:49:59.35823+00,2026-10-27 03:21:14.238121+00,,,meetup:social-sport-southwark:casual badminton near waterloo southwark london bridge,"Every week on Tuesday until February 20, 2027",f,GB
