d0f84cc1-90a8-4d9e-96b6-f8a3001d5357,,🎬 12 Angry Men (1957) - Film Discussion,12 Angry Men (1957) — Film Discussion,"**12 Angry Men (1957) — Film Discussion**

Twelve jurors. One life-changing decision. And twelve very different ways of seeing the truth.

Sidney Lumet’s *12 Angry Men* is more than a courtroom drama. It’s a starting point for a deeper conversation about human nature, prejudice, doubt, and the power of standing alone when everyone else disagrees.

How do we decide what to believe? What makes us change our minds? And how often do our assumptions shape the way we see others?

Join me for an open, thought-provoking dialogue where the film is just the beginning. You don’t need to be a film expert, just bring your curiosity and your perspective.

🎬 **Before the event:** Please try to watch *12 Angry Men* beforehand so you can get the most out of our discussion. We’ll be exploring the film’s deeper themes, challenging each other’s perspectives, and going beyond the story itself.

Looking forward to meeting you all and having a great conversation!
Ana

