22af3699-653e-4f82-b195-45d38f6843bd,,Build Consistently. Together.,"A weekly space to work on your side hustle, stay accountable, and keep moving","A weekly space to work on your side hustle, stay accountable, and keep moving

🧩 Typical Flow

We keep things simple and repeatable:
• Quick intros & intentions

• Main session (rotates weekly):
• Co-working
• Show & tell
• Accountability check-ins
• Practical discussion or tool share

• Wrap-up & next steps

You can participate actively or just listen and work quietly. Both are welcome.

🎯 Who this meetup is for
• Beginners exploring their first side hustle
• People stuck and needing momentum
• Builders who want consistency
• Anyone tired of doing this alone

🌱 The vibe

Casual. Supportive. Action-oriented.

We value small wins, honest conversations, and steady progress.

Come regularly if you can. Drop in when you need to.

Either way, you’re welcome.

