2dd5da62-ca58-4e7b-8ce8-29a76eec6626,,In Person: CoffeeOps,We are back! This is going to be a monthly IN PERSON meet up in London.,"We are back! This is going to be a monthly IN PERSON meet up in London.

A very big thank you goes to Accurx who is hosting us in their amazing Shoreditch offices. This will include access to facilities including coffee! 😻☕️

**Want to know more? 👇**

As with all CoffeeOps, this is an interactive, chatty, build your own adventure type of meet-up. Instead of booking in experts to *learn* *from*, we gather a group of practitioners to ***learn*** ***with***. We have been running for over 4 years now and often get feedback that this is the most useful meetup people join!

The event is approximately 90 minutes and always starts by brainstorming topics to discuss. The group then votes on the most relevant/interesting to them and we then cycle through the topics trying to discuss each deeply, but in a time bound slot.

To get an idea of topics, you can check out our remote board here (https://easyretro.io/publicboard/h404NF84Uje4tCcxpJdHr4Ycs9B3/a4a35d2b-181b-409b-832e-a729be1af79c). The general gist is anything is fair game, though we tend to revolve around software delivery and definitely lean towards the more Ops-y or DevOps-y side of things.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/4/f/0/5/highres_509900229.jpeg,2027-03-11 08:00:00+00,2027-03-11 09:30:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,Accurx,7 Curtain Road,London,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,{technology},,external,https://www.meetup.com/coffeeops-london/events/plbrbtykcfbpb/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-24 03:23:30.368241+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/coffeeops-london/events/plbrbtykcfbpb/,event_plbrbtykcfbpb@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-24 03:23:30.368241+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.493162+00,,,meetup:coffeeops-london:in person coffeeops,Every 2nd Thursday of the month,f,GB
f117ac83-0e00-4956-9ed4-1855b46986f4,,"🚀 First IT Job Preparation(Interview, CV, AIs) Bootcamp!",Ready to start a career in tech but unsure where to begin?,"Ready to start a career in tech but unsure where to begin?
**zero2hero Technology Training Centre is volunteering its time to offer this special two-month bootcamp completely FREE.** Bring your ambition—we’ll help you take the first step.

📅 **Interview Ends: 1 November 2026**

📅 **Starts: 7 November 2026**
⏳ **Duration: 2 months**

🎁 **Special promotion: £0 instead of £999**

👨💻👩🏿💻 **In-class training on weekends and remote training on weekdays.**

Please book a **15-minute interview** so we can discuss your goals, availability and motivation to join the programme:

👉 https://calendly.com/rasimsen/15min

Gain practical experience with **AI tools, Git, GitHub, Jira, Agile and Scrum**. Work on a portfolio project, discover how software teams operate, and build confidence for your first IT role.
**Beginners and career changers welcome.** Curiosity, commitment and regular participation are essential.

🎯 **Candidates will be selected through a 15-minute interview** to discuss their goals, motivation and availability.

👉 **Register your interest through this event.** Your place will be confirmed following a successful interview.

Explore the bootcamp programme (https://www.zero2hero.training/training/first-it-job-bootcamp)

✅ Requirements & Eligibility

This free bootcamp is for graduates who are currently unemployed and preparing to start their first IT role.

• **Attend in person:** You must live in London or be able to travel to our London training centre for weekend classes. Weekday sessions are remote.
• **Know at least one programming language:** You should be comfortable with basic programming concepts and able to write simple code independently. This bootcamp does not teach a programming language from scratch.
• **Be a graduate and currently unemployed:** Applicants who are currently employed will not be eligible for this free cohort.
• **Commit to the full two months:** Be available from **7 November 2026** for weekend classes, weekday remote sessions and independent project work.
• **Bring your own laptop:** A working laptop and reliable internet connection are required.
• **Participate actively:** Complete assigned tasks, collaborate with your team and take part in feedback sessions.
• **Communicate in English:** You should be comfortable following lessons and contributing to group discussions in English.

🎯 **Only 10 candidates will be selected through a 15-minute interview**, based on eligibility, motivation and availability.

**Please apply only if you can commit to the programme. Every free place is an opportunity for someone ready to take their next step into tech.**

**Your ambition. Our support. Your first step into tech.**",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/8/b/3/e/highres_536495646.jpeg,2026-10-30 18:30:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,ZERO2HERO - Technology Training Centre,"Unit 15 Castle Square, London SE17 1EU, UK",London,4cece675-2670-4581-90e6-2b792576b047,"{technology,careers}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/zero2hero/events/316883565/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/zero2hero/events/316883565/,event_316883565@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.493162+00,,,,,f,GB
