15bcde32-92df-47ab-9739-05c510b739b0,,Generative AI Workshop,"You run a business, lead a department or work for yourself. You suspect AI could save you time or open up new work, but you are not sure where to begin. The volume of tools and advice online makes…","**You run a business, lead a department or work for yourself.** You suspect AI could save you time or open up new work, but you are not sure where to begin. The volume of tools and advice online makes it hard to tell what applies to a business like yours. You may also have heard what other businesses report gaining from AI and want yours to keep pace.
This Meetup is a practical starting point, where you will see AI tools applied to ordinary business tasks and can ask questions about your own situation. Other owners and managers share what they have tried, including the attempts that failed. Come with the problems you want to solve.

**What Happens at the Event**

• **Live demonstrations:** Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini and other tools handle research, content creation and routine procedures
• **Open Q&A:** bring questions about your own business and get practical answers on using Claude effectively
• **Recording & Files:** each session is recorded and can be viewed later by community members.

**Who Should Attend**

The event suits business owners, department heads, consultants, freelancers and anyone self-employed. No technical background is needed and all experience levels are welcome. Some members have never opened an AI tool, while others are already building with one.

**What You Leave With**

You leave with clarity on where AI could help you find efficiencies in your daily work. You get recordings and files to help you implement strategies and automations that work for you. You get a sense of which tool suits each task, along with a group of people you can keep learning from.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/8/7/c/highres_536302652.jpeg,2026-11-13 17:00:00+00,2026-11-13 18:00:00+00,Europe/Dublin,online,Online event,,,4cece675-2670-4581-90e6-2b792576b047,"{technology,ai}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/claude-code-automations/events/317121151/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/claude-code-automations/events/317121151/,event_317121151@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.493162+00,,,meetup:claude-code-automations:generative ai workshop,"Every week on Friday until December 18, 2026",f,
bd25db35-c7a6-48bd-80df-a901693a2031,,Public Speaking Business Club Frankfurt Toastmasters (Gallus),About Us,"**About Us**

Whether you're itching to share your thoughts or aiming to refine your speaking and leadership prowess, all while having fun, consider our community your stage – welcome! So come along and see what it's all about!

We are part of Toastmasters International, a non-profit organisation that aims to improve public speaking skills. If you want to, you can do much more:
Toastmasters offers a warm and encouraging environment, focusing on:

• Confidently addressing an audience
• Delivering impactful presentations
• Crafting well-structured speeches
• Orchestrating successful meetings
• Providing constructive feedback and embracing criticism.

Join us on Tuesdays, Wednesdays or Thursdays, from 18:45 to approximately 21:30. Following our Toastmasters meeting, we pursue the conversation with food, drinks, and camaraderie in a nearby restaurant – a perfect conclusion to the evening!

