02b7b13e-0be7-4dd5-966e-f4a5de8057e1,,Beginner-Friendly Foosball Social at The 411,"Looking for a fun, social activity in London? Come and play foosball with London Table Football at The 411.","Looking for a fun, social activity in London? Come and play foosball with London Table Football at The 411.

Complete beginners are welcome. You can come alone, you do not need a playing partner and we will explain everything you need to know.

WHAT TO EXPECT

• Casual games with players of different levels
• A friendly host to welcome and introduce you
• Help learning the basic rules and techniques
• Opportunities to change partners and meet people
• No commitment to attend every week

ARRIVING FOR THE FIRST TIME

Please arrive at any time from 6:30pm and ask for Miguel, the London Table Football host. Tell them that it is your first session and they will help you join the games.

PRICE

There is no entry fee. The tables take contactless-card payments.

VENUE

The 411
411 St John St, London, EC1V 4AB
Nearest station: Angel

Look for the London Table Football group beside the foosball tables.

A Meetup RSVP is sufficient for this social session. If your plans change, please update your RSVP so we know how many people to expect.

