270c7941-f6de-4327-9465-afee3e9f071c,,🔥Build Mobile Apps with AI — No Coding Needed! (Vibe Coding) - Workshop,Hands-on Vibe Coding & AI Agents Workshop,"Hands-on Vibe Coding & AI Agents Workshop

**An app idea in your head. A working prototype on your screen.**

Join zero2hero for a full day of guided building, experimentation, and creativity. Discover how to create a simple mobile app with AI—even if you’ve never written a line of code.
You’ll learn how to guide an AI coding agent, give it clear project instructions, and test and improve what it builds.

📅 **Saturday, 31 October 2026**
⏰ **09:30–16:00**

📍 **zero2hero Technology Training Centre, London**

✨ **What you’ll learn**

• **Vibe Coding:** Turn your ideas into app features through clear prompts.
• **Agentic AI:** Work with an AI agent to plan, build, check, and improve your app.
• **AGENTS.md:** Create a project guide that tells your agent your goals and working rules.
• **Skills:** Give your agent reusable instructions for common tasks.
• **MCPs:** Explore how agents connect to external tools and information.
• **Mobile app basics:** Understand screens, user flows, and where React Native fits into the process.

🛠️ **Build something you can show**

We’ll start with a simple to-do app and personalise it with features such as categories, priorities, or a new layout.
Along the way, you’ll practise reviewing AI’s output, spotting problems, and asking for useful improvements.

**The goal: a simple working prototype and a workflow you can use for your next idea.**

👥 **Who is this for?**

Beginners, founders, designers, career changers, non-technical creatives, and developers curious about AI agents.
**No previous coding experience required.** Bring your laptop, curiosity, and willingness to experiment.

Workshop schedule

• **09:30–10:00** — Welcome, setup & choosing your app idea
• **10:00–11:00** — Vibe Coding, AI agents & your first app screens
• **11:00–11:15** — Break
• **11:15–12:30** — Guide your agent with AGENTS.md & skills
• **12:30–13:15** — Lunch break
• **13:15–14:15** — Explore MCPs & build your app’s core features
• **14:15–14:30** — Break
• **14:30–15:30** — Personalise, test & improve your prototype
• **15:30–16:00** — App demos, questions & next steps

💬 **What would you love to build?**

Share your idea in the comments—a habit tracker, study planner, or something completely different!

📍 **Address:** Unit 15 Castle Square, 40 Elephant Rd, London SE17 1EU
📲 **WhatsApp:** +44 7470 914266

👉 **Book your place and start bringing your app idea to life.**",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/b/9/7/c/highres_532607484.jpeg,2026-10-31 09:30:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,zero2hero Technology Training Center,"Unit 15, Castle Square, 40 Elephant Rd, London, SE17 1EU",London,4cece675-2670-4581-90e6-2b792576b047,"{technology,ai}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/zero2hero/events/316868269/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/zero2hero/events/316868269/,event_316868269@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.493162+00,,,,,f,GB
