30d38038-01e6-4eee-8782-997400b8064d,,AI Governance & Compliance Speed Networking London — After Work,"Every business is deploying AI faster than its policies can keep up. The people building with AI, the people governing it, and the people responsible for keeping data under control rarely sit in the…","*Every business is deploying AI faster than its policies can keep up. The people building with AI, the people governing it, and the people responsible for keeping data under control rarely sit in the same room. This event puts them there.*
**What the event is**
This After Work Speed Networking event brings together the people deploying AI, the people governing it, and the people safeguarding data. Across 8 short, structured conversations, you'll be matched with professionals from the other side of the table, so you leave with a real understanding of how AI risk, policy, privacy and practice actually meet.
**👥 Who should attend**
Legal, compliance, risk, data protection and DPO professionals, alongside cybersecurity, IT, AI and data teams, HR, procurement, audit and directors. AI providers and governance technology companies will also be in the room. Whichever side you're on, you'll meet the people you don't usually get time to talk to.
**🎟️ Your ticket includes**

• 1 drink + a bite, included
• 8 structured conversations, deliberately matching you with the other side of the table
• Open networking before and after the structured session

**Why attend**

• Understand how other organisations are handling AI policy, privacy and risk in practice
• Meet the compliance, legal, DPO or technical contacts you actually need
• Get honest input on where your own AI governance has gaps
• Build connections with people responsible for accountability and data control, not just adoption

**📅 Agenda**
6:00–6:30pm: Arrival, drinks and open networking
6:30–6:40pm: Welcome and a quick explainer on how the evening works
6:40–7:30pm: Structured speed networking, 8 specific questions connecting people deploying AI with people governing it and safeguarding data
7:30–8:00pm: Drinks and open networking continue
Places are limited and these events sell out. Book your ticket now and be in the room where AI meets accountability.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/f/b/9/highres_536080889.jpeg,2026-11-11 18:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,Hampton by Hilton London Waterloo,"157 Waterloo Rd, London SE1 8XA, UK",London,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{carrer,growth,technology,ai}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/speed-network-now/events/316502246/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-23 03:22:32.413499+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/speed-network-now/events/316502246/,event_316502246@meetup.com,,2026-10-23 03:21:52.022+00,,2026-10-23 03:22:32.413499+00,2026-10-23 03:22:35.036882+00,,,,,f,GB
