66ec7601-b209-40f0-b18a-f4044274eef4,,"Finance, Banking, Investment, Property - Business Networking Event in London","Looking for a finance, banking, investment and property networking event in London? Join us in Covent Garden for an evening of quality business networking. Hosted by digital business card startup…","**Looking for a finance, banking, investment and property networking event in London?** Join us in **Covent Garden** for an evening of quality business networking. Hosted by digital business card startup **GMax Card** and eCommerce platform **Getshop Today**.

**What to Expect**

• **Meet finance professionals, bankers, investors, property professionals, business owners and decision-makers** in a relaxed, purposeful environment.
• **Build partnerships, generate referrals and make valuable new business connections** across finance, investment, property and related sectors.
• Exchange ideas, discuss opportunities and expand your professional network.
• A **lightly structured event** – not a formal conference, nor a random pub mingle.
• A **high-quality yet relaxed atmosphere** with space for genuine business conversations.
• Our hosts are there from the start to **help with introductions** and ensure everyone feels welcome.

**Who You'll Meet**

• **Finance and banking professionals**
• **Investment professionals and advisers**
• **Property professionals, developers and investors**
• Accountants, financial advisers and business finance professionals
• Entrepreneurs, founders and business owners
• B2B service providers working with finance and property businesses
• London-based and international professionals looking to expand their business network

**Please note:** our events are theme-led rather than closed-sector events, so while this evening has a strong **finance, banking, investment and property focus**, you may also meet professionals from adjacent areas such as technology, professional services and entrepreneurship.
**How the Evening Flows**
18:30 - Arrival
19:00 - Short introductions
19:30 - Open networking
21:30 - Close
Hosts are there from the start to **help with introductions.**

**Venue - Sycamore Bar at Middle Eight Hotel**
A stylish, design-led bar inside the 5-star Middle Eight Hotel in central London. Located in the Covent Garden/Holborn area, just a short walk from Holborn, Covent Garden and Tottenham Court Road stations, it offers a relaxed and refined setting for business networking.

**Hosted by:**
GMax Card - a digital business card (http://www.gmaxcard.com/) platform designed for modern networking and professional connections beyond LinkedIn. Share all your contact details through one simple link.
[Getshop Today - eCommerce platform/agency](www.getshop.today)
[3Edit (beta) - AI vibe coding platform for web design agencies](www.3edit.com): build better and more affordably than Lovable or Replit.

**Entry & GMax Cards**

• Free RSVP: Event access only
• Paid ticket (when available): Includes a contactless GMax Card (ask host to claim; not distributed automatically)

**Dress Code**
Business / smart casual recommended.

**Important Info**

• 18+ (ID may be required)
• Photos/video by Cine Eye Audiovisual Production Studio (http://www.cineeye.co.uk/) (inform us if you prefer not to appear)
• Attendance is at your own risk. Organisers and the venue are not liable for any injury, loss, or damage.

**Limited spots - early registration recommended!**

Join our WA Business Community (https://chat.whatsapp.com/FJdEP809H5U8WQ4y4BLLS5?mode=hqctcli) to stay connected between events, and follow us on LinkedIn (http://linkedin.com/company/gmax-card) for upcoming dates.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/b/2/b/highres_536156107.jpeg,2026-11-05 18:30:00+00,2026-11-05 21:30:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,Sycamore,"66 Great Queen St, London WC2B 5BX",London,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth,entrepreneurship,finance,technology}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/london-entrepreneur-startup-network-tech-business-ecommerce/events/317007650/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-23 03:22:32.413499+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/london-entrepreneur-startup-network-tech-business-ecommerce/events/317007650/,event_317007650@meetup.com,,2026-10-26 03:21:52.922+00,,2026-10-23 03:22:32.413499+00,2026-10-26 03:22:28.885863+00,,,meetup:london-entrepreneur-startup-network-tech-business-ecommerce:finance banking investment property business networking event in london,"Every week on Thursday until December 3, 2026",f,GB
