Join **Joy Mallard** for a free live workshop exploring how AI tools can support online business ideas, simplify everyday tasks, and help you take your first steps toward building an additional income stream.

🚀 What You'll Discover

✅ How beginners can explore AI-powered income opportunities
✅ Ways AI tools can help with content creation, research, and business tasks
