38c40884-09b4-4221-bfa3-07a294d92ef9,,Hugglets Winter BearFest 2027 with BLYTHE & Friends,"Meet thousands of teddy bears and their artists, as well as phenomenal Blythe Dolls, at the world's first major bear fair of the year.","The **Hugglets Winter BearFest** is the world's first major teddy event of the year and features around 80 stands and thousands of teddy bears for sale, with prices ranging from a few pounds to over £1,000. Both antique and modern bears will be there, plus clothes and accessories, as well as bear-making supplies. Here's all the information: hugglets.com/festivals/wbf26/

For the first time, Hugglets will open an **additional floor dedicated to the Blythe community**, creating a complementary event alongside the established world of teddy bears and soft toy artistry. With **one ticket**, you can explore **both events** across two floors.

