b4b65d47-79b2-481d-a1bd-3f7a66ec944c,,Dating Burnout? Reset Your Approach to Finding Connection,"Tired of dating apps, mixed signals and starting over?","Tired of dating apps, mixed signals and starting over?

Perhaps you’re meeting people but struggling to find a connection that feels mutual. Or you’ve taken a break because dating has become more exhausting than enjoyable.

When disappointment builds up, it can be easy to question yourself, lower your standards or feel tempted to give up altogether.

Join **Aurore’s Therapy** for a welcoming event exploring how to approach dating with greater clarity, confidence and self-respect.

Together, we’ll explore:

• **Dating burnout:** recognising when you need a pause and what you need from it.
• **Repeating patterns:** noticing the choices and habits that leave you feeling drained.
• **Standards and boundaries:** getting clear on what matters to you and communicating it.
• **Chemistry and compatibility:** looking beyond the initial spark to the qualities that support connection.
• **Self-trust:** paying attention to your needs while staying open to getting to know someone.

Whether you’re actively dating, taking a break or wondering if you’re ready to try again, this is an opportunity to step back and consider what you want your dating experience to feel like.
You don’t need to become someone else to build a meaningful connection. You can begin by understanding yourself more clearly—and making choices that reflect that.

**Join me for a fresh perspective on dating, with more room for curiosity, clarity and connection.**

Warmly,
Aurore",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/f/2/d/highres_536707981.jpeg,2026-11-04 19:30:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/aurorestherapy-london/events/317060453/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.927193+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/aurorestherapy-london/events/317060453/,event_317060453@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.927193+00,2026-10-28 03:22:27.129706+00,,,,,f,
