8a9df838-4898-42fd-9639-49cc1ea8804b,,"Agentic Data Lab: Stateless Models, Stateful Systems: Designing Data Layers for","Welcome to Agentic Data Lab, a new GDG Essex event series exploring the data, memory, security, and infrastructure foundations behind modern AI agents.","Welcome to Agentic Data Lab, a new GDG Essex event series exploring the data, memory, security, and infrastructure foundations behind modern AI agents.

Through a combination of expert talks, technical deep dives, live demos, architecture sessions, and hands-on workshops, this series explores how developers can build AI agents that are reliable, secure, scalable, and ready for production.

🔍 About The Session
Stateless Models, Stateful Systems: Designing Data Layers for Long-Running Agents

In a demo, your AI agent appears to remember everything. In production, it may forget you instantly—or worse, leak your data to the next user.

Why? Because AI models are fundamentally stateless—they don’t have built-in memory. Memory isn’t simply a feature of the model; it is a complex data system that developers need to architect, secure, and scale.

In this session, Sathyaram Sannasi will explore the real engineering behind building long-running AI agents on Google Cloud. You’ll learn how to distinguish between short-term conversational state and long-term memory, design scalable data layers, and implement strong access controls to prevent data exposure across users.

What You Will Learn

The fundamental difference between short-term conversational state and long-term agent memory.

How to architect scalable data layers for long-running AI agents.

How data and memory integrate into production agent architectures.

Best practices for securing agent data and implementing strict access controls.

Proven techniques to prevent cross-user data leakage.

Real-world engineering patterns for building reliable, production-ready AI systems.

👤 Speaker Profile
Name: Sathyaram Sannasi (GDE)

Title & Role: Data/AI Engineer, X | Freelance Data Engineer & ML Engineer

Google Developer Expert (GDE) on Data and GenAI

🕒 Agenda

2:00 PM – 2:10 PM: Welcome & GDG Essex Community Updates

2:10 PM – 3:30 PM: Stateless Models, Stateful Systems (Talk by Sathyaram Sannasi)

3:30 PM – 3:40 PM: Live Q&A Session & Closing Remarks

Agenda

Speaker

Sathyaram Sannasi

Sathyaram Sannasi is a Google Developer Expert and a data practitioner specializing in using Data and AI/ML for business outcomes primarily on Google Cloud Platform. As a freelancer, he advises and implements solutions that transform data into decisions and products.

