2c2cc148-7810-4257-99e3-0905015b9012,,Guided fungi walks - Streatham Common,Come join us for a guided fungi walk in Streatham Common this autumn!,"**Join us again this autumn for a limited run of fungi walks. All walks have sold out two years running so be quick to nab your spot!**

Are you interested in fungi? Do you want to learn more about the importance of fungi in woodlands and the role it plays in our lives? Join Em Robinson of Fight for Wildlife (https://www.instagram.com/fightforwildlife) as we explore the wonderful world of fungi and learn about their ecology. No experience necessary!

**Please note:** This is a guided walk to explore fungi in-situ, we will not be collecting fungi for culinary purposes. We will be looking at the role of fungi in our ecosystems, there will be no foraging advice given.

