d0256d48-45db-417e-bf68-48fea977b259,,Motherhood & Ambition: The Trade-Off That Isn't One,Wanting More After Motherhood,"**Wanting More After Motherhood**

A free live conversation for mothers who still want more and want to want it **without guilt**.
Somewhere between the school run and the endless to-do list, a quieter question can appear:
**What happened to what I wanted for myself?**
You didn’t lose your ambition when you became a mother. But it may have gone underground, folded into everyone else’s needs, postponed until “someday,” or wrapped in guilt that makes wanting more feel selfish.
This hour is for mothers who feel that pull and don’t want to apologise for it.
RSVP your spot here (https://belong.womanship.co/c/upcoming-workshops)

Together, we’ll explore what it means to reconnect with your ambitions while making space for the reality of motherhood without losing yourself in the process.

*Join Womanship events for only **€1 per month** and get easy access to upcoming events and specialist professionals: Join Womanship (https://belong.womanship.co/checkout/welcome-to-womanship-youre-making-the-right-call)*

Event Details

📅 **Date: 27th Oct 2026**
🕒 **Time: 16:00 - 17:00**
💻 **Online: free to attend -** RSVP your spot here (https://belong.womanship.co/c/upcoming-workshops)
*Come as you are: camera on or off, coffee or wine in hand. Bring the question you’ve been avoiding.*

**What We’ll Explore**

• Why ambition and motherhood are so often framed as a trade-off.
• What changes when they no longer have to be.
• How to tell the difference between goals that are truly yours and goals you’ve inherited.
• What it takes **to maintain a sense of forward movement** when your time and energy aren’t fully your own.
• A first, **honest step towards wanting more without losing yourself in the process.**

*This is a space to **think out loud, hear that you’re not alone,** and leave with a little more ground beneath your feet.*

**Who This Is For**

This conversation is for mothers who:

• Feel a pull towards something more.
• Miss a part of themselves beyond their role as a mother.
• Want to reconnect with their career, creativity, ambitions, or sense of purpose.
• Feel guilty for wanting more.
• Are ready to take one small, honest step forward.

**Meet Your Host: Jessica Hsia**

Jessica is a **Resilience and Career Coach** who helps driven people and teams overcome burnout and build lasting resilience. Having lived through this journey herself, she understands how difficult change can be and how challenging it can feel to move forward when life is already full.
Her reminder is simple: **change is hard, but staying stuck is harder.**

*Join Womanship events for only **€1 per month** and get easy access to upcoming events and specialist professionals: Join Womanship (https://belong.womanship.co/checkout/welcome-to-womanship-youre-making-the-right-call)*",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/a/4/3/highres_536275875.jpeg,2026-10-27 15:00:00+00,,Europe/Amsterdam,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,careers,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/amsterdam-women-entrepreneurs-meetup/events/316945891/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.927193+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/amsterdam-women-entrepreneurs-meetup/events/316945891/,event_316945891@meetup.com,,2026-10-27 03:21:52.243+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.927193+00,2026-10-27 03:22:31.70089+00,,,,,f,
