54d83225-a219-4a7f-9a7b-8e0a21182ce3,,Meetup Nr. 5/2026: The Future of the WooCommerce Admin with Rodolfo Melogli,"We are thrilled to welcome Rodolfo Melogli, one of the best-known names in the WooCommerce world, as our speaker for the November meetup!","We are thrilled to welcome Rodolfo Melogli, one of the best-known names in the WooCommerce world, as our speaker for the November meetup!

Topic: The future of the WooCommerce admin

The WooCommerce admin is where store owners, developers and agencies spend their days, and it is changing. Rodolfo will share where the WooCommerce backend is heading, what it means for the way we build and run stores, and how to get ready. Bring your questions, there will be plenty of time for Q&A.

About Rodolfo

If you have ever searched for how to customize something in WooCommerce, chances are you ended up on Business Bloomer. Rodolfo has worked as an independent WooCommerce freelancer since 2011 and is the founder of Business Bloomer, Checkout Summit and WooWeekly. His huge library of free WooCommerce snippets and tutorials has helped countless developers, agencies and merchants worldwide, and the Business Bloomer Club brings WooCommerce professionals together to learn and grow. He is a regular WordCamp speaker, including WordCamp Europe 2026.

Details

Date: Wednesday, 4 November 2026, 19:00 Swiss time
Where: Online via Google Meet (the link is visible to attendees after RSVP)
Language: English
Format: Short community news, Rodolfo's talk, then Q&A

The session will be recorded and transcribed, and we will share the recording and a summary with the group afterwards.

