4aebf59b-077f-4e21-a2eb-5460408c8375,,Operation You: Everyone Needs You. But Who Sees You?,Do you wake up tired—even before anyone needs anything from you?,"Do you wake up tired—even before anyone needs anything from you?
Does everyone rely on you, yet you rarely feel truly seen or appreciated?

Are you exhausted by being strong, holding everything together while feeling empty inside?

Have you spent so long being there for everyone else that you’re no longer sure who you are—or what you want?

**OPERATION YOU**

*An **online webinar for women** who are tired of being needed but longing to be seen.*

You can love the people in your life and still feel that the way you’re living leaves too little room for you. Your energy. Your needs. Your sense of fulfilment.
Perhaps you don’t need to try harder. Perhaps you need space to hear yourself again.

Join us for a compassionate conversation about the roles we carry, the needs we silence, and how to begin making room for a life that feels like our own.

Together, we’ll explore simple ways to recognise what drains you, give your needs a voice, and take one small step towards yourself.

You’re welcome to come, listen, and take what you need. You don’t have to arrive feeling strong.

**You deserve to be more than the person everyone can count on. You deserve to feel like you again** 💚

**Reserve your place at Operation You.**

If you’ve been feeling stretched, unheard or ready for something to change, you will be invited to come and discover what our in-person event on 21 November in Uxbridge could offer you: fresh perspectives, meaningful connection and **time dedicated to YOU.**

This **women-only** event brings four experts together for honest conversations about confidence, wellbeing and finding your voice.

Join us to explore what may be holding you back, gain fresh perspectives and connect with women who understand.

📅 Saturday 21 November 2026 | 10am–2pm
📍 In person at the Battle of Britain Bunker, Uxbridge
🎟 Early bird £47—rising to £67 on 31 October.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/7/c/d/0/highres_536491952.jpeg,2026-10-27 19:30:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/aurorestherapy-london/events/316880005/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.927193+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/aurorestherapy-london/events/316880005/,event_316880005@meetup.com,,2026-10-27 03:21:52.243+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.927193+00,2026-10-27 03:22:31.70089+00,,,,,f,
