fa09e824-ad9f-4fa1-83ee-fcd2cfc038e5,,Nickel Boys (2024) - BBC iPlayer,I was going to put on something really long and slow this month but then I saw Nickel Boys was on iPlayer so opted for that instead. I've been wanting to watch this since I saw its trailer toward…,"I was going to put on something really long and slow this month but then I saw Nickel Boys was on iPlayer so opted for that instead. I've been wanting to watch this since I saw its trailer toward the end of 2024. The cinematography looks incredible and the critical reception was largely positive too. I hope its rich visual style and unique first-person POV translates to a laptop screen!

Adapted from Pulitzer-winning writer Colson Whitehead's novel, Nickel Boys tells the story of the friendship between two African-American kids who are sent to a notorious reform school in the '60s, and their struggle against an oppressive system.

Trailer: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-2qZ429rUZw

