ad48f6d8-5e69-47c0-95ac-a915a3c81c90,,Freddy Mercury Exhibition @ V&A Museum. Socialise and Make New Friends,"Join us for an unforgettable free exhibition on the late, great Freddie Mercury is landing at the V&A museum to celebrate what would've been his 80th birthday","**Join us for an unforgettable free exhibition on the late, great Freddie Mercury is landing at the V&A museum to celebrate what would've been his 80th birthday**

Developed closely with his former fiancée, friend, and confidante, Mary Austin, the display will be a trail of six stops that each highlight an iconic moment in his career. The exhibition has been created by Tom Piper, who was behind the 'Taylor Swift | Songbook Trail' at the V&A 🎵⁠
⁠
'Freddie Mercury | Splendid Things' shows off eight outfits, seven of which were lent to the space by Mary Austin, including the 'Mercury Wing' catsuit worn in the 'Bohemian Rhapsody' music video and the crown and cloak he wore in his final stage performance with Queen 👑⁠

Gather with fellow enthusiasts just outside the museum’s charming café, where the aroma of freshly brewed drinks mingles with the elegance of Victorian architecture. ☕✨ Connect with new friends, share your passion for art and design, and let the creative energy of the V&A inspire you! 🎉

After our coffee catch-up, dive into the museum’s treasures at your own pace. 🖼️ Wander through galleries filled with breathtaking exhibits, from ancient artifacts to cutting-edge fashion, or join a group to explore the collections together. 🗿👗 Whether you're a history buff, a design lover, or just here for the vibes, there’s something for everyone. 😊

**Where**: V&A Museum, Central Courtyard Café (meet just outside) 📍

**What to Bring**: Your enthusiasm and love for great coffee and culture! 🙌
Don’t miss this perfect blend of relaxation, connection, and discovery at the V&A. Let’s make this afternoon one to remember! 🚀🎭

