801b3f06-e303-4f7e-9a9b-f3ebf3105e02,,Omni AI Analytics Meetup London #2,"Come along to the second edition of the Omni AI Analytics Meetup in London to learn from people who work hands-on with data, analytics, and AI technology every day.","Come along to the second edition of the Omni AI Analytics Meetup in London to learn from people who work hands-on with data, analytics, and AI technology every day.

You will hear real stories about putting modern tools into practice, learn how experts build data products, and explore what this means for business outcomes.

