***Jasim Alladin, Engineering Lead, Infinite Lambda (https://www.linkedin.com/in/jasim-alladin/)***

Jasim will use AI to analyse a spreadsheet and enhance the data model, exploring what to look out for along the way and how it can unlock more interesting analytical work.

