2d83a4bc-01d6-4722-8313-3c1a76517a8a,,Fit with Parkinson's (Zoom indoor class),"Exercise can slow down the progression of Parkinson’s, and Covid 19 Quarantine is no reason not to move! Join our fun online class and stay fit and healthy.","Exercise can slow down the progression of Parkinson’s, and Covid 19 Quarantine is no reason not to move! Join our fun online class and stay fit and healthy.

Our ‘Nordic Neuro Magic’ is a new exercise class designed for people in the early stage of Parkinson’s and their friends or partners who can walk, are at a low risk of falls and have no major other health concerns.

Inspired by PD Warrior, we run especially designed classes, designed to slow down the progression of Parkinson’s. Our members love it, and we can really see the difference in the members who have been with us for a while!

Now we are all in Quarantine during the Covid 19 outbreak, we have adapted our outdoor classes to an interarctive online session twice a week.
So join us every Tuesday and Thursday at 11am for this fun and fast paced session.

If you have 1.5×1.5 meter space, a sturdy chair without arm rests and an internet connection, you are good to go.

It is sociable, fun, and keeps you in the best shape you can be, without ever leaving your home.

The classes are based around 7 key principles:
o Powerful
o Complex
o Frequent
o High effort
o Meaningful in daily life
o Specific to symptoms
o Fun!

Once we can get back to Nordic Walking we will! Please keep an eye out for our outdoor classes when quarantine time is over.

New to Fit and Happy Outdoors? Please email me on ailien@fitandhappyoutdoors.com or send me a personal message through Meetup at least 24 hours before the session you would like to join.

That will give me enough time to get back to you and discuss your needs and find out a bit more about you.

Once signed up we will send you a link to our Zoom meeting, as well as the password.

Cost: £150 per 10 sessions or £90 per month for unrestricted access to all our classes. Your partner can join your session for free.

Pay What Works:
The price shown above is the “true” value of the session that best reflects the work I put into preparing and leading your session. However, I understand that not everyone can afford to pay full price, and I don’t want that to stop you from joining us.

In an effort to find a balance between more financial accessibility and sustainable pricing, I now offer a “Pay What Works” model. This allows for financial flexibility while still valuing and respecting the work and energy I provide in creating and delivering these classes.

Then send an email to ailien@fitandhappyoutdoors.com with the heading “INVOICE please”- followed by “FAHO 1” to pay full price as quoted below, “FAHO 2”, for 20% off, or “FAHO 3” for 50% off.

Pllease do tell me if you want to pay for 10 sessions, or if you’d like to pay monthly.
I prefer payment by bank transfer, but if that is not possible you could post me a cheque, made out to Ailien Rhijnsburger.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/7/6/1/highres_490131041.jpeg,2026-11-23 11:00:00+00,2026-11-23 12:00:00+00,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,8827b689-2637-4245-8ba7-214b35948ea2,"{sport,travel,fitness}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/fit-and-happy-outdoors/events/jlxhtryjcpbfc/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,source:f26eb5d4-b239-4813-8e0c-3cf689eed4bd,https://www.meetup.com/fit-and-happy-outdoors/events/jlxhtryjcpbfc/,event_jlxhtryjcpbfc@meetup.com,,2026-10-27 03:22:34.801+00,,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,2026-10-27 03:22:59.22745+00,,,meetup:fit-and-happy-outdoors:fit with parkinson s zoom indoor class,Every week on Monday,f,
7547e493-bf9a-41b8-ac79-0375201fc327,,"Zen Social @ V&A Friday Late: A Night of Art, Music, Connection! 🎨🎶","Join us for an electrifying Friday Late at V&A South Kensington. This monthly event transforms the museum into a vibrant hub of contemporary culture, featuring live performances, interactive…","Join us for an electrifying **Friday Late** at V&A South Kensington. This monthly event transforms the museum into a vibrant hub of contemporary culture, featuring **live performances**, **interactive installations**, **thought-provoking talks**, and **pulsating DJ sets**. It’s the perfect blend of art, music, and social connection! 🎭🎤

We will have an amazing **after-party** with live music here:
https://www.meetup.com/cityzenlondon/events/316483882/

More details about the theme of the event:
**https://www.vam.ac.uk/info/friday-late**

**What to Expect:**

• **Art & Inspiration**: Wander through the V&A’s breathtaking galleries, showcasing everything from Renaissance sculptures to modern couture, all illuminated under the magic of late-night vibes.
• **Live Performances & DJs**: Groove to eclectic beats from top DJs and experience boundary-pushing performances by emerging artists.
• **Interactive Workshops**: Engage in hands-on activities, from crafting your own designs to joining thought-provoking discussions.
• **Social Vibes**: Meet new friends, spark conversations, and connect with fellow art enthusiasts in a relaxed, welcoming atmosphere. 🤝

**Admission Details:**

• **Free for the first sign-ups** secure your spot early!
• After the free allocation you will have to buy your RSVP through the meetup app. Please show your RSVP on the meetup app to the host on arrival.
• If you end up paying a late comer fee you are paying for signing up late and having the privilege of joining and mingling with our group and entry to the afterparty. Hosts will be checking RSVPs on the meetup app.

**Schedule:**

• **6:45 PM – Meet & Mingle**: Gather at the **Porter Gallery entrance in the DOME room**. Enter via the **Cromwell Road entrance**, head to the circular reception area (now a lively bar), and look left. From **Exhibition Road**, ask an attendant for the Porter Gallery. Enjoy drinks, chat, and soak in the atmosphere for 30 minutes. 🍹
• **7:15 PM – Explore or Stay**: Choose your adventure! Split into small groups to explore Friday Late events (pop-up performances, installations, or talks) or stay in the DOME room to keep mingling. 🗺️
• **8:30 PM – Reconvene**: Regroup at the DOME room meeting point to share your evening’s highlights. We will wait for 15 mins before going to the afterparty at 100 Queens Gate:
https://www.meetup.com/cityzenlondon/events/316483882/

**Why You Can’t Miss This:**

The V&A Friday Late is a cultural playground where art, music, and connection collide. Whether you’re an art aficionado, a music lover, or just looking to meet new people, this night has it all. With free entry for early birds, a stunning museum setting. it’s the perfect way to kick off your weekend! 🌟
**Join us for a night of creativity and connection at the V&A Friday Late! Sign up now and let’s make February unforgettable!** 🎉

**About the V&A South Kensington**

Nestled in the heart of London’s cultural quarter, the **Victoria and Albert Museum (V&A)** in South Kensington is the world’s leading museum of art, design, and performance. Founded in 1852 and named after Queen Victoria and Prince Albert, the V&A houses over **2.7 million objects** spanning 5,000 years of human creativity—from ancient ceramics to modern fashion. Its stunning architecture, including grand galleries and intricate mosaics, complements its diverse collections, making it a global destination for inspiration. Located at **Cromwell Road, SW7 2RL**, the V&A is open seven days a week with **free general admission**, inviting everyone to explore its treasures. 🏛️

**Some Tips:**

1. **Let’s all commit to updating our RSVPs if plans change**—it helps us plan better and ensures great attendance for everyone. If you RSVP “yes” but don’t attend and don’t update your RSVP, you may be removed from the group to keep things fair. No stress, though—you can rejoin for a small £10 fee! Just send me a DM, and I’ll share the PayPal details to get you back in.
2. **Turn Up on Time at the start!** This helps the quality of the event and helps you.
3. If you are struggling with the **app**, use the web page instead, that's what I use.
4. **Attendee Numbers & Guest Lists:** We have this event listed at least on two groups and the guest list includes attendees from all. You can see the list of attendees here:
https://www.meetup.com/zensingles/
https://www.meetup.com/cityzenlondon/
https://www.meetup.com/LoveLife
1. **Join our** **social media**:
**Instagram**: https://www.instagram.com/cityzen.london/
**X:** https://x.com/CityZenLondon
1. **Our WhatsApp group:** [See private comment in the comments section below]. We have a few rules including no ads, no DMs unless recipient is in the ""Direct Messaging List"" or risk removal and £10 rejoin fee.
2. **Support Our Amazing London Event Hosts! 🙌**
