d8dbcd43-a645-4b44-8d50-888b65da50de,,Constable Country,"Come join us for this wonderfully enchanting 8.5 mile walk by the delightful River Stour, Flatford Mill and Dedham Vale and the setting of The Hay Wain as well as a few other fantastic paintings of…","Come join us for this wonderfully enchanting 8.5 mile walk by the delightful River Stour, Flatford Mill and Dedham Vale and the setting of The Hay Wain as well as a few other fantastic paintings of Constable !

Let's go with the flow !

We shall meet outside of platform 10 close to the main ticket office.

We can then buy group return train tickets for the train at 9.30am that arrives at Manningtree at 10.25am.

Train ticket : Manningtree return

We shall commence the walk at around 10.35am.

Or you may decide to drive.

Please bring packed lunch, water, snacks etc plus waterproof jacket and walking shoes/boots/trainers.

We shall have lunch in and around the cafe at Flatford Mill.

Meetup fee £5 special price preferably paid in cash on the day !

The final part of the walk shall be on the Essex Way culminating in Boxted Cross from where we shall take the bus at 3.40pm ( or failing that at 5.10pm )to Colchester train station and then the subsequent train to London. Due to the high number of attendees and the buses to Colchester being both infrequent and single decker some people may choose to share an Uber back to Colchester station at the end of the walk.

Please only post photos of others with their consent.

Neil will be leading this walk as Steven will be away ....his no 07813 689301",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/8/3/7/highres_535795351.jpeg,2026-10-24 08:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,London Liverpool Street station,"Liverpool Street, EC2M 7QH",London,8827b689-2637-4245-8ba7-214b35948ea2,"{sport,fitness}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/walks-by-water/events/316293176/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,source:f26eb5d4-b239-4813-8e0c-3cf689eed4bd,https://www.meetup.com/walks-by-water/events/316293176/,event_316293176@meetup.com,,2026-10-24 03:22:29.103+00,,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,2026-10-24 03:22:51.846923+00,,,,,f,GB
