cbdf0665-8a96-4ad7-be85-84a90c02cb24,,Bamberg Toastmasters – Practise public speaking in a friendly atmosphere online,Bamberg Toastmasters (https://www.bamberg-toastmasters.de) is a non-profit English language public speaking club that is part of the worldwide Toastmasters Organization (https://www.toastmasters.org).,"Bamberg Toastmasters (https://www.bamberg-toastmasters.de) is a non-profit English language public speaking club that is part of the worldwide Toastmasters Organization (https://www.toastmasters.org).
