d2a7852a-6dd9-49cb-925b-2cd303eb1b8d,,🪷Healing Clinic,Join us for an one-of-a-kind energetic healing 🧡,"**Join us for an one-of-a-kind energetic healing 🧡**

We are offering a holistic healing service dedicated to supporting the emotional, physical, and spiritual well-being of our participants. The clinic is volunteer-run and sustained by donations, allowing us to keep the healing services accessible to everyone who needs them.

During the session, you will receive spiritual communication on the meaning of what you are experiencing to you as a spirit. This communication will not diagnose or recommend medical treatments.

🪷**How is the healing done?**
The healing session focuses on the energy field surrounding your body,
your grounding connection to the earth, and the alignment of the vital energy flowing through you.

During the healing, you will receive communication and insights about the unique rhythm and current state of your energetic field and the impact it has on your current experience.

🪷**What are the healing benefits?**
This healing helps you to gently release any heavy, stuck energy and gently call back your own energy, allowing your body and soul to heal from within.

🪷**The setting of the meeting**
Once you reserve your attendance, you will see the Zoom link in the meeting invitation. When you join the meeting, you will be placed in a waiting room based on first come, first served.
Each healing takes approximately 30 minutes and you can leave the meeting once your healing is complete.

🪷**Only a few places are available**
The healings are being offered on a limited capacity with few places available. Once the reservation limit is reached, reservations will be placed in a waitlist. If your session is confirmed and you can't attend, please update your attendance status as soon as possible so that others can participate.

🪷**Donations**
This sacred space is designed to hold space for healing in a spirit of sharing and donations are welcome. The details for donations will be provided in the clinic.

🪷**Your host**
The healings are provided by a certified spiritual counsellor, psychologist and energy medicine healer with many years of experience.

🪷**This healing session is for those:**

• Looking for deeper, spiritual meaning, purpose, or inner peace
• Want to balance their mind, body, and spirit
• Are ready to actively participate in their own healing
• Value volunteer-run wellness care

🪷**This healing session is not for those:**

• Looking for a quick fix without active self-reflection
• Are not interested in spirituality
• Want a clinical diagnosis or medical treatment
• Need urgent medical or psychiatric care",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/9/6/1/highres_535975649.jpeg,2026-11-03 17:00:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth,healthcare}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/schoolofspiritualityenergy-healing/events/317088587/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-24 03:22:25.885011+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/schoolofspiritualityenergy-healing/events/317088587/,event_317088587@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-24 03:22:25.885011+00,2026-10-28 03:22:27.129706+00,,,,,f,
