edef7ac9-4ae2-4e16-b6fe-ec3cce4a726f,,She Bytes Back x Snyk: What Breaks When Agents Start Shipping Your Code?,Hosted by Amber Shand | She Bytes Back,"📅 **Wednesday 18th November** | 🕕 **18:00 – 21:00** | 📍 **London** | 🍕 **Food & drinks on us** | 🚨 **Approval-only for experienced women engineers**

As agents take on more of the software development lifecycle, what happens when they produce code that passes every test but is fundamentally wrong, access something they shouldn't, or make a mistake that goes unnoticed until production? 👀

She Bytes Back is teaming up with **Snyk** for an evening of candid, technical talks about what it actually takes to build, evaluate and trust AI systems.

We're getting into evals, permissions, testing, observability and guardrails, including what teams only realised they needed after something went wrong.

🎤 **Speakers to be announced soon!**

The agenda

**6:00 PM:** Doors open, food & drinks
**6:45 PM:** Welcome from She Bytes Back + Snyk
**6:50 PM:** Three technical talks
**7:35 PM:** Open Q&A + group photo
**7:50 PM:** Our signature networking games
**8:30 PM:** Closing networking
**9:00 PM:** WE'RE OUT!!

About She Bytes Back

She Bytes Back brings together 3,700+ women in tech, creating technical rooms filled with experienced women engineers to connect, learn and grow their careers.

About Snyk

Snyk is the AI security company empowering organizations to build fast and stay secure. Their platform quickly finds and fixes security issues across code, dependencies, containers, and cloud infrastructure, enhanced by AI-powered insights, so businesses can embed security and AI trust directly into their development process.

*In the meantime, follow She Bytes Back on LinkedIn for updates, subscribe to our newsletter, and connect with Amber on LinkedIn.*

*Please familiarise yourself with our community's code of conduct, ensuring a safe and enjoyable experience for all attendees.*

*By signing up to this event, you agree to the She Bytes Back privacy policy and are subscribed to the She Bytes Back mailing list. You can unsubscribe at any time.*

