Our incredible crew of hosts is the heartbeat of London’s buzzing meetup scene, bringing people together for unforgettable experiences that spark connection, growth, and…",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/5/b/3/highres_536142419.jpeg,2026-12-25 18:45:00+00,2026-12-25 21:45:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,"The V&A, South Kensington","Cromwell Rd, London SW7 2RL",London,8827b689-2637-4245-8ba7-214b35948ea2,"{sport,arts,socialising,music,fitness}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/cityzenlondon/events/316300945/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,source:f26eb5d4-b239-4813-8e0c-3cf689eed4bd,https://www.meetup.com/cityzenlondon/events/316300945/,event_316300945@meetup.com,,2026-10-23 03:22:35.713+00,,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,2026-10-23 03:23:01.453296+00,,,meetup:cityzenlondon:zen social v a friday late a night of art music connection,"Every 3rd Friday of the month until December 31, 2026",f,GB
