145ed0bd-9a2c-49e2-bd21-2e339b125489,,Brookmans Park Circular,Let's go with the flow and do this amazing 7 to 8 mile walk in the delightful Hertfordshire countryside in this lovely village including Gobions Open Space and its most beautiful pond.,"Let's go with the flow and do this amazing 7 to 8 mile walk in the delightful Hertfordshire countryside in this lovely village including Gobions Open Space and its most beautiful pond.

