We play every:

• Monday in Finsbury Park (19:00 - 20:00)
• Tuesday in Shoreditch (19:00 - 20:00)
• Wednesdays in Elephant & Castle (19:00-20:00)
• Saturday in Southwark Park (10:30 - 11:30)
• Saturday in Finsbury Park (11:00 - 12:00)
