07b4b3b4-29cb-4948-9a69-75f96ee117fc,,*NEW BOOKING SYSTEM - SEE INFO* Saturday @ MULBERRY SPORTS Centre (11am - 12pm),"Important: This Meetup page is now for information only. Your space is not reserved by RSVPing on Meetup. To secure your place, you must book and pay via genb.shuttlestats.app…","**Important:** This Meetup page is now for information only. **Your space is not reserved by RSVPing on Meetup.** To secure your place, you **must** book and pay via genb.shuttlestats.app (http://genb.shuttlestats.app/).

**Saturday - Intermediate+ (1 hour) @ Mulberry**
Come and join our friendly badminton club for a fun and competitive doubles session at Mulberry Sports & Leisure Centre in Whitechapel!

**How it works**

• Book your spot on genb.shuttlestats.app (http://genb.shuttlestats.app/) – spaces are limited.
• Bring your own racket and non-marking indoor shoes. Feather shuttles are included.
• We have 2 courts for this session (number 3 & 4) so numbers are capped at 12 players

**Level**
This is an **Intermediate+ session**. You should be able to play clears, smashes, drops, drives, and net shots consistently in games.

All players **must be at the right level** for this session. Badminton levels vary between clubs, so we strongly recommend checking out our **Instagram page** to see what *we* class as **Lower Intermediate, Intermediate, and High Intermediate** before booking.

We always use the **first game as a level check**. If it becomes clear during that game that the standard isn’t the right match for this session, **you won’t be able to continue beyond that point**.

As a **small community club**, we’re unfortunately **unable to offer refunds** in these situations. Please **only book a session if you are happy to accept these conditions**.

💬 **Stay connected**
We have a club WhatsApp group for updates, photos, and extra playing opportunities. Message Peter on **07561 100 413** after you've played at your first session and we’ll add you!

**Venue**

• Where: Mulberry Sports & Leisure Centre, Anthony Street, E1 2TX (nearest tube: Whitechapel).
• On arrival: Let reception know you’re here for the Tower Hamlets Badminton Meetup.

**Price**
£6 per person, payable in advance when booking on genb.shuttlestats.app (http://genb.shuttlestats.app/)",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/c/3/b/highres_525352283.jpeg,2026-10-24 10:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,Mulberry Sports Centre,Richard Street,London,c06699ed-62e0-4957-bcb4-080c5271da9a,"{sport,fitness}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/generationbadminton/events/316837287/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:49:59.35823+00,source:cba1b9d2-d09d-4c19-a89e-50bdbe5525a0,https://www.meetup.com/generationbadminton/events/316837287/,event_316837287@meetup.com,,2026-10-24 03:20:44.813+00,,2026-10-22 19:49:59.35823+00,2026-10-24 03:21:22.049678+00,,,meetup:generationbadminton:new booking system see info saturday mulberry sports centre 11am 12pm,"Every week on Saturday until December 27, 2030",f,GB
