8e07f3b6-6fa0-4b90-86b8-298b3d5da40d,,SIMS is Back: What’s Changed in Digital Marketing?,Suffolk Internet Marketing Specialists,"**Suffolk Internet Marketing Specialists**
SIMS is coming back.

For those who haven’t encountered it before, SIMS — Suffolk Internet Marketing Specialists — is a community for people working in and around digital marketing in Suffolk.

SEO, content, paid search, social, websites, analytics, email, AI, CRO and whatever gets invented next.
The emphasis is on practitioners talking to practitioners.

For our return, we’re going to start with a deceptively simple question: **What’s actually changed?**

AI is reshaping search and content. Google keeps moving. Social platforms are changing. Websites are changing. Clients are changing. And the boundaries between previously separate digital disciplines are becoming increasingly blurred.

• So what are people actually seeing?
• What’s working?
• What isn’t?
• What have you stopped doing?
• What are you experimenting with?

And what do we collectively need to get better at next?

We’ll have some people to get the conversation started, but SIMS isn’t intended to be an hour of somebody talking at you.

Bring your experience, questions, experiments, frustrations and things you’ve spotted.

Whether you’re an experienced specialist, work in-house, run an agency, freelance or are developing your digital marketing career, you’re welcome.

**More speakers and details to come — for now, save your place and get SIMS back in the diary.**",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/b/d/d/highres_535931229.jpeg,2026-11-17 18:00:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{technology,marketing}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/suffolk-internet-marketing-seo-sem-specialists/events/316354650/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/suffolk-internet-marketing-seo-sem-specialists/events/316354650/,event_316354650@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.493162+00,,,,,f,
