a1d877dd-e014-437a-bd18-1306bb6e9239,,Beginner-Friendly Foosball Social at The Prince,"Looking for a fun, social activity in London? Come and play foosball with London Table Football at The Prince.","Looking for a fun, social activity in London? Come and play foosball with London Table Football at The Prince.

Complete beginners are welcome. You can come alone, you do not need a playing partner and we will explain everything you need to know.

WHAT TO EXPECT

• Casual games with players of different levels
• A friendly host to welcome and introduce you
• Help learning the basic rules and techniques
• Opportunities to change partners and meet people
• No commitment to attend every week

ARRIVING FOR THE FIRST TIME

Please arrive at any time from 7pm and ask for Pasquale, the London Table Football host. Tell them that it is your first session and they will help you join the games.

PRICE

There is no entry fee, simply pay for your games using the contactless-card payment system.

VENUE

The Prince
14 Lillie Road,
West Brompton,
SW6 1TT
Nearest station: West Brompton

