3a8bcab9-62f8-473d-9c12-760affb39aeb,,V is for VLOOKUP and other fanciful Excel tales | Vaughan Grandin,"Did you know that November is the only month of the year containing the letter “V”? That makes it the perfect time for the valiant, vibrant and versatile Vaughan Grandin, Head of Financial Modelling…","Did you know that November is the only month of the year containing the letter “V”? That makes it the perfect time for the valiant, vibrant and versatile Vaughan Grandin, Head of Financial Modelling at Teneo, to venture into a varied discussion, starting with the venerable (and controversial) **Vlookup** formula (valuable in the 90s, less so now) and ending up with the most important “V” in spreadsheets - **Value**.
