9e94cb71-da27-43f0-bca3-d3251f28a932,,Basketball league on Thursdays in Wimbledon (south west London),Join our competitive basketball league for experienced intermediate+ players who enjoy playing good basketball and want to be part of a great group of players.,"Join our competitive basketball league for experienced intermediate+ players who enjoy playing good basketball and want to be part of a great group of players.

We've been running basketball sessions in London for over 20 years, and our aim with the league is to bring together players who enjoy playing competitively while also valuing the people they're playing with.

We want players with good skills, who work hard and play competitively but also respect their opponents, the referee's decisions and the atmosphere we're trying to create.

Most importantly, we're looking to build a basketball community that people want to stay part of. If you enjoy the league, you'll be welcome to continue playing with us in future seasons and at our regular basketball sessions.

The league runs for 6 weeks. Matches are 40 minutes (2 x 19 mins) and run on Thursdays between 8.05pm and 10pm.

You need to book your place in advance on our website using a bank card, PayPal, or Apple Pay. Note that we manage bookings and post updates on the booking page on our website, not on meetup:
https://playfit.co.uk/w/basketball/

CONTACT: If you have any questions or need help booking your place then message us on Whatsapp (https://wa.me/message/WMVRULBIR7TJA1) or send us an email through our website (https://playfit.co.uk/w/contact).

