1d438910-d8e4-417d-96d4-74ccfdf82409,,The Scales Aren’t Moving. How Do You Keep Going?,The Scales Aren’t Moving. How Do You Keep Going?,"**The Scales Aren’t Moving. How Do You Keep Going?**

You’ve been making an effort with your eating and exercise. Then you step on the scales—and the number hasn’t changed.
It’s frustrating when your effort doesn’t seem to be paying off. You start questioning your plan, becoming stricter or wondering whether there’s any point continuing.

You want to know whether you’re making progress, what needs adjusting and how to move forward with confidence.

In this free live webinar, we’ll explore:

• Why the scales don’t always give you the full picture of your progress.
• How expectations and your response to disappointing results can affect your next choices.
• How to review your habits and progress before deciding what to adjust.

**You’ll leave with a simple progress-review checklist:** what to look at, what’s working and how to choose a useful next step.

Imagine responding to a disappointing weigh-in without letting it decide how you feel about yourself—or whether you carry on. What difference would that make to your week?

Hosted by **Gaelle Joseph and Philip Perre**.

If you’d like ongoing support to put these ideas into practice, we’ll also share details of our **Mind and Body Reset membership**.
Explore Mind and Body Reset (https://www.weightharmony.co.uk/mind-and-body-reset-membership)

Want to explore what keeps getting in your way and how support could help?
Book a discovery call (https://calendar.google.com/calendar/u/0/appointments/schedules/AcZssZ0NXWkvTJDKtZVPzii5WO9FgQN7ldMEEwja_t-4EfRU8NFQUXJ846KBeWsfbl3IKfJcX4Om4qp1)

**When the scales don’t show the result you hoped for, what do you tend to do next?** Share in the comments below. We’d love to hear from you and bring your questions into the session.

***Please note:*** This webinar is for educational and self-development purposes only and is not intended to replace medical, nutritional or psychological advice, diagnosis or treatment.

We look forward to seeing you there.",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1793157692/orbit/event-covers/sources/dojc1gkvlo0bulytf9fk.jpg,2026-11-26 20:00:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,c06699ed-62e0-4957-bcb4-080c5271da9a,"{sport,fitness,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/coaching-and-therapy-for-weight-management/events/316769081/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,0.00,0.00,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-28 03:21:15.128928+00,source:cba1b9d2-d09d-4c19-a89e-50bdbe5525a0,https://www.meetup.com/coaching-and-therapy-for-weight-management/events/316769081/,event_316769081@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:20:38.34+00,,2026-10-28 03:21:15.128928+00,2026-10-28 03:21:33.525969+00,,,,,f,
