d82d30e9-9bcf-4954-9957-7204cfb43cea,,"Cloud Native London, November 2026",Hi folks!,"Hi folks!

Welcome to our November Cloud Native London meetup! Join us to hear from our three great speakers and network with your fellow techies over pizza and drinks, or alternatively chat and following along on Youtube or LinkedIn!

6:00 Pizza and drinks
6:30 Welcome
6:45 Speaker TBC
7:15 Kubernetes Is Not Your Hyperledger Fabric Control Plane (Pereowei Daniel, DLM Capital Group)
7:45 Break
8:00 Surya Pandian, Truelayer (Talk TBC)
8:30 Wrap up

See you there!

Cheryl (@oicheryl)

**Kubernetes Is Not Your Hyperledger Fabric Control Plane (Pereowei Daniel, DLM Capital Group)**
Kubernetes can schedule Hyperledger Fabric peers, orderers, certificate authorities, and chaincode services, but a running Pod does not necessarily mean that a Fabric network is operational. Kubernetes cannot tell whether a peer has the correct MSP material, whether certificates are valid, whether it has joined the intended channel, or whether a Chaincode-as-a-Service deployment is ready to serve transactions.
This talk explores the gap between Kubernetes workload health and Fabric operational readiness. Drawing on the development of FabricOps, an LF Decentralized Trust Lab, I will show how a reconciliation-driven Kubernetes operator can express Fabric networks as desired state and manage the lifecycle concerns that matter in production: identities, TLS, channels, chaincode, health, and multi-organization ownership. The session will include a short demonstration and an honest look at the remaining hard problems, including federated network joining and BFT ordering.

*Pereowei Daniel is a DevOps/Cloud Infrastructure Engineer, and the maintainer of FabricOps, an LF Decentralized Trust Lab for declaratively provisioning and operating Hyperledger Fabric networks on Kubernetes. He is also a contributor to Hyperledger Labs Fablo, where he contributed Chaincode-as-a-Service support. His work focuses on making the operational complexity of distributed systems, identity infrastructure, and permissioned ledgers more manageable through automation.*
*Social links:*
*LinkedIn: https://linkedin.com/in/pereowei*
*X: https://x.com/pereoweidaniel*
*GitHub: https://github.com/dpereowei*

***Check out https://www.oicheryl.com/cloudnativelondon if you're interested in speaking or sponsoring.***",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792698989/orbit/event-covers/sources/q5uvpgkznmftgjgdix07.jpg,2026-11-04 18:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,Just Eat London,"Fleet Place House, 2 Fleet Pl, London EC4M 7RF,",London,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,{technology},,external,https://www.meetup.com/cloud-native-london/events/315992081/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,0.00,0.00,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/cloud-native-london/events/315992081/,event_315992081@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.312165+00,51.516514,-0.103296,,,f,GB
