5f2fbe6a-c210-4585-ad4e-198facb62c87,,Cinematic Photography : Atmospheric Night Shoot,"Join us on this workshop which has been developed to help you explore new areas of your photography. Using a 50mm prime (or 35mm prime) we'll be working without a tripod, hand holding at night.","Join us on this workshop which has been developed to help you explore new areas of your photography. Using a 50mm prime (or 35mm prime) we'll be working without a tripod, hand holding at night.

There is no particular rule to define Cinematic Photography. A Cinematic shot looks like a frame pulled out of a movie. Mood, lighting and atmosphere are really important for this particular type of photography.

This workshop is designed to help you see cinematic style photography. We will focus on street life in London using ambient light to capture cinematic style images.

