3cba5a26-c4ae-4c8e-b2a0-89b8830b2662,,In Person: CoffeeOps,We are back! This is going to be a monthly IN PERSON meet up in London.,"We are back! This is going to be a monthly IN PERSON meet up in London.

A very big thank you goes to Accurx who is hosting us in their amazing Shoreditch offices. This will include access to facilities including coffee! 😻☕️

**Want to know more? 👇**

As with all CoffeeOps, this is an interactive, chatty, build your own adventure type of meet-up. Instead of booking in experts to *learn* *from*, we gather a group of practitioners to ***learn*** ***with***. We have been running for over 4 years now and often get feedback that this is the most useful meetup people join!

The event is approximately 90 minutes and always starts by brainstorming topics to discuss. The group then votes on the most relevant/interesting to them and we then cycle through the topics trying to discuss each deeply, but in a time bound slot.

To get an idea of topics, you can check out our remote board here (https://easyretro.io/publicboard/h404NF84Uje4tCcxpJdHr4Ycs9B3/a4a35d2b-181b-409b-832e-a729be1af79c). The general gist is anything is fair game, though we tend to revolve around software delivery and definitely lean towards the more Ops-y or DevOps-y side of things.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/4/f/0/5/highres_509900229.jpeg,2027-01-14 08:00:00+00,2027-01-14 09:30:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,Accurx,7 Curtain Road,London,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,{technology},,external,https://www.meetup.com/coffeeops-london/events/plbrbtykccbsb/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-24 03:23:30.368241+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/coffeeops-london/events/plbrbtykccbsb/,event_plbrbtykccbsb@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-24 03:23:30.368241+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.493162+00,,,meetup:coffeeops-london:in person coffeeops,Every 2nd Thursday of the month,f,GB
90b0ba84-22d1-4ecb-a88b-432d9fa7e9c6,,Passive A.I Income: 7 Ways To Monetise A.I,Stop Living Paycheck to Paycheck — Here's How to Change That,"**Stop Living Paycheck to Paycheck — Here's How to Change That**

Most people never escape the cycle of relying on a single income. Not because they lack the skills or ambition — but because nobody showed them how to turn what they already know into something that earns for them.
That changes with this webinar.

**🚨✅ Click here to register ✅🚨 (https://wealthgrowthlab--clientsandconsulting.thrivecart.com/7-ways-to-monetise-ai/)**

**7 Ways to Make a Passive Income Online** is a free, practical training session designed for people who are ready to stop waiting and start building. Whether you're stretched thin at the end of every month, craving more financial breathing room, or simply tired of your income being tied to the hours you put in — this is the session you've been looking for.

**Here's what you'll discover inside:**

• How to identify the knowledge and skills you already have — and turn them into a sellable digital product
• The most in-demand types of digital products right now: e-books, online courses, webinars, templates, and more
• How to find and reach your ideal buyers — even if you're starting from zero
• The smart way to automate your sales process, so you're generating income around the clock — not just when you're working
• How to create a product once and sell it repeatedly, building a revenue stream that grows over time

**Why digital products?**

Unlike freelancing or a second job, digital products don't require you to show up. Once created, they can be sold to one person or ten thousand — with no extra effort on your part. That's the power of building something scalable.
And the best part? You don't need a big audience, a tech background, or a big budget to get started. You just need a plan — and that's exactly what this webinar gives you.

**This won't be available forever.**

Spots are limited, and this webinar won't be repeated in its current format. If you've been telling yourself you'll ""look into passive income someday"" — this is your someday.
People who attend sessions like this consistently say the same thing afterwards: *""I wish I'd done this sooner.""*
Don't be the person who saw this, thought about it, and scrolled on.

