19731cf2-1f8c-473e-92a0-eb9cedbb461f,,Icebreaker & Launch Session: Meet the Community,"Welcome to our very first online gathering! This session is all about breaking the ice, setting a comfortable rhythm for future events, and meeting fellow members in a relaxed, low-pressure…","Welcome to our very first online gathering! This session is all about breaking the ice, setting a comfortable rhythm for future events, and meeting fellow members in a relaxed, low-pressure environment.
