39ff75d9-c307-44c7-be2e-ba508dd18056,,Sourcing & Vendor Reliability: A Roundtable for Manufacturing & Trading,Please complete the form - https://forms.gle/HADKJUiRME2gD3sZ7 - to get added to Founders and Business Owners WA group (only +91 country code allowed),"Please complete the form - https://forms.gle/HADKJUiRME2gD3sZ7 - to get added to Founders and Business Owners WA group (only +91 country code allowed)

Every business in this room has faced it: a vendor who delays delivery, ships inconsistent quality, disputes payment terms, or simply goes quiet after a quote — and with thin margins and locked-in production timelines, small manufacturers and traders have the least room to absorb it. This session brings owners together to talk through what's actually breaking sourcing right now, and what would genuinely fix it.

