b6d91675-90c1-46c8-a5f4-b70cf3c24a51,,Can We Build a Healthier Future Together?,"What would it take to build a future where healthier ways of living are more accessible, where people can connect with the right resources, and where communities actively contribute to their…","What would it take to build a future where healthier ways of living are more accessible, where people can connect with the right resources, and where communities actively contribute to their collective wellbeing?

Our health and potential are shaped by the conditions in which we live every day. From sleep, nutrition and physical activity to stress regulation, recovery and our surrounding environment, these foundations influence how we feel, function and develop. Yet access to specialised expertise, personalised assessments and evidence-informed frameworks for improving these foundations remains financially out of reach for many people. How can we change that?

In this webinar, we’ll explore how we can make these resources more accessible by building communities and shared infrastructure around proactive health; not only helping people respond to health challenges, but also supporting them in understanding and addressing the factors that contribute to them.

I’ll introduce the vision behind Hygieia Protocol; a community-backed health hub in Brussels designed to bring together practitioners, education, specialised approaches, shared experiences and practical frameworks for proactive health.

The ambition is to help make practices that might otherwise be accessible mainly to higher-paying demographics available to a broader community.

We’ll explore how this model could work, how a community can help build and sustain meaningful infrastructure, and how we might turn a shared vision into something tangible, accessible and sustainable.

Whether you’re interested in health, human performance, entrepreneurship, community building or positive impact, join us for an open conversation about how we can create the conditions for people to thrive.

Bring your curiosity, questions and ideas.

Details:

• Location: Online
• Cost: Free
• Timezone: CEST (Brussels Time)",,2026-11-07 19:00:00+00,,Europe/Brussels,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth,entrepreneurship}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/business-healthy-lifestyle-positive-impact/events/317093991/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-24 03:22:25.885011+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/business-healthy-lifestyle-positive-impact/events/317093991/,event_317093991@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-24 03:22:25.885011+00,2026-10-28 03:22:27.129706+00,,,,,f,
5a67a488-228c-47b2-8efb-18878216e61e,,In Person: CoffeeOps,We are back! This is going to be a monthly IN PERSON meet up in London.,"We are back! This is going to be a monthly IN PERSON meet up in London.

A very big thank you goes to Accurx who is hosting us in their amazing Shoreditch offices. This will include access to facilities including coffee! 😻☕️

**Want to know more? 👇**

As with all CoffeeOps, this is an interactive, chatty, build your own adventure type of meet-up. Instead of booking in experts to *learn* *from*, we gather a group of practitioners to ***learn*** ***with***. We have been running for over 4 years now and often get feedback that this is the most useful meetup people join!

The event is approximately 90 minutes and always starts by brainstorming topics to discuss. The group then votes on the most relevant/interesting to them and we then cycle through the topics trying to discuss each deeply, but in a time bound slot.

To get an idea of topics, you can check out our remote board here (https://easyretro.io/publicboard/h404NF84Uje4tCcxpJdHr4Ycs9B3/a4a35d2b-181b-409b-832e-a729be1af79c). The general gist is anything is fair game, though we tend to revolve around software delivery and definitely lean towards the more Ops-y or DevOps-y side of things.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/4/f/0/5/highres_509900229.jpeg,2027-02-11 08:00:00+00,2027-02-11 09:30:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,Accurx,7 Curtain Road,London,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,{technology},,external,https://www.meetup.com/coffeeops-london/events/plbrbtykcdbpb/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-24 03:23:30.368241+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/coffeeops-london/events/plbrbtykcdbpb/,event_plbrbtykcdbpb@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-24 03:23:30.368241+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.493162+00,,,meetup:coffeeops-london:in person coffeeops,Every 2nd Thursday of the month,f,GB
