2e7b1772-a622-4c99-bf2d-b2b141e6083f,,Generative AI Workshop,"You run a business, lead a department or work for yourself. You suspect AI could save you time or open up new work, but you are not sure where to begin. The volume of tools and advice online makes…","**You run a business, lead a department or work for yourself.** You suspect AI could save you time or open up new work, but you are not sure where to begin. The volume of tools and advice online makes it hard to tell what applies to a business like yours. You may also have heard what other businesses report gaining from AI and want yours to keep pace.
This Meetup is a practical starting point, where you will see AI tools applied to ordinary business tasks and can ask questions about your own situation. Other owners and managers share what they have tried, including the attempts that failed. Come with the problems you want to solve.

**What Happens at the Event**

• **Live demonstrations:** Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini and other tools handle research, content creation and routine procedures
• **Open Q&A:** bring questions about your own business and get practical answers on using Claude effectively
• **Recording & Files:** each session is recorded and can be viewed later by community members.

**Who Should Attend**

The event suits business owners, department heads, consultants, freelancers and anyone self-employed. No technical background is needed and all experience levels are welcome. Some members have never opened an AI tool, while others are already building with one.

**What You Leave With**

You leave with clarity on where AI could help you find efficiencies in your daily work. You get recordings and files to help you implement strategies and automations that work for you. You get a sense of which tool suits each task, along with a group of people you can keep learning from.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/8/7/c/highres_536302652.jpeg,2026-10-23 16:00:00+00,2026-10-23 17:00:00+00,Europe/Dublin,online,Online event,,,4cece675-2670-4581-90e6-2b792576b047,"{technology,ai}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/claude-code-automations/events/316828771/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/claude-code-automations/events/316828771/,event_316828771@meetup.com,,2026-10-23 03:23:03.153+00,,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,2026-10-23 03:23:43.045297+00,,,meetup:claude-code-automations:generative ai workshop,"Every week on Friday until December 18, 2026",f,
fa8a80d6-ca8f-40bf-a24d-39aee01d99e9,,"Copilot, Power Platform & Dynamics Coffee Talk!","Welcome to our first Copilot, Power Platform & Dynamics Coffee Talk!","Welcome to our first Copilot, Power Platform & Dynamics Coffee Talk!

This will be a relaxed meetup where we can get to know each other, exchange ideas, and decide together which topics we would like to explore in future events.
We can discuss Microsoft Copilot, Copilot Studio, AI agents, Microsoft Foundry, Power Platform, Dynamics 365, Dataverse, business automation, governance, security, and responsible AI. We can also exchange project experiences, talk about new and upcoming features, and help each other with practical questions and implementation challenges.

There is no formal presentation planned for this first meetup. You do not need to prepare anything or be an expert. Simply bring your questions, experiences, and ideas.

If someone would like to present a topic, use case, or demo in the future, we can plan a dedicated online or in-person session based on the topic and the number of interested participants.

Agenda
• Arrival and introductions
• Brief introduction to the community
• Open discussion about Copilot, AI agents, Power Platform, and Dynamics 365
• Collection of ideas for future topics
• Planning the next meetup
• Informal networking

German will normally be our main language.
If more English-speaking participants attend, we can hold the conversation in English so everyone can participate.
