3ed7f19a-9df2-4156-b013-5e7bbe7eb78b,,Free Startup Fundraising Video Office Hours Q&A with Angel Investor Scott Fox!,Startup Founders: Bring your startup questions and challenges to the Startup Council’s FREE founder support “Office Hours”. Get FREE expert Silicon Valley advice to help you start and grow your…,"**Startup Founders: Bring your startup questions and challenges to the Startup Council’s FREE founder support “Office Hours”. Get FREE expert Silicon Valley advice to help you start and grow your venture.**

**Want to find angel investors? Practice your investor pitch? Have questions about raising venture capital? How to find product/market fit? Pitch decks? Building your team? Protecting your intellectual property? Starting a company as a first-time, female, or minority founder? We're here to help!**

A **free, fun, friendly livestream** for startup founders and friends worldwide, our mission is to increase access to innovation and investment for all. Join Startup Council CEO, **Scott Fox**, for valuable startup strategy advice, fundraising expertise, and networking.

**NOW NO REGISTRATION REQUIRED!**
Just join us at call time here:
**https://www.startupcouncil.org/startup-office-hours**

**WHEN: The 4th Tuesday of every month at 900pm US Pacific Time (aka 12 midnight US ET).**
**That's WEDNESDAY at 5:00am UTC / 9:00am GST / 10:30am IST / 3:00pm AEST for our friends in Asia, Australia, MENA, and India.**

**AT SHOW TIME YOU CAN WATCH & CHAT LIVE AT ANY OF THESE CHANNELS:**
**https://www.startupcouncil.org/startup-office-hours**
https://www.linkedin.com/company/startupcouncil
https://www.youtube.com/scottfox (with Live Chat!)

