You'll get helpful, free expert feedback LIVE if you RSVP in advance!

**Submit your Startup Question or Pitch summary here BEFORE the show to get the ON CAMERA participation link: https://startupcouncil.org/sohsrsvp**

***Priority Access for StartupCouncil.org Members***

*Priority for on camera questions and pitch practice is given to startup **Member** companies listed on StartupCouncil.org. Learn More and join now at* https://StartupCouncil.org/join (https://StartupCouncil.org/join)

**Your Host & Moderator:** Scott Fox, CEO of the Startup Council, Chairman of Stanford Angels & Entrepreneurs SoCal (Orange County), ecosystem builder & speaker, investor in 30+ startup companies, serial startup founder, best-selling entrepreneurship author of Click Millionaires, Internet Riches, more…

**SPONSORS**

**StartupCouncil.org (https://StartupCouncil.org/)**: We're a community service group helping founders worldwide to accelerate the success of their early-stage startups! Our mission is to help entrepreneurs and investors globally by increasing access to relationships, expertise, and innovation capital, especially for first-time, minority, and underrepresented founders.

***SUBSCRIBE to the FREE Startup Council email newsletter lists HERE: https://www.startupcouncil.org/newsletters .***

