4f59d33e-21dc-412a-8d93-70aacf3c7058,,Understanding the Nervous System,"Have you ever wondered why you can know what you “should” do, but still feel stuck, overwhelmed, anxious, disconnected, or unable to slow down?","Have you ever wondered why you can know what you “should” do, but still feel stuck, overwhelmed, anxious, disconnected, or unable to slow down?

In this online masterclass, we will explore the nervous system in a simple, practical, and human way. You will learn what happens inside your body when you feel stressed, activated, shut down, or disconnected, and how to understand your reactions with more compassion.

This class is mainly theoretical and gives you the foundation for nervous system regulation. **The somatic tools are practiced in the NeuroSomatic Breathwork group session**, where we take this knowledge into the body through breath, movement, sound, and allowance.

Together, we will look at stress, activation and shutdown, why rest can feel difficult, how people get stuck in constant doing, and what nervous system regulation actually means.

You do not need any previous experience. Come as you are, with curiosity and openness.

Everyone who joins will also receive my Somatic Stress Release Guide, so you can continue exploring simple regulation tools after the session.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/7/2/7/highres_534998695.jpeg,2026-10-23 14:00:00+00,,Europe/Prague,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/soulful-high-achievers-club/events/315788491/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.927193+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/soulful-high-achievers-club/events/315788491/,event_315788491@meetup.com,,2026-10-23 03:21:52.022+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.927193+00,2026-10-23 03:22:33.131983+00,,,meetup:soulful-high-achievers-club:understanding the nervous system,"Every 4th Thursday of the month until December 30, 2026",f,
2f85ecde-6e68-4ff1-9fb7-9a9fd566016f,,The Artist’s Way – Free Weekly Online Support Group & Book Club for Creatives,"Hi everyone,","Hi everyone,

Thank you for being part of the Playmakers journey — whether you’re brand new or you’ve been with us already, we appreciate you.

Playmakers is a creative community built around one simple idea: play isn’t just for children — it’s a powerful way for adults to connect, recharge, and grow. Over time, we’ll be hosting in-person workshops and events that blend theatre, movement, games, music, writing, and other creative activities to help people develop skills and build community.
For now, we’re keeping things simple.

As a low-barrier entry point into the Playmakers space, we’re running a free weekly online workshop. (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSf9mHEnC3L9PpeMpaRVcsNqQ6EpVR7Bb7HJb8OV1UlGrFIhSg/viewform?usp=dialog) It’s a creative book-club-style group centred around *The Artist’s Way*, where we explore ideas together, share reflections, and gently challenge ourselves in a supportive environment.
Each session stands on its own, so you can join at any point in the year. It doesn’t matter how far we are in the book — there’s no catching up required. Just come as you are and start where we are.
It’s relaxed, welcoming, and you can engage at your own pace. No pressure — just curiosity, creativity, and connection.

**New here?** You can find all the details and sign up via This link - Book Club Sign up Form (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSf9mHEnC3L9PpeMpaRVcsNqQ6EpVR7Bb7HJb8OV1UlGrFIhSg/viewform?usp=dialog) (you’ll receive the Google Meet link after submitting)

**Returning?** You don’t need to fill the form again — just join using the usual link you’ve already received or keep an eye out for our weekly emails.

**Quick favour:** even if you’re a regular, please hit **Attend / RSVP**. It helps the Meetup algorithm push the event to more people and grow the community

**Event details**
**Sundays | 10:30–11:30am**
**Platform:** Google Meet
**What to bring:** something to write with (notebook + pen or Notes app)

For any questions or further info, hit me up at **Taurean@theplaymakersproject.com**.
Looking forward to building this with you.

— Taurean

The Playmakers Project",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792984815/orbit/event-covers/sources/oabswdi65dy9p5ql41d3.jpg,2026-12-27 10:30:00+00,2026-12-27 12:00:00+00,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,books,creative,socialising}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/playmakers-play-creativity-community/events/317144676/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:46:36.725985+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/playmakers-play-creativity-community/events/317144676/,event_317144676@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:19:10.809+00,,2026-10-22 19:46:36.725985+00,2026-10-28 03:19:47.193092+00,,,meetup:playmakers-play-creativity-community:the artist s way free weekly online support group book club for creatives,"Every week on Sunday until February 14, 2027",f,
