b3467f60-c288-4d9c-9b03-bc1c4169ba90,,Know What to Do. So What's Stopping Me?,Why Do I Know What to Do… But Still Don't Do It?,"**Why Do I Know What to Do… But Still Don't Do It?**
Have you ever wondered why you know exactly what needs to change in your life, yet find yourself repeating the same habits and patterns?
Discover the psychology behind procrastination, inconsistency, and self-sabotage — and learn how to take practical steps toward lasting change.

🤔 **Have you ever told yourself…**
💭 “I'm going to finally launch that business I've been thinking about.”
💭 “Next week, I'll take my health and wellbeing seriously.”
💭 “This time, I'll stay committed and see it through.”

**But somehow, you end up back where you started?**
You make plans, set goals, and feel ready for a fresh start. At first, you're motivated and excited. Then life gets busy, your energy fades, and the promises you made to yourself become harder to keep.
But what if the problem isn't a lack of discipline or ambition?

🧠 What if there's a deeper psychological reason behind the way you respond to challenges, form habits, and make decisions?

🚀 **What You'll Discover in This Masterclass**
In this engaging masterclass, you'll explore the connection between your thoughts, beliefs, identity, and everyday behaviours. You'll discover why good intentions don't always translate into action and how understanding your mind can help you approach change differently.

**During this session, you'll explore:**
🔹 Why knowing isn't enough: Understand why awareness alone doesn't automatically lead to action.
🔹 Hidden behavioural patterns: Discover the psychological habits that may be keeping you from moving forward.
🔹 Beyond motivation: Learn why motivation comes and goes and what can help you stay consistent.
🔹 The power of identity: Explore how your self-image influences your everyday decisions, habits, and goals.
🔹 Limiting beliefs: Recognise how the beliefs you hold about yourself can affect your confidence and willingness to act.
🔹 Practical strategies: Explore ways to build better habits, overcome resistance, and follow through on your intentions.

**This event is for you if...**

• You know you're capable of more but struggle to stay consistent.
• You start projects with enthusiasm but rarely finish them.
• You've invested in books, courses or coaching but still feel stuck.
• You want to build confidence, discipline and resilience that lasts.
• You're ready to stop relying on motivation and start understanding yourself.

🌱 **Ready to Break the Cycle?**
You don't need another promise to start over on Monday. You need a better understanding of what gets in your way and how you can respond differently.

💡 If you're ready to explore the psychology behind your habits and discover new ways to move closer to your goals, join us for this masterclass and take the next step toward making meaningful changes in your life.

**Reserve your place and join the conversation!**
