b5a48cf6-75cb-4f15-8ed3-fe91720df62d,,How To Build A Top 1% Pitch Deck with Open VC,Investors are pissed off with decks right now. This is because founders are creating AI slop. Learn how to create the perfect deck with Shaun Gold from OpenVC and Mercedes Bankston from Loyal VC.…,"Investors are pissed off with decks right now. This is because founders are creating AI slop. **Learn how to create the perfect deck with Shaun Gold from OpenVC and Mercedes Bankston from Loyal VC**. Then, for sixty seconds, you pitch. Everyone else in the room learns from your mistake so they do not have to make it themselves. Any stage counts, including an idea you have never said out loud. **Register now and bring it (https://fi.co/e/407499/meetup)**.

**❯ Featured Mentors:**

• Shaun Gold (Chief Evangelist, OpenVC)
• Mercedes Bankston (Venture Partner, Loyal VC)

**❯ What You'll Learn:**

• How to create an excellent deck
• How to avoid the AI slop
• How to open a pitch so the room knows what you do in one sentence;
• The structure investors and mentors expect, in the order they expect it;
• How to talk about traction when you have none;
• The mistake most founders make at this stage, and the fix;
• How to take feedback in the room without arguing with it.

**❯ Who Should Attend:**

• Founders preparing to pitch investors, mentors, or an accelerator;
• Founders not getting anywhere with VCs
• Idea-stage founders who have never pitched to strangers;
• Anyone who has pitched and could not tell why it did not land;
• People who want to learn by watching others get honest feedback.

