Whether you’re getting excited or growing concerned, come to this AI peer support session for working designers, researchers and product people. We won’t have any expert teachings for you (this is not another AI masterclass) but you WILL be able to say “hey, this is what I’m facing.”

Moan, inspire, fret, reassure - it’s all welcome, and there will be learnings to be shared.

**This session is exactly where we are living right now - the messy middle of our careers. Come join us.**

