db0f26fd-b423-4607-bf5c-c9ee472e684d,,What Is Your Startup Worth: Valuation Basics for Founders [ONLINE],"In this session we'll walk through how early-stage companies are valued, the numbers investors look at, and how to estimate a range for your own business.","In this session we'll walk through how early-stage companies are valued, the numbers investors look at, and how to estimate a range for your own business.

