4538de75-9c7b-4d58-8f3c-f654764d1bf3,,"Tech Startups in the Pub, Shoreditch - Relaxed Networking",🍻 Join Us for Tech Startups in the Pub! 🍻,"🍻 **Join Us for Tech Startups in the Pub!** 🍻
Hey there! 🌟
We'd love for you to join us for our next edition of *Tech Startups in the Pub*. It's a relaxed evening at The Windmill, our go-to spot for tech chats and good vibes. We have been running for 3.5 years, and it's always a joy to see familiar faces and meet new folks.
Whether you're a regular, a tech founder, an enthusiast, a budding entrepreneur, or simply curious about the tech scene, you'll fit right in. This isn't about panels or pitching, just good old-fashioned networking with like-minded people over a drink (and maybe some pizza) on a Friday evening.
📍 **Where:** The Windmill, 27 Tabernacle St, Shoreditch, London EC2A 4DE
🕕 **When:** From 6 PM on the 3rd Friday of every month!
**House Rules:**

• Find Oliver, Pedro, Rob, or the other Rob (or anyone in a burgundy T-shirt) to introduce yourself so we can welcome you properly. The pub isn't reserved exclusively for us, so we don't want you mingling with someone's birthday party by mistake!
• No hard selling or heavy pitching. This is a chill, friendly after-work get-together.
• Not drinking? No worries! You're more than welcome to come hang out and enjoy the conversation.

Mark your calendar and come down for some fun tech talk. See you there!",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/0/1/5/highres_535148213.jpeg,2026-11-20 18:00:00+00,2026-11-20 22:00:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,The Windmill in the City,27 Tabernacle Street,London,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{technology,entrepreneurship,socialising}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/tech-startups-in-the-pub-relaxed-networking/events/312111859/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/tech-startups-in-the-pub-relaxed-networking/events/312111859/,event_312111859@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.493162+00,,,meetup:tech-startups-in-the-pub-relaxed-networking:tech startups in the pub shoreditch relaxed networking,"Every 3rd Friday of the month until January 1, 2027",f,GB
83ad21b5-5e93-4a1f-b36b-549637c6a6cc,,🎃🎬 PRINCE CHARLES CINEMA: HALLOWEEN QUIZ NIGHT,✏️ Think you’re the ultimate horror buff? Let’s find out!,"***✏️ Think you’re the ultimate horror buff? Let’s find out!***

**Hey guys** 👋 It’s time to put our cinematic horror knowledge to the tes**t**, like we do every year. If you haven’t been to this before, it’s pretty awesome. It’s hosted by our friend **Chevy McLaren**, who is a full-blown presenter and so much fun.

This quiz is a whole celebration of cinematic chaos and a wild night of **cult classics**, **horror favourites** and **endless movie trivia**, all inside the fantastic cult venue that is the **Prince Charles Cinema**, which we have to say is our favourite.

Beyond this, **expect** **limited-edition PCC merch**, **free cinema tickets**, **exclusive prizes**, **live performances**, **bonkers audience games** and loads of laughter! You can come alone or bring someone else. Either way, you’ll be fine because you’ll be with us. And they say there’s allegedly safety in numbers on Halloween. 🎃

**The Meetup:** We’ll warm up first at the **Victory House Wine Bar** (next to the cinema) at **7:30 pm**. Then at **8:15 pm**, we’ll head over to the **Prince Charles Cinema**. We’ll need to queue as there are no assigned seats, and we intend to get as near to the front as possible.

**Then at around 10:45 pm**, we’ll stick around for the quiz highlights and see who wins what. Maybe you’ll finally win that **cursed dol**l you’ve always wanted. Who knows? **You’ll also find the** **full ticket information, cinema address and map down below**, so you won’t get lost.

So grab a drink, don’t be afraid, and prepare to scream, guess, act and laugh your way through one of the most chaotic and iconic quiz nights in London.

**We’ll see you guys there!**
**Tom & Jonny**

🗓 **SCHEDULE BREAKDOWN**

• **7:30 PM:** Drinks (Victory House Wine Bar)
• **8:30 PM:** Quiz
• **10:45 PM:** Quiz Highlights

