• **Price:** From £11:00
• **Members Price**: £8.50
• **Tickets**: Prince Charles Cinema (https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627852/)

📍**VENUE ADDRESS**

• **Victory House Wine Bar:** 14 Leicester Pl, London WC2H 7BZ
• **Prince Charles Cinema:** 7 Leicester Pl, London WC2H 7BY

