• f). **Venue Address:**
Cranford Community College Sports Hall,
High Street, Cranford, TW5 9PD
• g). Please RSVP if you are attending the Badminton Club
• h). Please ensure that you update your RSVP status ASAP if for any reason you are unable to attend the badminton club so the next member on the wait list can attend. **(If you cancel your RSVP last minute, we will not charge you).**

If for any reason you cannot RSVP on meetup. Please send Harry a text on 0771 182 4977 with your name to state you will be attending badminton and you will be added as a guest on meetup.

