f464b6c2-3c6f-413f-ae97-7b269f4ab64c,,The AI-Built Business That Works While You Don’t,What if your business ran seamlessly without you?,"What if your business ran seamlessly without you?

Imagine AI agents handling your marketing, publishing content, capturing leads, and closing sales 24/7.

This webinar is a live look inside a complete, automated business system we can build *for* you.
You’ll see a fully connected system featuring:
**- AI Workforce:** Automated campaign creation and hands-free social posting.
**- AI Sales Advisor:** Trained to answer objections and recommend products.
**- Turnkey Infrastructure:** Ready-to-sell digital courses, lead magnets, and automated subscriber capture.

Our core digital products have already driven over £700,000 in sales. You don't need to master marketing, tech, or automation to own a scalable online business — we build the infrastructure, you stay the owner.

Stop spending months learning. Start seeing what happens when AI becomes your workforce.

**About the speaker**

Before launching his online coaching business, Paul spent 20 years in education recruitment, building a multi-million-pound business from the ground up. He recruited and trained high-performing teams and led international recruitment initiatives across the globe. Drawing on his sales background and the guidance of mentors along the way, Paul moved from the corporate world into a digital nomad lifestyle, now running his business from wherever he happens to be. His focus is on helping others do the same - sharing the strategies, tools, and systems he uses to build income on social media, primarily LinkedIn.

