2932f683-533a-4143-b375-cdde473ab9ab,,Beginner-Friendly Foosball Social at The 411,"Looking for a fun, social activity in London? Come and play foosball with London Table Football at The 411.","Looking for a fun, social activity in London? Come and play foosball with London Table Football at The 411.

Complete beginners are welcome. You can come alone, you do not need a playing partner and we will explain everything you need to know.

WHAT TO EXPECT

• Casual games with players of different levels
• A friendly host to welcome and introduce you
• Help learning the basic rules and techniques
• Opportunities to change partners and meet people
• No commitment to attend every week

ARRIVING FOR THE FIRST TIME

Please arrive at any time from 6:30pm and ask for Miguel, the London Table Football host. Tell them that it is your first session and they will help you join the games.

PRICE

There is no entry fee. The tables take contactless-card payments.

VENUE

The 411
411 St John St, London, EC1V 4AB
Nearest station: Angel

Look for the London Table Football group beside the foosball tables.

A Meetup RSVP is sufficient for this social session. If your plans change, please update your RSVP so we know how many people to expect.

Find all London Table Football events at www.londontablefootball.com (http://www.londontablefootball.com/).",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/7/f/e/1/highres_536252737.jpeg,2026-11-03 19:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,The 411 London,"411 St John St, London EC1V 4AB, UK",London,c06699ed-62e0-4957-bcb4-080c5271da9a,"{sport,fitness,socialising}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/london-foosball/events/316978980/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-28 03:21:15.128928+00,source:cba1b9d2-d09d-4c19-a89e-50bdbe5525a0,https://www.meetup.com/london-foosball/events/316978980/,event_316978980@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:20:38.34+00,,2026-10-28 03:21:15.128928+00,2026-10-28 03:21:18.144659+00,,,meetup:london-foosball:beginner friendly foosball social at the 411,"Every week on Tuesday until March 21, 2027",f,GB
a5b838bf-72fd-403c-acbe-27ea31e6a4f9,,Drop-in Saturday Games & Social @ The Thirsty Bear,"If you're looking for a laid back Saturday playing some board games and talking nerd stuff in a pub with some awesome people, this is the meetup for you! Whether you're new to London or just want to…","If you're looking for a laid back Saturday playing some board games and talking nerd stuff in a pub with some awesome people, this is the meetup for you! Whether you're new to London or just want to get some long-lost in-person socialisation, we're a friendly community and welcome you all.

**What to expect:** We officially play from **2 PM to 7 PM**, but we keep it casual. Show up when you can, and stay as long as you like. If you’re having a good time, there’s usually a group that stays late for a few extra pints and chat.

**Some house rules:**

• We aim to ensure these events are friendly, welcoming and safe, and so we ask you abide by our Code of Conduct (https://drive.google.com/file/d/1YEl0gv61SkBFN-YF6fyVvuQYicWbWhRL/view?usp=drive_link)
• We have a community box of games we keep in the pub, but please feel welcome to bring your own games along. Just be prepared to teach us how to play!
• We don't charge a cover fee, so please help support the pub by ordering food and drink throughout the afternoon.
• Please keep your RSVPs updated so we can manage numbers and ensure we can reserve enough tables.",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792898435/orbit/event-covers/sources/zitey6zvytfibiwyu13u.jpg,2026-12-26 14:00:00+00,2026-12-26 19:00:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,The Thirsty Bear,"62 Stamford Street, London, SE1 9LX",London,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,socialising}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/overboardlondon/events/314808396/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:46:36.725985+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/overboardlondon/events/314808396/,event_314808396@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:19:10.809+00,,2026-10-22 19:46:36.725985+00,2026-10-28 03:19:47.193092+00,,,meetup:overboardlondon:drop in saturday games social the thirsty bear,"Every week on Saturday until December 31, 2027",f,GB
