bd561b48-2c97-4a81-b31d-5fb6791f2041,,Live: Breaking an AI-Built App in 30 Minutes — for CTOs and Founders,Your team releases faster with AI coding tools. But who checks what those tools leave behind?,"Your team releases faster with AI coding tools. But who checks what those tools leave behind?

In this 45-minute online session I will take an app built with AI tools and break it live, step by step. You will see how API keys are pulled out of an installed app, how one user can read another user's data through a badly configured backend, and what an attacker finds in data stored on the phone.

Then we turn it round: five checks you can ask your team to run on Monday, and the questions to ask before you sign off the next release.

WHO IT IS FOR
CTOs, technical founders, heads of engineering and product leads who are accountable for releases and customer data. This is not a beginner's coding class; no setup is needed.

WHAT YOU WILL TAKE AWAY
• The five security faults that appear again and again in AI-built mobile apps
• A one-page checklist for your team, sent after the session
• The option to book a free 15-minute scan of your own app

PROGRAMME
12:30 Why AI-written code breaks in the same places
12:35 Live demo: from installed app to leaked data
13:05 Five checks to ask your team for
13:10 Questions

ABOUT THE SPEAKER
Sergii Koval: iOS and macOS developer for 17 years, specialising in mobile security (penetration testing, OWASP Mobile, static and binary analysis). Author of ""Secure Development of iOS and macOS Applications"". Runs security workshops in Luxembourg for teams building with AI tools.

PRACTICAL DETAILS
• Online. The link is sent to registered attendees on the day.
• Limited to 50 places, so that every question gets a proper answer.
• Please register with your role and company.
• The demo uses an app built for this purpose; no real company's app is attacked.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/b/8/2/highres_536632098.jpeg,2026-11-13 11:30:00+00,,Europe/Luxembourg,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{technology,entrepreneurship,ai}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/luxembourg-vibe-coding-meetup-group/events/317009427/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:16:55.807095+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/luxembourg-vibe-coding-meetup-group/events/317009427/,event_317009427@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-21 22:16:55.807095+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.689062+00,,,,,f,
