1db1e20e-1898-4b87-b2ee-755c547b3783,,"Study Group: The Psychology of Software Teams, Chapter 5","Join us for the next session of our study group, where we're reading and discussing Dr. Cat Hicks' book The Psychology of Software Teams.","Join us for the next session of our study group, where we're reading and discussing Dr. Cat Hicks' book *The Psychology of Software Teams*.
Our topic for this session is **Chapter 5: Conflict or Coalitions?.**

This is an informal book club: we meet to share our thoughts, questions, and half-formed reactions to what we've read. Everyone is welcome, whatever your relationship to the software engineering world and however long you've been in it. The only preparation needed is reading the chapter for that session.
We'll shape the group and its format together, taking inspiration from the book club guide the author put together herself: https://catharsisinsight.com/book-club-guide

**About the series**
The current plan is to have one session per chapter and meet roughly every other week, giving everyone plenty of time to prepare. We also have a discord channel to keep the discussion going between the meetings: https://discord.gg/FApmy7zYkn

