7c8fba24-6f6a-4142-8988-6f0e8718692b,,Stop Sabotaging Your Relationships,"This webinar is for men and women who are smart, self-aware, and doing the work but still end up in the same painful relationship cycles.","This webinar is for men and women who are smart, self-aware, and doing the work but still end up in the same painful relationship cycles.

It’s for you if you’ve read the books, listened to the podcasts, maybe even done therapy or coaching, **yet still:**

• You keep attracting emotionally unavailable partners… or becoming one.
• Conflict escalates quickly or disappears into silence.
• You feel too much… or nothing at all.
• You crave connection but sabotage it when it gets close.
• You’re exhausted from being “the strong one” but don’t know how to soften.

Not because you’re doing something wrong.
You’re patterned.
But because old survival strategies may still be shaping how you relate - quietly, automatically, beneath awareness.

And patterns can be changed.

**We’ll look at:**

• why awareness alone doesn’t stop self-sabotage in love
• how the nervous system and subconscious drive attraction, attachment, and choice
• why patterns repeat even when you “know better”
• what actually changes when emotional safety is restored from the inside out

This isn’t a motivational talk or a list of techniques.
It’s a grounded, reflective space to understand *why* these patterns exist and how they begin to dissolve.

**What You’ll Gain From This Webinar**
By the end of the session, you’ll have:

• clearer insight into the patterns that have been undermining your relationships
• a deeper sense of self-trust and inner steadiness
• an understanding of what emotional safety really feels like in your body
• greater clarity around the kind of relationship that genuinely aligns with you
• a felt sense of what secure, grounded love could look like for *you*

For many people, this alone creates a noticeable shift, less overthinking, more calm, more clarity.

**You don’t need to be in a relationship to attend.**

You just need a willingness to look honestly and kindly at what’s been shaping your experience.

**Your Invitation**
There’s no pressure and no expectation to join anything afterward.
This webinar is simply a space to **see clearly** and decide from there.

If this speaks to you, that’s often the signal worth listening to.

**Reserve your spot now**

With warmth,
