259784d2-fee3-4d55-be76-37e49c6d701c,,Build an AI Event Planner Agent with Copilot Studio & Dataverse,What if an AI agent could plan the perfect event—and recommend products based on what is actually available?,"What if an AI agent could plan the perfect event—and recommend products based on what is actually available?

