41a33eaf-d8cf-43da-9fc1-b8480f0714b3,,Break Free from Overthinking & People-Please: Rewire for Confidence,"If you struggle with overthinking, saying “yes” when you mean “no,” keeping the peace, or carrying everyone else’s emotions…","If you struggle with overthinking, saying “yes” when you mean “no,” keeping the peace, or carrying everyone else’s emotions…

You’re not “too sensitive.” You’re running an old survival program.
You learned, very young, that shrinking yourself kept you safe.

But today, that same pattern is **costing** you:

• your confidence
• your boundaries
• your relationships
• your peace
• your identity

And no amount of journaling, affirmations, or talking about it fixes programming that lives deeper than thought.

**That’s why rewiring your subconscious mind works.**

Because instead of teaching you more information, we rewire the program that’s been running your life.

This **free live webinar** is for the high-achieving, big-hearted woman who’s tired of living in her head… and is finally ready to feel safe in her body again.

**Here’s What You’ll Learn (and FEEL):**
**1. The exact subconscious pattern that drives your overthinking and people-pleasing**
You’ll see why you’ve been stuck and **why it’s not your fault**.
**2. Why boundaries feel terrifying and how to make them effortless**
(Not with confidence tips… but with rewiring.)
**3. The real reason you disappear, silence yourself, or second-guess everything**
And how to break that loop in real time.
**4. A short guided RTT® hypnosis designed to create an immediate emotional shift**

This isn’t a pep talk.
