866e418d-2d26-43a8-8165-e32f5845b522,,How to Future-proof Your UTM Taxonomy,Our guest speaker this month is Alex Holman-Butt from Uplifter!,"Our guest speaker this month is Alex Holman-Butt from Uplifter!

Is your UTM taxonomy built for the future, or is it holding your marketing reporting back?

As marketing teams grow, channels multiply and campaign strategies evolve, inconsistent UTM naming conventions can quickly create reporting chaos. What starts as a simple spreadsheet can become a complex mix of inconsistent campaign names, tracking errors and unreliable analytics data.

In this masterclass, we'll explore how to design, implement and maintain a future-proof UTM taxonomy that scales with your business, supports multiple teams and agencies, and delivers consistent, actionable marketing data.

We'll cover the essential principles of UTM governance, common taxonomy mistakes and how to establish naming conventions that work across channels, platforms and campaigns.

You'll also discover how a link management platform can simplify UTM governance, automate campaign link creation and help marketing teams maintain data consistency without relying on complicated spreadsheets.

Whether you're starting from scratch or looking to improve an existing taxonomy, this webinar will give you a practical framework for building a UTM strategy that stands the test of time.

What you'll learn:

• How to build a dream UTM taxonomy – based on years of experience seeing what works (and what doesn't)

• How to implement a UTM taxonomy – without drama and pushback

• How to maintain a UTM taxonomy – without colleagues and agencies going rogue

• How to integrate a UTM taxonomy – with your current (and future) MarTech, fit for an AI future.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/e/8/b/highres_536724203.jpeg,2026-11-10 16:00:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,{technology},,external,https://www.meetup.com/bristol-digital-analytics-meetup/events/317070934/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/bristol-digital-analytics-meetup/events/317070934/,event_317070934@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.689062+00,,,,,f,
