a5d42311-5b43-4293-a1d6-b3c9f73ac1d3,,"Tech, AI, FinTech & Start-ups Business Networking Event London","Tech, AI, FinTech & Start-ups Business Networking Event London","**Tech, AI, FinTech & Start-ups Business Networking Event London**
Welcome to Perspectivv, a community of entrepreneurs and business professionals like no other!

Unlike traditional networking events that lean towards a more formal approach, our events resemble more of a social setting as we believe this provides the most ideal atmosphere for young entrepreneurs to network with other like-minded individuals.

We have a fast growing community and are constantly striving to provide an inclusive environment that attracts a diverse range of people no matter what stage they’re at in their entrepreneurial journey.

So whether you're an established business owner, aspiring entrepreneur, business professional or simply just want to meet new people, this is the perfect opportunity for you to expand your network and make new connections.

**For this event we welcome those working across:**

• **Artificial Intelligence** – AI, Generative AI, Machine Learning and Automation
• **FinTech** – Digital Banking, Payments and Financial Technology
• **Start-ups & SaaS** – Startup Founders, Software Companies and Entrepreneurs
• **Cybersecurity** – Cyber Security, Information Security and Cloud Security
• **Blockchain & Web3** – Blockchain, Web3, Crypto and Decentralised Technology
• **Software & Data** – Software Development, Data Science, Cloud Computing and DevOps
• **Digital Business** – E-commerce, MarTech, AdTech and Digital Transformation
• **Emerging Technology** – HealthTech, PropTech, EdTech, ClimateTech, Robotics and IoT
• **Investment & Growth** – Venture Capital, Angel Investors, Tech Investors and Business Growth

**Event details:**

• Date: November 13th, 2026
• Time: 19:00 - 21:30
• Venue: The Listing
• Address: 27 Bush Ln, London EC4R 0AA

Follow us on Instagram to join our community and stay up to date with all the latest from @perspectivv_ltd (https://www.instagram.com/perspectivv_ltd/)

Please be advised that tickets are sold on other ticketing platforms outside of Meetup. You can expect approximately 30-40 attendees at each of our events.

