95527061-e712-42ce-98c4-d7ba48665f35,,AI Show & Tell: What Are You Building?,Bring something you’re currently working on and one problem you’re trying to solve.,"Bring something you’re currently working on and one problem you’re trying to solve.

This is a casual **AI Show & Tell** session designed for builders, business owners, creatives, and curious minds who want to explore what’s possible with AI, automation, and modern tools.

Each person will have up to 5 minutes to share:
• What they’re building
• What tools or workflows they’re using
• What’s working
• Where they’re stuck or need ideas

Projects can be anything from automations, websites, content systems, internal tools, AI agents, workflows, marketing systems, dashboards, apps, experiments, or even early-stage ideas.

After each share, we’ll roundtable it together.. asking questions, brainstorming solutions, sharing tools/resources, and helping each other think through challenges in a collaborative and low-pressure environment.

*The goal isn’t perfection. It’s learning, experimenting, getting inspired, and seeing the real-world potential of AI and automation through actual projects people are building right now.*",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792621057/orbit/event-covers/sources/ono7jh8rlukghreqepyn.jpg,2026-11-06 16:00:00+00,2026-11-06 17:00:00+00,Europe/Amsterdam,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{technology,ai,entrepreneurship,marketing}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/the-innovative-compass-lab/events/314851301/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:16:55.807095+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/the-innovative-compass-lab/events/314851301/,event_314851301@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-21 22:16:55.807095+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.689062+00,,,meetup:the-innovative-compass-lab:ai show tell what are you building,"Every 1st Friday of the month until November 16, 2026",f,
