b6fd32a8-2aaa-4d25-9307-01cafc08b07a,,🎃🎬 HALLOWEEN MARATHON + HISTORY OF MICHAEL MYERS,"🎃🔪 A blank, pale, emotionless face. The blackest eyes... the DEVIL’S eyes!","🎃🔪 ***A blank, pale, emotionless face. The blackest eyes... the DEVIL’S eyes!***

👋 **Hey, what's going on guys!** Welcome to **The Night Shift of Fun!** This Halloween we're going back to **Haddonfield** for an all-night journey through the **Original Halloween Timeline**, following **Michael Myers** from **The Night He Came Home** through the increasingly strange and convolute sequels that took **The Shape** all the way to the **Curse of Thorn (https://evil.fandom.com/wiki/Curse_of_Thorn)**.

If you're a **Halloween virgin**, then here's what you need to know. The **Original Haddonfield Timeline** consists of **Halloween (1978) (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8NrREGTS-Ws)**, **Halloween II (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Lg_NVNvq9wI),** **Halloween 4: The Return of Michael Myers (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=27PbiWvVyUA)**, **Halloween 5: The Revenge of Michael Myres (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ilHM_qpy-zM)** and **Halloween: The Curse of Michael Myers (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HLb6eufH_7o)**.

As a **bonus chapter**, we'll also be watching the weird middle child, **Halloween III: Season of the Witch (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xBKOP5MSmJA).** It may have absolutely nothing to do with **Michael Myers**, but it's an effing cult classic, and **Silver Shamrock** deserves its moment.☘️

**And before you ask:** this marathon does not include **Halloween H20 (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EmvTLN0OoNI),** which is part of the **Revenge of Laurie Strode timeline**, any of the **Rob Zombie remake movies (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=75CFtwn1CEU)**, or the **David Gordon Green trilogy (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DQ-3we7p3rc)**, as they all belong to completely different timelines. Yes, the Halloween universe is **bloody complicated**, but that's half the bloody fun!

🎃 **The Meetup**:
We'll meet at **Joshua's Tavern at The Londoner at 9:00 pm** where we'll take deep dive into the **History of Michael Myers (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DQ-3we7p3rc)** (spoiler-free). Feel free to bring out your scariest or quirkiest Halloween costume!

Then at around **10:00 pm**, we'll head over to the legendary **Prince Charles Cinema**, where the marathon will be playing on both screens, one starting at **10:15 pm** and the other at **10:45 pm**. We've chosen the **front row of Screen 2**, but feel free to choose whichever screen you prefer, as we'll regroup during the breaks to score the films and share our thoughts. You’ll also find the **full ticket information, cinema address and map down below**, so you won’t get lost.

**After the marathon**, if you survive, that is, we'll regroup for one final gallop for coffee, a group pic and some final thoughts before heading home to safety. ***Then finally, you will come to realise that what is living behind those eyes is purely and simply... EVIL!***

So jump aboard the **Halloween Express**, settle in, stay awake and whatever you do... **don't assume the Boogeyman is dead.**

🎃 **See you guys there... if you dare.**
~ **Jonny, Tom & Dar**

**📸 FOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM**

• 👉 **Heads up,** you can follow me **jonnyhideout (https://www.instagram.com/jonnyhideout/)** | **Tom Harris (https://www.instagram.com/the_motion_picture_blogger/)**| **Darinka (https://www.instagram.com/darikforme/)** or our club **thehideoutmax (https://www.instagram.com/thehideoutmax/)** on **instagram** for fun updates.

🗓 **SCHEDULE BREAKDOWN**

• **9:00 PM:** History of Michael Myres (Joshuas Tavern)
• **10:00 PM:** Marathon (Prince Charles Cinema)
• **10:10 AM:** Survival & Moment of Truth

📱**STAY CONNECTED**

• Join our WhatsApp or Telegram groups (available by request), or hop onto our **WhatsApp Channel (https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaDvGuK0AgW8KPxOnG2V)** or **Telegram Channel (https://t.me/thehideoutuk)** for quiet updates without the chat. Whatever you prefer!

🎬 **PLOT DETAILS**

• *The* Halloween *franchise defined the slasher genre by introducing Michael Myers, the unstoppable embodiment of pure evil. The original run follows his relentless hunt for Laurie Strode* through the eerie, synth-driven atmosphere of Haddonfield. Franchise Trailer (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mw8X2fd6hc8)

🎟️ **BOOKING INFORMATION**

• **Price:** From £27:50
• **Members Price**: £25.00
• **Tickets**: Prince Charles Cinema (Screen 2) (https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627796/)
• **Tickets**: Prince Charles Cinema (Screen 1) (https://princecharlescinema.com/prince-charles-cinema/booknow/31627518/)

📍**VENUE ADDRESS**

• **Joshuas Tavern:** 38 Leicester Square, London WC2H 7DX
• **Prince Charles Cinema:** 7 Leicester Pl, London WC2H 7BY

🔊 **HOW WE ROLL**

• Have fun, be respectful, and no abuse of any kind
• Three-time no-show limit (applies after your first attended event), please update your RSVP if your plans change
• This group is for over-18s only

