1eef77bb-f902-43fc-ac8d-42690625ff1e,,🏸⚔️SATURDAY - Smash Knights⚔️🏸 5:20pm - 2h badminton,"Join our Saturday badminton session from 5:20pm to 7:20pm at Richard Challoner School, New Malden, KT3 5PE!","Join our Saturday badminton session from 5:20pm to 7:20pm at Richard Challoner School, New Malden, KT3 5PE!

This is a mixed session open to all levels and genders. Our group is part of a social comunity playing in other locations as well. Some sessions are overbooked via Watsap so you won't find them on Meetup.

One of the three courts will be used for coaching by our coach Ken. Feel free to enquire if you need more details on how to join that one.

Our regulars already joined us on WhatsApp at the time of posting this event.

Playing with good quality feathers shuttles and the fee is £8.5 for 2 hours.

To give everyone enough play time we are limiting the number of players to not more than 5-6 per each court.

Please make sure you are using badminton shoes to avoid injuries and also to not leave black marks on the floor.

