102996d8-6ed4-4684-a5d1-33178d9aec39,,Intelligent Agile (IA) #8,"An Ongoing, Online Meetup Series (https://tobiasmayer.uk/edu/ia)","**An Ongoing, Online Meetup Series (https://tobiasmayer.uk/edu/ia)**

**Session 8** guest speaker: **Alan Cyment (https://www.linkedin.com/in/acyment/)**

**Composting Agility — part2**
*What happens to teams, post-Agile?*
—
Alan Cyment continues to explore a post-Agile world, this time looking specifically at the concept of ""team"". Full description coming soon...
—
**Bio**
Alan works with executives, transformation leaders, and teams when organisational friction slows coordination, blurs priorities, and makes adaptation more costly than it needs to be.
—

**Description of this series**
Agile didn’t promise speed. It promised sustainability.
The original Agile Movement was never about pumping out code at breakneck speed. It was about building robust, adaptable software and creating healthier, human-centred workplaces. It promised autonomy, trust, and environments where people were empowered to make meaningful decisions.
For the most part, we missed that mark.
Over the last two decades, workers were subjected to micromanagement, rigid tools, and metric tracking. Managers, too, were trapped in a system few truly understood. While delivery pipelines improved, the human potential latent within our organisations remained largely untapped.

**Read the full description here: Intelligent Agile (https://tobiasmayer.uk/edu/ia).**

Join us to explore how we can finally fulfil the original promise of Agile—creating exceptional products in truly human-centric environments.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/a/4/4/highres_536290820.jpeg,2026-11-19 13:00:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,{technology},,external,https://www.meetup.com/agile-conversations/events/316816169/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/agile-conversations/events/316816169/,event_316816169@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-22 19:56:05.832408+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.689062+00,,,,,f,
