2a0617ee-8a9e-4368-9add-9a8b1d939100,,🤝 Founders Meetup by F4F,Founders for Founders brings you Real conversations for Entrepreneurs building Startups around the world. Every Week.,"***Founders for Founders* brings you Real conversations for Entrepreneurs building Startups around the world. Every Week.**
*Talk it out, build it better.*

• This is a special FREE weekly event for founders around the world: you can check out The Founders for Founders Website (https://f4f.vc/) for more info.

Building something is a rollercoaster, and it's a whole lot better with people who *get it*. Founders for Founders is our weekly get-together where you meet other entrepreneurs, talk through what you're working on, and leave with fresh ideas and new connections.
Here's how it works:

• **⏱️ One hour, once a week:** an easy, energising break in your week
• **🤝 Meet 4 different founders:** we personally put you in touch with four others, so every conversation counts
• **💬 Real talk (English):** share your ideas, talk through your blockers, and get honest opinions from people who've been there
• **🌱 Connections that last:** many of the founders you meet become sounding boards, collaborators, and friends long after the hour is up

**Talk it out, build it better.**

This is a FREE event. No one to impress, just peers who *get it*.
Whether you're deep in the build, just starting out, or somewhere in between, for-profit, nonprofit, or a project you believe in, you're welcome here.

**Where:** We meet on SpeakDuo (https://speakduo.onelink.me/DlwG/meetup), built for live online group events with advanced matching, so you're paired with the right founders for focused, meaningful conversations instead of getting lost in a crowded call.

**RSVP to save your spot:** bring what you're working on, and let's
unite. You can also check upcoming events at f4f.vc/events (http://f4f.vc/events). 🚀",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/3/0/f/highres_535297647.jpeg,2026-10-27 18:00:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,entrepreneurship,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/founders-london/events/316885303/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/founders-london/events/316885303/,event_316885303@meetup.com,,2026-10-27 03:21:52.243+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,2026-10-27 03:22:31.0888+00,,,meetup:founders-london:founders meetup by f4f,"Every week on Tuesday until July 11, 2031",f,
7f4a04d8-ca75-4077-b814-c795ddef6dc2,,"Knit, crochet, stitch and chat!",Welcome! We hope you'll join us!,"Welcome! We hope you'll join us!

Please bring your current project and grab a chair!

We’re an informal group, not a class, and there’s no fee to attend. If you're able, please do order a drink or snack at the bar...The Canbury Arms welcomes our group every Monday evening and we like to show our appreciation!

If you are experiencing symptoms related to Covid-19, please do not attend the event. We’ll be very happy to welcome you at the next one!

Find us:

We meet in the restaurant side of the pub. Upon entering from the main door on Canbury Park Rd, veer to the right and make your way into the dining room; we sit at the banquette tables along the wall to the right. If in doubt, please ask at the bar! You can order drinks and snacks at the bar or use the 'Young's - On Tap' app.

Christine teaches beginning knitting, intermediate/advanced knitting techniques, and beginning crochet. If you would like a private lesson for yourself or your small group, please get in touch for details. Currently, Christine is only teaching in a private capacity.

Chat with us on Discord:

Our group has a Discord server for staying in touch outside of our regular Monday meets! If you are a current or past member who attends in-person meet-ups, and you're interested in even more yarny chat, this is the place to join in! Contact Christine or Aisha for an invite.

Accessibility:

We meet in the restaurant side of The Canbury Arms, which is wheelchair accessible. If you have any questions, please do send Christine a DM!",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1793071203/orbit/event-covers/sources/u3hkwuway1ii8idkzlyw.jpg,2026-12-14 17:30:00+00,2026-12-14 19:30:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,The Canbury Arms Kingston,49 Canbury Park Road,Kingston upon Thames,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,hobbies,socialising}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/kingstonknittingbee/events/312279201/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:46:36.725985+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/kingstonknittingbee/events/312279201/,event_312279201@meetup.com,,2026-10-27 03:19:10.711+00,,2026-10-22 19:46:36.725985+00,2026-10-27 03:20:39.163856+00,,,meetup:kingstonknittingbee:knit crochet stitch and chat,"Every week on Monday until May 31, 2027",f,GB
