aa5aaae1-5cfd-47df-8fb0-51afe920b95e,,"Keep, Watch, Skip: Navigating MCPs, AI Moderation & Digital Twins",✨Please register here (https://eu01web.zoom.us/webinar/register/4817925095644/WN_e6cTIvmdQ3yM4lLCYwJuzA) to get your unique link for the event!✨,"**✨Please register here (https://eu01web.zoom.us/webinar/register/4817925095644/WN_e6cTIvmdQ3yM4lLCYwJuzA) to get your unique link for the event!✨**

AI in UX research has moved fast this year. New tools promise to make research quicker, easier, and more scalable, but it’s not always easy to tell what’s genuinely useful, what’s still experimental, and where there are risks.

Alina Bezchotnikova (https://www.linkedin.com/in/alina-bezchotnikova/)'s dug into the literature and carried out her own experiments to see what actually holds up among the biggest AI trends shaping UX research in 2026.

From AI moderation and digital twins to MCPs and new ways of connecting AI to research workflows. In this session, you’ll learn:

• What’s real (and what’s still hype) with AI moderation and digital twins
• Practical MCP workflows for your research
• What Alina’s data-leak experiment revealed
• The legal gray areas around some of these tools

If you’re using AI in your research, this session will help you use it smarter and more safely.

✨You can also register here (https://eu01web.zoom.us/webinar/register/4817925095644/WN_e6cTIvmdQ3yM4lLCYwJuzA) ✨ We're looking forward to seeing you!

All you need to know:
📅 Date: November 18th, 2026
🕖 Time: 5 pm CET / 11 am ET
🗣️ Language: English

Condens UX Meetups cater to both seasoned research practitioners and beginners eager to explore UX research. It's also an opportunity to connect with other UX practitioners.

If you’re curious to explore Condens, the collaborative tool designed for storing, analyzing, and sharing user research data, you can check out our website: https://condens.io/.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/f/5/f/highres_536708031.jpeg,2026-11-18 16:00:00+00,,Europe/Berlin,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{technology,ai}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/ux-research-munich/events/317060507/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:16:55.807095+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/ux-research-munich/events/317060507/,event_317060507@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-21 22:16:55.807095+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.689062+00,,,,,f,
