c33c437d-3da2-446e-8d31-184aa1390834,,Silver Tuesdays Nordic Walking in Brockwell Park,"Over the last nine years, Silverfit has been able to offer exercise to everyone over 50 in Brockwell Park. Together with Silverfit, I have done my best to keep the exercise fun for everyone, no…","Over the last nine years, Silverfit has been able to offer exercise to everyone over 50 in Brockwell Park. Together with Silverfit, I have done my best to keep the exercise fun for everyone, no matter if you are fit or not so fit, strong or not so strong, sporty or not so sporty.
And, over all, I think we have done that pretty well! We have had some glorious years, and we made many, many friends over that time.
Silverfit managed to keep it going through the good times and the hard Covid years, but unfortunately, the reality of the current economic climate is hitting Silverfit hard. Many councils and charities that have supported Silverfit over the years have stopped funding, and without funding, Silverfit just simply cannot keep going.
Recently, they have had to take the hard decision to cut quite a number of their activities, and unfortunately, Nordic Walking in Brockwell park is one of the sessions that needs to be stopped.
Yesterday afternoon was our last session for Silverfit.
But…. I aim to keep your Tuesday walk going!
So many of you love our Tuesday session, and it would just be too sad to stop completely.
I would like to keep the Silver Tuesday session going under my own company, Fit and Happy Outdoors.
Sadly, I cannot do this for free, as I do need to make a living. But in order to keep this session available for everyone, I plan to keep our Tuesday afternoon session at a highly reduced rate compared to my normal rates.
New rates for our Silver Tuesday walks:
10 sessions for £45 (my normal rate is 10 sessions for £90).
For those of you who struggle financially, I am happy to reduce this rate to £30, or even offer it for free.
I can of course only do this if enough of you pay the normal rate, and I trust you will only ask for a reduction if you really need it. As I said, I do this for my living, but I don’t want money to be the reason you miss out on the benefits of Nordic Walking and spending time with our lovely group of friends.
If you are already a member of Fit and Happy Outdoors and you pay monthly, then the Tuesday session is included in your fee. No extra payment is necessary (unless you’d like to sponsor someone who cannot pay)
How does it work?
1. Please email me at Ailien at Fitandhappyoutdoors dot com, and let me know if you agree with me sending you an invoice for the full rate, or if you need a reduced rate.
2. I will then send you an invoice with my bank details on it.
3. Once I have received your payment in my bank account, I will hand you a 10-session card at the first session I see you
4. Every time you come walking on Tuesday, I will stamp your card
5. Once you have walked 10 times, I will send you a new invoice for the next 10.
Payment: I really, really, prefer bank transfers.
If you really do not do bank transfers, then you can pay me in cash. No cheques please (I really try to avoid having to go to the bank, it is just too much hassle).
If you or a friend only comes once in a very blue moon, then they can pay £5 in cash for the session (only banknotes please. Help a girl out, I do enough weightlifting already 😊)
Are you a walk leader? You are always welcome and do not have to pay me. I am grateful for your help!
Do we still need to sign up?
1. Have your own poles? No need to sign up. But, if there is a weather warning, please check in with me as I might have to cancel and if I don’t know you are planning to come, I might not be able to tell you it’s cancelled
2. Happy to use the Meetup app, then sign up for your walk here? If you sign in, I will know you are planning to come, and it will be easy for me to let you know if I do need to cancel a session.
3. Need to borrow poles from me? Please text me ON THE DAY OF THE WALK to ask me to bring a set. My number is 078 078 3456 4. Just use normal text, no Whatsapp please, as I will probably miss your message.
Any questions? Feel free to reply to this email, or text me on the number above.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/8/9/9/highres_512766297.jpeg,2027-01-05 14:15:00+00,2027-01-05 15:45:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,"Brockwell Park, by park bench left of Herne Hill gate","Brockwell Park Entrance Near Herne Hill Gate/Norwood Road entrance, Norwood Rd",London,8827b689-2637-4245-8ba7-214b35948ea2,"{sport,fitness,travel}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/fit-and-happy-outdoors/events/hkztdtykccbhb/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,source:f26eb5d4-b239-4813-8e0c-3cf689eed4bd,https://www.meetup.com/fit-and-happy-outdoors/events/hkztdtykccbhb/,event_hkztdtykccbhb@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:30.379+00,,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,2026-10-28 03:22:55.486349+00,,,meetup:fit-and-happy-outdoors:silver tuesdays nordic walking in brockwell park,Every week on Tuesday,f,GB
e6fef20f-c4f2-4de4-bd16-05083fcc243c,,Introduction to R Shiny | Free One Hour Workshop,Introducing Datacove,"**Introducing Datacove**
Datacove (https://datacove.co.uk/) are a Data and Analytics Consultancy Team based in Brighton, with experience in founding many well-attended R & Python events. Plus, home of the International Data Intelligence Summit!
We work across multiple streams - from marketing and consumer analytics, to bespoke dashboards, process automation, and training!

**Introduction to R in Shiny**
Tuesday 24th November | Online | 14:00 - 15:00

Curious about how R can be used to create interactive dashboards and applications?

In this practical, beginner-friendly session, you’ll be introduced to Shiny and learn the foundations of building your own interactive app.

**What You'll Learn:**

• What Shiny is and how it fits into the R ecosystem
• The basic structure of a Shiny application, including UI and server
• How to create simple layouts, inputs and outputs
• How Shiny’s reactive programming works
• How to bring these elements together into a working application

By the end of the session, you’ll have the foundations needed to start building your own Shiny dashboards and applications, with an understanding of where to go next.

**Who This is For:**

• R users looking to explore Shiny
• Beginners interested in interactive dashboards
• Analysts and aspiring data professionals
• Anyone curious about building applications with R

Some familiarity with R is recommended, but no prior Shiny experience is required.

We look forward to seeing you there!",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/a/7/7/highres_536691831.jpeg,2026-11-24 14:00:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,4cece675-2670-4581-90e6-2b792576b047,{technology},,external,https://www.meetup.com/bristol-data-intelligence-network/events/317048568/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-26 03:23:35.811927+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/bristol-data-intelligence-network/events/317048568/,event_317048568@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-26 03:23:35.811927+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.689062+00,,,,,f,
3d634043-b539-4cc1-891d-1d47ed40e741,,HR Managers & Job Seekers — Meet Employers Hiring Now,"Job hunting in London shouldn't feel like sending your CV into a black hole. You spend hours tailoring applications, only to wait weeks for an automated reply. What if you could skip the application…","*Job hunting in London shouldn't feel like sending your CV into a black hole. You spend hours tailoring applications, only to wait weeks for an automated reply. What if you could skip the application queue entirely and put yourself directly in front of the person making the hiring call?*
**What the event is**
Speed NetworkNow cuts straight through the recruitment noise. We bring hiring London employers and ambitious professionals together in one room. Instead of wandering around an overwhelming job fair, you sit down for structured, timed one-to-one conversations designed to showcase your skills and line up formal interviews.
**👥 Who should attend**
Job seekers, HR managers, and qualified professionals looking for their next career move in London.

• Founders and hiring managers: Pitch directly to decision-makers who have live roles open in London right now.
• Internal recruiters and HR leads: Sit down with talent teams actively sourcing for tech, operations, marketing, and business vacancies.
• Driven professionals: Connect with peers navigating London's job market and swap actionable industry insights.

**🎟️ Your ticket includes**

• 60 minutes of structured, timed one-to-one conversations with hiring teams
• Snacks & drinks included during the break
• Open follow-up time to lock in interview dates before you leave

**Why attend**

• Bypass automated screening: Pitch your experience directly to real people instead of hoping an algorithm flags your CV.
• Target immediate vacancies: Speak with teams who need to hire today, not recruiters stockpiling resumes for the future.
• Lock in final interviews: Win over employers with your personality and walk away with agreed interview dates on your calendar.

**📅 Agenda**
3:30 – 3:45 PM | Arrival & Registration: Check in, grab your name badge, and settle into the room.
3:45 – 3:55 PM | Welcome & Format Briefing: Catch the ground rules and rotation plan from the Speed NetworkNow team before rounds begin.
