ae6e5643-732d-4799-9a97-0560270a8b25,,📸 COFFEE & CAMERAS • London ☕,Spots are limited — RSVP on Meetup to join us.,"Spots are limited — RSVP on Meetup to join us.

A monthly gathering for photographers, videographers, and creators who want to connect beyond the photo walks.

No walking. No pressure. Just good coffee, creative conversations, and new connections.

**Welcome to Take a Photo Walk Community.**
Connect with photographers, videographers, and creators. Beginners, enthusiasts, and pros — all are welcome.

For now, our meetups are community-led, so there’s no single host running everything.

We are looking for volunteers or hosts to help build the community in London.
👉 Apply to become a Community Host or Volunteer (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeKhDHXwV-Wf2F3WTOXJ9NvwHIaD7iB_cUP8R52GcoXduS7tw/viewform?usp=sharing&ouid=100889718372908702262)

**EVENT DETAILS**
Date: 31-10
Time: 3.30 – 5.00
Meeting Point: Ozone Coffee Roasters
Address: 11 Leonard St, London EC2A 4AQ, UK
Google Maps: Open meeting point on Google Maps (https://maps.app.goo.gl/2awxxv4NwyfW5o9p9)

**IMPORTANT**
• Free, community-led creative meetup.
• Punctuality helps so everyone can connect from the beginning.
• Success depends 100% on everyone's energy, collaboration, and positive attitude.

**CONNECT & UPDATES 📍**
• Join WhatsApp Group for Updates (https://wa.me/34661463049?text=Hi%21%20I%27d%20like%20to%20join%20the%20WhatsApp%20group%20for%20London)
• Waitlisted? Send us a message (https://wa.me/34661463049?text=Hi%21%20I%27d%20like%20to%20join%20I%27m%20waitlisted%20on%20London)
• Follow @takeaphotowalkcommunity on Instagram (https://www.instagram.com/takeaphotowalkcommunity)

**WHAT TO BRING**
• Smartphone, film camera, or digital camera.
• A project or idea you'd like to share (optional).

**ABOUT TAKE A PHOTO WALK**
Founded in Barcelona in July 2024, Take a Photo Walk connects photographers and creators through real-life meetups worldwide. London is part of the story 📸🌸

👉 Apply to become a Community Host or Volunteer (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeKhDHXwV-Wf2F3WTOXJ9NvwHIaD7iB_cUP8R52GcoXduS7tw/viewform?usp=sharing&ouid=100889718372908702262)",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/4/b/d/highres_536725789.jpeg,2027-02-27 15:30:00+00,2027-02-27 17:30:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,"Ozone Coffee Roasters, Shoreditch","11 Leonard St, London EC2A 4AQ, UK",London,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,creative,socialising,food}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/takeaphotowalklondon/events/hdfsbvykcdbkc/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:46:36.725985+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/takeaphotowalklondon/events/hdfsbvykcdbkc/,event_hdfsbvykcdbkc@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:19:10.809+00,,2026-10-22 19:46:36.725985+00,2026-10-28 03:19:47.193092+00,,,meetup:takeaphotowalklondon:coffee cameras london,"Every last Saturday of the month until April 21, 2027",f,GB
