0d70d715-147f-4681-b464-59a68a7a1fd7,,Pilates at Better Gym in Teddington,Advanced booking is required - find out more on our website https://www.silverfit.org.uk/teddington Meet Up is a means for promotion and not a way to sign up to this session.,"**Advanced booking is required** - find out more on our website https://www.silverfit.org.uk/teddington **Meet Up is a means for promotion and *not a way to sign up* to this session.**

