5ccd9eb4-2d4d-4e38-899c-7cbe7c25e500,,"Law, Property & Business - Business Networking Event in London, Holborn","Looking for a business networking event in London for property lawyers, solicitors, landlords, investors, developers and property professionals? Join us in the Holborn/Covent Garden area for a…","**Looking for a business networking event in London for property lawyers, solicitors, landlords, investors, developers and property professionals?** Join us in the **Holborn/Covent Garden area** for a quality networking evening bringing together people across **property, law and business**, hosted by digital business card platform GMax Card.
**What to Expect**

• **Connect with property solicitors, lawyers, landlords, investors, developers and property professionals** in a relaxed but purposeful setting - where conversations can lead to clients, referrals, partnerships and new opportunities.
• **Build valuable professional relationships across the property ecosystem** - from transactions, conveyancing and legal services to investment, development, finance and property management.
• Meet professionals whose work naturally overlaps across **property and law**, alongside business owners and professional advisers.
• A **lightly structured event** - not a formal, overcrowded conference, nor a random pub mingle.
• An **atmosphere that feels high-quality yet relaxed**, with space for real professional conversations.
• Hosts are there from the start to **help with introductions**.

**Who You'll Meet**

• Property and real estate solicitors
• Conveyancers and property legal professionals
• Commercial property lawyers
• Landlord & tenant and lease specialists
• Property developers and investors
• Residential and commercial landlords
• Estate agents, letting agents and block managers
• Surveyors, architects and planning consultants
• Mortgage brokers, bridging lenders and property finance professionals
• Accountants, tax advisers and other professional advisers
• PropTech and property service providers
• Business owners with property interests

Please note: our events are **theme-led rather than closed-sector events**, so you may also meet relevant professionals from adjacent areas such as finance, investment, business services, technology and entrepreneurship.

**How the Evening Flows**
18:30 - Arrival
19:00 - Short introductions
19:30 - Open networking
21:30 - Close
Hosts are there from the start to **help with introductions.**

**Venue - Sycamore Bar at Middle Eight Hotel**
A stylish, design-led bar inside the 5-star Middle Eight Hotel in central London. Located in the Covent Garden/Holborn area, just a short walk from Holborn, Covent Garden and Tottenham Court Road stations, it offers a relaxed and refined setting for business networking.

**Entry & GMax Cards**

• Free RSVP: Event access only
• Paid ticket (when available): Includes a contactless GMax Card (ask host to claim; not distributed automatically)

**Dress Code** Business / smart casual

**Hosted by:** GMax Card - a digital business card (http://www.gmaxcard.com/) platform designed for modern networking and professional connections beyond LinkedIn. Share **all** your contact details through one simple link.

**Important Info**

• 18+ (ID may be required)
• Photos/video by Cine Eye Audiovisual Production Studio (http://www.cineeye.co.uk/) (inform us if you prefer not to appear)
• Attendance is at your own risk. Organisers and the venue are not liable for any injury, loss, or damage.

**Limited spots - register early!**
Join our WA Business Community (https://chat.whatsapp.com/FJdEP809H5U8WQ4y4BLLS5?mode=hqctcli) to stay connected between events, and follow us on LinkedIn (http://linkedin.com/company/gmax-card) for upcoming dates.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/b/1/3/highres_536156083.jpeg,2026-10-29 18:30:00+00,2026-10-29 21:30:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,Sycamore,"66 Great Queen St, London WC2B 5BX",London,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{carrer,growth,law,entrepreneurship,finance,technology}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/london-entrepreneur-startup-network-tech-business-ecommerce/events/316370709/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-23 03:22:32.413499+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/london-entrepreneur-startup-network-tech-business-ecommerce/events/316370709/,event_316370709@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-23 03:22:32.413499+00,2026-10-28 03:22:26.899552+00,,,meetup:london-entrepreneur-startup-network-tech-business-ecommerce:law property business business networking event in london holborn,"Every week on Thursday until November 25, 2026",f,GB
