≣ **My Story**

Five years ago, I began exploring the technical side of blockchains and cryptocurrencies. Navigating a rapidly evolving industry sparked a long-term passion for digital assets.

I love watching the digital asset space grow, and I established this community to connect with others who share the same passion.

≣ **Topics We’ll Explore**

