736118df-ea48-47b4-bae2-5f8e973e63db,,"Property Investor Networking London Waterloo | Investors, Developers & Agents","Free monthly property investor networking in London Waterloo. Bring a deal, find capital, JV partners, agents, lenders and developers.","**Free monthly property investor networking in London Waterloo.** Bring a deal, find capital, JV partners, agents, lenders and developers.

👉 **Grab your FREE ticket here (required for entry):** https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/property-deal-network-london-waterloo-pdn-investor-networking-event-tickets-1975244754232

Property Deal Network (PDN) is a relaxed monthly meetup for property investors, developers and professionals who want to do business face-to-face.

**What happens at PDN London Waterloo?**
People bring deals. Others bring capital. Some are sourcing their next project, others are looking for JV partners or professional services. The format is simple: arrive, grab a drink and start conversations. No presentations, no pitches from the front – just direct networking with people who are actively working in property.

**Who attends?**
Investors (from first-timers to portfolio landlords), developers, sourcing agents, brokers, solicitors, architects, lenders and accountants. If you're involved in property – or want to be – you'll find relevant people here.

**Practical details**
• **When:** Wednesday 28 October, from 7pm local time
• **Venue:** All Bar One Waterloo, 1-3 Chicheley Street, London SE1 7PY
• **Cost:** Free to attend. The venue asks that everyone buys a drink at full price
• **Dress:** Smart casual (no sportswear). Over 25s only; ID may be requested

This is an established event that runs every month (except December) – if this date doesn't work, there's always next month. All London Waterloo dates: https://www.propertydealnetwork.com/locations/united-kingdom-networking-events/london-waterloo-property-networking-event/

**Industry professional?** Paid promotion tickets (max 2 per event) are available on the ticket page for architects, accountants, builders, mortgage brokers, insurance brokers, interior designers, lenders, estate agents and surveyors.

*Property Deal Network – property investor networking in 190+ cities worldwide. Join this group to hear about PDN events everywhere.*",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/9/3/6/highres_536786934.jpeg,2026-10-28 19:00:00+00,,America/New_York,in_person,All Bar One Waterloo,"1-3 Chicheley Street, London SE1 7PY",London,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{carrer,growth,finance,technology}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/propertydealnetwork/events/317106951/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-25 03:22:33.838204+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/propertydealnetwork/events/317106951/,event_317106951@meetup.com,,2026-10-26 03:21:52.922+00,,2026-10-25 03:22:33.838204+00,2026-10-26 03:22:31.331046+00,,,,,f,GB
