1a28d2c7-d1e9-4cf8-a674-18544439c6dc,,Hardware Founders Assemble- East Coast /West Coast / EU Online Tech Mixer,Hardware Founders Mixer (Global | Monthly),"**Hardware Founders Mixer (Global | Monthly)**

Building hardware is hard. Doing it alone is harder.
This is a monthly, no-fluff gathering for hardware founders across SF, NYC, London — and beyond — to connect in real time.
This is for founders who are building their own hardware business - Physical product business.
No panels. No pitches. Just people in the trenches.
Whether you’re:

• shipping your first units
• scaling manufacturing
• raising, stuck, or figuring out what’s next

you’ll be in a room with others who *get it*.
We keep it informal on purpose. Cameras on (if you can), honest conversations, and space to talk about the parts no one posts about — delays, cash pressure, supplier chaos, tough calls.
This isn’t “networking” in the usual sense.
It’s about building a support system you’ll actually use.
**What to expect:**

• Quick intros (who you are, where you’re at)
• Breakouts with other founders at a similar stage
• Open conversation — bring what’s on your mind

Over time, this becomes a room you recognise — the same people showing up, helping each other move forward.
If you're building in hardware, you should be in this room.
Grab a coffee. Join from wherever you are.

