d2ce20d2-ddef-482d-8f3d-5e278115fd36,,Build an Online Store with AI — A Beginner's Workshop,"AI is changing how people start online businesses. In this free workshop, you'll see how complete beginners are using tools like ChatGPT, Claude, and Shopify AI to research products, build stores,…","AI is changing how people start online businesses. In this free workshop, you'll see how complete beginners are using tools like ChatGPT, Claude, and Shopify AI to research products, build stores, and automate the day-to-day work. No coding or prior experience is required at all.

**You'll come away with:**
• An overview of the fastest-moving online business models right now including dropshipping, print on demand, digital products, and affiliate marketing
• The AI tools worth knowing, and what they're each good for
• How to find viable products and launch on a small budget
• Common beginner mistakes, and a realistic roadmap for your first 90 days

This session is for anyone curious about AI-powered business, whether you're exploring a side income or considering starting from scratch.

**About the speaker**

Zahid Muhammad is the founder and CEO of Conzia Inc. After leaving a corporate career with no prior e-commerce experience, he built multiple successful Shopify and Amazon stores from the ground up. He's since supported over 20,000 entrepreneurs globally in launching and growing their own online businesses.

