49d3cd2a-9813-4a11-9994-9e93fef1866f,,The ZOOM ONLINE Fandorica Geek & Sci-Fi/Fantasy Meetup! All Fandoms Welcome!,The ZOOM Online Fandorica returns on Friday 30th October 2026 from 7pm onwards! Please join us at anytime during the evening! We may even have a quiz if we have a decent crowd!,"The ZOOM Online Fandorica returns on **Friday 30th October 2026 from 7pm** onwards! Please join us at anytime during the evening! We may even have a quiz if we have a decent crowd!

That's **Friday 30th October 2026.**

**THIS ZOOM EVENT REQUIRES REGISTERING USING YOUR ZOOM ACCOUNT EMAIL ADDRESS. PLEASE READ BELOW ON HOW TO REGISTER TO RECEIVE THE FANDORICA ZOOM MEETING ID & PASSCODE FOR THIS EVENT.**

**PLEASE ALSO MAKE SURE THAT YOU ARE USING THE LATEST VERSION OF ZOOM TO AVOID ANY CONNECTION PROBLEMS.**

Please do join us for what will hopefully be a fun evening! It's all very relaxed, so if you can't pop along at the start, then join us when it's convenient for you!

The specified end time is Midnight, but depending on how it goes the meetup may finish earlier or later than that.

We're going to be meeting up on ZOOM! Please do join us!

And please do keep an eye out for any changes in case they occur!

**ZOOM Meetup Details:**

**To receive the Fandorica Meeting ID & Passcode, please do the following:**

**1) Please RSVP here to reveal the ZOOM Meetup Registration link.**

**2) Click the link and complete the simple registration form using your ZOOM account email address. It'll take less than a minute to do.**

**Once you have completed the registration process, the Fandorica ZOOM Meeting ID & Passcode will be emailed to you. Please check your Inbox for the email, and also keep an eye on the Spam folder just in case it ends up there.**

**When you join the Fandorica Meetup on ZOOM, please make sure that you are logged into ZOOM with your ZOOM account email address that you received the ZOOM details on. The ZOOM Meeting ID & Passcode will not work with another email address.**

**This registration process has been implemented to provide all Fandorica members with a safer and more secure system for ZOOM events since this means only those who register can join us on the Fandorica ZOOM.**

**If you do have any issues completing the registration form, or joining the ZOOMs, or if you have any questions, please do get in touch so that I can help you join. Ideally a WhatsApp message with your name so that I know who are on here. Alternatively, please message me on here. My mobile number is... 07463 621 754.**

To make sure that everyone has a fantastic time at the Fandorica meetups, please do familiarise yourselves with the **Fandorica Etiquette** which can be found here: **https://bit.ly/fandoricaetiquette**

The Fandorica has always been about bringing people together, now more than ever. If you've not been able to get to an In-Person Fandorica meetup before, then I hope that the ZOOM Online edition works for you!

Bring your own drinks and food... And join us on ZOOM on the device of your choice!

Ultimately, it's going to be you all that will make it what it is. Feel free to chat about anything you like! Be as silly or serious as you want!

As always, you'll find it a very relaxed welcoming atmosphere. The idea is simply to bring people who have a shared love of all things geek together for a good time! It's all about meeting people and making new friends! Trust me, you won't need an encyclopedic knowledge!

So whatever you're into... Doctor Who, Marvel, DC, Star Wars, Cobra Kai, Stranger Things, Game Of Thrones, Disney, Supernatural, Comics, Films, Books, Board Games, D&D, etc, I'm sure we'll all have something in common to talk about! Chat about anything you fancy!

I appreciate that times can be scary and we're all doing our best to stay safe. We also need to be as social as we can be using whatever means we have access too... Social media, WhatsApp, Email, Phone calls, etc. Whatever works to connect people! So my Inboxes, as well as my WhatsApp, are always open if you fancy a chat! Details below!

Hopefully see many of you at the ZOOM Fandorica!

To make sure that everyone has a fantastic time at the Fandorica meetups, please do familiarise yourselves with the **Fandorica Etiquette** which can be found here: **https://bit.ly/fandoricaetiquette**

**The Fandorica meetups are currently free to attend for everyone. However, both Meetup and ZOOM do charge fees to the organiser for their services. So if you enjoy coming along to the Fandorica meetups and want to help keep them running, then please donate via the Fandorica PayPal page: [paypal.me/fandorica](paypal.me/fandorica).**

**Donations to help keep the Fandorica meetups running are optional but every penny helps!**

As always, you can contact me by either messaging me on here or via the following ways:

Website: http://www.fandorica.co.uk

Instagram: TheFandorica (https://www.instagram.com/thefandorica)

Threads: TheFandorica (https://www.threads.com/@thefandorica)

Bluesky: Fandorica.bsky.social

Mobile: 07463 621 754 (WhatsApp preferred).

