380fe768-343e-4a52-ac27-709557329804,,Agile Clinic,Agile Clinic — bring your real-world Agile problems,"**Agile Clinic — bring your real-world Agile problems**
Stuck on something at work? A team that won't self-organise, a backlog that's sprawling out of control, a stakeholder who wants everything yesterday, or a ""Scrum, but…"" setup that isn't quite clicking? Bring it to the Agile Clinic.
This is a friendly, practical session for anyone working with Scrum, Kanban, or Agile more broadly. No slides, no sales pitch, no theory for its own sake. Just practitioners talking through real challenges together, with a Scrum Alliance Certified Scrum Trainer on hand to help.
**How it works**
Come along with a problem, a question, or just some curiosity. We look at what people most want to dig into, then work through it as a group. You'll leave with practical ideas you can try on Monday morning, and you'll help someone else do the same.
**Who it's for**
Scrum Masters, Product Owners, developers, delivery leads, coaches, and the Agile-curious. Whether you're brand new or years into the craft, if you've got a problem to solve or an opinion to share, you're in the right place.
**What you'll take away**
Fresh thinking on whatever's been stuck, a few new approaches to test, and a group of practitioners who understand exactly what you're dealing with.
It's free, it's relaxed, and every question is a good one. Bring a colleague if you'd like.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/0/6/9/highres_535944681.jpeg,2026-11-25 18:00:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,{technology},,external,https://www.meetup.com/surrey-and-sussex-agile-and-scrum-user-group/events/316368293/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-27 03:23:37.258822+00,source:a123de80-56fb-42df-942f-e46132c725f9,https://www.meetup.com/surrey-and-sussex-agile-and-scrum-user-group/events/316368293/,event_316368293@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:57.772+00,,2026-10-27 03:23:37.258822+00,2026-10-28 03:23:34.689062+00,,,,,f,
