54134607-aac6-4929-8ec9-0a9b039931fc,,Advanced Aspects for Systemic Constellation Practitioners: Certification 2026/7,Advanced Aspects for Systemic Constellation Practitioners: Certification Training 2026/7,"**Advanced Aspects for Systemic Constellation Practitioners: Certification Training 2026/7**

Are you ready to deepen your practice and explore advanced techniques in Systemic Constellations? We invite you to join the Advanced Aspects for Systemic Constellation Practitioners Certification Training.

This specialised training is designed for practitioners at all levels who are eager to expand their knowledge and skills in Family Constellations and systemic work.

**🟢TRAINING SCHEDULE**
**3-Part Training**
**Part 1:** 16–18 November 2026
**Part 2:** 15–17 December 2026
**Part 3:** 1–3 February 2027

**Time:** 6:30 PM–9:00 PM (UK Time)

**PRICING**
**Single Part:** £225
**Early Bird:** £191 per part — **15% OFF**

**FULL COURSE (all 3 parts): £495**

Each 3-day training part explores an advanced aspect of constellation work, combining in-depth learning with hands-on guidance to help you integrate these methods into your practice.

Let’s take a closer look at the topics covered in each part of this transformative training:

**📖COURSE SUBJECTS**
PART 1:
**1. Blind Constellations**
When working with delicate topics that evoke strong emotions or reactions, bias can easily arise in the field. This bias can influence the representatives and potentially skew the constellation process. In this module, you’ll learn how to avoid these unintended influences through ‘blind’ Constellations—a powerful approach that taps directly into the Knowing Field without preconceptions or interference.
**2. Silent Constellations**
What if the most profound healing could happen in silence? In this session, you’ll explore how silence can be a potent medium for constellation work. Often, the body holds both the question and the answer to challenges and traumas. Through Silent Constellations, you’ll discover how to guide clients without uttering a word, allowing for a deeper connection to the Knowing Field and providing an alternative ‘language’ for healing.

PART 2:
**3. Visualised Constellations / HypnoConstellation™️**
Imagine creating a full constellation process by simply closing your eyes. In this module, you’ll learn how to conduct constellations without physical representatives, felts, figurines or objects, using visualisation techniques drawn from Hypnotherapy and Systemic work. Whether working online or in-person, with individuals or groups, you’ll gain a powerful tool that brings flexibility and depth to your practice.
**4. Structured Constellations**
Short, focused, and deeply revealing, Structured Constellations are a highly effective method for addressing a wide range of personal and organisational challenges. This process is a versatile ‘power tool’ for practitioners, offering profound insights and solutions in a streamlined format, all while maintaining the richness and depth of traditional Constellation work.

PART 3:
**5. Decision-Making Constellations**
Are you or your clients struggling with decision-making? This process helps align choices with the Knowing Field, whether it’s navigating simple yes/no questions or resolving more complex inquiries. Through Decision-Making Constellations, you’ll learn to support clients in making choices that are fully aligned with their inner wisdom.
**6. Distant-Healing Constellations™️**
As humanity continues to evolve, so too does our relationship with Time and Space. In this module, you’ll learn how to use Distant-Healing Constellations™️ to create powerful healing rituals that transcends time and space, in support of individuals, groups, or even entire regions/nations. This way of doing Constellations can integrat energetic frequencies from crystals and minerals as an additional resource that amplify the healing potential and create a structured ritual that transcends physical boundaries.

**🟠WHY THIS TRAINING IS FOR YOU**
Whether you’re a seasoned facilitator or a practitioner looking to expand your toolbox, this certification training offers advanced techniques to help you refine your practice. Each module will provide practical, hands-on learning and opportunities for deep personal and professional growth. You’ll leave with new ways to apply in your personal healing journey or in your sessions, empowering you to support clients in more profound and innovative ways.

FACILITATED BY
**Illi Adato SQHP**
Systemic, Organisational & Family Constellations facilitator, member of ISCA | Recognised Master Constellator by CI - Constellators International | Hypnotherapy Senior Member of GHR (UK) & Member of IHF (USA) | Advanced NLP Therapeutic Specialist™ | Systemic Ritual® Facilitator

**✍️HOW TO REGISTER**
Secure your place today by registering through the links down below. Don’t miss this opportunity to enhance your practice and connect with a community of fellow practitioners trained by London School of Systemic & Family Constellations.

