e65e4883-2890-4f67-a94f-673296ed326f,,Meet Your First AI Employee: The AI Receptionist 🤖,"What if your business could answer every call, qualify leads, and book appointments, even when you're off the clock?","**What if your business could answer every call, qualify leads, and book appointments, even when you're off the clock?**
Meet Ava, an AI receptionist that's changing the way businesses handle customer communication.
Join Innovative Compass for a **FREE live workshop** where we'll show you what an AI employee can actually do for your business.

What You'll Discover

• Watch a live AI receptionist demonstration.
• See how AI answers calls, qualifies leads, and books appointments 24/7.
• Learn how AI connects with your CRM and existing business tools.
• Discover how AI employees can support your business beyond answering calls.

Who Should Attend?

Business owners, entrepreneurs, and anyone curious about using AI to save time, capture more opportunities, and streamline operations.

**No technical experience needed!**
