fad1e65b-6038-4f57-9fc8-7671339cad37,,Ask Your Data Anything: Databricks Genie,Turn your data into trusted insights with conversational analytics.,"Turn your data into trusted insights with conversational analytics.
Give teams a simpler way to get answers from their data, without relying on dashboards, technical teams or complex queries. Databricks Genie makes conversational analytics more accessible, while the quality of the answers depends on the data, business context and governance behind it.
Join Unifeye to explore how to build a trusted Genie experience that helps users find insights faster, ask better follow-up questions and make more informed decisions, while reducing the time and cost involved in accessing data. Learn how to maximise the value of your data and increase ROI from your Databricks investment, with a Genie experience that is accurate, secure and governed.

What we’ll cover:
• Understand how Databricks Genie can help teams get faster answers from their data
• Define the business semantics, metrics and context needed to make insights more meaningful
• Improve efficiency by reducing reliance on technical teams and manual data requests
• Build governance, security and permissions into your Genie environment
• Explore how semantic and ontology capabilities can help AI better understand your business
• See Genie in action through a realistic business use case and discover how to turn questions into actionable insights across different business functions.
• Understand how to move from a Genie pilot to production while maximising ROI and controlling costs
• Live Q&A: Bring your questions and join the conversation with the Unifeye team

Who should attend?
• Data, Analytics and AI Leaders
• Data Architects, Engineers and Analytics Engineers
• Technology and IT Leaders - Business leaders exploring conversational analytics
