69f63be7-15b9-427a-846e-4a0179d41097,,Voice & Visibility (fireside chat + dinner),An evening about being heard and being seen.,"An evening about being heard and being seen.

Our special guest is Jennifer Challenger (https://www.linkedin.com/in/jennifer-challenger-coach/), an executive coach. Jennifer will lead a fireside chat on public speaking and positioning: how to speak up in the room, and how to make sure people understand the value you bring.

We want this collective to feel like the villages where everyone knows someone who can help. In a city as big as London, that’s easy to lose. Need something that would normally cost the earth? Someone knows someone. “Ask so-and-so, she’ll sort you out.” That’s what our events are for. Our village, our coven, our circle of sisters, the group chat that shows up for you.
That’s why our events always come with something worth taking away, either free or at a price that won’t hurt. At our last event it was £5 LinkedIn headshots with photographer Morgyn Goff. This time, it’s the turn of The Third Act Studios, our founding design partner and the team behind WILL’s new look.

If you come along, you can sign up on the night for a free 15-minute brand clinic with founder Pratiti Bhadra (https://www.linkedin.com/in/pratiti-bhadra/). These are online, one to one, and there are only 10 slots.
Whether you’re building a business, job hunting, changing careers or coming back to work, this is a free chance to get a professional eye on how you show up

Slots are first come, first served, and sign-up is in person only, so you’ll need to be there.

We keep these evenings small and friendly, so you’ll leave having spoken to people, not just stood near them lol

Come ready to meet some good people.
Come and join our collective at WILL.
At WILL, we speak up. At WILL we show up.
