a2a420f5-a791-4ac8-b9fb-4abbb388e5dd,,Photography Basics: Learn how to get better pictures and make new friends,Hello everyone! We are running another round of free photography tutorials!,"Hello everyone! We are running another round of free photography tutorials!

It is super exciting for me to start our photography adventure together. This group is all about learning about photography and meeting like-minded people who share an interest in this great hobby.

What you can expect in this group is a mix of theory and practical meetups. The future planned events are intended to be sequential but don’t worry if you miss one, they will be rolling. Coming up will be camera basics, lenses, composition, portrait sessions, night photography and much more.

We will kick off with an online event focused of teaching some of the fundamentals of photography. There will be about 60mins of slides and explanation followed by discussion. It does not matter what type of camera you have or at what level you are, this is all about the fundamentals, including exposure, getting sharp images, “how to” examples and much more. The event will be on Zoom.

Happy Shooting!

