36171b97-6d14-45d1-87c1-84c6d73fc164,,Yes Atlas: Scavenger Hunt- UK 🇬🇧,"Hosted by Seek Discomfort, Laura Copeland and 1 other","**Hosted By:** Seek Discomfort

Most people spend a weekend in the places they already know. That’s the comfortable version. This is the other one.

