ce85d5da-c695-4573-965e-dd5f80fc7de6,,The Startup Stroll x FoundHers,"Hosted by Marion Boimond, Stefanie Mulder and 2 others","**The Startup Stroll partners with FoundHers** to organise a longer walk in Hampstead Heath! Find out more about **FoundHers** here (https://foundhersglobal.com/) ✨ and learn more about **The Startup Stroll** below 🤗

**Your Saturday morning reset. No agenda, no pitching, just good conversation** ☕

The Startup Stroll is a bi-monthly morning walk for founders and builders. Building something is hard and we rarely make room to just *talk*. About the messy bits, the doubts, and the wins that don't feel big enough to celebrate yet.

This is that space.

Wind down into the weekend with people who *get it.* Bring your curiosity, your coffee, and whatever's on your mind. We'll stroll through London's greenery, talk honestly, and share what we're working on 🌿

