**Proceedings:**
These will be roundtable discussions where everyone will have equal standing and equal opportunity to contribute to the discussion.

We like to keep the tone of our discussions warm and casual and to approach these conversations with playfulness, kindness, open-mindedness, and respectfulness. In that spirit, we appreciate reflective questioning, critical thinking, and debate too.

We'll vote on what to read for the next meeting at the start of this meeting.

Please feel free to bring suggestions for readings that we can add to the list of alternatives to vote on. Please note that we prefer readings which are in the public domain and freely accessible online.

