17a9686e-09f9-444c-a42c-8514be932275,,Wellbeing Walk-TOOTING BEC,Overview,"Overview

Join us for a morning of fresh air, movement, and community connection!
Our upcoming well-being walk is the perfect opportunity to recharge your mind and body while meeting like-minded people in a positive, supportive environment.
Whether you are looking to boost your mood, enjoy the local scenery, or simply have a chat with new friends, this walk is for you. We believe in good vibes, positive energy, and building great connections.
**Event details:**

• **When:** Saturday, 7th November 2026
• **Meeting Time:** 11:45am. Walk starts at 12:00pm.
• **Where:** Tooting Bec.The exact meeting point will be emailed to you after ticket purchase.

Please beware that this walks will be about 1.5 hours-3 hours long and may be hilly or muddy so please wear appropriate footwear. If you have any questions about this walk or you will be bringing a dog please ensure they remain on leads and email us asap to inform us at info@bntcommunity.com that you are bringing your dog.
We can’t wait to see you there and share this experience with our community!
For admin queries or urgent queries please
contact Niketa at admin@bntcommmunity.com

