By choosing to join us for a BNT Wellbeing Walk, you understand and agree that
your participation is entirely at your own risk.
BNT, its organisers, and its volunteers will not be held liable for any loss, damage, or
injury to you or your personal property that may occur before, during, or after the
walk. This includes, but is not limited to, personal injury, accidents, or any unforeseen circumstances.
We encourage you to assess your own physical fitness and ensure you are adequately prepared for the walk.
All donation tickets are non-refundable. If you can no longer make the walk, please
let us know asap and cancel your ticket.
**REFUND AND TICKET TRANSFER DISCLAIMER**-
We do not allow ticket transfers,if you can no longer make an event please request a ticket cancellation from your order confirmation email or **email Niketa at admin@bntcommunity.com** at your earliest inconvenience. Refunds will be issued for cancellations made at least 7 days prior to the event. No refunds will be granted for cancellations made within 7 days or less of the event date.
