821d1fb8-2ad4-4932-8aa5-6dd739003115,,High Intermediate Badminton Friday. NEW PRICE UPDATE*,"This event is for badminton players of high intermediate to advance level skills, or players with club or league experience. This club is not suitable for beginners, improvers or low intermediate.","**This event is for badminton players of high intermediate to advance level skills, or players with club or league experience. This club is not suitable for beginners, improvers or low intermediate.**
Venue: Queensbridge Sports Centre E8 3XW.
2hours 40minutes feather shuttles. Cost £14
For more information please message EVENT HOST OR CO ORGANIZESRS.
**Enquiries: Sian: 07307875359 (I may be working if no answer please text me)**

**PLEASE RSVP and complete payment for your session by 7 PM the evening before to confirm your spot. Thank you for your cooperation!**

**NEW PRICE £14**
**Pay: Zahra Ali**
**Sort: 60-83-71 Account: 47645380 select: Business Account**
Please state your meetup name as payment reference to assist matching your payment. Thank you

**IMPORTANT INFORMATION**
This club is for players of high intermediate to advance level playing doubles badminton. You must have competent racket skills, good level of consistency, sound understanding of tactics and strategies, footwork skills and know how to rotate around your partner on court.
To maintain the quality of games, event spaces will be prioritised to players of advance level **if / when** there is a long waitlist. This also means there is possibility of players who already RSVP may be moved on to waitlist and admitted when spaces become available. This is to maintain competitive game standard and we appreciate your understanding on this matter.

Games may be arranged by organiser or by players mutually pairing evenly to ensure the games are competitive. Please be courteous to those waiting the longest.

**Please RSVP in good time to avoid disappointment.**
If your plans change, please update your RSVP to ""NO"" as soon as possible or not less than 24 hours. This would allow other members adequate notice to plan for attendance of any vacant spots. Cancellations less than 24 hours before the event or no show, will be charged the whole fee whether or not the slot was filled.
We don’t issue refunds, if you cancel before the 24 hours and have already paid we will credit you for a session. The Credit will be valid for 1 month

**How to get to Queensbridge Sports Centre:**
If you are driving, please avoid driving through any of the big wooden flower pots. You may get a fine if you drive through them. Please stick to the main Roads: Kingsland Road, Dalston Lane, Graham Road, Whiston Road, Queensbridge Road, and then Richmond Road then Holly Street.

Nearest over ground: Dalston Junction station and Haggerston station. Then 5 minutes walk. Buses; 30, 38, 56, 76, 149, 236, 242, 243, 277 all stops are within 10 minutes walk. Parking is free on Weekends outside the sport centre on Holly street and adjacent streets. Parking Restrictions are Mon-Fri 8.30am-6.30pm

Your are responsible for your own health and safety. Please ensure you have appropriate sports wear and stretch / warm up before play. This club is not responsible for any injuries or broken rackets that may arise from play. You are reminded to keep your belongings safe as the club is not responsible for any lost or damaged property.

We may take videos or images during the session. By joining this event, you grant HBC permission to take videos or images and to use them in any media including, without limitation, in printed publications, presentations, promotional material or online, in their original format or edited or altered in any way.
Thank you for your support.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/d/1/7/highres_487883831.jpeg,2026-10-23 18:15:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,Queensbridge Sports And Community Centre,"30 Holly Street, Hackney, E8 3XW",London,c06699ed-62e0-4957-bcb4-080c5271da9a,"{sport,fitness}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/hackney-badminton-club/events/316830623/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:49:59.35823+00,source:cba1b9d2-d09d-4c19-a89e-50bdbe5525a0,https://www.meetup.com/hackney-badminton-club/events/316830623/,event_316830623@meetup.com,,2026-10-23 03:20:40.799+00,,2026-10-22 19:49:59.35823+00,2026-10-23 03:21:16.723507+00,,,meetup:hackney-badminton-club:high intermediate badminton friday new price update,"Every week on Friday until October 30, 2026",f,GB
a124b3e4-9edf-4c03-9c9f-e27d4f04be5b,,Free workshop: Starting a business in the NL,Are you planning to start a business in the Netherlands or have you recently registered one?,"Are you planning to start a business in the Netherlands or have you recently registered one?

Join us for an essential, practical workshop where we'll explain everything you need to know to set up and manage your company hassle-free.

Whether you are starting as a freelancer (*Eenmanszaak*), forming a partnership (*V.O.F.*), or incorporating a company (*B.V.*), understanding Dutch tax laws and administration can feel overwhelming.

We are here to make it simple and stress-free.

**Agenda:**

**Setting Up Your Business:**

• Choosing the right legal structure (*Eenmanszaak* vs. *V.O.F.* vs. *B.V.*)
• Key steps for registering with the KvK (Chamber of Commerce)

**Taxes & Compliance Essentials:**

• Understanding VAT / BTW (*Omzetbelasting*) obligations and deadlines
• How to handle *Naheffingsaanslagen* (automated tax estimates) and avoid common fines
• Income Tax (*Inkomstenbelasting*) basics for business owners

**Maintaining Your Administration:**

• Bookkeeping best practices and choosing the right tools/software
• Self-managed vs. full-service accounting models",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/b/5/highres_536583509.jpeg,2026-10-29 18:00:00+00,,Europe/Amsterdam,online,Online event,,,4cece675-2670-4581-90e6-2b792576b047,"{carrer,entrepreneurship,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/heerhugowaard-wisdom-business-network-meetup-group/events/316957763/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/heerhugowaard-wisdom-business-network-meetup-group/events/316957763/,event_316957763@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,2026-10-28 03:22:27.129706+00,,,,,f,
