1db2474b-7edc-4881-b63b-95b67f84af3b,,🤝 Founders Meetup | Founders for Founders+,Founders for Founders brings you Real conversations for Entrepreneurs building Startups around the world. Every Wednesday.,"***Founders for Founders* brings you Real conversations for Entrepreneurs building Startups around the world. Every Wednesday.**
*Talk it out, build it better.*

• This is a special FREE weekly event for founders around the world: you can check out The Founders for Founders Website (https://f4f.vc/) for more info.

Building something is a rollercoaster, and it's a whole lot better with people who *get it*. Founders for Founders is our weekly get-together where you meet other entrepreneurs, talk through what you're working on, and leave with fresh ideas and new connections.
Here's how it works:

• **⏱️ One hour, once a week:** an easy, energising break in your week
• **🤝 Meet 4 different founders:** we personally put you in touch with four others, so every conversation counts
• **💬 Real talk (English):** share your ideas, talk through your blockers, and get honest opinions from people who've been there
• **🌱 Connections that last:** many of the founders you meet become sounding boards, collaborators, and friends long after the hour is up

**Talk it out, build it better.**

This is a FREE event. No one to impress, just peers who *get it*.
Whether you're deep in the build, just starting out, or somewhere in between, for-profit, nonprofit, or a project you believe in, you're welcome here.

**Where:** We meet on SpeakDuo (https://speakduo.onelink.me/DlwG/meetup), built for live online group events with advanced matching, so you're paired with the right founders for focused, meaningful conversations instead of getting lost in a crowded call.

**RSVP to save your spot:** bring what you're working on, and let's
unite. You can also check upcoming events at f4f.vc/events (http://f4f.vc/events). 🚀",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/2/e/7/highres_535297607.jpeg,2027-01-13 17:00:00+00,2027-01-13 18:00:00+00,Europe/Amsterdam,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,entrepreneurship,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/founders-amsterdam/events/sxvrztykccbrb/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/founders-amsterdam/events/sxvrztykccbrb/,event_sxvrztykccbrb@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,2026-10-28 03:22:26.899552+00,,,meetup:founders-amsterdam:founders meetup founders for founders,"Every week on Wednesday until August 1, 2029",f,
584933da-07a3-46f8-81d5-979f1b677102,,Scale or Die,Hosted by Solana Foundation,"**Scale or Die | London | November 14**

Back by popular demand, we’re bringing Solana’s developer-focused Scale or Die event to London on November 14th, leading into Breakpoint.

Scale or Die is Solana’s application-only summit for the engineers, validators, protocol developers, infrastructure teams, and researchers pushing the network to its limits.

This is not a general crypto event. No marketing decks. No sales pitches. Just deep technical programming, hands-on workshops, and focused time with the teams building and scaling Solana’s future.

Expect talks and conversations across validator performance, consensus, transaction landing, RPC, Firedancer, post-quantum readiness, agentic infrastructure, high-performance onchain applications, and more.

A dedicated DevCave space will run throughout the day for technical discussion, debugging, collaboration, and direct access to the people shipping core infrastructure.

If you are building on Solana, operating infrastructure, writing protocol code, or working at the frontier of Solana, this is the room you want to be in.

**For Sponsorship opportunities, please reach out to events@solana.org**

Still need to book a hotel? Book with Nomadz (https://nomadz.xyz/breakpoint) and save up to 30%

**Interested in speaking?** Please fill out this form. (https://airtable.com/appCy7M2j24UF6QqT/pag8nSnDP4LUKD13W/form)",https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/ya/55315312-4b26-4b79-be90-7c38556ac574.jpg,2026-11-14 09:30:00+00,2026-11-14 18:30:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,,,London,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{technology,socialising,marketing,careers,crypto,finance}",,external,https://luma.com/scale-or-die-26,Register on Luma,f,,t,,0.00,0.00,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 17:08:42.885373+00,source:5f864383-431a-4751-b4a4-f07868d73687,https://luma.com/scale-or-die-26,evt-saiU3xVXKv6HsFC@events.lu.ma,,2026-10-28 03:23:37.327+00,,2026-10-22 17:08:42.885373+00,2026-10-28 03:23:43.085408+00,,,,,f,GB
c657a6df-f21d-486b-989a-3768fba1beaf,,Poker Night @ DAS London,"Hosted by Katie Narain, Matthew Leightman and 2 others","**♠️ The Final Table of the Year**

Over 2025 and 2026 our poker nights have travelled from **Buenos Aires** to **Miami**, from **Cannes** to **Hong Kong**. Now the 2026 tour wraps in London.

We're coming together with **Blockworks** for **DAS London**, joined by **Flow Traders**, to open the conference with our last tournament of the year. It's the first night of DAS Week, **Monday 9 November**, at the **Royal Horseguards**, a historic Whitehall landmark on the Thames.

**12 tables. 120 players. One champion.**

Expect a night of Texas Hold'em, live jazz, drinks and some of the sharpest people in digital assets, all before the Summit starts.

**The night**
🃏 Free-entry Texas Hold'em tournament across 12 tables
🎷 Live jazz and music all evening
🥂 Drinks and canapés
🏆 A prize for the champion

**Details**
📍 The Royal Horseguards, 2 Whitehall Court, London SW1A 2EJ
🗓 Monday 9 November, 6pm until late
👔 Dress code: optional cocktail, smart is favoured

**How to get a seat**
There are only 120 seats, so registering doesn't guarantee you a place at the tables. We review every player request. **Confirmed players will get a separate email** with their seat confirmation and the details for the night.

Please rsvp with your work email

**Not confirmed?** We'll keep a few seats back for last-minute walk-ins. They're released at **6pm before play starts** and go on a first-come, first-served basis, so get there early.

We'll deal you in at the start of DAS week.

*Presented by Serotonin × Flow Traders × Blockworks*

*photos and videos will be taken during the event, attendees may be filmed and photographed for content used as promotional material

**About DAS:** Blockworks' Digital Asset Summit (DAS) returns to London this November 10–11, 2026. DAS is crypto's premier institutional event.

Stablecoins, tokenization, onchain infrastructure, and AI are rapidly reshaping the global financial system. DAS London will bring together the leading institutional leaders, allocators, builders, and policy makers from across the UK, Europe, North America, MENA, and Asia to discuss how the next chapter of global finance will be written.",https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/l9/97fbcabb-cde2-41f0-95a5-2819c9afdb23.png,2026-11-09 18:00:00+00,2026-11-10 00:00:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,"The Royal Horseguards Hotel & One Whitehall Place, London","2 Whitehall Ct, London",London,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{technology,socialising,marketing,careers,crypto,finance}",,external,https://luma.com/z7g0eoa3,Register on Luma,f,,t,,0.00,0.00,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 17:08:42.794703+00,source:5f864383-431a-4751-b4a4-f07868d73687,https://luma.com/z7g0eoa3,evt-MgdhYr9RORaw5d6@events.lu.ma,,2026-10-28 03:23:37.327+00,,2026-10-22 17:08:42.794703+00,2026-10-28 03:23:43.085408+00,51.5060478,-0.1241368,,,f,GB
