bb1708a7-45e1-4613-8e3c-02e853c0665e,,"Wake Up, Write! ***Taster Session***","IF YOU'D PREFER, YOU CAN PAY DIRECTLY VIA OUR WEBSITE, HERE: https://www.writeandpint.com/events/wake-up-write-taster-session-10","IF YOU'D PREFER, YOU CAN PAY DIRECTLY VIA OUR WEBSITE, HERE: https://www.writeandpint.com/events/wake-up-write-taster-session-10

...

Hi there!

**This is a very low cost taster session for you if you want to see what it feels like to:**

1. Start the day with a meditation
2. Listen to a poetry reading + soothing background music
3. Partake in a 50-minute silent writing session
4. Listen to people share their ideas for 15 minutes at the end
5. ***FEEL MOVED, INSPIRED, and PROUD OF WHATEVER YOU ACHIEVE*** throughout the day thereafter.

...

**What you need to do?**

Simply buy your £2.50 ticket. Then...

• Login to the Zoom call at 8:55am (ready to start at 9am)
• Have your camera on or off (you decide)
• Say hello in the chat or verbally (you decide)
• Let us guide you through a calm, grounding meditation
• Hear us read and discuss a poem, with ambient music in the background
• Sit with us in silence for 50 minutes, writing (*Note: you can focus on your own creative work in this time)
• Then come back for the final 10/15 minutes, where we'll open the space to anyone who'd like to share anything.

**Who is this for?**

This is for people who struggle to find their rhythm with creative writing... or people who just love writing in community... or people who have always wanted the accountability to start their day with meditation + something creative.

**FAQs**

Q: **Do I have to present or share ideas?**
A: No. You can have your camera and mic. on or off (it's totally up to you).

Q: **Do I need to already be working on something?**
A: This does help, but of course you're more than welcome to come along and use the session itself to start something new... or simply to journal about your thoughts, emotions, and experience there at the start of the day.

Q: **Why is it only £2.50 when your membership is more than that per session?**
A: We want to extend this taster opportunity to as many people as we possibly can, as we know how powerful and genuinely life-changing these morning sessions can be.

Q: **What will other people be working on during the writing component of the session?**
A: We have people who are just starting out, as well as novelists, Substack article writers, poets, short film writers, and numerous other people besides. So all forms of writing are absolutely welcome.

Q: **Do I need to have any particular experience?**
A: Nope. Whatever level you're at (from complete beginner to published professional) you're very very welcome. This is not a workshop. It's just you getting things done in your own space and time after an inspirational meditation at the beginning.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/7/1/4/4/highres_532288996.jpeg,2026-10-30 08:55:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,c17c4a77-8c19-42da-a932-7fd57ad27fc7,"{social,books,socialising}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/the-waterloo-anxiety-reader-s/events/316709636/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:46:37.169472+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/the-waterloo-anxiety-reader-s/events/316709636/,event_316709636@meetup.com,,2026-10-25 03:19:10.667+00,,2026-10-22 19:46:37.169472+00,2026-10-25 03:19:48.071597+00,,,,,f,
