Join us in the heart of London for a focused networking event tailored for entrepreneurs, startups, and professionals immersed in the fields of Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning. This event provides a unique platform to connect, share insights, and explore collaboration opportunities without the typical distractions of larger conferences.

**Event Highlights:**
**One-Minute Presentations:** A rapid-fire session where AI and ML startups can pitch their innovations and business ideas directly to a curated audience of peers and potential investors. Each presentation is limited to one minute, emphasizing clarity and impact.
**Structured Networking Opportunities:** Engage in meaningful discussions with fellow innovators and industry leaders. This event is designed to foster connections that lead to collaboration, investment, and growth.

**Who Should Attend:**
**AI and ML Entrepreneurs and Startup Founders:** Ideal for those looking to showcase their innovative solutions, seek funding, or find potential co-founders. This event provides a platform to pitch your projects to an audience that includes potential investors and partners, maximizing exposure and opportunities for growth.
**Investors Specializing in AI and ML:** Venture capitalists and angel investors interested in the latest developments in AI and ML will find a pool of potential investment opportunities. This event offers a streamlined way to identify emerging talents and innovative projects worth backing.
**AI and ML Professionals:** Data scientists, machine learning engineers, researchers, and other professionals working in the AI and ML fields should attend to network with peers, discuss industry trends, and explore potential career advancements or collaborative projects.
**Technology Enthusiasts and Students:** Those passionate about AI and ML technologies, including students and academic professionals, will benefit from direct interaction with industry leaders and innovators, gaining insights into the practical challenges and opportunities in the field.

**Reasons to Attend:**
**Networking Opportunities:** This event is specifically designed to facilitate direct connections among attendees, making it an excellent venue for networking with other professionals and industry leaders in a focused setting.
**Knowledge Exchange:** Engaging with fellow professionals and industry experts allows for a valuable exchange of ideas, updates on industry trends, and discussions about the future directions of AI and ML technologies.
**Career Advancement:** Professionals looking to advance their careers can find opportunities by connecting with potential employers and learning about new openings in the field.
**Educational Value:** Students and tech enthusiasts can learn more about the real-world applications of AI and ML, understand the industry demands, and meet potential mentors who can guide their career paths.
This event is a must-attend for anyone involved in or interested in the AI and ML sectors, providing a unique opportunity to engage with the community, discover opportunities, and foster collaborations that can shape the future of technology.
The event will be held in a sophisticated and vibrant venue, adorned with modern decor and equipped with state-of-the-art facilities to ensure your comfort and convenience throughout the day.
Get your tickets now and join us for a day that will shape the trajectory of your professional journey!

How our event works:
7.00pm - When you arrive your name will be checked off the guest list, the host will direct everyone to the reserved area and explain how the event will work.
7.30pm – Event starts, you will be introduced to each other in a nice relaxed environment in the semi private reserved area.
10 pm - Event ends, all guests are welcome to stay and enjoy chatting with each other.
This event will be hosted till 9pm; the key to making the most of speed friending is to follow up with your contacts over time to develop friendships.
Dress code is either business or office attire or smart casual, no T-shirts, no trainers.
If you have any questions email contact@thebusinessminds.co.uk or call Elena on 07762038437

Ticket for 1 person allows 1 person to enter the venue from 7pm

Please Note:

