0764f9a0-04fc-4f16-9e4c-1dcae71dafff,,UK Dubai Property Network Live!,UK Dubai Property Network Live!,"**UK Dubai Property Network Live!**

Join us online every week !
(2nd Monday of each month will be evening event - check Skool link for details)
Whether you’re a seasoned investor, a budding landlord or simply curious about the future of real estate, UK Dubai Property Network Live! brings together the UK and Dubai's leading property experts to share cutting-edge strategies and actionable tips to our growing community.
This event is aimed at serious Investors, Developers, Property Professionals. This is NOT a sales event - we're bringing together a collection of the best property minds with the goal to collaborate and make new meaningful connections.
Evereything you need, including access to the FREE commuinty, live event links and content via the link below:

**Sponsored by:** ""UK DUBAI PROPERTY ACCELERATOR""**FREE-TO-JOIN community - via this link:** https://www.skool.com/uk-dubai-property-accelerator-2766/about?ref=7365050126724e728a99244e1a6f2eb3

**FORMAT:**
Varies each week and regularly includes Guest Speakers, Structured fun Speed Networking, Q&A Ask the Expert, ""How To... Features""
**WHY ATTEND?**
• Network with top investors, developers and industry specialists.
• Learn how to make money from UK and Dubai real estate (and how to avoid the pitfalls).
• Gain practical, immediately implementable strategies.
• Choose your format: online access.
• Grow your contact book—and your bottom line.
• Stay ahead of the game!
• VIP ticket gives you access to event recordings to watch on-demand.
Here's just some of the strategies we cover:

• **UK and Dubai Property investing (hands on or hands off)**
• **Commercial to Residential (C2R) Conversion**
• **Deal Sourcing**
• **Off-Plan**
• **Rent-to-Rent (R2R)**
• **Rent-to-Serviced Accommodation (R2SA)**
• **Serviced Accommodation (SA) / Holiday Lets**
• **House in Multiple Occupation (HMO)**
• **Buy-to-Let (BTL)**
• **Fix and Flip**
• **BRRRR (Buy, Rehab, Rent, Refinance, Repeat)**
• **Wholesaling**
• **Real Estate Investment Trusts (REITs)**

Whether you’re a property beginner or property expert we have something for you. Regular topics cover R2SA (Serviced Accommodation), Co-Living, HMO’s, BTL, C2R, Lease Options, Property Developments, Social Housing, How to Make Money from Property, Property Sourcing, Tenant/Property Management, AND much more…

###

We have Live events/streams almost every week and every month we have guest speakers who share their knowledge and experiences - why make the same costly mistakes yourself when you can learn from others?Events are streamed online each month but watch out for our next in-person London and Dubai events. (Join our FREE Skool community for updates):https://www.skool.com/uk-dubai-property-accelerator-2766/about?ref=7365050126724e728a99244e1a6f2eb3

Every month we have networking and our team will make you feel comfortable and introduce you to new contacts - you may even meet your next Investor, JV partner, Landlord, power team member.

Our motto is Your Network is Your Net Worth and our team will help facilitate and intrude you to contacts that can help your business become more successful. Whether you’re joining for the first time, alone or with a colleague, you can be assured that our team will look after you and make you feel welcome.

###

