ce0ba1c7-e7a0-4e52-93ba-20ad7f5eb168,,"Finance, Banking, Investment, Property - Business Networking Event in London","Looking for a finance, banking, investment and property networking event in London? Join us in Covent Garden for an evening of quality business networking. Hosted by digital business card startup…","**Looking for a finance, banking, investment and property networking event in London?** Join us in **Covent Garden** for an evening of quality business networking. Hosted by digital business card startup **GMax Card** and eCommerce platform **Getshop Today**.

