45f36410-ea26-4a05-9ec5-5b835a10197c,,LS GO Online - Topic TBD,🔹 TOPIC:,"🔹 TOPIC:
Determined each month by the Design Team for that month. Check back for updates on the topic.

🔹THIS GROUP IS FOR:
All lovers of liberating structures and newcomers who would like to enjoy LS online with people from all over the world.

🔹OUR PURPOSE
This is an INTERNATIONAL ONLINE LS USER GROUP in which we cherish a cross-country, cross-user group exchange to enrich ourselves not only for our LS practice but also for learning and integrating new perspectives, expanding our horizons, getting out of our silos, creating new connections, and spreading LS even more around the world…

🔹WHAT WE DO
We practice, explore, enjoy, learn and fail forward with 43 Liberating Structures (https://www.liberatingstructures.com/ls-menu-1) and utilize many resources found on the NEW Liberating Structures website (https://www.liberatingstructures.com/).

🔹HOW WE DO THIS
We will have an online event every month or every second month.
Each meetup lasts 120 minutes, has a specific topic and will be hosted by a design team. ***Feel free to contact us and join the design team for the next event.***

During each meetup, we practice various Liberating Structures and create spaces to network, get to know each other, learn from each other and to laugh with each other.

Liberating Structures can revolutionize your meetings, your workshops, your team events, your conferences, your teaching, and your life.
It can support you in your transformation and help you to exchange knowledge and learn from each other differently.

**Join us and try it out!**",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/4/9/e/highres_497281182.jpeg,2026-11-26 18:00:00+00,,Europe/Zurich,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/liberating-structures-go-online/events/316340722/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-28 03:22:26.159151+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/liberating-structures-go-online/events/316340722/,event_316340722@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-28 03:22:26.159151+00,2026-10-28 03:22:29.621455+00,,,,,f,
