6ce074f0-222a-4125-b18b-bb8793b96c99,,Toastmasters Online Speaking club,"Stevenage Speakers – Build Confidence, Communication & Leadership","Stevenage Speakers – Build Confidence, Communication & Leadership

Looking to become a more confident speaker, stronger leader, or better communicator in a supportive and welcoming environment?

Stevenage Speakers is a friendly and ambitious Toastmasters club dedicated to helping people grow their public speaking, leadership, networking, and communication skills — whether you are a complete beginner or an experienced professional.

Our members come from a wide range of backgrounds including engineering, management, business, education, marketing, and leadership roles. We are proud to have members serving in high-ranking Toastmasters leadership positions, including District Director and Area Director roles, bringing a wealth of experience, mentorship, and insight to the club.

At Stevenage Speakers, you can:

• Improve your confidence speaking in meetings, interviews, and presentations
• Learn how to structure engaging speeches and communicate clearly
• Develop leadership and management skills
• Practice impromptu speaking in a fun and relaxed environment
• Receive supportive feedback to help you grow
• Network with ambitious and encouraging professionals
• Gain experience in chairing meetings and leading teams

We believe growth happens best in a positive and encouraging atmosphere. Whether your goal is career progression, personal development, overcoming nerves, or simply meeting like-minded people, Stevenage Speakers offers a safe space to learn and thrive.
Guests are always welcome, and there is no pressure to speak on your first visit — just come along, observe, and enjoy the experience!

Join us and discover how powerful confident communication can be.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/4/e/5/a/highres_534200058.jpeg,2026-11-26 19:00:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth,careers}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/stevenage-professional-speaking-meetup-group/events/317090402/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-28 03:22:26.159151+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/stevenage-professional-speaking-meetup-group/events/317090402/,event_317090402@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-28 03:22:26.159151+00,2026-10-28 03:22:29.720496+00,,,meetup:stevenage-professional-speaking-meetup-group:toastmasters online speaking club,"Every 4th Thursday of the month until June 30, 2027",f,
