a0dd2634-75b7-4c48-b90e-d8b722d2eb49,,INTRO TO MACHINE SEWING – 1 DAY,Bookable via our website ➡️ https://www.thegoodlifecentre.co.uk/events/intro-to-machine-sewing-1-day-95/,"**Bookable via our website ➡️** https://www.thegoodlifecentre.co.uk/events/intro-to-machine-sewing-1-day-95/
⋆⋆⋆

If you would love to run up some new clothes or just fix a seam but are daunted by all those controls on a sewing machine, our one-day workshop will demystify them all and send you home with newfound confidence and a simple item you will make during the day.

Experienced tutor Ian McQueen will guide you through how to recognise all the parts of a machine, thread the bobbins, and sew neat rows of stitching on basic materials. How to read rulers and tape measures and cut fabric accurately. Make hems, seam allowances and French seams.

We have various user-friendly machines for you to try which will help you choose if you are planning on purchasing one soon. Bring lots of questions and we will supply everything else.

Our classes are small and each person has a machine to themselves for the day.

This is an excellent confidence booster and a great primer for all of our project sewing courses.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/0/3/0/highres_518381008.jpeg,2026-11-21 10:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,The Goodlife Centre,49/55 Great Guildford Street,London,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,hobbies,socialising}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/thegoodlifecentre/events/316780890/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:46:37.169472+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/thegoodlifecentre/events/316780890/,event_316780890@meetup.com,,2026-10-25 03:19:10.667+00,,2026-10-22 19:46:37.169472+00,2026-10-25 03:19:48.071597+00,,,,,f,GB
db100402-f7f3-4e96-ace2-013ebcc04e32,,Wednesday Photowalk: Tower Bridge and Thames Path South,📸 Join us for our inaugural photowalk!,"**📸 Join us for our inaugural photowalk!**

The walk will start off with some time for coffee and a slice of pizza at Circle and Slice on Whitechapel Road, before we set off south on Mansell Street and traverse Tower Bridge. We will continue on the southern Thames Path all the way along to Waterloo, taking in the iconic sights along the way. All being well, there'll be a chance to grab an optional pint afterwards too!

Digital and film cameras, whether compact, bridge, or system, are all welcome.

As it's our first photowalk, this will be an opportunity for me to test the format and get some feedback about what works and what doesn't, so it will be nice and relaxed. I expect the event to run for about three hours or so, but the duration could vary.

In the event of adverse weather, we will stick around in Circle and Slice for a bit and discuss photography and some of the work we are proud of creating, so feel free to make sure that some of your favourite photographs are saved to your phone.

**📍 Meeting point**
Circle and Slice, 11 Whitechapel Road, E1 1DU
🚉 Aldgate East (District, H&C), Aldgate (Circle, Met)

🎞️ **Need supplies?**
21Studio, 21 Whitechapel Road, E1 1DU
Wex, 37-39 Commercial Road, E1 1LF
*This group has no affiliation with the aforementioned retailers.*

**🍺 Proposed finish location**
Vaulty Towers, 34 Lower Marsh, SE1 7RG

