2db8a5b8-113c-4fbc-94a3-4f710c3749ea,,Through the Lens - Learn all about photography lenses and meet new friends,Hello everyone! We are scheduling a free photography course on lenses! This group is all about learning about photography and meeting likeminded people who share an interest in this great hobby.,"Hello everyone! We are scheduling a free photography course on lenses! This group is all about learning about photography and meeting likeminded people who share an interest in this great hobby.

What you can expect in this group is a mix of theory and practical meetups. The future planned events are intended to be sequential but don’t worry if you miss one, they will be rolling.

In this course we are focusing on lenses and their uses and effects. There will be about 60mins of slides and explanation followed by discussion. You can expect to learn all about focal length, angle of view, depth of field, common terms and issues. Do you know what an ultrawide angle is? What about tilt-shift? We are going to cover all the good stuff.

It does not matter what type of camera you have or at what level you are, this is all about the fundamentals, lens types and “how to” examples and much more. The event will be on Zoom.

Happy Shooting

www.gormteper.net (http://www.gormteper.net)

