92ab9d79-4e30-41c7-a225-b7c7a5d35372,,Public Speaking Meetup – online,"WALK THE TALK Zurich Toastmasters is the place to be if you want to improve your public speaking, communication, and leadership skills.","**WALK THE TALK** Zurich Toastmasters is the place to be if you want to improve your public speaking, communication, and leadership skills.

**Walk the Talk** offers a friendly and inspirational environment for all levels of public speaking experience. Guests and new members are always welcome!

A typical meeting includes 1–3 prepared speeches by members, evaluations of the speeches, and Table Topics – impromptu speaking.

This meeting is online on Zoom. Guests are welcome and encouraged to introduce themselves, participate in Table Topics, and share feedback. Please be on camera if possible and on mute when you're not speaking.

""You can speak well if your tongue can deliver the message of your heart."" John Ford

DISCLAIMER:
We may take pictures/videos of our events and share them online or on social media. If you do not wish to be in the pictures, please let us know before the meeting starts. We will do our best to respect your wishes.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/c/7/0/3/highres_513530947.jpeg,2026-10-28 17:45:00+00,,Europe/Zurich,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/walk-the-talk-toastmasters-club/events/316696386/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/walk-the-talk-toastmasters-club/events/316696386/,event_316696386@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,2026-10-28 03:22:26.69383+00,,,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02:public speaking meetup online:online,,f,
a4fde2b3-2d94-40df-8b30-7a8f4dad1505,,All Out of Bubblegum Film Club 154 / Hellraiser,"Hellraiser is a 1987 British supernatural horror film written and directed by Clive Barker in his directorial debut. Based on his own 1986 novella The Hellbound Heart, the film's plot concerns a…","Hellraiser is a 1987 British supernatural horror film written and directed by Clive Barker in his directorial debut. Based on his own 1986 novella The Hellbound Heart, the film's plot concerns a mystical puzzle box that summons the Cenobites, a group of extra-dimensional, sadomasochistic beings who cannot differentiate between pain and pleasure. It stars Andrew Robinson, Clare Higgins, Ashley Laurence, and Doug Bradley as the leader of the Cenobites.

