c1d965cd-7a2d-43ed-94b9-8d8d17cb7cd3,,🤝 Founders Meetup | Founders for Founders+,Founders for Founders brings you Real conversations for Entrepreneurs building Startups around the world. Every Wednesday.,"***Founders for Founders* brings you Real conversations for Entrepreneurs building Startups around the world. Every Wednesday.**
*Talk it out, build it better.*

• This is a special FREE weekly event for founders around the world: you can check out The Founders for Founders Website (https://f4f.vc/) for more info.

Building something is a rollercoaster, and it's a whole lot better with people who *get it*. Founders for Founders is our weekly get-together where you meet other entrepreneurs, talk through what you're working on, and leave with fresh ideas and new connections.
Here's how it works:

• **⏱️ One hour, once a week:** an easy, energising break in your week
• **🤝 Meet 4 different founders:** we personally put you in touch with four others, so every conversation counts
• **💬 Real talk (English):** share your ideas, talk through your blockers, and get honest opinions from people who've been there
• **🌱 Connections that last:** many of the founders you meet become sounding boards, collaborators, and friends long after the hour is up

**Talk it out, build it better.**

This is a FREE event. No one to impress, just peers who *get it*.
Whether you're deep in the build, just starting out, or somewhere in between, for-profit, nonprofit, or a project you believe in, you're welcome here.

**Where:** We meet on SpeakDuo (https://speakduo.onelink.me/DlwG/meetup), built for live online group events with advanced matching, so you're paired with the right founders for focused, meaningful conversations instead of getting lost in a crowded call.

**RSVP to save your spot:** bring what you're working on, and let's
unite. You can also check upcoming events at f4f.vc/events (http://f4f.vc/events). 🚀",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/2/e/7/highres_535297607.jpeg,2026-10-28 17:00:00+00,2026-10-28 18:00:00+00,Europe/Amsterdam,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,entrepreneurship,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/founders-amsterdam/events/316551210/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/founders-amsterdam/events/316551210/,event_316551210@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,2026-10-28 03:22:26.899552+00,,,meetup:founders-amsterdam:founders meetup founders for founders,"Every week on Wednesday until August 1, 2029",f,
1f1b7e1c-8588-4142-97cd-e4a2351e6332,,"SalsaTrain weekly classes Salsa for beginners, improvers/improver + level","Join us at SalsaTrain for a fun-filled evening of dancing and learning the art of salsa, suitable for all levels! SalsaTrain is in its 5th year now.","Join us at SalsaTrain for a fun-filled evening of dancing and learning the art of salsa, suitable for all levels! SalsaTrain is in its 5th year now.
All aboard! The SalsaTrain every Weds @ the Selhurst Railway Club in South London right by Selhurst Train station. Salsa classes every Weds night from 6.30-11pm.

The classes are fun & interactive with Dominic Insta(Salsa_Legend) with over 20 years salsa experience, and Trish with 10 years teaching experience. Dominic's style is Predominately L.A. on 1/ cuban fusion. He was placed 1st in the Tropicana Tropics World Open Salsa Championship (Ama Division) 2003, has performed with a team of dancers at the 2005 UK salsa congress and placed as runner up in the European Open Salsa Championships (Cab 2007). He has also performed at the Scandinavian Salsa Congress 2009 in Sweden; as part of a team at one of the New York Salsa Congresses and instructed for many salsa promoters within the UK and Internationally.
During lockdown, Dom launched his weekly music show ""Sundown Salsa Live"" on Mixcloud and has played regularly on OSSR radio every Friday 10am-12pm. Trish teaches the beginner class and has had experience teaching with another Salsa Group.

All lessons (45 mins long) include party. No partner necessary.
Free stop - 6.30-7pm Bachata Time (Music and Dance for 30 mins). There will be Bachata Tasters - (Beginners steps - 30 mins - Subject to change).
1st stop - 7-7.45pm Beginners & Improvers
2nd stop - 8-8.45pm Improvers plus level
3rd stop - 9-11pm - PartyTrain Social dancing
Homeward Bound 11pm
£10 for 1 class, £12.50 for 2 classes, £5 for party only. Early bird tickets for beginners Salsa class only for £8.50 & for 2 classes including party train for £10.00 inc Eventbrite fee available until 6.30pm each Tuesday - 24 hours before SalsaTrain.
Boarding from 6.30pm.

