fdfa7199-5b86-4df4-849f-bcae1d9a85aa,,Foil Embossing Workshop,"Join us for a Foil embossing workshop, facilitated by Zareen Tahir. Inspired by our current show: The Rising Crescendo of the Band Baja.","Join Sanaya Havaldar and Zareen Tahir (Zealous Fankar) for a relaxed, hands-on evening exploring the tactile art of foil embossing. Inspired by Adeela Suleman's exhibition The Rising Crescendo of the Band Baja, this beginner-friendly workshop is made for complete newcomers. No artistic experience or crafting skills needed.

What to expect

In this 2-hour guided session, you'll learn how to transform a simple foil sheet into textured relief art. Zareen will guide you step by step through easy techniques to trace, score and push patterns into the foil, so you can create an intricate decorative piece from scratch.

What's included

• All tools and materials, provided on the day

• Your own handcrafted embossed artwork to take home

• Drinks

Event details

• Date: Thursday 29th October 2026

• Time: 6:00 PM – 8:00 PM

• Location: Grosvenor Gallery, 35 Bury Street, SW1Y 6AU

• Tickets: £25 (includes materials and refreshments)

