72ccb168-423b-4b32-b8df-9616da4fbc22,,Founders and Angel Investors and service providers event,"Dream Big: Founders, Investors & Service Providers Networking","**Dream Big: Founders, Investors & Service Providers Networking**
Big ambitions need the right people around them.
Join Tech Launchpads for an evening connecting ambitious founders, aspiring entrepreneurs, angel investors, VCs and startup service providers in Covent Garden.
Whether you’re building a business, looking for a co-founder, exploring investment opportunities or offering expertise to help startups grow, come and meet people who share your ambition.
**Who is it for?**
• Founders and aspiring entrepreneurs ready to take action
• Angel investors and VCs looking to connect with founders
• Service providers in sales, marketing, customer acquisition, technology, finance and legal support
• Potential co-founders, advisers and collaborators
Expect relaxed conversations, fresh perspectives and opportunities to build relationships. You don’t need a polished pitch. Bring your ideas, your curiosity and a genuine interest in others.
📅 **Friday, 30 October 2026**
🕡 **6:30–9:30 pm**
📍 **Middle Eight Hotel, Covent Garden, London**
Come ready to introduce yourself, share what you’re working on and discover how you could help one another.
**Tech Launchpads | Dream Big**
