08b43798-bc55-4f86-af30-c57c0363ecce,,The Artist’s Way – Free Weekly Online Support Group & Book Club for Creatives,"Hi everyone,","Hi everyone,

Thank you for being part of the Playmakers journey — whether you’re brand new or you’ve been with us already, we appreciate you.

Playmakers is a creative community built around one simple idea: play isn’t just for children — it’s a powerful way for adults to connect, recharge, and grow. Over time, we’ll be hosting in-person workshops and events that blend theatre, movement, games, music, writing, and other creative activities to help people develop skills and build community.
For now, we’re keeping things simple.

As a low-barrier entry point into the Playmakers space, we’re running a free weekly online workshop. (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSf9mHEnC3L9PpeMpaRVcsNqQ6EpVR7Bb7HJb8OV1UlGrFIhSg/viewform?usp=dialog) It’s a creative book-club-style group centred around *The Artist’s Way*, where we explore ideas together, share reflections, and gently challenge ourselves in a supportive environment.
Each session stands on its own, so you can join at any point in the year. It doesn’t matter how far we are in the book — there’s no catching up required. Just come as you are and start where we are.
It’s relaxed, welcoming, and you can engage at your own pace. No pressure — just curiosity, creativity, and connection.

**New here?** You can find all the details and sign up via This link - Book Club Sign up Form (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSf9mHEnC3L9PpeMpaRVcsNqQ6EpVR7Bb7HJb8OV1UlGrFIhSg/viewform?usp=dialog) (you’ll receive the Google Meet link after submitting)

**Returning?** You don’t need to fill the form again — just join using the usual link you’ve already received or keep an eye out for our weekly emails.

**Quick favour:** even if you’re a regular, please hit **Attend / RSVP**. It helps the Meetup algorithm push the event to more people and grow the community

**Event details**
**Sundays | 10:30–11:30am**
**Platform:** Google Meet
**What to bring:** something to write with (notebook + pen or Notes app)

For any questions or further info, hit me up at **Taurean@theplaymakersproject.com**.
Looking forward to building this with you.

— Taurean

The Playmakers Project",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792984815/orbit/event-covers/sources/oabswdi65dy9p5ql41d3.jpg,2026-11-08 10:30:00+00,2026-11-08 12:00:00+00,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,books,creative,socialising}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/playmakers-play-creativity-community/events/317026833/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:46:36.725985+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/playmakers-play-creativity-community/events/317026833/,event_317026833@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:19:10.809+00,,2026-10-22 19:46:36.725985+00,2026-10-28 03:19:47.193092+00,,,meetup:playmakers-play-creativity-community:the artist s way free weekly online support group book club for creatives,"Every week on Sunday until February 14, 2027",f,
7190d4ff-6042-4f2c-81ca-c27f93ebc97a,,🤝 Founders Meetup by F4F,Founders for Founders brings you Real conversations for Entrepreneurs building Startups around the world. Every Week.,"***Founders for Founders* brings you Real conversations for Entrepreneurs building Startups around the world. Every Week.**
*Talk it out, build it better.*

• This is a special FREE weekly event for founders around the world: you can check out The Founders for Founders Website (https://f4f.vc/) for more info.

Building something is a rollercoaster, and it's a whole lot better with people who *get it*. Founders for Founders is our weekly get-together where you meet other entrepreneurs, talk through what you're working on, and leave with fresh ideas and new connections.
Here's how it works:

• **⏱️ One hour, once a week:** an easy, energising break in your week
• **🤝 Meet 4 different founders:** we personally put you in touch with four others, so every conversation counts
• **💬 Real talk (English):** share your ideas, talk through your blockers, and get honest opinions from people who've been there
• **🌱 Connections that last:** many of the founders you meet become sounding boards, collaborators, and friends long after the hour is up

**Talk it out, build it better.**

This is a FREE event. No one to impress, just peers who *get it*.
Whether you're deep in the build, just starting out, or somewhere in between, for-profit, nonprofit, or a project you believe in, you're welcome here.

**Where:** We meet on SpeakDuo (https://speakduo.onelink.me/DlwG/meetup), built for live online group events with advanced matching, so you're paired with the right founders for focused, meaningful conversations instead of getting lost in a crowded call.

**RSVP to save your spot:** bring what you're working on, and let's
