596049e4-f8ab-4d56-b7ba-9ff9c6a6f9b1,,Practice Public Speaking | Data Science Speakers Club | IN PERSON,The Data Science Speakers Club is a Toastmasters International club that helps current and next-generation data scientists improve their public speaking skills.,"The Data Science Speakers Club is a Toastmasters International club that helps current and next-generation data scientists improve their public speaking skills.

