d900d8a3-4da2-485d-9dcf-a54696f35555,,London Chrome Hearts and Morning Brews,We are putting together an informal morning meetup for anyone who appreciates the aesthetics and engineering of Chrome Hearts. Whether you have been collecting for years or just have an interest in…,"We are putting together an informal morning meetup for anyone who appreciates the aesthetics and engineering of Chrome Hearts. Whether you have been collecting for years or just have an interest in the craftsmanship and history behind the brand, this is a chance to step away from the screens and connect with others in the city who share the same focus. We will be meeting at a quiet local spot in London to grab a coffee and talk shop, trade stories about favorite pieces, or simply enjoy some good company before the busyness of the weekend takes over.

This gathering is open to anyone in the Classic Chrome and Coffee Social Club community, regardless of how long you have been following the brand. There is no agenda beyond a relaxed conversation and a decent cup of coffee. If you are around on Saturday morning and feel like catching up with like-minded people, we would love to see you there. Please take a moment to RSVP so we can keep an eye on the numbers and make sure we have enough space for everyone to settle in comfortably.",,2026-11-01 19:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,70 Albacore Cres,70 Albacore Cres,London,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,socialising}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/meetup-group-dtjbpjex/events/316868005/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:46:37.169472+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/meetup-group-dtjbpjex/events/316868005/,event_316868005@meetup.com,,2026-10-26 03:19:10.789+00,,2026-10-22 19:46:37.169472+00,2026-10-26 03:19:42.346903+00,,,,,f,GB
164e0987-e133-4157-959c-ceb01f290ca0,,Women in Tech Speed Networking London — After Work,"When did you last talk shop with another woman in tech, properly, not just a quick chat at a conference? This evening is built for that.","*When did you last talk shop with another woman in tech, properly, not just a quick chat at a conference? This evening is built for that.*
**What the event is**
This After Work Speed Networking event is all about careers, connections and opportunities for women in tech. Across 8 short, structured conversations, you'll meet other women working across the industry and build real connections, not just swap business cards. No pitches, no long presentations, just genuine conversation.
**👥 Who should attend**
Women working in software, AI, data, product and cybersecurity, alongside UX and design, tech sales, consulting and technology leadership. Founders will also be in the room. Whatever stage you're at, you'll find people who understand exactly what you're working through.
**🎟️ Your ticket includes**

• 1 drink + a bite, included
• 8 structured conversations
• Open networking before and after the structured session

**Why attend**

• Meet women across the tech industry you wouldn't normally cross paths with
• Talk openly about careers, challenges and what's next, with people who get it
• Build a network you can actually turn to, not just add on LinkedIn
• Enjoy a relaxed evening over drinks with people who share your world

**📅 Agenda**
6:00–6:30pm: Arrival, drinks and open networking
6:30–6:40pm: Welcome and a quick explainer on how the evening works
6:40–7:30pm: Structured networking, 8 short conversations meeting women across the tech industry 7:30–8:00pm: Drinks and open networking continue

Places are limited and these events sell out. Book your ticket now and meet the women shaping tech in London.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/7/9/7/highres_536078807.jpeg,2026-10-27 18:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,Hampton by Hilton London Waterloo,"157 Waterloo Rd, London SE1 8XA, UK",London,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{carrer,growth,technology,entrepreneurship,careers}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/speed-network-now/events/316500200/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:53:33.497215+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/speed-network-now/events/316500200/,event_316500200@meetup.com,,2026-10-24 03:21:51.18+00,,2026-10-22 19:53:33.497215+00,2026-10-24 03:22:26.144448+00,,,,,f,GB
