2e346f9e-7397-4708-9492-d7bd15210cbe,,🧠 FREE Career Clarity Workshop ⚡️,🧠 FREE Career Clarity Workshops ARE BACK! ⚡️,"**🧠 FREE Career Clarity Workshops ARE BACK! ⚡️**

**A Structured Working Session**
90 minutes. Small group. Camera on. You will write, reflect, and leave with something you didn't have before.

**This is not a webinar. This is not a lecture.**
This is a guided working session where you'll go through the first part of the framework I use with my private coaching clients. You'll do the exercises yourself, in real time, in a small group of max. 10 people.

By the end, you'll have three things on paper:
→ An honest snapshot of where you actually are
→ A concrete vision of where you want to be – in your own words
→ The one obstacle that matters most right now

Think of this as the starting point, not the final destination.

**You'll get the most out of this if you…**
**→** feel you could do more, but don't know where to focus
**→** suspect you're underpaid or under-positioned
**→** would love a sparring partner who takes your goals seriously
**→** are curious about coaching but want to experience it before committing
**→** are willing to reflect honestly – even if that feels uncomfortable at first

You don't need to have it all figured out. That's the whole point.

**How to secure your spot**
Spots are limited to 10 and we usually have a waitlist. To make sure every seat goes to someone who's ready to make the most of it, there's a short preparation step.

**1 → RSVP here on Meetup**

**2 → Complete ""The First Step"" on the weekend before the workshop (15 min)**
A short guided introspection that helps you prepare – and helps me tailor the session.
👉 https://tally.so/r/PdOxOV
Your answers are and always will be private.

**3 → Teams link**
The video call will be visible in the event to everyone who signed up on the day of the event. If you realize you will not attend after all, please cancel so people form the waitlist can join.

**Why complete The First Step beforehand?**
The exercises we do in the workshop require you to mentally prepare and put yourself into the right mindset for you to take away the most value. If you come unprepared, the experience will not be the same. Plus, I'll have the chance to prepare the session better once I've seen where you are coming from. The combination of your written reflection and the live session gives you and me a much fuller picture and experience.

The First Step is valuable on its own – the workshop makes it better.

**What to expect**
• Structured exercises with timed writing and small group discussion
• Real insights from my previous clients' journeys
• A safe, supportive space – key questions that make you think deeper
• English or German, depending on participants
• Room for questions throughout with custom feedback

**Event details**
📅 On a Tuesday evening
⏱ 90 minutes
💻 Online – Teams video call
💰 Free
👥 Max. 10 participants

**About me**
I'm Max, career coach, based in Zürich. I've coached 50+ professionals through career pivots, salary negotiations and the hard work of figuring out how to get what they actually want. I ask the right questions, give honest feedback and stay in your corner until you get where you want to go.

More info at wavehoover.com (https://wavehoover.com/).

*Note: RSVP closes on the weekend before the workshop. Take The First Step to get the most out of the session.*",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/3/5/highres_532622613.jpeg,2026-11-04 17:30:00+00,2026-11-04 19:00:00+00,Europe/Zurich,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,careers,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/wavehoover/events/316884935/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/wavehoover/events/316884935/,event_316884935@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,2026-10-28 03:22:26.899552+00,,,meetup:wavehoover:free career clarity workshop,"Every last Tuesday of the month until December 23, 2026",f,
