5e7f7e3d-c39a-4af5-9cdb-1dd411fc374c,,🤝 Founders Meetup | Founders for Founders+,Founders for Founders brings you Real conversations for Entrepreneurs building Startups around the world. Every Wednesday.,"***Founders for Founders* brings you Real conversations for Entrepreneurs building Startups around the world. Every Wednesday.**
*Talk it out, build it better.*

• This is a special FREE weekly event for founders around the world: you can check out The Founders for Founders Website (https://f4f.vc/) for more info.

Building something is a rollercoaster, and it's a whole lot better with people who *get it*. Founders for Founders is our weekly get-together where you meet other entrepreneurs, talk through what you're working on, and leave with fresh ideas and new connections.
Here's how it works:

• **⏱️ One hour, once a week:** an easy, energising break in your week
• **🤝 Meet 4 different founders:** we personally put you in touch with four others, so every conversation counts
• **💬 Real talk (English):** share your ideas, talk through your blockers, and get honest opinions from people who've been there
• **🌱 Connections that last:** many of the founders you meet become sounding boards, collaborators, and friends long after the hour is up

**Talk it out, build it better.**

This is a FREE event. No one to impress, just peers who *get it*.
Whether you're deep in the build, just starting out, or somewhere in between, for-profit, nonprofit, or a project you believe in, you're welcome here.

**Where:** We meet on SpeakDuo (https://speakduo.onelink.me/DlwG/meetup), built for live online group events with advanced matching, so you're paired with the right founders for focused, meaningful conversations instead of getting lost in a crowded call.

**RSVP to save your spot:** bring what you're working on, and let's
unite. You can also check upcoming events at f4f.vc/events (http://f4f.vc/events). 🚀",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/2/e/7/highres_535297607.jpeg,2026-11-11 17:00:00+00,2026-11-11 18:00:00+00,Europe/Amsterdam,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,entrepreneurship,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/founders-amsterdam/events/316776021/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/founders-amsterdam/events/316776021/,event_316776021@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,2026-10-28 03:22:26.899552+00,,,meetup:founders-amsterdam:founders meetup founders for founders,"Every week on Wednesday until August 1, 2029",f,
2aaedf07-3058-4397-8dee-a53d55a3cb9f,,The Monsters Among Us,"How a Hidden Minority Preys on Organisations, Societies, and Nations — and How We Stop Them","How a Hidden Minority Preys on Organisations, Societies, and Nations — and How We Stop Them

There are people in this world whose psychology is profoundly abnormal — organisational predators driven by extreme psychopathy and narcissism. They are few in number, perhaps less than one percent of the population, yet their impact is devastating. They infiltrate organisations, manipulate culture, erode trust, and quietly seize influence. When enabled, they become monsters — unseen, applauded, protected — leaving destruction in their wake.

For decades, Gearóid Carey has studied these individuals and the catastrophic effects they have on teams, communities, governments, and entire nations. In this groundbreaking book, he reveals their psychology, their methods, and the predictable pattern of infiltration, grooming, and colonisation that they use to gain power.

But The Monsters Among Us is not a book about despair — it is a book about the cure.
Carey introduces two revolutionary frameworks capable of stopping organisational predators: Organisational Hygiene and Anti-Tyrannical Measures. When these principles are applied, predators lose their power, organisations recover, and societies thrive. When they are absent, corruption spreads, misery rises, and tyrannous rule emerges.

Inside this book, you will learn:
• How organisational predators think, behave, and manipulate
• Why good people fail to recognise them until it’s too late
• The three stages of organisational capture: infiltration, grooming, colonisation
• How networks of predators coalesce into the powerful superclass
• Why tyranny has been the default condition of civilisation for 10,000 years
• Why liberal democracy is the first real antidote — and why it is under attack
• The essential anti-tyrannical safeguards every free society must defend
• How to apply organisational hygiene to protect teams, institutions, and nations

A warning. A diagnosis. A blueprint for victory.
This book exposes how the superclass manipulates economies, healthcare, food systems, education, and government to serve their own interests — regardless of human suffering. Yet it also offers a path to rebuild integrity and restore freedom.

A call to action
If we understand the monsters, we can defeat them. If we defend liberal democracy and organisational hygiene, their age ends — and the age of human flourishing begins.
This is the end of tyranny — if we are brave enough to defend the light.

For readers of:
Matt Goodwin, Ayaan Hirsi Ali, Jordan Peterson, Douglas Murray, and Robert F. Kennedy Jr.

About the Author
Gearóid Carey is a counsellor, researcher, and writer with over 20 years of experience helping people recover from trauma, addiction, and mental-health crises. He is the creator of the Recovery Tracker and an advocate for transforming society through measurable wellbeing, integrity, and freedom.",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792698511/orbit/event-covers/sources/stcimytiovboslu05wwi.jpg,2027-01-17 19:00:00+00,2027-01-17 19:30:00+00,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,socialising}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/journey-to-democracy/events/fvrpbvykccbwb/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:46:37.169472+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/journey-to-democracy/events/fvrpbvykccbwb/,event_fvrpbvykccbwb@meetup.com,,2026-10-27 03:19:10.711+00,,2026-10-22 19:46:37.169472+00,2026-10-27 03:19:46.873136+00,,,meetup:journey-to-democracy:the monsters among us,"Every week on Sunday until October 8, 2028",f,
