7527c4ef-993b-414d-a7ef-230f12a03a87,,Business Networking Community,"Business Networking Community is a professional platform that brings together entrepreneurs, business owners, freelancers, startups, professionals, and aspiring entrepreneurs who are passionate…","**Business Networking Community** is a professional platform that brings together entrepreneurs, business owners, freelancers, startups, professionals, and aspiring entrepreneurs who are passionate about building meaningful business relationships and growing together.
Our community is designed to help members expand their professional network, exchange ideas, share referrals, discover collaboration opportunities, and learn from one another in a supportive and friendly environment. Whether you're starting a new venture, growing an existing business, or looking to connect with like-minded professionals, you'll find valuable opportunities to build lasting relationships.

Who is this for?

• Business owners and entrepreneurs
• Startups and small businesses
• Freelancers and consultants
• Sales and marketing professionals
• Corporate professionals
• Anyone looking to grow their network and business

What you'll get:

• Regular business networking events
• Opportunities to meet professionals from diverse industries
• Business referrals and collaboration opportunities
• Knowledge sharing, guest speakers, and business discussions
• Access to our dedicated **WhatsApp Community** for networking, event updates, business opportunities, and ongoing support
• Exclusive announcements and resources shared with members

How to Join

Simply register here on meetup to get the google meet link and you can complete our **Google Form** registration to become a member. Once registered, you'll receive an invitation to join our **WhatsApp Community,** where you can connect with fellow members and stay updated on upcoming events, networking sessions, and community activities.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/7/3/4/highres_535205940.jpeg,2026-11-11 13:30:00+00,2026-11-11 14:30:00+00,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{carrer,entrepreneurship,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/business-networking-gb/events/317047729/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/business-networking-gb/events/317047729/,event_317047729@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,2026-10-28 03:22:26.899552+00,,,meetup:business-networking-gb:business networking community,"Every week on Wednesday until January 16, 2027",f,
