44cc697a-1ac7-4b28-8ee6-1726d2b19b29,,How to Build Confidence Without Seeking Approval,"Do you find yourself overthinking conversations, struggling to say no, or putting everyone else's needs before your own?","Do you find yourself overthinking conversations, struggling to say no, or putting everyone else's needs before your own?
Join us for a **free live webinar** exploring how subconscious beliefs and learned behavioural patterns can influence confidence, boundaries, and self-worth.
Designed for ambitious, compassionate women who want to feel more confident expressing their needs, this interactive session offers practical insights into understanding and changing unhelpful patterns.
**What You'll Learn:**

• Why overthinking and people-pleasing patterns can develop.
• How past experiences may influence your confidence and boundaries.
• Practical ways to recognise and challenge limiting beliefs.
• An introduction to Rapid Transformational Therapy (RTT®), including an optional guided relaxation and hypnosis exercise.

