0c033f44-c7fb-4b04-a60f-11603f717d15,,Who Are You Beneath the Roles?,"Join me for an intimate reflection circle inspired by my book, Dear Me Letters.","Join me for an intimate reflection circle inspired by my book, **Dear Me Letters**.

