84a2b8f1-bc83-462f-9142-25d693a567a1,,"Zen Social @ Tate Modern Friday Late, DJ, Events, Activities, Performances! 🎨🎶",ABOUT:,"**ABOUT:**

Get ready for an electrifying evening at **Tate Modern**, where art, socials, and good vibes collide! 🎶🖼️ Housed in the iconic former Bankside Power Station, Tate Modern is a global beacon of contemporary art, showcasing jaw-dropping works from legends like Picasso, Warhol, and Hockney, alongside cutting-edge installations that’ll spark your imagination. 🏛️✨ With its striking industrial architecture, sprawling Turbine Hall, and breathtaking views of the Thames, this isn’t just a gallery—it’s an experience! 🌉

On this late opening night, Tate Modern stays open late, buzzing with **art explorers, tours, and people meeting each other** 🎭 Whether you’re an art aficionado or just love a vibrant atmosphere, there’s something for everyone! This is a **social event**, so you’ll have plenty of chances to mingle, make new friends, and share your excitement over a masterpiece or two. 😄👥

Then keep the night going at the **PopWorld Afterparty**—dance, connect, and celebrate the vibes! 🎉

**Admission Details:**

• **Free for the first sign-ups** secure your spot early! IF YOU CLICKED ATTEND AND ARE ON THE ATTENDEES LIST THEN YOU ARE IN!
• After the free allocation you will have to buy your RSVP through the meetup app. Please show your RSVP on the meetup app to the host on arrival. You are paying for signing up late and having the privilege of joining and mingling with our group and entry to the afterparty. Hosts will be checking RSVPs on the meetup app.

**SCHEDULE:**
🕖 **Until 6:45pm-7:15 PM**: Meet us **inside** the TURBINE HALL entrance. Look for our friendly hosts wearing a lanyard and/or ZEN logo. As you enter the turbine hall we will be gathering a short distance away from the entrance. See uploaded photo

🕖 **7:15 PM–8:30PM**: Dive into the upper floors of the Tate Modern ! 🎉 Explore in small groups, soak up the art, join a workshop, or groove to live music in the Turbine Hall. 🖌️🎨 Pop to the **CORNER Café Bar** to regroup and share your highlights! Unwind with a drink, enjoy the chic vibe, and keep the conversations flowing with your new friends. Check out the vibe here: 🔗 CORNER Café Bar (https://www.tate.org.uk/visit/tate-modern/corner)

**🕤8:30pm:** RECONVENE AT ORIGINAL MEETING POINT

🕤 **8:30pm. Cross the Millennium Bridge and head to POPWORLD, arrive 8:45pm**
17 Watling Street, London, GB EC4M 9BB**. Bring ID and MENTION ZEN for entry.** Route: https://maps.app.goo.gl/zQimhbGUuXT7jSuN9

🎉 **Come for the art, stay for the connections!** This is your chance to experience Tate Modern’s magic, meet awesome people, and make memories in one of London’s most iconic cultural hotspots. See you there! 😎🙌

Important Details

• **Dress Code**: Smart casual; no athletic tracksuits or sports trainers.
• **Bring ID** for entry to the bar venues.
• **More Info**: Check the event page for additional details.
• **Join up now** - if we have a lot of sign ups we may introduce a fee for any additional new joiners (through the meetup RSVP system). Avoid this by signing up early
• **WARNING:** I cannot stress strongly enough about turning up on time as described. I won't be answering any messages or calls from late comers. You will have to use the schedule and guess work to find the group.

**Some Tips:**

1. **Let’s all commit to updating our RSVPs if plans change**—it helps us plan better and ensures great attendance for everyone. If you RSVP “yes” but don’t attend and don’t update your RSVP, you may be removed from the group to keep things fair. No stress, though—you can rejoin for a small £10 fee! Just send me a DM, and I’ll share the PayPal details to get you back in.
2. **Turn Up on Time at the start!** This helps the quality of the event and helps you.
3. If you are struggling with the **app**, use the web page instead, that's what I use.
4. **Attendee Numbers & Guest Lists:** We have this event listed at least on two groups and the guest list includes attendees from all. You can see the list of attendees here:
https://www.meetup.com/zensingles/
https://www.meetup.com/cityzenlondon/
https://www.meetup.com/LoveLife
1. **Join our** **social media**:
**Instagram**: https://www.instagram.com/cityzen.london/
**X:** https://x.com/CityZenLondon
1. **Our WhatsApp group:** [See private comment in the comments section below]. We have a few rules including no ads, no DMs unless recipient is in the ""Direct Messaging List"" or risk removal and £10 rejoin fee.
2. **Support Our Amazing London Event Hosts! 🙌**
Our incredible crew of hosts is the heartbeat of London’s buzzing meetup scene, bringing people together for unforgettable experiences that spark connection, growth, and fun! 🌟 From museum adventures to flirty dating mixers, these rockstar hosts pour their energy, time, and passion into creating events that level up your social and communication skills. But hosting isn’t easy—it takes resources, effort, and heart. 💖
Please consider supporting our hosts with a donation to keep the good vibes…",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/1/0/8/highres_536153512.jpeg,2026-10-30 18:45:00+00,2026-10-30 21:45:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,Tate modern,"Bankside,SE1 9TG",London,8827b689-2637-4245-8ba7-214b35948ea2,"{sport,socialising,music,fitness,arts}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/cityzenlondon/events/316460131/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,source:f26eb5d4-b239-4813-8e0c-3cf689eed4bd,https://www.meetup.com/cityzenlondon/events/316460131/,event_316460131@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:30.379+00,,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,2026-10-28 03:22:55.486349+00,,,meetup:cityzenlondon:zen social tate modern friday late dj events activities performances,"Every 4th Friday of the month until March 7, 2027",f,GB
