2c29b50e-26b2-4238-b484-50a8dae344c9,,Women Founders Speed Networking London — After Work,"Building a business is hard enough without doing it alone. The right conversation tonight could be your next customer, investor or co-founder.","*Building a business is hard enough without doing it alone. The right conversation tonight could be your next customer, investor or co-founder.*
**What the event is**
This After Work Speed Networking event is built around customers, capital and connections for female founders. Across 8 short, structured conversations, you'll meet other women building businesses and talk openly about what's actually working, and what isn't. No pitches, no long presentations, just real conversation between founders.
**👥 Who should attend**
Female founders, entrepreneurs and business owners from across different industries. Some will be just starting out, others further along and happy to share what they've learned. Conversations often cover customers, growth, funding, hiring and partnerships.
**🎟️ Your ticket includes**

• 1 drink + a bite, included
• 8 structured conversations
• Open networking before and after the structured session

**Why attend**

• Meet other founders who understand the reality of building a business
• Find potential customers, partners or investors in one evening
• Get honest advice on a challenge you're currently facing
• Build a founder network you can actually rely on, over drinks, not a pitch deck

**📅 Agenda**
6:00–6:30pm: Arrival, drinks and open networking
6:30–6:40pm: Welcome and a quick explainer on how the evening works
6:40–7:30pm: Structured networking, 8 short conversations connecting founders around customers, capital and growth 7:30–8:00pm: Drinks and open networking continue

Places are limited and these events sell out. Book your ticket now and meet the founders building alongside you.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/f/2/1/highres_536080737.jpeg,2026-11-11 18:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,Hampton by Hilton London Waterloo,"157 Waterloo Rd, London SE1 8XA, UK",London,c78f921f-ce89-4a92-b98f-83bf7cc57102,"{carrer,growth,entrepreneurship,finance,careers}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/speed-network-now/events/316501886/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-24 03:22:25.885011+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/speed-network-now/events/316501886/,event_316501886@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-24 03:22:25.885011+00,2026-10-28 03:22:26.899552+00,,,,,f,GB
d2a176e1-c2a7-4866-977e-f2d545b90f8c,,Dulwich Park Nordic Walking,Ready to get outside? Our Thursday morning session in Dulwich park is back!,"Ready to get outside? Our Thursday morning session in Dulwich park is back!

At this moment we can meet with up to 30 people (of more than two households) to do outdoor exercise and walks. However, i like to keep our exercise groups small, so I have set the maximum participants at 12.

For now this walk is for our experienced Nordic Walkers only, who already used to Nordic Walk with us regularly before Covid 19 kept us indoors, and who have their own Nordic Walking poles.

As this session is outdoors, we will not ask you to wear a face mask, but we do ask you to keep 2 meters apart. Some of our walkers might be immune compromised or more at risk, so please help us keep everyone safe!

Please do not come to the session and stay at home if:
• you know you have been in contact - in the last 2 weeks- with someone with symptoms of possible Covid, or if you have been in contact with someone who tested positive.
• you have any of the following symptoms: (new) Loss of smell/taste, Persistent cough, Fatigue, Loss of appetite, Skin rash, Hives, Fever, Severe muscle pain, Shortness of breath, Diarrhoea, Delirium, Abdominal pain, Chest pain, Hoarse voice, Eye soreness, Sore or painful throat, Nausea or vomiting, Headache, Dizziness or light headedness

We meet by the cafe in the middle of the park.

Session Price: £10 per session, £89 for a 10-session card or £70 unlimited sessions per month. Session cards and pay Monthly can be used in any of our outdoor walks or indoor Zoom classes sessions (except for the Parkinson's sessions).

Pay What Works:
The price shown above is the “true” value of the session that best reflects the work I put into preparing and leading your session. However, I understand that not everyone can afford to pay full price, and I don’t want that to stop you from joining us.

In an effort to find a balance between more financial accessibility and sustainable pricing, I now offer a “Pay What Works” model. This allows for financial flexibility while still valuing and respecting the work and energy I provide in creating and delivering these classes.

Then send an email to ailien@fitandhappyoutdoors.com with the heading “INVOICE please”- followed by “FAHO 1” to pay full price as quoted below, “FAHO 2”, for 20% off, or “FAHO 3” for 50% off.

Pllease do tell me if you want to pay for 10 sessions, or if you’d like to pay monthly.
I prefer payment by bank transfer, but if that is not possible you could pay in cash. No cheques please, the queues by the banks are just too long.

We walk in all safe weather conditions – if a walk is cancelled, we will contact you to let you know. Please check for text messages or Meetup messages before leaving home!",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792698882/orbit/event-covers/sources/uhst1yrm8oyptaxrrutp.jpg,2026-12-24 09:15:00+00,2026-12-24 10:15:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,Pavilion cafe Dulwich Park,"Dulwich Park, SE21 7BQ",London,8827b689-2637-4245-8ba7-214b35948ea2,"{sport,travel,fitness}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/fit-and-happy-outdoors/events/tbpqgsyjcqbgc/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:54:30.136455+00,source:f26eb5d4-b239-4813-8e0c-3cf689eed4bd,https://www.meetup.com/fit-and-happy-outdoors/events/tbpqgsyjcqbgc/,event_tbpqgsyjcqbgc@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:30.379+00,,2026-10-22 19:54:30.136455+00,2026-10-28 03:22:55.75405+00,,,meetup:fit-and-happy-outdoors:dulwich park nordic walking,Every week on Thursday,f,GB
