9dcfdc36-9229-42c0-9aac-bb571737097e,,"Law, Property & Business - Business Networking Event in London, Holborn","Looking for a business networking event in London for property lawyers, solicitors, landlords, investors, developers and property professionals? Join us in the Holborn/Covent Garden area for a…","**Looking for a business networking event in London for property lawyers, solicitors, landlords, investors, developers and property professionals?** Join us in the **Holborn/Covent Garden area** for a quality networking evening bringing together people across **property, law and business**, hosted by digital business card platform GMax Card.
