c59ae588-3f53-4c01-a0ad-dd54996d9ebb,,The Gentlemen’s Business Circle | The First Dinner — Chelsea,THE GENTLEMEN’S BUSINESS CIRCLE,"THE GENTLEMEN’S BUSINESS CIRCLE

The First Dinner — Chelsea

Saturday, 14 November 2026 • 7:00 PM sharp
Côte Brasserie • Sloane Square, Chelsea

An intimate first dinner bringing together a small circle of ambitious and like-minded gentlemen in the heart of Chelsea.

The purpose of this first gathering is simple: to get to know one another, build genuine connections and establish the foundations of the Gentlemen’s Business Circle.

We believe the best conversations happen around one table, in a relaxed and refined atmosphere where everyone has the opportunity to participate.

To preserve this intimate setting and avoid separate subgroups, attendance is strictly limited to 11 gentlemen in total, including the organiser. This ensures that everyone has the opportunity to join the conversation and get to know one another properly.

Conversations may touch on business, investments, property, travel, current affairs and lifestyle. There is no formal agenda and no pressure to network.

This first dinner is the beginning. Future gatherings will explore an increasingly distinguished selection of venues and experiences across London.

Attendance & Refundable Deposit

To secure your place, a £20 refundable commitment deposit is required.

Once you join the group and express your intention to attend, you will be contacted privately with the bank transfer details to arrange your deposit.

As places are strictly limited, this deposit helps ensure that reservations are taken seriously and that everyone who books intends to attend.

The full £20 deposit will be refunded by bank transfer to every guest who attends the dinner.

In the event of a no-show without prior notice, the deposit will be non-refundable.

If you can no longer attend, please notify the organiser as early as possible. Refund arrangements for advance cancellations will be communicated clearly before your booking is confirmed.

This deposit is not intended to generate profit. It is simply a way to respect everyone’s time, minimise last-minute no-shows and ensure a successful gathering.

The Gentlemen’s Business Circle

One table. One circle. Genuine connections.

No pitches. No forced networking. Just good food, interesting conversation and excellent company.

Join our private WhatsApp group for future gatherings, invitations and updates.

https://chat.whatsapp.com/Ii94UmL5osN7Iq75AUNbFL?s=cl&p=i&mlu=4&ilr=4

