c3685655-a08f-4320-94fa-466ab3f45293,,How to trust an AI-driven QA process | Product Builders | AI-Native #5,REGISTER HERE (https://events.zoom.us/ev/AmXiUt1vfen1DP175lVEByT_tpaNKPCB-7Qlv54wpwKgfLaKaDxh~AvbZj426ztA4KIaFDn1_sjDJRxjUy6Qt-mavQkO-RGQ3TNyBiBUokzz-Vq8FCKOaY5Lnq76bdB_5CnebScErpUS1JA),"REGISTER HERE (https://events.zoom.us/ev/AmXiUt1vfen1DP175lVEByT_tpaNKPCB-7Qlv54wpwKgfLaKaDxh~AvbZj426ztA4KIaFDn1_sjDJRxjUy6Qt-mavQkO-RGQ3TNyBiBUokzz-Vq8FCKOaY5Lnq76bdB_5CnebScErpUS1JA)

**How to build an AI QA process that saves the most – and uses human time only where it counts?**

AI doesn't wait for a bug report. In AI-native QA teams, the agent doesn't just run tests – it writes them, maintains them, reacts to code changes, and decides what still needs checking. The catch: code is still the final judge of quality – except now the code is asking itself whether it did a good job.

In this **Product Builders | AI-Native session**, **Piotr Majchrzak** (co-CEO, Boldare) and **Milena Cylinska** (QA Lead & Test Automation Engineer) show how to build a QA process where a human still knows what to trust and what not to – even when AI handles most of the testing.

**You'll learn:**

• how to spot that ""all tests passed"" can be a false sense of security rather than proof of quality,
• exactly where to place checkpoints in QA automation so AI never grades its own work unsupervised,
• how to design a system that earns more autonomy over time – starting small and expanding only based on data, not declarations.

Coming from a team running this in production, the session skips the theory and gets straight to what actually works: a testing process you can trust, and know exactly why.

**About Product Builders | AI Native**

**Product Builders | AI-Native** is a community for practitioners building digital products in the AI era – Substack is where it all comes together.

Monthly live sessions with guests across product, design, and engineering, written articles, show notes, and podcast episodes on **YouTube (https://www.youtube.com/@Boldarecom), Spotify (https://open.spotify.com/show/3VpRL4e89G681woPahmC1L?si=2b36f8353fcb4f90)**, and **Apple Podcasts (https://podcasts.apple.com/pl/podcast/agile-product-builders-by-boldare/id1732493856?l=pl)**. Powered by Boldare.

**👉 Join the Product Builders | AI Native Community:**
