c5390936-274d-4d55-b779-69a59ce23598,,Free Public Speaking: Beginners to Advanced – Central London Toastmasters,🎤 Join Our Free Public Speaking Class in Central London,"🎤 **Join Our Free Public Speaking Class in Central London**

• 🌟 Are you struggling with public speaking or experiencing anxiety about it?
• 👉 Attend our in-person public speaking class, suitable for beginners to advanced speakers, absolutely FREE as a guest!

*You don't need to speak - just observe and learn, or participate if you feel ready.*

**Why Attend Our Public Speaking Class?**

• 💪 **Overcome Public Speaking Fear**
Central London Toastmasters is the premier weekly public speaking club, offering a relaxed and supportive environment. Practice in a safe space where no one judges you, and start your journey to becoming a confident speaker.
• ✨ **Become a Charismatic Speaker**
Enhance your public speaking skills and develop the charisma you've always wanted. Impress your colleagues with smooth, polished presentations and wow your friends with newfound confidence and storytelling abilities.
• 💼 **Improve Business Speaking Skills**
Our meetings are friendly and informal, making them the perfect starting point for building confidence in public speaking. Many of our members began with anxiety, but now speak with total confidence. As a guest, you’ll see firsthand how warm and welcoming our club is, and you can chat with members about their experiences.
• 🏆 **Develop Leadership Skills**
Public speaking is not just about presenting; it's also about leading. Our club provides opportunities to take on leadership roles, helping you to develop crucial skills like team management, decision-making, and strategic thinking that can benefit your personal and professional life.

📅 **Location and Time**

• 📍 Location: Cittie of Yorke pub, Holborn
• ⏰ Time: 6:30 PM – 8:30 PM (Feel free to arrive late and quietly take a seat)

🔄 **What to Expect at Our Meetings**

• The meeting is divided into two halves, each lasting approximately 50 minutes, with a 10-minute break.
• 🎯 First Half: Members participate in impromptu speeches, and guests are invited to introduce themselves by name.
• 📈 Second Half: Members deliver prepared speeches followed by evaluations.
• After the meeting, we enjoy drinks and informal chats, providing a great opportunity to network and learn more about the club.

🎟️ **Interested in Becoming a Member?**
Membership includes access to our online course, Pathways, guiding you step-by-step through your public speaking journey. A full year’s membership, covering 50 weekly meetings, is just £168, plus a one-time £30 registration fee.

**💬 Testimonials from Our Members**

• **“Toastmasters transformed my life!”**
""I went from fearing public speaking to leading meetings at work. This newfound confidence even earned me a promotion!"" – **Alexander**
• **""A warm and supportive club!""**
""From the first meeting, I felt welcomed. The constructive feedback boosted my confidence both in public speaking and daily life."" – **Sarah**
• **""Overcoming my fear was easier than I thought.""**
""The support here made my sales presentations more impactful and less stressful. It's been a game-changer for me professionally."" – **David**
• **""A fun and rewarding experience.""**
""I look forward to every meeting. The sessions are engaging, and I love the socializing afterward."" – **Lucy**
• **""I've grown as a speaker and leader.""**
""Taking on roles in the club has sharpened my leadership skills, making me more effective at work."" – **James**",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/e/1/6/highres_523151798.jpeg,2026-12-01 18:30:00+00,2026-12-01 20:30:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,Cittie of Yorke,22 High Holborn,London,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth,socialising}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/meetup-group-xkeapfpj/events/312459712/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:53:33.497215+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/meetup-group-xkeapfpj/events/312459712/,event_312459712@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-22 19:53:33.497215+00,2026-10-28 03:22:26.899552+00,,,meetup:meetup-group-xkeapfpj:free public speaking beginners to advanced central london toastmasters,"Every week on Tuesday until December 15, 2026",f,GB
daaa649c-1162-4a4a-b9a5-91c7f12f5ed8,,🦇🎬 THE LOST BOYS: ALMOST 40TH ANNIVERSARY (WITH EXTRA GARLIC),"🎡 Sleep all day. Party all night. Never grow old. Never die. Ooooh, I hear it's fun to be a vampire!","🎡 ***Sleep all day. Party all night. Never grow old. Never die. Ooooh, I hear it's fun to be a vampire!***

👋 **Hey guys!** You know, there’s nothing better than **a werewolf hosting a horror comedy about vampires**. And that’s only because I have an open mind. 🐺🧛♂️

This defining piece of **1980s American pop culture** graces us with all the **sexy vampires** we need, **teenage vampire lore** and plenty of **MTV-style fashion and aesthetics**. And that’s not just lip service from me. Consider it my **bite-on-the-neck contribution** for the evening, as this movie pretty much speaks for itself.

Now, the motion picture you’re about to see was directed by the late **Joel Schumacher**, and it’s fast approaching its **40-year mark**. It follows two teenage brothers who move to a California coastal town that just happens to be secretly overrun by vampires. **Sounds like my kind of town.**

**The Meetup:** We’ll be meeting at **7:30 pm** at **Victory House Wine Bar** for some **Vampire Survival Trivia**, with a **Bloody Prize** up for grabs if you know your vampires best. 🧄 Then we’ll head next door to the **Prince Charles Cinema** for the **8:30 pm screening**. You’ll find me in **seat D14** if you’d like to sit in the same row.

**After the film**, at around **10:25 pm**, we’ll regroup at the bar to share our thoughts, discuss the massacre we’ve just witnessed and share our **Letterboxd (https://letterboxd.com/movieroadhouse/)** scores. You’ll also find the **full ticket information, cinema address and map down below**, so you won’t get lost.

You’ll definitely want to **sink your teeth into this one**, especially if you haven’t seen it in a bit. Because **blood always tastes different after a while.** 🩸

**See you guys there!**
**Jonny**

**📸 FOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM**

