88bf3064-f8ca-4d93-a590-0ff386e7ad71,,All Out of Bubblegum Film Club 157 / In The Mouth of Madness,"In the Mouth of Madness is a 1994 American supernatural psychological horror film directed and scored by John Carpenter and written by Michael De Luca. It stars Sam Neill, Julie Carmen, Jürgen…","In the Mouth of Madness is a 1994 American supernatural psychological horror film directed and scored by John Carpenter and written by Michael De Luca. It stars Sam Neill, Julie Carmen, Jürgen Prochnow, David Warner and Charlton Heston. Neill stars as John Trent, an insurance investigator who visits a small town while looking into the disappearance of a successful author of horror novels, and begins to question his sanity as the lines between reality and fiction seem to blur.

