7167a248-34e7-4c04-a729-bc6bd9fa869c,,AI Tech & Startup Night — London,"Nomad Global Hub brings together builders, founders, and tech professionals for a night of curated networking and high-impact startup pitches.","**Nomad Global Hub** brings together builders, founders, and tech professionals for a night of curated networking and high-impact startup pitches.

