With a track record of **235+ events** across **23 global cities** worldwide, we have welcomed over **5,000 attendees** and featured **1,200+ startup pitches** on our stages.

We intentionally keep our meetups intimate because the best partnerships happen in focused, high-quality conversations, not in loud, overcrowded halls.
**What to Expect**

• **Live Tech Startup Pitches**: Watch selected early-stage founders present AI & Tech projects followed by sharp audience Q&A.
• **High-Quality Networking:** Connect with a hand-picked audience of founders, investors, engineers, and tech leaders who value substance over small talk.
• **Global Exposure:** Join a community that bridges **23 tech hubs worldwide**, providing you with a network that extends far beyond a single city.

**Who Should Join**

• Founders & Co-Founders looking for peers, feedback, investors and collaborators.
• Tech Professionals & Builders seeking a high-quality community.
• Ambitious Individuals ready to dive into the AI & Startup ecosystem.

