683a07c1-3f28-4e0f-88b4-d471a915eb5e,,Online discussion of East of Eden by John Steinbeck,📚✨Hello to all the bookworms here 😉 Summer is finally gone and we’re back to our shared reads and discussions!,"📚✨Hello to all the bookworms here 😉 Summer is finally gone and we’re back to our shared reads and discussions!
This time we will discuss East of Eden by J. Steinbeck, which conveniently has its adaptation coming out on Netflix! So we will probably be reading and watching it after as a bonus! ✨😍 Steinbeck once said that all of his books lead up to *East of Eden* — I guess we’ll have to check and see if it’s as great as it is hyped up to be!

You've got time to read it until November 22nd! We're meeting in zoom at noon (12) Barcelona time (the link will be in our telegram chat)

Start now -- the shared file is in our telegram group!
Enjoy!

❗ Remember, to participate in the meeting you should join our Reading BEYOND community (https://t.me/+XWfIOPjZ9282N2Fi) on telegram - all **the links, updates, polls and material are shared there as our main space of communication**!
Also, it's a great place to maintain the habit of reading and connect with fellow readers.

See you in zoom at 12 (CET time), as always ☺️

Are you joining us? ✨

(in case the link doesn't work for some reason, text me there in telegram @allroundmasha! and I'll add you)

MAIN INFO:
I'm an English coach and teacher for adults and a life-long learner, and I host online bookclub and movie discussions for those who love consuming things mindfully (watching and reading), talking about thought-provoking topics, challenging their assumptions and learning something new. All the while using your English, of course!💬🙌 To be able to participate and enjoy the experience it's nice to at least have intermediate level (B2) of English, although the discussions are for everyone who wants to improve their fluency, activate working vocabulary and boost reading, listening and speaking skills!

We meet monthly on Sundays at noon (Barcelona time) online, to chat about a book/ movie / mini-series I propose in advance in our telegram chats. The meeting in Zoom usually lasts around 90-120 minutes, and we continue to chat about it in Telegram several weeks afterwards!
To get updates on the details and connect with like-minded people, please join my Reading and Watching BEYOND communities in telegram

People who come are usually open-minded and fun, some are language nerds or even teachers from all over the world 😊
https://t.me/+XWfIOPjZ9282N2Fi

(in case the link doesn't work for some reason, text me there in telegram @allroundmasha! and I'll add you)

The event is based on small donations and your enthusiasm to learn more and exchange ideas!

Cheers! xx
Masha
