42e87cf9-dda8-4a9f-812e-286c20cfff5c,,London Public Speakers | Toastmasters Club,"Ready to ditch the ""umms"" and conquer your fear of public speaking? 🎤 Then step right up to London Public Speakers (LPS) Toastmasters Club! 🎉","Ready to ditch the ""umms"" and conquer your fear of public speaking? 🎤 Then step right up to London Public Speakers (LPS) Toastmasters Club! 🎉

