7b2e0e39-6655-45e7-a4b4-320312178f2f,,"Networking for founders, creators, freelancers + rebels ⚡","Free monthly meetups for Rebels of all kinds, to connect, learn and share.","**Free monthly meetups for Rebels of all kinds, to connect, learn and share.**

**Topic:** Beyond SEO: How to Rank on ChatGPT, Claude & Gemini

**Guest**:
Our guests this month are Sal Mohammed (Lang Sync) and Charlie Clark (Minty Digital)—two leading specialists in Generative Engine Optimization (GEO) and Answer Engine Optimization (AEO). In this panel discussion, you will learn how AI engines like ChatGPT, Claude, and Gemini choose who to recommend, how to adapt your search strategy for the post-Google era, and the practical steps to ensure your business gets cited and recommended first.

**Format:**
6:30 pm - Doors Open & Networking
7:00 pm - Fireside + Q&A
8:00 pm - Networking

**About:**
Founder-led networking events from founders, creators and successful business owners. There will be a fire side chat with opportunities to network before and after.

