d9de0256-2c02-49e5-8cea-b9c1f2d12642,,"How to Stop Attracting Unavailable Partners, with Aurore Prefumo",You've worked on yourself. You've read the books. And somehow you still end up with someone who can't meet you halfway.,"You've worked on yourself. You've read the books. And somehow you *still* end up with someone who can't meet you halfway.

Here's why: you might be ignoring red flags, over-giving, or staying silent about your needs. **And that trains your nervous system to settle for less.**

**Join our speaker Aurore Prefumo and learn:**
• Why you're drawn to unavailable partners in the first place
• A script to name your needs, without sounding ""too much""
• One boundary to set THIS WEEK that raises your standards in love

At the end, she'll share a deeper half-day workshop for women and men ready to break the pattern for good. Totally optional, no pressure.

Open to anyone ready for something different. 📍 Live on Zoom. Link sent after RSVP.

**About the speaker**

Aurore Prefumo is a coach and hypnotherapist working with relationships, self-worth, and personal transformation. Her own path included years of emotional overwhelm she once saw as simply part of who she was — until deeper work showed her these were patterns, not identity.
Today, she supports clients in rebuilding self-trust and creating more authentic relationships — with others and with themselves. Drawing on Rapid Transformational Therapy (RTT), NLP, and other mindset-based approaches, she works with clients on confidence, anxiety, stress, and the ways these patterns can show up physically as well as emotionally.
*Disclaimer: This session is for general educational and informational purposes only and is not a substitute for medical or mental health treatment. This Meetup group does not provide financial or medical advice.*",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/7/e/7/highres_535962983.jpeg,2026-11-11 20:00:00+00,,Europe/Amsterdam,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/amsterdam-start-your-online-business-today/events/317071026/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:53:34.160664+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/amsterdam-start-your-online-business-today/events/317071026/,event_317071026@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-22 19:53:34.160664+00,2026-10-28 03:22:27.129706+00,,,,,f,
5ecd2963-296d-4f63-a73e-415d5c7eceed,,Cuentos elegidos de Augusto Roa Bastos - Paraguay,"Premio Cervantes e Insignia de la Orden francesa de Artes y Letras, entre muchos otros. Es el escritor más importante de Paraguay y uno de los más importantes escritores del siglo veinte en español.","Premio Cervantes e Insignia de la Orden francesa de Artes y Letras, entre muchos otros. Es el escritor más importante de Paraguay y uno de los más importantes escritores del siglo veinte en español.
Desafortunadamente, la mayoría de sus libros están descatalogados, al menos en Europa, y solo veo algunos ejemplares de segunda mano en papel, lo que no garantiza el acceso a todo el mundo. Además, su obra principal es bastante difícil de leer. Propongo, en cambio, esta selección de cuentos que se puede descargar en pdf de internet y que podría compartir en el grupo de WhatsApp.
Los cuentos del escritor paraguayo Augusto Roa Bastos destacan por su realismo crudo, la profunda influencia de la tradición oral y guaraní y la fuerte presencia de temas políticos como el exilio, la represión y la lucha de clases.
Temas Centrales
Denuncia social y política: Aborda la marginalidad, el autoritarismo, la delación y las constantes persecuciones políticas que sufrió a lo largo de su vida.
El exilio y el destierro: Al haber vivido más de cuarenta años fuera de Paraguay, el desarraigo es una constante ética y vital en sus tramas.
La naturaleza vs. el hombre: Conflictos psicológicos y físicos donde el entorno natural (como en sus célebres relatos sobre los carpincheros) moldea la vida de los personajes.
El pdf con sus Cuentos elegidos se puede bajar de manera gratuita en en el siguiente enlace: chrome-extension://efaidnbmnnnibpcajpcglclefindmkaj/https://www.unae.edu.py/libroferia/images/2021/Cuentos-Selectos-Augusto-Roa-Bastos.pdf",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/7/5/b/highres_506018747.jpeg,2026-11-05 19:00:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,socialising}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/virtual-spanish-and-latin-american-literature-book-group/events/316182917/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:46:37.169472+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/virtual-spanish-and-latin-american-literature-book-group/events/316182917/,event_316182917@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:19:10.809+00,,2026-10-22 19:46:37.169472+00,2026-10-28 03:19:47.776315+00,,,,,f,
