37f64ce4-8764-490a-9870-d8738b874e22,,INTRO TO WOODTURNING,Bookable via our website ➡️ https://www.thegoodlifecentre.co.uk/events/intro-to-woodturning-124/,"**Bookable via our website ➡️** https://www.thegoodlifecentre.co.uk/events/intro-to-woodturning-124/
**⋆⋆⋆**

If you have ever seen wood turned on a lathe and been intrigued by the bowls and forms made on it, this one-day workshop will demystify the technique and teach you basic techniques to make a simple bowl and a hardwood barreled pen.

You will be led by expert, Nathan Cardwell who is a passionate woodworker and a patient tutor. When not with us, he teaches woodwork in a London boy’s school. Nathan will introduce the parts of the lathe and explain how to safely secure your work, the methods to use with each chisel and how to sand and finish your projects.

During the day you will learn the ’Headstock method’ to make a small bowl in hardwood and ‘Spindle turning’ to make a wooden tube that fits into a metal pen mechanism.

We will supply everything so come with curiosity and enthusiasm and leave with satisfaction, a bowl and a ready-to-use rollerball pen.

We will also advise you on how to continue this fascinating hobby with guidance on buying your own lathe, tools and timber.",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792898433/orbit/event-covers/sources/vtmgif6kvl1ldv715pnx.jpg,2026-11-21 10:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,The Goodlife Centre,49/55 Great Guildford Street,London,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,socialising,hobbies}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/thegoodlifecentre/events/316780971/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,220.00,220.00,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-25 03:19:47.028458+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/thegoodlifecentre/events/316780971/,event_316780971@meetup.com,,2026-10-27 03:19:10.711+00,,2026-10-25 03:19:47.028458+00,2026-10-27 03:19:46.873136+00,51.503124,-0.096614,,,f,GB
02da1549-5352-44f6-9158-15b39470c0f5,,"""A Beautiful Mind"": A Book Club for Everyday Intentions - Introduction","🔴This is not a traditional reading circle, a self-help group, or a religious gathering.","🔴This is not a traditional reading circle, a self-help group, or a religious gathering.

🟢This is a shared space focused on mindful living. We want to move from passive reading to active behavior. **Our goal is to explore how different perspectives can help us rethink our daily experiences.**

We read books focused on human values—such as the Dalai Lama’s *The Art of Happiness* —as practical guides to navigate our daily lives with greater wisdom. You only need a positive desire to bring these fresh perspectives into your everyday life!

Inner Development and the Well-being of Others

Working on our own minds and bringing peace to others are completely inseparable. When we change how we view a stressful situation, the impact is simultaneous: we ease our own friction and release reactive thinking, while instantly bringing ease, patience, and empathy to the people around us. We develop ourselves while benefiting others.

How Our Gatherings Work

The book is a tool to help us rethink our lives. When we meet, our conversation centers on these reflections:

• What perspective from the reading helped you take distance and observe a daily situation differently this month?
• Did you notice yourself becoming more aware of your automatic reactions when holding this new lens?
• In what ways did pausing to observe the situation allow you to bring more ease to the people you encountered?

Keeping the Circle Safe

To ensure everyone has the time to speak in a quiet, manageable environment, we strictly limit our active meetings to 8 members.

How to Join Us

RSVPing ""Yes"" does not automatically guarantee a spot. If this approach resonates with you, please send a short direct message answering.",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1793157600/orbit/event-covers/sources/niapcc3ewhvlvygpobty.jpg,2026-11-04 17:00:00+00,,Europe/Berlin,online,Online event,,,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,books,socialising}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/a-beautiful-mind-a-book-club-for-everyday-intentions/events/317145404/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,0.00,0.00,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-28 03:19:46.398197+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/a-beautiful-mind-a-book-club-for-everyday-intentions/events/317145404/,event_317145404@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:19:10.809+00,,2026-10-28 03:19:46.398197+00,2026-10-28 03:20:01.398857+00,,,meetup:a-beautiful-mind-a-book-club-for-everyday-intentions:a beautiful mind a book club for everyday intentions introduction,"Every 1st Wednesday of the month until January 5, 2027",f,
