5112f841-1af3-4ee3-8bb1-07c6102d3d83,,AI Work Walks London: What Has AI Actually Changed About Your Job This Year?,The question for this walk: What Has AI Actually Changed About Your Job This Year?,"**The question for this walk: What Has AI Actually Changed About Your Job This Year?**
Not what’s supposed to change. What actually has. Bring the real version, including the parts where nothing moved.We walk in pairs and small groups, and I'll mix people up once or twice along the way so you get a proper conversation with three or four people.

**Who this is for**
People trying to make AI work inside organisations. Adoption and transformation leads, L&D and HR, operations, product, policy, risk, internal comms, engineers and builders, consultants doing this for clients.

**What this isn't**
If you're here to sell, this isn't the one.

**Meeting point:**
Under the clock on the main concourse at Waterloo station, by the Pret. We leave the station at 18:25 sharp, so please be on time.

**Route:** down to the South Bank and east past the National Theatre and Tate Modern, over towards Borough. Finishing at The Mudlark by Southwark Cathedral for a drink with whoever has time. London Bridge station is two minutes from there for your way home.

**RSVPs include one question. I read the answers, so please give me a line.**

Running late on the night: 07491656653 or message me here.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/4/d/2/d/highres_536419757.jpeg,2026-11-04 18:15:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,Waterloo Station,"Waterloo Station, London SE1 7ND, UK",London,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth,careers,technology,ai}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/ai-work-walks-london/events/316824928/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:53:33.497215+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/ai-work-walks-london/events/316824928/,event_316824928@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-22 19:53:33.497215+00,2026-10-28 03:22:26.899552+00,,,,,f,GB
c888feba-114d-42ca-a1ed-e47438eda173,,The Must know Secrets Of Financial Intelligence: Become Financially Independent,"We fully endorse the policies and principles of Meetup in our effort to run a successful business group. However, we want to emphasise that we do not provide any financial services or assurances,…","We fully endorse the policies and principles of Meetup in our effort to run a successful business group. However, we want to emphasise that we do not provide any financial services or assurances, and we cannot guarantee any specific outcomes. It is important to note that all our Meetup sessions are free of charge.

**Unlock My 3-Step Blueprint to Create Wealth and Master Money Management - Without Sacrificing Your Lifestyle**
**Join Charles and discover powerful yet simple money strategies to take control of your finances, reshape your money mindset, build lasting wealth, and achieve true financial freedom.**

We're navigating turbulent economic waters - soaring inflation, rising interest rates, potential recession. Yet even in challenging times, opportunities abound for those who can adapt and thrive regardless of circumstances.

The question is: What can you do to not just survive, but flourish despite external economic forces?
The truth is, your internal money mindset and personal financial habits will influence your wealth-building success far more than any external events.

Recent upheavals have exposed how ill-prepared most people are for financial setbacks like job loss or increased costs. With no emergency fund or backup plan, a short-term crisis quickly becomes catastrophic.
But it doesn't have to be that way for you.
