Subject to availability, tickets will also be sold on the door.

About Kennington Noir

An occasional series of film noir screenings at the Cinema Museum.
See all Cinema Museum Events presented by Kennington Noir here. (https://cinemamuseum.org.uk/schedule/category/events/kennington-noir/)

We will meet from 7pm at the venue. Further details to be added.

