As this session is outdoors, we will not ask you to wear a face mask, but we do ask you to keep 2 meters apart. Some of our walkers might be immune compromised or more at risk, so please help us keep everyone safe!

Please do not come to the session and stay at home if:
• you know you have been in contact - in the last 2 weeks- with someone with symptoms of possible Covid, or if you have been in contact with someone who tested positive.
• you have any of the following symptoms: (new) Loss of smell/taste, Persistent cough, Fatigue, Loss of appetite, Skin rash, Hives, Fever, Severe muscle pain, Shortness of breath, Diarrhoea, Delirium, Abdominal pain, Chest pain, Hoarse voice, Eye soreness, Sore or painful throat, Nausea or vomiting, Headache, Dizziness or light headedness

We meet by the cafe in the middle of the park.

Session Price: £10 per session, £89 for a 10-session card or £70 unlimited sessions per month. Session cards and pay Monthly can be used in any of our outdoor walks or indoor Zoom classes sessions (except for the Parkinson's sessions).

Pay What Works:
The price shown above is the “true” value of the session that best reflects the work I put into preparing and leading your session. However, I understand that not everyone can afford to pay full price, and I don’t want that to stop you from joining us.

In an effort to find a balance between more financial accessibility and sustainable pricing, I now offer a “Pay What Works” model. This allows for financial flexibility while still valuing and respecting the work and energy I provide in creating and delivering these classes.

Then send an email to ailien@fitandhappyoutdoors.com with the heading “INVOICE please”- followed by “FAHO 1” to pay full price as quoted below, “FAHO 2”, for 20% off, or “FAHO 3” for 50% off.

Pllease do tell me if you want to pay for 10 sessions, or if you’d like to pay monthly.
I prefer payment by bank transfer, but if that is not possible you could pay in cash. No cheques please, the queues by the banks are just too long.

We walk in all safe weather conditions – if a walk is cancelled, we will contact you to let you know. Please check for text messages or Meetup messages before leaving home!",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792698882/orbit/event-covers/sources/uhst1yrm8oyptaxrrutp.jpg,2026-11-26 09:15:00+00,2026-11-26 10:15:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,Pavilion cafe Dulwich Park,"Dulwich Park, SE21 7BQ",London,8827b689-2637-4245-8ba7-214b35948ea2,"{sport,travel,fitness}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/fit-and-happy-outdoors/events/tbpqgsyjcpbjc/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,10.00,10.00,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:54:30.136455+00,source:f26eb5d4-b239-4813-8e0c-3cf689eed4bd,https://www.meetup.com/fit-and-happy-outdoors/events/tbpqgsyjcpbjc/,event_tbpqgsyjcpbjc@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:22:30.379+00,,2026-10-22 19:54:30.136455+00,2026-10-28 03:22:55.75405+00,51.445515,-0.079015,meetup:fit-and-happy-outdoors:dulwich park nordic walking,Every week on Thursday,f,GB
3ba6cb12-2e1b-4159-b8c1-a89f98c37c49,,Artist's Way Free Course,The Artist’s Way – weekly creative circle,"**The Artist’s Way – weekly creative circle**
Each Tuesday we work through one chapter of Julia Cameron’s *The Artist’s Way* together.

**Before each session:**

• Read (or listen to) that week’s chapter
• Keep up your morning pages
• Take your artist date

**Please bring:**
Your book, a notebook and a pen.

**How the session runs:**

• **Check-in:** how your morning pages and artist date went, and anything significant from your week
• **Tasks:** we work through the chapter’s tasks together as quiet writing exercises
• **Reflection:** a short share at the end, only if you’d like to

**A safe space**
This is a peer-led circle, not a class or therapy group. We’re all in it together, including me.
What’s shared here stays here. You don't have to share, and nobody will be fixed or critiqued. Different views are welcome, shared with kindness.

Cameras on, at least during check-in and sharing - seeing each other helps us all feel safe and connected. You can turn them off during quiet writing time. If you need yours off at some point, just let us know at the start of the session.
Sessions are not recorded.

This work can sometimes bring things up. If it does, please be gentle with yourself and reach out to someone you trust, or to a professional if you need more support.

**Schedule**

• 27 Oct – Week 2: Recovering a Sense of Identity
• 3 Nov – Week 3: Power
• 10 Nov – Week 4: Integrity
• 17 Nov – Week 5: Possibility
• 24 Nov – Week 6: Abundance
• 1 Dec – Week 7: Connection
• 8 Dec – Week 8: Strength
• 15 Dec – Week 9: Compassion
• 22 Dec – Week 10: Self-Protection
• 29 Dec – Week 11: Autonomy
• 5 Jan – Week 12: Faith

Dates around Christmas may change; I’ll confirm nearer the time.
However your week went - seven days of pages or none - you are welcome to join. Just come as you are.

**WhatsApp group**
We also have a WhatsApp group for support between sessions - sharing pages done, artist date ideas and little breakthroughs. Please see under **Event Chat** to join. Please note that members can see each other’s phone numbers.

Dom",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1793071190/orbit/event-covers/sources/uijudafh6qsrvpavufjw.jpg,2026-11-03 19:30:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,socialising,books}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/meetup-group-givbfttm/events/317074754/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,0.00,0.00,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-27 03:19:45.380416+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/meetup-group-givbfttm/events/317074754/,event_317074754@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:19:10.809+00,,2026-10-27 03:19:45.380416+00,2026-10-28 03:19:47.10558+00,,,meetup:meetup-group-givbfttm:artist s way free course,"Every week on Tuesday until January 12, 2027",f,
76933548-9261-4121-a9cd-ee8dfcd29953,,The Artist’s Way – Free Weekly Online Support Group & Book Club for Creatives,"Hi everyone,","Hi everyone,

Thank you for being part of the Playmakers journey — whether you’re brand new or you’ve been with us already, we appreciate you.

Playmakers is a creative community built around one simple idea: play isn’t just for children — it’s a powerful way for adults to connect, recharge, and grow. Over time, we’ll be hosting in-person workshops and events that blend theatre, movement, games, music, writing, and other creative activities to help people develop skills and build community.
For now, we’re keeping things simple.

As a low-barrier entry point into the Playmakers space, we’re running a free weekly online workshop. (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSf9mHEnC3L9PpeMpaRVcsNqQ6EpVR7Bb7HJb8OV1UlGrFIhSg/viewform?usp=dialog) It’s a creative book-club-style group centred around *The Artist’s Way*, where we explore ideas together, share reflections, and gently challenge ourselves in a supportive environment.
Each session stands on its own, so you can join at any point in the year. It doesn’t matter how far we are in the book — there’s no catching up required. Just come as you are and start where we are.
It’s relaxed, welcoming, and you can engage at your own pace. No pressure — just curiosity, creativity, and connection.

**New here?** You can find all the details and sign up via This link - Book Club Sign up Form (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSf9mHEnC3L9PpeMpaRVcsNqQ6EpVR7Bb7HJb8OV1UlGrFIhSg/viewform?usp=dialog) (you’ll receive the Google Meet link after submitting)

**Returning?** You don’t need to fill the form again — just join using the usual link you’ve already received or keep an eye out for our weekly emails.

**Quick favour:** even if you’re a regular, please hit **Attend / RSVP**. It helps the Meetup algorithm push the event to more people and grow the community

**Event details**
**Sundays | 10:30–11:30am**
**Platform:** Google Meet
**What to bring:** something to write with (notebook + pen or Notes app)

For any questions or further info, hit me up at **Taurean@theplaymakersproject.com**.
Looking forward to building this with you.

— Taurean

The Playmakers Project",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792984815/orbit/event-covers/sources/oabswdi65dy9p5ql41d3.jpg,2026-12-20 10:30:00+00,2026-12-20 12:00:00+00,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,books,creative,socialising}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/playmakers-play-creativity-community/events/317144673/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:46:36.725985+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/playmakers-play-creativity-community/events/317144673/,event_317144673@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:19:10.809+00,,2026-10-22 19:46:36.725985+00,2026-10-28 03:19:47.193092+00,,,meetup:playmakers-play-creativity-community:the artist s way free weekly online support group book club for creatives,"Every week on Sunday until February 14, 2027",f,
