881aace9-e2fa-4de1-b700-b12c7236d032,,Film Discussion: The Life of Chuck,Join us for a friendly discussion of the film The Life of Chuck directed by Michael Flanagan based on Steven King's book with the same name.,"Join us for a friendly discussion of the film The Life of Chuck directed by Michael Flanagan based on Steven King's book with the same name.

