4b43e9ea-d5cd-40d3-91ea-a93efd91b847,,Nervous System Support: Reclaim Energy and Start Where You Are,"To truly manage chronic pain and fatigue, one must understand the underlying biological systems at play. Federica, an ICF-certified coach, presents an analytical look at nervous-system-informed…","To truly manage chronic pain and fatigue, one must understand the underlying biological systems at play. **Federica, an ICF-certified coach,** presents an analytical look at nervous-system-informed recovery. This session utilises systems thinking to explain why traditional approaches to stress often fail and how energy-safe tools can create a more predictable, sustainable life structure. Learn the principles of **""Energy-Safe Transformation""** to optimise your recovery and reclaim your professional and personal clarity.

**Key Takeaways:**

• **The Biology of Survival:** An analytical look at why the nervous system stays in survival mode.
• **Systemic Interruptions:** Understanding the mechanics of the ""Boom & Bust"" cycle.
• **Resource Management: T**he foundations of energy-safe tools for stress and fatigue.
• **Future-Proofing:** Strategies for building a meaningful life within your current energy capacity.

**Mandatory Disclaimer: Educational only. No financial promises, guarantees, or services offered.**",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/7/3/3/a/highres_536609498.jpeg,2026-10-29 14:00:00+00,,Europe/Amsterdam,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/amsterdam-remote-work-ai-digital-skills-collective/events/316982781/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-25 03:22:33.838204+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/amsterdam-remote-work-ai-digital-skills-collective/events/316982781/,event_316982781@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-25 03:22:33.838204+00,2026-10-28 03:22:26.899552+00,,,,,f,
a90e6887-295f-4771-b07e-9b38d008fbe4,,How to Start a Profitable Print-on-Demand Business Using AI (Free Live Webinar),🚀 Live Online Webinar – Build a Print-on-Demand Income with AI,"🚀 Live Online Webinar – Build a Print-on-Demand Income with AI

