64859a75-95a2-4225-b93b-41f4425a9511,,November Goal Setting Workshop,Don’t drift into November. Decide what you want from it.,"Don’t drift into November. **Decide what you want from it.**

Join us for a practical, interactive workshop designed to help you **get clear on what you want to achieve, understand why it really matters, and turn it into actions you can actually follow through on.**

This isn’t a webinar where you sit and listen. You’ll be working on **your own goal**, completing short exercises and joining **small breakout rooms** to talk things through with other people who are working towards something too.

Together, we’ll help you:

• **Get clear on what you really want**
Take something you want to achieve in November and turn it from a vague intention into a *clear, specific goal*.
• **Connect with why it matters**
Go beyond the obvious answer and uncover the *real reason* you want to achieve it. When the month gets busy, knowing your why helps you stay focused.
• **Turn your goal into action**
Break your goal down into *milestones and commitments*, so you leave knowing what you actually need to do next.

Throughout the workshop, you’ll have opportunities to **share, reflect and work with others in breakout rooms**. Sometimes saying your goal out loud, explaining why it matters and hearing somebody else’s perspective is exactly what helps things click.

Whether your goal is about your **career, business, health, relationships, a personal project**, or simply getting yourself back on track, bring something that genuinely matters to you.

*You don’t need to arrive with the perfect goal.*

**Come with something you want to change. Leave knowing what you’re going to do about it.**

**Frequently asked questions**

**Will the workshop be recorded?**
No, none of our workshops are recorded for privacy reasons.

**Does my camera need to be on?**
Yes, this is an interactive workshop with breakout sessions, so having your camera on is idea.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/8/3/a/highres_536558970.jpeg,2026-10-25 19:00:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,4cece675-2670-4581-90e6-2b792576b047,"{carrer,careers,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/accountability-club-london/events/316586036/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/accountability-club-london/events/316586036/,event_316586036@meetup.com,,2026-10-25 03:21:52.286+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,2026-10-25 03:22:34.639528+00,,,,,f,
