255b6692-9ee7-46f4-9210-2ae98dafe97f,,"Women in Tech, Fintech, AI, Startups, Business Event",PLEASE MAKE SURE TO BOOK YOUR TICKET IN ADVANCE TO ATTEND THE EVENT. YOU CAN RESERVE YOUR SPOT HERE.…,"**PLEASE MAKE SURE TO BOOK YOUR TICKET IN ADVANCE TO ATTEND THE EVENT. YOU CAN RESERVE YOUR SPOT HERE. https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/women-in-tech-fintech-ai-startups-business-event-with-elevator-pitch-tickets-2002210748246**

**You are invited to take part in Women Entrepreneurs and Professionals Business Networking Event !**
Join us for an empowering and insightful networking event designed for professionals in the dynamic fields of Women in Tech, Fintech, Artificial Intelligence, Startups, and Entrepreneurship. This event is a melting pot of ideas and innovations, bringing together the brightest minds and trailblazers in these sectors.

**You will also be able to join the dedicated Whatsapp group for the event and start networking before the actual event.**

**Event Overview:**

• **Women in Tech:** An exclusive platform for women in technology to share their experiences, challenges, and triumphs. This segment focuses on empowering female professionals and entrepreneurs in the tech industry, offering a space to connect, learn, and inspire.
• **Fintech:** Dive into the world of financial technology with experts and innovators. Explore the latest trends, discuss challenges and opportunities, and connect with peers who are shaping the future of fintech.
• **AI:** Engage with professionals at the forefront of Artificial Intelligence. Whether you’re a developer, a strategist, or simply an AI enthusiast, this segment offers a deep dive into emerging technologies, ethical considerations, and groundbreaking applications.
• **Startups:** A space for startup founders and entrepreneurs to network, share stories, and gain insights. This segment is perfect for those looking to scale their startups, seeking mentorship, or wanting to learn from successful entrepreneurial journeys.
• **Entrepreneurs:** Connect with fellow entrepreneurs across various industries. Discuss strategies, share experiences, and explore potential collaborations. This is an ideal platform for both seasoned and aspiring entrepreneurs.
*
• **Why Attend?**
• **Networking Opportunities:** Meet and connect with professionals across diverse yet interconnected fields.
• **Knowledge Sharing:** Learn from leaders and peers, and gain valuable insights that can propel your career or business forward.
• **Collaboration and Growth:** Discover potential collaborations, partnerships, and ways to expand your professional network.
• **Inspiration:** Get inspired by success stories and innovative ideas that are driving these industries.

**Who Should Attend the event?**

• **Female Professionals in Tech**
• **Fintech Enthusiasts and Professionals**
• **AI Innovators and Tech Buffs**
• **Startup Founders and Team Members**
• **Aspiring Entrepreneurs**
• **Investors and Venture Capitalists**
• **Business Consultants and Advisors**
• **Academics and Researchers**

This diverse group of attendees ensures a dynamic and multifaceted networking event, full of potential for new insights, collaborations, and business development opportunities.

How our event works:
7.00pm - When you arrive your name will be checked off the guest list, the host will direct everyone to the reserved area and explain how the event will work.
7.30pm – Event starts, you will be introduced to each other in a nice relaxed environment in the semi private reserved area.
8 pm - Short presentations.
8:30 pm- Networking
10 pm - Event ends, all guests are welcome to stay and enjoy chatting with each other.
Dress code is either business or office attire or smart casual, no T-shirts, no trainers.
Ticket for 1 person allows 1 person to enter the venue from 7pm
If you have any questions email contact@thebusinessminds.co.uk

Please Note:

