6473ad8d-b966-493b-b614-5ea2a863c9c7,,Founder Mixer & Business Networking | Saturday Social in Covent Garden,"Looking for a business networking event in London with a more social, founder-led atmosphere, and on a Saturday? Join us for a Business Networking & Founder Mixer in Covent Garden. Hosted by London…","**Looking for a business networking event in London with a more social, founder-led atmosphere, and on a Saturday?** Join us for a Business Networking & Founder Mixer in Covent Garden. Hosted by London tech startups GMax Card, Ciitab, and Getshop Today.

