5ff48951-7520-48d2-a08b-0a4cbe353ca5,,Make This Your Print-on-Demand Breakthrough Year,Make 2026 Your Print-on-Demand Year,"**Make 2026 Your Print-on-Demand Year**
**Turn Your Creativity into Cash, No Experience Needed**

If you're thinking about starting a new income stream or finally launching something of your own, **there’s no better moment than right now**. A new year brings new opportunities, and 2026 is set to be a breakthrough year for creative entrepreneurs who know how to use the right technologies.

Whether you're a total beginner or already exploring digital products, this live webinar will show you how **AI is transforming print-on-demand (POD)** into one of the easiest and most flexible ways to build a creative business from home.

**Meet Your Speaker**
Nigel Wymer is a veteran mentor, Etsy expert, and successful entrepreneur with over **16 years of POD experience**. He has helped thousands launch and grow profitable stores.
***Nigel recently appeared on Channel 4’s Can You Make 10K in 10 Days? on 9 January****, presented by Scarlett Moffatt, where he discussed print-on-demand and how the model works in practice. The programme explored a range of side hustles and is now available to watch on catch-up.*

**What You’ll Learn**
