f365e9bf-6200-4e34-85b6-46bb6e6a3dea,,Cybersecurity & Business Risk Speed Networking London — After Work,"Most breaches start with a person, not a system. Tonight, the people who understand that meet the people who don't yet.","*Most breaches start with a person, not a system. Tonight, the people who understand that meet the people who don't yet.*
**What the event is**
This After Work Speed Networking event brings together the technical and non-technical people responsible for managing organisational risk. Across structured speed networking sessions, you'll meet people from different parts of the business and exchange real perspectives on cybersecurity, not sales pitches. No presentations, just useful conversation.
**👥 Who should attend**
CISOs and cybersecurity professionals, alongside IT, CFOs and finance teams, legal, risk and compliance specialists. HR, insurance professionals, business owners and cybersecurity or technology providers will also be in the room.
**🎟️ Your ticket includes**

• 1 drink + a bite, included
• 8 structured conversations
• Open networking before and after the structured session

**Why attend**

• Understand how other parts of the business think about cybersecurity risk
• Meet the technical or non-technical contacts you actually need
• Get honest input on gaps you might not have considered
• Build connections with people who take risk seriously, not just IT

**📅 Agenda**
6:00–6:30pm: Arrival, drinks and open networking
6:30–6:40pm: Welcome and a quick explainer on how the evening works
6:40–7:30pm: Structured networking, 8 short conversations connecting technical and non-technical risk owners 7:30–8:00pm: Drinks and open networking continue

