96d059b6-8db7-424e-9c27-64479b4402b5,,Book Review : Emma Grede - Start With Yourself,Join us for our first meeting of Book Club for Women in Business - Ireland!,"Join us for our first meeting of Book Club for Women in Business - Ireland!
We’ll be discussing **Start With Yourself by Emma Grede**.
Tuesday 17 November, 10am to 11am, online.
**Why I selected this book:**
Emma Grede faced a huge viral backlash after describing herself as a “three-hour mum” on weekends. It sparked debate about work-life balance, ambition and whether women are judged by different standards to men.
Her challenge to the idea of “empowering women” also raises an interesting question: does that language help us, or suggest we need someone else to give us power?
There’s plenty to discuss, whether you agree with her or not!
We’ll start with brief introductions, then discuss:
• What stood out to you?
• What did you agree with, and what would you challenge?
• Does the advice make sense for our businesses and lives here in Ireland?
• What’s one idea you’d like to put into practice?
Whether you’re running a business or thinking about starting one, you’re welcome. Please come even if you haven’t finished the book.
You can read it or, like me, listen on the way to school drop-off!
Find the audiobook here, or use your preferred bookshop or audiobook service:
https://audiobookstore.com/audiobooks/start-with-yourself
Looking forward to meeting you!
Georgia",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792898426/orbit/event-covers/sources/ylov5t9il6ot1bmlikja.jpg,2026-11-17 10:00:00+00,,Europe/Dublin,online,Online event,,,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,books,socialising}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/business-book-club-for-women-in-business-ireland/events/317101488/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,0.00,0.00,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-25 03:19:47.028458+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/business-book-club-for-women-in-business-ireland/events/317101488/,event_317101488@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:19:10.809+00,,2026-10-25 03:19:47.028458+00,2026-10-28 03:19:47.776315+00,,,,,f,
