3b981df9-3383-41d9-afe5-ae619b91224d,,"Street Photography - Creative Composition - Layering, Depth & Perspective",Photography is a two dimensional art form which means your photos can look flat. This workshop has been designed to help you create a sense of depth and create interest in your images.,"Photography is a two dimensional art form which means your photos can look flat. This workshop has been designed to help you create a sense of depth and create interest in your images.

