86fd5da3-231a-4cf6-82fc-2fd4357e6f6e,,✨ Fantasy STANDALONE: Sword of Kaigen by M.L. Wang 🌊⚔️❄️,Sword of Kaigen by M.L. Wang (651 pages),"**Sword of Kaigen by M.L. Wang (651 pages)**
**Genre:** Fantasy • Military Fantasy • Epic Fantasy

**Summary:**
On the remote Kusanagi Peninsula, generations of powerful warriors have trained to defend the Kaigenese Empire from foreign threats. Among them are the legendary Matsuda family, whose members possess extraordinary elemental abilities passed down through bloodlines and tradition.
Misaki Matsuda has spent years burying her own ambitions beneath the expectations of wifehood and motherhood, while her son Mamoru dreams of becoming a great warrior like his ancestors. But when long-hidden truths begin to emerge and war arrives at their doorstep, both mother and son are forced to confront everything they believe about duty, sacrifice, and the stories nations tell themselves.
Combining breathtaking action with deeply emotional character work, *Sword of Kaigen* is a powerful standalone fantasy about family, loss, resilience, and the devastating cost of war.

Join the Sci-Fi/Fantasy Series Squad! 🚀📚

If you’ve ever gotten halfway through a fantasy or sci-fi series and needed a little group support to finish, this is your crew. We’re reading one book a month together—so you can keep pace, stay motivated, and enjoy deep-dive discussions without feeling overwhelmed.

How It Works:

🪐 **Series Focus:** We're tackling one sci-fi or fantasy book per month. This September, we're diving into *Sword of Kaigen* by M.L. Wang—one of the most beloved modern standalone fantasy novels.

🙌 **No Pressure Zone:** Didn’t finish the book? No stress. Come anyway—we’ll chat about the world-building, characters, favorite quotes, and wildest twists.

📍 **Join us at the Dog & Bull (Surrey Street) in Croydon on Wednesday 28th of October at 7:00 PM**
Grab a drink, prepare your fighting spirit, and let’s venture into the windswept world of Kaigen together.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/b/9/e/highres_534583934.jpeg,2026-10-28 19:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,The Dog,"24 Surrey St, CR0 1RG",Croydon,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,socialising,books}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/croydon-bookworms-book-club-in-person/events/315119343/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:46:36.725985+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/croydon-bookworms-book-club-in-person/events/315119343/,event_315119343@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:19:10.809+00,,2026-10-22 19:46:36.725985+00,2026-10-28 03:19:47.193092+00,,,,,f,GB
