What You'll Learn

During this live demonstration, Paul will explore:

• 🤖 **AI Marketing Agents:** How AI can assist with content creation and marketing campaigns.
• 📱 **Social Media Automation:** How businesses can schedule and publish approved content with less manual effort.
• 💬 **AI Sales Advisors:** How intelligent assistants can respond to customer questions and suggest relevant products.
• 🛍️ **Digital Products:** How online courses and digital products can be incorporated into an online business.
• 📩 **Automated Lead Generation:** How websites can capture leads and automatically deliver free resources.
• 🔗 **Connected AI Systems:** How different tools can work together to support marketing, sales, and customer engagement.

Who Is This Webinar For?

This event is perfect for:

• Aspiring entrepreneurs exploring online business opportunities
• Side-hustle enthusiasts interested in digital business models
• Small business owners wanting to improve productivity
• Professionals curious about AI and automation
• Beginners who want to understand how AI business systems work

**No previous AI or technical experience is required.**

Meet Your Presenter — Paul

Paul will guide attendees through a demonstration of an AI-supported online business system, showing how marketing, lead generation, customer engagement, and digital products can be connected.
Rather than focusing on learning dozens of separate AI tools, this webinar explores how integrated systems can simplify everyday business activities.

Why Attend?

AI is changing how businesses approach routine work, content creation, and customer communication.
This webinar provides an opportunity to discover what's possible, ask questions, and better understand the benefits and limitations of using AI in business.
You'll leave with ideas to consider for your own entrepreneurial journey.

Reserve Your Spot!

