9352876d-7df1-46ac-aa19-77263dec24f5,,Monetize your Substack [NIFTY LAB],Build a Substack That Compounds: A 1-Hour Practical Lab for Growing and Monetizing Your Newsletter,"Build a Substack That Compounds: **A 1-Hour Practical Lab for Growing and Monetizing Your Newsletter**

This is not a lecture.

It’s a working session.

In this 1-hour lab, we’ll go through a short mini-course on how to grow and monetize a Substack — then we’ll break it down together and apply the ideas directly to your own business.

We’ll look at:

• why newsletters often stall at a low subscriber count
• how to create a content system that attracts the right readers
• how cross-promotions can help you grow without ads
• when it makes sense to introduce a paid tier
• how to think about converting free subscribers into paying members
• how to build a simple 90-day plan that keeps compounding over time

The goal is not just to learn the theory.

**The goal is to leave with a clearer strategy** for how Substack could actually **make** **money** inside your business.

You’ll listen, discuss, ask questions, and then work through how the ideas apply to your own offer, audience, content and monetization model.

This lab is for you if:

You’re considering starting a Substack, already have one that feels stuck, or want to understand how a newsletter can become more than “just content.”

Bring your business, your questions and something to take notes with.

By the end of the hour, you should have a much clearer idea of:

**what to publish, how to grow, and how your Substack could eventually make money.**

See you at the lab!",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/d/0/c/5/highres_536333445.jpeg,2026-10-30 08:30:00+00,,Europe/Brussels,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/the-business-lab/events/316732525/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-25 03:22:33.838204+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/the-business-lab/events/316732525/,event_316732525@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-25 03:22:33.838204+00,2026-10-28 03:22:27.129706+00,,,,,f,
2cfa3e95-ae4e-4ec3-ba93-d047911079a9,,No Man's Mare by Djuna Barnes (The Shorter the Better),"YEAR 7, EPISODE 313","YEAR 7, EPISODE 313

TITLE: No Man’s Mare
DATE: Monday, 23 November 2026

Hi! Welcome to The Shorter the Better, the Short Story Reading Club.

On Monday, 23 November 2026, at eight o’clock in the evening London time, 20:00 GMT we will be discussing the short story No Man’s Mare by Djuna Barnes.

Here you have the link to the short story:

