1cf23c0f-f0d9-4bf7-8a49-969ae729e9d1,,What Do Recruiters Find When They Search Your Name?,A default avatar and zero activity on LinkedIn are not doing you any favours.,"A default avatar and zero activity on LinkedIn are not doing you any favours.

Hiring practices, economic uncertainty and AI-driven screening have changed the job search, and it's not enough to simply register with a job board and hope for the best. Before a hiring manager calls you, they look you up, so the image you project online is already part of your application.

In this interactive session you'll learn how to use AI to take charge of that image. We'll focus on your LinkedIn profile, then look at how posting, commenting and joining professional conversations shape what people see when they search for you.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/f/f/f/highres_536408191.jpeg,2026-11-10 18:00:00+00,,Europe/Berlin,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,careers,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/ai-readiness-career-lab/events/316810216/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/ai-readiness-career-lab/events/316810216/,event_316810216@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,2026-10-28 03:22:27.129706+00,,,,,f,
ecc783e0-2d84-4bfd-82f1-66c106bdce91,,☕ Girls’ Coffee & Support Club,☕ Girls’ Coffee & Support Club,"☕ Girls’ Coffee & Support Club

Real Talk • Real Connections • Supporting Each Other

📅 When: Last Saturday of every month 🕐 Time: 1pm–4pm
📍 Where: White City House,
, next to the BBC Centre
2, Television Centre, 101 Wood Ln, London W12 7FR

Join us on the last Saturday of every month, from 1pm to 4pm, at a cosy café in Soho House, White City, next to the BBC Centre.

Life in London can be busy, balancing work, responsibilities, relationships and personal goals. Sometimes, we just need a space to slow down, enjoy a coffee and have meaningful conversations with like-minded women.

Our monthly girls’ club is all about real conversations, genuine connections and supporting one another through life’s journey. Whether you want to talk about work, share experiences, discuss life’s challenges, exchange ideas or simply meet new friends, you’re welcome here.

💕 No pressure, no judgement — just good coffee, honest conversations and women supporting women.

Come as you are, bring your stories and leave with new connections. Let’s make time for ourselves and build a supportive community of women in London! ☕❤",,2027-04-24 12:00:00+00,2027-04-24 15:00:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,BBC Broadcasting House,"BBC Broadcasting House, Portland Place, W1A 1AA",London,8827b689-2637-4245-8ba7-214b35948ea2,"{sport,fitness,food}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/globegirls/events/rqgsbvykcgbgc/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,source:f26eb5d4-b239-4813-8e0c-3cf689eed4bd,https://www.meetup.com/globegirls/events/rqgsbvykcgbgc/,event_rqgsbvykcgbgc@meetup.com,,2026-10-25 03:22:37.598+00,,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,2026-10-25 03:23:00.161242+00,,,meetup:globegirls:girls coffee support club,Every last Saturday of the month,f,GB
f40e0a88-37c9-4d71-85e4-65df3fc2fc02,,Coffee Social — Fitzrovia,Sign-up is only possible via the WeMeet app: https://onelink.to/wemeet,"**Sign-up is only possible via the WeMeet app:** https://onelink.to/wemeet
**Sunday afternoon, London, nothing on? Come for a coffee.** 👋
An hour, a table, a few new people. **No agenda, no going-round-the-table introductions** — just sit down and see who you end up talking to. Coffee, tea, whatever you fancy, everyone orders their own. ☕
Usually **4 to 6 people**. Nearly all of them come on their own and don't know anyone beforehand. **That's rather the point** — nothing to bring, nothing to prepare, nobody to know. Just turning up is enough.
💬 **There's no host at this event — what there is instead is the event chat.** Do say hello there beforehand, it makes finding each other on the day much easier.
The table is booked under **""WeMeet by WeRoad""**.
🙏 **And please only sign up if you actually plan to come** — it's fairer to everyone else who'd like a spot, and to the café holding seats for us.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/4/8/e/f/highres_536478671.jpeg,2026-10-25 14:30:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,London,"London, UK",London,8827b689-2637-4245-8ba7-214b35948ea2,"{sport,socialising,fitness,food}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/wemeet-london/events/316865708/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,source:f26eb5d4-b239-4813-8e0c-3cf689eed4bd,https://www.meetup.com/wemeet-london/events/316865708/,event_316865708@meetup.com,,2026-10-25 03:22:37.598+00,,2026-10-22 19:54:29.549376+00,2026-10-25 03:23:00.161242+00,,,,,f,GB
e70b3139-87cf-4251-b841-87eadea89c12,,"Knit, crochet, stitch and chat!",Welcome! We hope you'll join us!,"Welcome! We hope you'll join us!

Please bring your current project and grab a chair!

We’re an informal group, not a class, and there’s no fee to attend. If you're able, please do order a drink or snack at the bar...The Canbury Arms welcomes our group every Monday evening and we like to show our appreciation!

If you are experiencing symptoms related to Covid-19, please do not attend the event. We’ll be very happy to welcome you at the next one!

Find us:

We meet in the restaurant side of the pub. Upon entering from the main door on Canbury Park Rd, veer to the right and make your way into the dining room; we sit at the banquette tables along the wall to the right. If in doubt, please ask at the bar! You can order drinks and snacks at the bar or use the 'Young's - On Tap' app.

Christine teaches beginning knitting, intermediate/advanced knitting techniques, and beginning crochet. If you would like a private lesson for yourself or your small group, please get in touch for details. Currently, Christine is only teaching in a private capacity.

Chat with us on Discord:

Our group has a Discord server for staying in touch outside of our regular Monday meets! If you are a current or past member who attends in-person meet-ups, and you're interested in even more yarny chat, this is the place to join in! Contact Christine or Aisha for an invite.

