915051ec-e8f6-4e80-894a-e46628608659,,"'Filmmakers' social sit-down: BFI-NFT box-office bar (on Theatre Ave, Southbank)","Come along to BFI-NFT for a relaxed sit-down social - 1st Monday every month, 7pm: An informal meetup open for anyone pursuing or developing personal film-making goals, however big or small. *(See…","Come along to BFI-NFT for a relaxed sit-down social - 1st Monday every month, 7pm: An informal meetup open for anyone pursuing or developing personal film-making goals, however big or small. *(See location info for where to find us)

**Format / Schedule:**
This isn't a formal networking event: it is for newcomers and outsiders, to be able to meet and chat. No pressure to pitch - you can discuss your film goals and background as much or little as you wish.

Also a chance to exchange input about any events and resources that you may have found useful (or not!) - anything that may help each other find what they need.
(Nothing beats word of mouth :)

**7.00pm-7.45pm** -
Arrive / Get drinks or food.

**7.45pm-8.30pm** -
We will take some time to speak as a group and share (if you are comfortable):
-To say what we're most looking to find, from networking.
-What we've found most hard to find, so far.
-What we've found most easy to find.

-To take the opportunity to exchange personal information, and share any resources we’ve come across which would be useful to others.

**8.30pm- 9.30pm**
You're welcome to stay on longer and keep chatting, no pressure to stay, we'll be meeting every month.
....

Free to attend- No expectation of professional background, or active projects - just interest :) To connect with others, creatively or socially.

A space to discuss your personal film-making interests or goals, with new faces - or to catch up with faces you already know.

We'll have a table space in the rear cinema lobby-bar, from 7pm. To rear of building, on Theatre Avenue *(not the riverfront side). Look out for a sign.

Make sure to RSVP and update if you can't attend, so we have idea of numbers.

And feel free to message via here if you have queries prior to attending.

**ACCESS:**
-Venue has step-free access, via more than one entrance.
