d14d5bbf-c60f-4f0b-b7ed-24886a26c05b,,🦖🎬 GODZILLA MINUS ZERO (IMAX FILM & SOCIAL),"🦕 It looks like the original King of the Monsters is heading back this way, and I’m pretty sure I know what that means. Now those Tinseltown imposter monsters can F off.","🦕 **It looks like the original King of the Monsters is heading back this way, and I’m pretty sure I know what that means. Now those Tinseltown imposter monsters can F off.**

👋 **Hey guys!** And pardon my French, I just couldn’t resist the headline. You know, it just feels completely justified to see Japan’s original **King of the Monsters** push everything else aside for a change. And what makes **Minus Zero** particularly special is that it’ll be the first Toho Godzilla film to receive a near-simultaneous international release. As it should be.

This new entry is once again written and directed by the genius **Takashi Yamazaki**, who also returns to oversee the visual effects. **Now pay attention,** this is the **official sequel** to **Godzilla Minus One (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r7DqccP1Q_4)**, so **please don’t confuse the two of them**, as they are completely different movies.

This one picks things up in **1949**, two years after the tumultuous events of **Godzilla Minus One**, and continues the story of the Shikishima family as they face an all-new catastrophe. **Now, enough said. Let’s move on to the meetup!** 🦖

**THE MEETUP:** If you’re a monster film enthusiast, we’ll most likely be watching this one in **IMAX**, with a few drinks and a catch-up before the film. Then afterwards, we’ll get together for a **monstrous discussion**, including our reviews and **Letterboxd (https://letterboxd.com/movieroadhouse/)** scores. **Final details and exact times will be updated as we get closer to the release date, so keep a sharp eye on this page.**

You know, **sometimes Hollywood monsters just make me sick**, so I’m glad, glad, glad to see Japan finally taking centre stage. 🇯🇵

**See you guys then!**
**Jonny**

