6a7e605b-6cfa-4c40-970e-7dbd1d630446,,Film Discussion: The Life of Chuck,Join us for a friendly discussion of the film The Life of Chuck directed by Michael Flanagan based on Steven King's book with the same name.,"Join us for a friendly discussion of the film The Life of Chuck directed by Michael Flanagan based on Steven King's book with the same name.

