39643805-375e-4fdf-ba0a-ac72463dfdb2,,This is Fascism—Rosan Smits,"This is the most important book we’ll be reading this year. In the face of emerging fascism, this fucking shit needs to be defeated by turning political apathy into action: by reading and watching…","This is the most important book we’ll be reading this year. In the face of emerging fascism, this fucking shit needs to be defeated by turning political apathy into action: by reading and watching key sources, discussing them with others, continuing the conversation with family and friends, and mobilising ourselves. Democracy can only survive with well-informed citizens.

