1fc2239a-dd8c-4f3a-b957-27abd39d865e,,A Cure For Brainrot bookclub 02 - Bataille & Barker,"A Cure For Brainrot is a non-fiction book club reading philosophy/politics/psychology paired with a film each month. This month, Bataille & Barker.","A Cure For Brainrot is a non-fiction book club reading philosophy/politics/psychology paired with a film each month. This month, Bataille & Barker.

**Make Your Brain Work Good**
At our October 2026 session we will be discussing:
Book: *Eroticism* (part one) by Georges Bataille
Film: *Hellraiser* (1987) by Clive Barker
We don't read or watch the materials at the event. We will be using the film to help us understand and apply the ideas in the text and critique both.
We will be discussing part one of Eroticism - you won't have to read part two to participate.

**Event Details**
We meet on the first floor of The Idea Store in Lab 1a, 7-8.50pm, on the last Wednesday of each month.
