e1b34ca6-d55d-44fe-a225-7f298ec15b2f,,How Money Really Works: What Banks and Schools Never Taught You,"Most people were never taught how to properly manage money, build wealth, or make financial decisions that create long-term stability.","Most people were never taught how to properly manage money, build wealth, or make financial decisions that create long-term stability.

That’s why so many people work hard but still feel stuck financially.

This free online Financial Education Workshop is designed to change that.

In this session, we will cover:

✔ How to increase and better manage your income
✔ How to set clear financial goals that actually work
✔ The basics of getting on the property ladder sooner
✔ Simple strategies for mortgage acceleration
✔ How to start saving and investing for the long term
✔ Retirement planning and financial security
✔ Introduction to building generational wealth

…and practical steps you can start using immediately.

Who this is for:

This workshop is for anyone who feels:

• Like they’re working hard but not moving forward financially
• Unsure how to start building savings or wealth
• Ready to take control of their financial future

Important:

This is a free educational session, but spaces are limited to keep it interactive.

I’ve also put together a free guide you can use after this session so you don’t just learn this you actually apply it.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/2/f/4/highres_533841236.jpeg,2026-11-08 19:00:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth,finance}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/money-and-mindset-coaching/events/316992969/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-24 03:22:25.885011+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/money-and-mindset-coaching/events/316992969/,event_316992969@meetup.com,,2026-10-26 03:21:52.922+00,,2026-10-24 03:22:25.885011+00,2026-10-26 03:22:29.106722+00,,,,,f,
