8f48db9e-dc92-4c46-992f-6e9b49aceb30,,Ideas to Live: Lunch Break Edition,REGISTER HERE (https://femfounders.space/events/ideas-to-live-lunch-break-edition-11),"REGISTER HERE (https://femfounders.space/events/ideas-to-live-lunch-break-edition-11)

Have an idea but not sure where to start?
use your launch break to turn it into a clear plan.

**What you will gain**
You will learn a practical four-step framework for taking an idea from concept to launch. You will receive live feedback from the host and fellow founders, gain clarity on your first customer and your smallest viable first version, and leave with one concrete action to take this week.

After the session, you will receive a one-page Idea to Launch checklist.

**Who it is for**
This session is designed for aspiring founders with an idea they have not yet started, early-stage founders seeking a fresh perspective, and anyone curious about what it takes to start a business.

**Format**
The session opens with a short workshop, followed by live idea clinics in which selected members share their ideas and receive actionable next steps. No preparation is required. Simply bring your idea, even if it is still in its early stages.

Places are limited to keep the session interactive.
The Zoom link will be sent to registered attendees.

