6bad39ed-2e34-4a09-aa61-c04e1d6f1443,,"Public Speaking, Communication & Leadership Development",International Lunchtime Toastmasters (ILTM) is a club to improve public speaking and developing communication & leadership skills.,"International Lunchtime Toastmasters (ILTM) is a club to improve public speaking and developing communication & leadership skills.

Now we meet on the 1st and 3rd Tuesday at lunchtime, 12:00-13:15 (currently online on Zoom) for regular meetings, where we practice our communication & leadership skills in a welcoming and inspirational environment.

What makes ILTM special, is that we speak 3 languages in our meetings; **English**, **French** and **German**. You are welcome to speak in any of these languages, at least 2 of them. Fluency is not required, and indeed, many levels of linguistic ability are presented and encouraged! This international audience is the perfect practice for using simple language that everybody can understand.

We also come together if there is a 5th Tuesday of the month for unconventional meetings.

ILTM is part of the worldwide Toastmasters International organisation and offers a very inspiring and supportive environment.

We look forward to meeting you!",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/f/c/0/highres_490708608.jpeg,2026-11-03 11:00:00+00,2026-11-03 12:15:00+00,Europe/Zurich,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/international-lunchtime-toastmasters-club/events/315969407/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/international-lunchtime-toastmasters-club/events/315969407/,event_315969407@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,2026-10-28 03:22:27.129706+00,,,meetup:international-lunchtime-toastmasters-club:public speaking communication leadership development,"Every 1st Tuesday of the month until January 30, 2027",f,
