da472180-99ea-4197-b3ee-a6a6176e27e2,,"Putting ""Think and Grow Rich"" Into Action","Chapter 7 - Organized Planning, the Crystallization of Desire into Action","**Chapter 7 - Organized Planning, the Crystallization of Desire into Action**

What separates those who dream from those who achieve? The answer lies in organized planning; the bridge between ambition and success. In this deep dive into Chapter Seven of ""Think and Grow Rich"", we’ll unpack Napoleon Hill’s blueprint for turning your goals into actionable, step-by-step plans. From assembling the right team to mastering persistence, discover how to craft a roadmap that transforms your vision into reality. Are you ready to move beyond wishful thinking and start building the life you’ve always wanted?

Every week, we delve into one of the **13 principles of success**, exploring how to incorporate it into our daily actions to meet our objectives. Our sessions include a live online study group where participants can engage and learn together to gain valuable insights on how to utilize this knowledge for your own success.
Think and Grow Rich was the first book to boldly ask, ""What makes a winner?"" The man who asked and listened for the answer, Napoleon Hill, is now counted in the top ranks of the world's winners himself.

**Group Guidelines:**
This group is meant to be interactive. Having your video on is encouraged but not required. Come with questions and an open mind. My goal is to provide a safe and engaging environment for us to learn from each other and walk away feeling empowered to take action. Please practice kindness and respect. We'll summarize key takeaways from previous weeks, so don't worry if you missed the last one; drop in at any point in the book!

“There’s something really powerful about groups and shared experiences. People might be skeptical about their ability to change if they’re by themselves, but a group will convince them to suspend disbelief. A community creates belief.” — Charles Duhigg
Let's think and grow rich together!

Looking forward to meeting with you,
Dave and Doug",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/e/0/1/2/highres_536277362.jpeg,2026-11-10 19:00:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/london-e-business-owners-meetup-group/events/316864954/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.927193+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/london-e-business-owners-meetup-group/events/316864954/,event_316864954@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.927193+00,2026-10-28 03:22:27.129706+00,,,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02:putting think and grow rich into action:online,,f,
