32f19f85-c3ff-4d8c-a691-16ef0f90d3b2,,£99 Business Workshop: Who Is Your Ideal Customer? Drive More Leads,Who Is Your Ideal Customer - Building a Customer Avatar to Drive More Leads,"Who Is Your Ideal Customer - Building a Customer Avatar to Drive More Leads

Do you know who your ideal customer is? Most entrepreneurs would say my products or services are for everyone but that can be a very costly and dangerous decision. Why? A customer who isn't your ideal customer can exhaust your time and resources, and even cost you more than what you would have gained.

This workshop will focus on identifying who your ideal customers are, their buying behaviours, pain points and interest. This level of insight will help you understand your customers and it will help you create marketing strategies that will resonate to them, which can drive higher conversion rates.

By understanding what your customers want, you can also develop and improve products or services in an effective way.

RSVP Today!

Kind regards,

Julia Afdasta

Life & Business Coach | Director

