43bd82bc-9c29-4011-b704-f36fd2e81b8d,,🐴🎬 WILD HORSE NINE (FILM & DISCUSSION),🕵️♂️ I've killed people in countries you can't even spell...,"**🕵️♂️ I've killed people in countries you can't even spell...**

👋 **Hi guys!** We’re meeting up again for another **film and discussion**, this time for **Martin McDonagh’s new 2026 film**. It’s his first film in four years, and we’ll be peeling this one like an onion.

This **black comedy and action thriller**, set in **1973**, stars the brilliant duo of **Sam Rockwell** and **John Malkovich** as two eccentric CIA agents stationed on the remote, horse-populated Easter Island. The film is an **o**riginal screenplay by McDonagh himself, inspired by his desire to set a story there while weaving in real historical events.

**The Meetup:** We’ll begin with a **meet and greet** before the movie, then afterwards we’ll get together again for a **film discussion** and decide whether this one gets our seal of approval with our **Letterboxd (https://letterboxd.com/movieroadhouse/)** scores. **Full timings and meetup details will be added nearer the date, so check back here for updates.**

So come grab a drink and join your fellow film lovers as we find out whether this sharp-witted and absurd spy satirelives up to the description!

**I look forward to seeing you guys there!**
~ **Faheem**

