fa370df8-9876-4064-81c6-85680b6960e4,,Fantasy Book Club - Buffalo Hunter Hunter by Stephen Graham Jones,Come and join us to talk about this fascinating book!,"Come and join us to talk about this fascinating book!

From the New York Times bestselling author of The Only Good Indians comes a tale of the American West, writ in blood.

This chilling historical novel is set in the nascent days of the state of Montana, following a Blackfeet Indian named Good Stab as he haunts the fields of the Blackfeet Nation looking for justice. It begins when a diary written in 1912 by a Lutheran pastor is discovered within a wall in 2012.

What is unveiled is a slow massacre, a nearly forgotten chain of events that goes back to 217 Blackfeet dead in the snow, told in the transcribed interviews with Good Stab, who shares the narrative of his peculiar and unnaturally long life over a series of confessional visits.

This is an American Indian revenge story, captured in the vivid voices of the time, by one of the new masters of literary horror, Stephen Graham Jones.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/e/3/b/2/highres_535918290.jpeg,2026-11-17 19:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,"The Angel, 61 St Giles High St",London,WC2H 8LE,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,books,socialising}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/london-fantasy-book-club/events/316345964/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:46:37.169472+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/london-fantasy-book-club/events/316345964/,event_316345964@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:19:10.809+00,,2026-10-22 19:46:37.169472+00,2026-10-28 03:19:47.193092+00,,,,,f,GB
f8477239-5a8c-4d42-a3cd-e383d78a9530,,"Property Investor Networking London Kensington | Investors, Developers & Agents","Free monthly property investor networking in London Kensington. Bring a deal, find capital, JV partners, agents, lenders and developers.","**Free monthly property investor networking in London Kensington.** Bring a deal, find capital, JV partners, agents, lenders and developers.

👉 **Grab your FREE ticket here (required for entry):** https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/property-deal-network-london-kensington-pdn-investor-networking-event-tickets-1975243447323

Property Deal Network (PDN) is a relaxed monthly meetup for property investors, developers and professionals who want to do business face-to-face.

**What happens at PDN London Kensington?**
People bring deals. Others bring capital. Some are sourcing their next project, others are looking for JV partners or professional services. The format is simple: arrive, grab a drink and start conversations. No presentations, no pitches from the front – just direct networking with people who are actively working in property.

**Who attends?**
Investors (from first-timers to portfolio landlords), developers, sourcing agents, brokers, solicitors, architects, lenders and accountants. If you're involved in property – or want to be – you'll find relevant people here.

**Practical details**
• **When:** Thursday 5 November 2026, from 7pm local time
• **Venue:** The Builders Arms, 1 Kensington Court Place, London W8 5BJ
• **Cost:** Free to attend. The venue asks that everyone buys a drink at full price
• **Dress:** Smart casual (no sportswear). Over 25s only; ID may be requested

This is an established event that runs every month (except December) – if this date doesn't work, there's always next month. All London Kensington dates: https://www.propertydealnetwork.com/locations/united-kingdom-networking-events/london-kensington-property-networking-event/

**Industry professional?** Paid promotion tickets (max 2 per event) are available on the ticket page for architects, accountants, builders, mortgage brokers, insurance brokers, interior designers, lenders, estate agents and surveyors.

