813d017c-a6b6-4453-bd35-459e70e9c994,,Baker Street to Hampstead Walk,"A linear 10 mile walk starting from Baker Street station and ending at Hampstead station. The route takes in several notable viewpoints over London: Primrose Hill, Waterlow Park and Parliament Hill.…","A linear 10 mile walk starting from Baker Street station and ending at Hampstead station. The route takes in several notable viewpoints over London: Primrose Hill, Waterlow Park and Parliament Hill. The parks and Hampstead Heath provide a lot of green spaces to enjoy. We will stop momentarily to pay respects to George Michael by looking at his former home in Highgate Village. There are numerous blue plaques on route which link people of the past with buildings of the present - now run by English Heritage. Great fun trying to spot as many as you can! There will be a pub stop at the end in Hampstead.
Refreshments
Cafes on way, pub at end. Option to bring packed lunch.
Travel
Baker Street is on Metropolitan, Circle, Jubilee and Bakerloo lines. Hampstead is on Northern line, also Hampstead Heath station near end on Overground line.
Start
10:00am prompt at Baker Street station, postcode NW1 5LJ. Meet next to Starbucks cafe inside station.
Cost of event is £10. This includes full membership for 1 year, Event arranged by main group,(www.hawog.org.uk)
All day walks are free to full members. Please rsvp & pay via paypal link. . Any questions please mail meetup@hawog.org.uk",,2026-11-14 10:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,Baker Street,Marylebone Road,London,8827b689-2637-4245-8ba7-214b35948ea2,"{sport,fitness,travel}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/ealing-ruislip-harrow-walking-social-group/events/316367872/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:54:30.136455+00,source:f26eb5d4-b239-4813-8e0c-3cf689eed4bd,https://www.meetup.com/ealing-ruislip-harrow-walking-social-group/events/316367872/,event_316367872@meetup.com,,2026-10-26 03:22:31.993+00,,2026-10-22 19:54:30.136455+00,2026-10-26 03:22:57.740718+00,,,,,f,GB
