d5899847-899f-46d6-8a8a-0ca261359ab4,,REAL TRADER IN 3 HOURS | Full Trading Workshop | Forex | Crypto | Stocks,"Most traders lose because they enter too early, manage risk poorly, and spend countless hours staring at charts without understanding what actually moves the market.","Most traders lose because they enter too early, manage risk poorly, and spend countless hours staring at charts without understanding what actually moves the market.
