d2e150f4-5e32-4340-9c27-4a1779af0e46,,Questions You Keep Avoiding,"There is usually one question, pattern, or truth quietly asking for our attention.","There is usually one question, pattern, or truth quietly asking for our attention.

This is an intimate group coaching and reflection session for people who want more clarity, self trust, and space to hear themselves honestly.

Each session explores one meaningful theme connected to personal growth, change, confidence, fulfilment, relationships, work, purpose, or the patterns we keep repeating.

We will begin with a grounding practice, move into a short reflection on the theme, use journaling prompts to explore what is present, and then open the space for sharing, gentle coaching, and group reflection.

You do not need to arrive with the perfect question. The topic will guide us, and your own questions may naturally become clearer as we go.

This is not about fixing yourself or forcing instant answers. It is about creating space to listen more deeply, notice what is ready to be seen, and leave with one gentle next step.

Bring a notebook, curiosity, and the willingness to meet what may be asking for your attention.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/0/7/a/highres_536584218.jpeg,2026-11-09 15:00:00+00,,Europe/Prague,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/soulful-high-achievers-club/events/315789485/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.927193+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/soulful-high-achievers-club/events/315789485/,event_315789485@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.927193+00,2026-10-28 03:22:26.80884+00,,,meetup:soulful-high-achievers-club:questions you keep avoiding,"Every last Thursday of the month until January 1, 2027",f,
