863a9969-94b0-44fa-b4dd-276db767092c,,Operation You: How to Make Space for Yourself Again,"Do you wake up feeling exhausted before the day’s even begun? Are you the person everyone relies on, yet your own needs often come last?","**Do you wake up feeling exhausted before the day’s even begun? Are you the person everyone relies on, yet your own needs often come last?**

Perhaps you’ve spent so long caring for others, keeping everything together and being the strong one that you’ve lost sight of what makes you happy.

Operation You is a free online webinar for women who are ready to make more room for themselves and create a life that feels fulfilling, not just full of responsibilities.

Join relationship expert, Aurore, for a compassionate, practical conversation about recognising what drains your energy, understanding the needs you’ve put aside, and finding the confidence to make changes that matter to you.

