8a64a76d-1074-48a9-abfb-460643ce864b,,Book Swap Social Event - Make New Friends Who Love Books,Do you have spare books lying around your home? Do you want to read new interesting books for free while socializing with interesting people? This is the event for you.,"Do you have spare books lying around your home? Do you want to read new interesting books for free while socializing with interesting people? This is the event for you.

We will enjoy nice drinks and snacks together at a beautiful lounge bar in London. You can bring your books and exchange them with whoever has the books you want to read. Since this is a Science and Philosophy book club, it would be great for you to bring non-fiction books that are insightful and thought-provoking. If you want to bring fiction books that are scientifically or philosophically insightful, feel free to bring those as well.

Since it is a social event, I encourage everyone to make deep meaningful conversations and make new friends. You can come alone or bring your friends with you. If you come alone, there is no need to be shy or scared. I will welcome you and introduce you to cool interesting people to speak with. Also feel free to come even if you forget to bring any books.",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792984786/orbit/event-covers/sources/zhzyz01qzbkkdjmbcomn.jpg,2026-11-21 16:00:00+00,,Europe/London,in_person,Keepers lounge and Bar (Novotel London Tower Bridge),10 Pepys Streeet,London,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,socialising,books,science}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/science-and-philosophy-book-club/events/317121412/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,0.00,0.00,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-26 03:19:41.089186+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/science-and-philosophy-book-club/events/317121412/,event_317121412@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:19:10.809+00,,2026-10-26 03:19:41.089186+00,2026-10-28 03:19:47.193092+00,51.510643,-0.077363,,,f,GB
