63d8f044-c8e1-41f0-8b3a-527852c47699,,Online Get-Together: Playing Among Us,"We know it's not always possible to get together in person so we get together online as well, so join us tonight to play:","We know it's not always possible to get together in person so we get together online as well, so join us tonight to play:

Among Us!

Among Us is free to play, and no matter what you use to play it, you can come and join in whether it be android or PC.

This is a great opportunity to meet a lot of the GEEK.ZONE regulars and see what we get up to. Everyone is super cool and welcoming, and you'll feel at home in no time!

Enjoy this event in the comfort of your own personal space while still socialising with others, and feel free to eat and drink.

You will need Discord https://geek.zone/discord/

Feel free to leave any questions for one of our hosts in the comments below.

We look forward to seeing you online!",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1792725593/orbit/event-covers/sources/vt1gbdnmrbecrmmx7x3t.jpg,2027-01-09 19:00:00+00,2027-01-09 22:00:00+00,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,socialising,science,hobbies}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/geekzoneessex/events/nxztltykccbmb/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,0.00,0.00,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-23 03:19:47.45036+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/geekzoneessex/events/nxztltykccbmb/,event_nxztltykccbmb@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:19:10.809+00,,2026-10-23 03:19:47.45036+00,2026-10-28 03:19:47.776315+00,,,meetup:geekzoneessex:online get together playing among us,Every week on Saturday,f,
