ca57f0e3-db54-4fad-a54f-729756eb3cf6,,Life Drawing @ Cave Pimlico,Join us at cave for our friendly weekly life drawing sessions in the heart of Pimlico.,"Join us at **cave** for our friendly weekly life drawing sessions in the heart of Pimlico.

Whether you're a complete beginner or an experienced artist, these relaxed, untutored sessions are a great way to develop your observational drawing skills, experiment with new techniques and enjoy an evening of creativity.

During the two-hour session, we'll work from a professional life model through a series of short and long poses, finishing with a sustained final pose.

**£15 per session** includes all drawing materials, tea, coffee, nibbles and a drink. You're also welcome to bring your own materials if you prefer.

**Booking is essential.** Reserve your place with a **£5 non-refundable deposit** via Eventbrite: HERE (https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/life-drawing-cave-pimlico-tickets-170116706649) with the remaining **£10 payable on the door** by cash or card.

