84b7503f-77e3-4079-8387-dc36afcecf28,,Modern Business Strategy + Integrated AI + to Achieve Flexibility,"As the European labour market evolves, many professionals are exploring how emerging technologies can integrate with modern work models to provide greater autonomy.","As the European labour market evolves, many professionals are exploring how emerging technologies can integrate with modern work models to provide greater autonomy.

If you are curious about utilizing AI tools to explore online income opportunities alongside your current commitments—but want a grounded, intelligent introduction—this session is for you.

Guest speaker **Joy Mallard** will provide an explanatory overview, adopting a systems-thinking tone to break down how these systems actually work. We prioritize an exploratory look at the mechanics, ensuring clarity and educational value over surface-level hype.

