• Autonomy in action: How these models can support flexible working arrangements.
• Critical evaluation: Identifying common misconceptions and understanding realistic considerations before beginning.

Who this session is for: International contractors, analytical professionals, and Amsterdam knowledge workers interested in the intersection of AI, autonomy, and modern business strategy.

