1ce81371-e534-4923-8012-6a7c49e74b83,,Agentic Leadership - Are You Ready to Lead in the Age of AI?,"AI isn’t just changing what we do – it’s changing who we lead. Teams now include AI agents, and leaders must adapt or risk falling behind. But here’s the catch: AI can speed up work, but it can’t…","AI isn’t just changing *what* we do – it’s changing *who* we lead. Teams now include AI agents, and leaders must adapt or risk falling behind. But here’s the catch: **AI can speed up work, but it can’t replace trust, commitment, critical thinking – or human vision, intuition and innovation. It can, however, amplify it.** This webinar cuts through the hype to address the **real challenges** of leading in a world where not all team members are human.

How do you create psychological safety for humans – and machines? How do you ensure your team feels ownership when AI generates the sprint plan? How do you avoid the pitfalls of blind automation while preventing tunnel vision in a world of automated precision?

**Key takeaways:**

• Why **Catalyst Leaders** (not Expert Leaders) will thrive in the AI era – and how to make the shift.
• How to foster **innovation and autonomy** without losing strategic alignment or the human touch.
• The **3 shifts** every leader must make to embrace Agentic Leadership: from control to enablement, from precision to critical thinking, and from efficiency to trust.
• Lessons from the frontlines: What happens when AI meets human psychodynamics – and why **emotional intelligence** is your secret weapon.
• How to use AI as a **force multiplier** – not a crutch – so technology amplifies human vision, intuition and innovation, rather than replacing it.

**About the presenter:**
Bent Myllerup is an engineer turned leadership coach, trainer and consultant with **25+ years of experience** as a manager and leader. With a **Master’s in Management Development from Copenhagen Business School**, he blends real-world stories from his journey in **Product Leadership** and global consulting with practical tools for **authentic, human-centred leadership**. His approach is rooted in enabling teams to thrive in complexity – because, as he puts it, **“technology should serve people, not the other way around.”**

*Join us to lead with intention, clarity and humanity – not just efficiency.*",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/8/7/a/d/highres_536254733.jpeg,2026-11-20 11:30:00+00,,Europe/Copenhagen,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,technology,ai,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/agentic-leadership/events/316653779/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.927193+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/agentic-leadership/events/316653779/,event_316653779@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.927193+00,2026-10-28 03:22:27.129706+00,,,,,f,
a34bd642-b189-4c6c-a9ea-ddfbf13a9373,,Blaze (Online MeetUp),The discussion will be online and I'll post the link to the meeting on the day. The meeting will probably last about 2-3 hours including drinks breaks.,"The discussion will be online and I'll post the link to the meeting on the day. The meeting will probably last about 2-3 hours including drinks breaks.

