c853e55e-0d2b-41fa-abff-e3384efdbac0,,THREE LEGGED STOOL,Bookable via our website ➡️ https://www.thegoodlifecentre.co.uk/milking-stool/,"Bookable via our website ➡️ https://www.thegoodlifecentre.co.uk/milking-stool/
⋆⋆⋆

A wonderful 5-day project using basic carpentry woodwork skills and woodturning skills to make three-legged milking stool.

In this workshop you will learn the skills of how to measure accurately, cut precisely to join planks together using dowels. Use the ‘spindle method’ on a woodturning lathe to create the legs and use hand tools to finalise the shape of the seat. You will learn to use a drill guide to ensure the joinery is drilled at a consistent angle. The legs will be joined using the wedged tenon method.

During this 5 day workshop you will:

• Make a seat, glue 2 pieces of timber using the dowel method and roughly shape on using the band saw.
• Make a brace for the legs.
• Using the lathe you will turn 3 legs
• Create the finished shape of the seat using a spokeshave
• Use a reamer to make leg mortices conical for strength
• Use a tapered tenon cutter to make tapered tenon for strength

Stool dimensions approximately: 360mm high, diameter of the seat around 300mm.",https://res.cloudinary.com/deor01if5/image/upload/v1793157596/orbit/event-covers/sources/ohhd16nkui81h50a9eoz.jpg,2026-11-09 10:00:00+00,2026-11-09 17:00:00+00,Europe/London,in_person,The Goodlife Centre,"49-55 Great Guildford St, London SE1 0ES, UK",London,bbf01bc7-85fe-4d0e-8f0c-8fd50e9ffd7e,"{social,socialising,hobbies}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/thegoodlifecentre/events/317146661/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,595.00,595.00,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-28 03:19:46.398197+00,source:c243439e-e165-41fe-9fdf-b8e7ca9d670a,https://www.meetup.com/thegoodlifecentre/events/317146661/,event_317146661@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:19:10.809+00,,2026-10-28 03:19:46.398197+00,2026-10-28 03:19:57.417154+00,51.50314,-0.096736,meetup:thegoodlifecentre:three legged stool,"Every week on Monday until December 7, 2026",f,GB
