cf5bf7d4-f162-4f4a-b426-9f2d732caffb,,Hiring Remote Talent in South Africa: Everything You Need to Know,Hiring Remote Talent in South Africa: Everything You Need to Know,"Hiring Remote Talent in South Africa: Everything You Need to Know

Thinking about hiring remote talent from South Africa but unsure where to start?

Join this informal online meetup to discuss how UK, US, and international businesses can hire skilled South African professionals, reduce employment costs, and build effective remote teams.

We'll cover some of the most common questions employers have, including:

• **Salaries:** How much should you expect to pay South African professionals?
• **Hiring costs:** What recruitment fees, payroll costs and other expenses should you budget for?
• **Finding talent:** Where can you find reliable, experienced South African candidates?
• **Popular roles:** Which positions are best suited to remote hiring, from sales and marketing to operations, admin and customer success?
• **Compliance:** What should you know about contracts, taxes and employment obligations?
• **Time zones and communication:** How effectively can South African professionals work with UK and US teams?
• **Recruitment and screening:** How do you assess candidates before hiring?
• **Contractor vs Employer of Record (EOR):** What's the difference, and which arrangement is right for your business?

Hosted by the founder of SouthAfricanTalent.com (https://southafricantalent.com/), a recruitment service connecting international businesses with vetted South African professionals.
This is an informal, practical discussion rather than a sales presentation. Bring your questions, whether you're exploring your first international hire or looking to expand an existing remote team.

**Who should attend?** Founders, business owners, hiring managers and anyone considering hiring remote talent from South Africa.",,2026-11-12 19:00:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth,careers,entrepreneurship}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/outsourcing-to-south-africa-group/events/317069169/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-22 19:53:34.160664+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/outsourcing-to-south-africa-group/events/317069169/,event_317069169@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-22 19:53:34.160664+00,2026-10-28 03:22:27.129706+00,,,,,f,
