b13f83a0-f7d7-47e2-90f8-91346b83d1c2,,Online FIRE Meet Up - Time Freedom with Brian Herriot,"We will host a special online meet-up with Brian Herriot, author of Time Freedom: Rethink Your Work and Money to Create a Life You Love Now.","We will host a special online meet-up with **Brian Herriot, author of *Time Freedom: Rethink Your Work and Money to Create a Life You Love Now*.**

Brian is an author, speaker, financial advisor and former management consultant who writes about the intersection between money, work and how we spend our time. His philosophy of **“time freedom”** challenges the idea that we necessarily need to wait until we are fully financially independent or retired before we can start designing a life with more freedom and flexibility.

Brian reached what he describes as time freedom in his 40s, gradually moving away from the conventional career path and building a working life where he has much greater control over **how, when and with whom he works**.

During the meet-up, we’ll chat with Brian about the ideas behind *Time Freedom*, how it differs from traditional FIRE, and how we can start using money to create more freedom in our lives **today rather than someday**. There will also be plenty of opportunity to ask Brian questions and join the discussion.

**Everyone is welcome to attend, whether you are based in Limerick or anywhere else!**",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/3/6/5/highres_532601829.jpeg,2026-11-04 19:30:00+00,,Europe/Dublin,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,careers,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/financial-independence-limerick/events/316407840/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/financial-independence-limerick/events/316407840/,event_316407840@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-21 22:14:19.427857+00,2026-10-28 03:22:27.129706+00,,,,,f,
