Thoralf serves as a Product and Organizational Development (OD) Coach. His motto is: be at the center of value. He started his career developing medical devices like CT scanners and became a Certified Scrum Master in 2007. Based on many years of experience in diverse domains, Thoralf qualified as SPC in 2016, as Scrum@Scale and Scrum Inc. Trainer with Jeff Sutherland in 2019, and as Mobius Navigator Coach with Gabrielle Benefield in 2020. He has been translating her new book (https://www.amazon.com/Mobius-Outcome-Delivery-Quickstart-decisions-ebook/dp/B0DX1SHB2Y/) on Mobius Loop to German and he has been organizing several charity fundraiser training during pandemic and Ukraine crisis (giving to MSF). Thoralf recently became a genAI Practitioner Trainer for Scrum Inc and has been a Neural Network & AI geek since studying at MIT and is currently using AI for better Discovery using JTBD.

