1f71f261-646a-4544-b187-bf3dd1e44e00,,"Putting ""Think and Grow Rich"" Into Action",Chapter 9 - Persistence: the Sustained Effort Necessary to Induce Faith,"**Chapter 9 - Persistence: the Sustained Effort Necessary to Induce Faith**

What separates those who achieve their dreams from those who give up too soon? It’s not talent, luck, or even resources, it’s *persistence*. In Chapter 9 of *Think and Grow Rich* to uncover Napoleon Hill’s timeless secrets to building unshakable persistence. From the ‘Master Mind’ principle to the surprising role of failure, we’ll show you how to keep moving forward, even when the odds are stacked against you. Plus, we’ll share real-life stories, actionable strategies, and the one mindset shift that can turn setbacks into stepping stones. If you’ve ever felt like giving up, this episode is your wake-up call to keep going, because persistence isn’t just a trait, it’s your superpower. Let’s unlock it together!

Every week, we delve into one of the **13 principles of success**, exploring how to incorporate it into our daily actions to meet our objectives. Our sessions include a live online study group where participants can engage and learn together to gain valuable insights on how to utilize this knowledge for your own success.
Think and Grow Rich was the first book to boldly ask, ""What makes a winner?"" The man who asked and listened for the answer, Napoleon Hill, is now counted in the top ranks of the world's winners himself.

**Group Guidelines:**
This group is meant to be interactive. Having your video on is encouraged but not required. Come with questions and an open mind. My goal is to provide a safe and engaging environment for us to learn from each other and walk away feeling empowered to take action. Please practice kindness and respect. We'll summarize key takeaways from previous weeks, so don't worry if you missed the last one; drop in at any point in the book!

“There’s something really powerful about groups and shared experiences. People might be skeptical about their ability to change if they’re by themselves, but a group will convince them to suspend disbelief. A community creates belief.” — Charles Duhigg
Let's think and grow rich together!

Looking forward to meeting with you,
Dave and Doug",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/e/0/1/2/highres_536277362.jpeg,2026-11-24 19:00:00+00,,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/london-e-business-owners-meetup-group/events/317058125/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-28 03:22:26.159151+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/london-e-business-owners-meetup-group/events/317058125/,event_317058125@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-28 03:22:26.159151+00,2026-10-28 03:22:29.50239+00,,,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02:putting think and grow rich into action:online,,f,
