d5008cc7-f85d-4b0b-9002-d817cb4bb4bb,,🤝 Founders Meetup by F4F,Founders for Founders brings you Real conversations for Entrepreneurs building Startups around the world. Every Week.,"***Founders for Founders* brings you Real conversations for Entrepreneurs building Startups around the world. Every Week.**
*Talk it out, build it better.*

• This is a special FREE weekly event for founders around the world: you can check out The Founders for Founders Website (https://f4f.vc/) for more info.

Building something is a rollercoaster, and it's a whole lot better with people who *get it*. Founders for Founders is our weekly get-together where you meet other entrepreneurs, talk through what you're working on, and leave with fresh ideas and new connections.
Here's how it works:

• **⏱️ One hour, once a week:** an easy, energising break in your week
• **🤝 Meet 4 different founders:** we personally put you in touch with four others, so every conversation counts
• **💬 Real talk (English):** share your ideas, talk through your blockers, and get honest opinions from people who've been there
• **🌱 Connections that last:** many of the founders you meet become sounding boards, collaborators, and friends long after the hour is up

**Talk it out, build it better.**

This is a FREE event. No one to impress, just peers who *get it*.
Whether you're deep in the build, just starting out, or somewhere in between, for-profit, nonprofit, or a project you believe in, you're welcome here.

**Where:** We meet on SpeakDuo (https://speakduo.onelink.me/DlwG/meetup), built for live online group events with advanced matching, so you're paired with the right founders for focused, meaningful conversations instead of getting lost in a crowded call.

**RSVP to save your spot:** bring what you're working on, and let's
unite. You can also check upcoming events at f4f.vc/events (http://f4f.vc/events). 🚀",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/7/6/7/highres_536802855.jpeg,2027-01-19 18:00:00+00,2027-01-19 19:00:00+00,Europe/London,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth,entrepreneurship}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/founders-london/events/sbgtbvykccbzb/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-28 03:22:26.159151+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/founders-london/events/sbgtbvykccbzb/,event_sbgtbvykccbzb@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-28 03:22:26.159151+00,2026-10-28 03:22:29.942927+00,,,meetup:founders-london:founders meetup by f4f,"Every week on Tuesday until July 11, 2031",f,
fe41b6f0-b1b1-45a0-a4b3-b58e22b1389d,,Understanding the Nervous System,"Have you ever wondered why you can know what you “should” do, but still feel stuck, overwhelmed, anxious, disconnected, or unable to slow down?","Have you ever wondered why you can know what you “should” do, but still feel stuck, overwhelmed, anxious, disconnected, or unable to slow down?

In this online masterclass, we will explore the nervous system in a simple, practical, and human way. You will learn what happens inside your body when you feel stressed, activated, shut down, or disconnected, and how to understand your reactions with more compassion.

This class is mainly theoretical and gives you the foundation for nervous system regulation. **The somatic tools are practiced in the NeuroSomatic Breathwork group session**, where we take this knowledge into the body through breath, movement, sound, and allowance.

Together, we will look at stress, activation and shutdown, why rest can feel difficult, how people get stuck in constant doing, and what nervous system regulation actually means.

You do not need any previous experience. Come as you are, with curiosity and openness.

Everyone who joins will also receive my Somatic Stress Release Guide, so you can continue exploring simple regulation tools after the session.",https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/9/7/2/7/highres_534998695.jpeg,2026-11-26 14:00:00+00,,Europe/Prague,online,Online event,,,4de84854-e351-4122-ab9e-a6ea93b86ee5,"{carrer,growth}",,external,https://www.meetup.com/soulful-high-achievers-club/events/315555039/,Register on Meetup,f,,t,,,,GBP,published,,f,f,2026-10-28 03:22:26.159151+00,source:93b183a9-4cbd-478c-a97e-334e2b0e1a02,https://www.meetup.com/soulful-high-achievers-club/events/315555039/,event_315555039@meetup.com,,2026-10-28 03:21:53.769+00,,2026-10-28 03:22:26.159151+00,2026-10-28 03:22:30.027432+00,,,meetup:soulful-high-achievers-club:understanding the nervous system,"Every 2 weeks on Thursday until December 30, 2026",f,
